: 8, "start": 34.84, "end": 39.76, "text": "V\\u00e0 v\\u00ec v\\u1eady trong l\\u1edbp h\\u1ecdc n\\u00e0y, ngay t\\u1ea1i \\u0111\\u00e2y trong tr\\u00ecnh duy\\u1ec7t web c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n, b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd c\\u00f3 kh\\u1ea3 n\\u0103ng s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng"}, {"index": 9, "start": 39.76, "end": 45.0, "text": "m\\u00f4i tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng Jupyter Notebook \\u0111\\u1ec3 th\\u1eed nghi\\u1ec7m m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 \\u00fd t\\u01b0\\u1edfng n\\u00e0y cho ch\\u00ednh b\\u1ea1n."}, {"index": 10, "start": 45.0, "end": 48.64, "text": "\\u0110\\u00e2y kh\\u00f4ng ph\\u1ea3i l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t m\\u00f4i tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng h\\u01b0 c\\u1ea5u, \\u0111\\u01a1n gi\\u1ea3n h\\u00f3a."}, {"index": 11, "start": 48.64, "end": 54.16, "text": "\\u0110\\u00e2y ch\\u00ednh x\\u00e1c l\\u00e0 m\\u00f4i tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng, ch\\u00ednh x\\u00e1c l\\u00e0 c\\u00f4ng c\\u1ee5, Jupyter Notebook m\\u00e0 c\\u00e1c nh\\u00e0 ph\\u00e1t tri\\u1ec3n"}, {"index": 12, "start": 54.16, "end": 57.56, "text": "\\u0111ang s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng t\\u1ea1i nhi\\u1ec1u c\\u00f4ng ty l\\u1edbn ngay b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd."}, {"index": 13, "start": 57.56, "end": 62.28, "text": "M\\u1ed9t lo\\u1ea1i ph\\u00f2ng th\\u00ed nghi\\u1ec7m m\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd th\\u1ea5y xuy\\u00ean su\\u1ed1t l\\u1edbp h\\u1ecdc n\\u00e0y l\\u00e0 c\\u00e1c ph\\u00f2ng th\\u00ed nghi\\u1ec7m t\\u00f9y ch\\u1ecdn,"}, {"index": 14, "start": 62.28, "end": 69.96, "text": "m\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 m\\u1edf ra v\\u00e0 ch\\u1ea1y t\\u1eebng d\\u00f2ng m\\u1ed9t m\\u00e0 th\\u01b0\\u1eddng kh\\u00f4ng c\\u1ea7n ph\\u1ea3i vi\\u1ebft m\\u00e3 n\\u00e0o."}, {"index": 15, "start": 69.96, "end": 76.12, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, c\\u00e1c ph\\u00f2ng th\\u00ed nghi\\u1ec7m t\\u00f9y ch\\u1ecdn \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c thi\\u1ebft k\\u1ebf \\u0111\\u1ec3 r\\u1ea5t d\\u1ec5 d\\u00e0ng, v\\u00e0 t\\u00f4i c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 \\u0111\\u1ea3m b\\u1ea3o b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd nh\\u1eadn \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c \\u0111i\\u1ec3m t\\u1ed1i \\u0111a"}, {"index": 16, "start": 76.12, "end": 79.96, "text": "cho t\\u1eebng c\\u00e1i, v\\u00ec kh\\u00f4ng c\\u00f3 \\u0111i\\u1ec3m s\\u1ed1."}, {"index": 17, "start": 79.96, "end": 84.6, "text": "T\\u1ea5t c\\u1ea3 nh\\u1eefng g\\u00ec b\\u1ea1n c\\u1ea7n l\\u00e0m l\\u00e0 m\\u1edf n\\u00f3 ra v\\u00e0 ch\\u1ec9 c\\u1ea7n ch\\u1ea1y m\\u00e3 m\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i cung c\\u1ea5p."}, {"index": 18, "start": 84.6, "end": 89.48, "text": "V\\u00e0 th\\u00f4ng qua vi\\u1ec7c \\u0111\\u1ecdc v\\u00e0 ch\\u1ea1y m\\u00e3 trong c\\u00e1c ph\\u00f2ng th\\u00ed nghi\\u1ec7m t\\u00f9y ch\\u1ecdn, b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd th\\u1ea5y c\\u00e1ch m\\u00e3 h\\u1ecdc m\\u00e1y"}, {"index": 19, "start": 89.48, "end": 91.28, "text": "ch\\u1ea1y."}, {"index": 20, "start": 91.28, "end": 96.72, "text": "V\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n n\\u00ean c\\u00f3 kh\\u1ea3 n\\u0103ng ho\\u00e0n th\\u00e0nh ch\\u00fang, b\\u1ea1n bi\\u1ebft \\u0111\\u1ea5y, t\\u01b0\\u01a1ng \\u0111\\u1ed1i nhanh ch\\u00f3ng, ch\\u1ec9 b\\u1eb1ng c\\u00e1ch ch\\u1ea1y"}, {"index": 21, "start": 96.72, "end": 100.6, "text": "n\\u00f3 t\\u1eebng d\\u00f2ng m\\u1ed9t t\\u1eeb tr\\u00ean xu\\u1ed1ng d\\u01b0\\u1edbi."}, {"index": 22, "start": 100.6, "end": 104.48, "text": "C\\u00e1c ph\\u00f2ng lab t\\u00f9y ch\\u1ecdn ho\\u00e0n to\\u00e0n l\\u00e0 t\\u00f9y ch\\u1ecdn, v\\u00ec v\\u1eady b\\u1ea1n kh\\u00f4ng c\\u1ea7n ph\\u1ea3i l\\u00e0m ch\\u00fang ch\\u00fat n\\u00e0o n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n"}, {"index": 23, "start": 104.48, "end": 105.88, "text": "kh\\u00f4ng mu\\u1ed1n."}, {"index": 24, "start": 105.88, "end": 110.48, "text": "Nh\\u01b0ng t\\u00f4i hy v\\u1ecdng b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd xem qua, v\\u00ec vi\\u1ec7c th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n ch\\u00fang s\\u1ebd mang l\\u1ea1i cho b\\u1ea1n m\\u1ed9t c\\u1ea3m nh\\u1eadn s\\u00e2u h\\u01a1n,"}, {"index": 25, "start": 110.48, "end": 115.28, "text": "v\\u00e0 mang l\\u1ea1i cho b\\u1ea1n th\\u00eam m\\u1ed9t ch\\u00fat kinh nghi\\u1ec7m v\\u1edbi c\\u00e1c thu\\u1eadt to\\u00e1n h\\u1ecdc m\\u00e1y, v\\u1edbi nh\\u1eefng g\\u00ec"}, {"index": 26, "start": 115.28, "end": 119.04, "text": "m\\u00e3 h\\u1ecdc m\\u00e1y th\\u1ef1c s\\u1ef1 tr\\u00f4ng nh\\u01b0 th\\u1ebf n\\u00e0o."}, {"index": 27, "start": 119.04, "end": 123.28, "text": "B\\u1eaft \\u0111\\u1ea7u t\\u1eeb tu\\u1ea7n t\\u1edbi, c\\u0169ng s\\u1ebd c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 ph\\u00f2ng lab th\\u1ef1c h\\u00e0nh, s\\u1ebd cung c\\u1ea5p cho b\\u1ea1n c\\u01a1 h\\u1ed9i"}, {"index": 28, "start": 123.28, "end": 125.92, "text": "\\u0111\\u1ec3 vi\\u1ebft m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 m\\u00e3 \\u0111\\u00f3 t\\u1ef1 yourself."}, {"index": 29, "start": 125.92, "end": 129.04, "text": "Nh\\u01b0ng ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd \\u0111\\u1ebfn v\\u1edbi \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3 v\\u00e0o tu\\u1ea7n t\\u1edbi, v\\u00ec v\\u1eady \\u0111\\u1eebng lo l\\u1eafng v\\u1ec1 n\\u00f3 b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd."}, {"index": 30, "start": 129.04, "end": 133.0, "text": "V\\u00e0 t\\u00f4i hy v\\u1ecdng b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd ho\\u00e0n th\\u00e0nh ph\\u00f2ng lab t\\u00f9y ch\\u1ecdn ti\\u1ebfp theo v\\u00e0 ti\\u1ebfp t\\u1ee5c v\\u1edbi ph\\u1ea7n c\\u00f2n l\\u1ea1i c\\u1ee7a"}, {"index": 31, "start": 133.0, "end": 135.28, "text": "n\\u1ed9i dung cho tu\\u1ea7n n\\u00e0y."}, {"index": 32, "start": 135.28, "end": 138.12, "text": "V\\u1eady h\\u00e3y c\\u00f9ng xem m\\u1ed9t v\\u00ed d\\u1ee5 v\\u1ec1 m\\u1ed9t notebook."}, {"index": 33, "start": 138.64, "end": 142.16, "text": "\\u0110\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 nh\\u1eefng g\\u00ec b\\u1ea1n th\\u1ea5y khi b\\u1ea1n \\u0111\\u1ebfn ph\\u00f2ng lab t\\u00f9y ch\\u1ecdn \\u0111\\u1ea7u ti\\u00ean."}, {"index": 34, "start": 142.16, "end": 147.6, "text": "H\\u00e3y tho\\u1ea3i m\\u00e1i cu\\u1ed9n l\\u00ean v\\u00e0 xu\\u1ed1ng v\\u00e0 duy\\u1ec7t v\\u00e0 di chu\\u1ed9t qua c\\u00e1c menu kh\\u00e1c nhau v\\u00e0 xem"}, {"index": 35, "start": 147.6, "end": 151.12, "text": "c\\u00e1c t\\u00f9y ch\\u1ecdn kh\\u00e1c nhau \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y."}, {"index": 36, "start": 151.12, "end": 155.92, "text": "B\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 nh\\u1eadn th\\u1ea5y r\\u1eb1ng c\\u00f3 hai lo\\u1ea1i c\\u00e1c kh\\u1ed1i n\\u00e0y, c\\u0169ng \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c g\\u1ecdi l\\u00e0 \\u00f4"}, {"index": 37, "start": 155.92, "end": 157.4, "text": "trong notebook."}, {"index": 38, "start": 157.4, "end": 159.92, "text": "V\\u00e0 c\\u00f3 hai lo\\u1ea1i \\u00f4."}, {"index": 39, "start": 159.92, "end": 166.2, "text": "M\\u1ed9t lo\\u1ea1i \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c g\\u1ecdi l\\u00e0 \\u00f4 markdown, c\\u00f3 ngh\\u0129a l\\u00e0 v\\u1ec1 c\\u01a1 b\\u1ea3n l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t lo\\u1ea1t v\\u0103n b\\u1ea3n."}, {"index": 40, "start": 166.2, "end": 171.24, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y, b\\u1ea1n th\\u1ef1c s\\u1ef1 c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 ch\\u1ec9nh s\\u1eeda v\\u0103n b\\u1ea3n n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n kh\\u00f4ng th\\u00edch v\\u0103n b\\u1ea3n m\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i \\u0111\\u00e3 vi\\u1ebft."}, {"index": 41, "start": 171.24, "end": 175.2, "text": "Nh\\u01b0ng \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 v\\u0103n b\\u1ea3n m\\u00f4 t\\u1ea3 m\\u00e3 ngu\\u1ed3n."}, {"index": 42, "start": 175.2, "end": 182.6, "text": "Sau \\u0111\\u00f3 c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t lo\\u1ea1i kh\\u1ed1i, ho\\u1eb7c \\u00f4 th\\u1ee9 hai, tr\\u00f4ng nh\\u01b0 th\\u1ebf n\\u00e0y, \\u0111\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 \\u00f4 m\\u00e3."}, {"index": 43, "start": 182.6, "end": 187.4, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y, ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i \\u0111\\u00e3 cung c\\u1ea5p m\\u00e3, v\\u00e0 n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n ch\\u1ea1y \\u00f4 m\\u00e3 n\\u00e0y,"}, {"index": 44, "start": 187.4, "end": 191.88, "text": "th\\u00ec vi\\u1ec7c nh\\u1ea5n Shift-Enter s\\u1ebd ch\\u1ea1y m\\u00e3 trong \\u00f4 m\\u00e3 n\\u00e0y."}, {"index": 45, "start": 191.88, "end": 195.0, "text": "\\u00c0, v\\u00e0 nh\\u00e2n ti\\u1ec7n, n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n nh\\u1ea5p v\\u00e0o m\\u1ed9t \\u00f4 markdown,"}, {"index": 46, "start": 195.0, "end": 201.44, "text": "n\\u00f3 s\\u1ebd hi\\u1ec3n th\\u1ecb t\\u1ea5t c\\u1ea3 \\u0111\\u1ecbnh d\\u1ea1ng n\\u00e0y, h\\u00e3y c\\u1ea3m th\\u1ea5y t\\u1ef1 do nh\\u1ea5n Shift-Enter tr\\u00ean b\\u00e0n ph\\u00edm c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n."}, {"index": 47, "start": 201.44, "end": 206.28, "text": "V\\u00e0 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3 c\\u0169ng s\\u1ebd chuy\\u1ec3n \\u0111\\u1ed5i l\\u1ea1i th\\u00e0nh v\\u0103n b\\u1ea3n \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c \\u0111\\u1ecbnh d\\u1ea1ng \\u0111\\u1eb9p."}, {"index": 48, "start": 206.28, "end": 209.6, "text": "Ph\\u00f2ng th\\u00ed nghi\\u1ec7m t\\u00f9y ch\\u1ecdn n\\u00e0y cho th\\u1ea5y m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 m\\u00e3 Python ph\\u1ed5 bi\\u1ebfn."}, {"index": 49, "start": 209.6, "end": 214.28, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 ti\\u1ebfp t\\u1ee5c v\\u00e0 ch\\u1ea1y m\\u00e3 n\\u00e0y sau trong s\\u1ed5 tay Jupyter c\\u1ee7a ri\\u00eang b\\u1ea1n."}, {"index": 50, "start": 214.28, "end": 219.32, "text": "Khi b\\u1ea1n t\\u1ef1 m\\u00ecnh v\\u00e0o s\\u1ed5 tay n\\u00e0y, \\u0111i\\u1ec1u t\\u00f4i mu\\u1ed1n b\\u1ea1n l\\u00e0m l\\u00e0 ch\\u1ecdn c\\u00e1c \\u00f4"}, {"index": 51, "start": 219.32, "end": 221.4, "text": "v\\u00e0 nh\\u1ea5n Shift-Enter."}, {"index": 52, "start": 221.4, "end": 223.96, "text": "Ch\\u00e0, h\\u00e3y \\u0111\\u1ecdc qua m\\u00e3, xem li\\u1ec7u n\\u00f3 c\\u00f3 h\\u1ee3p l\\u00fd kh\\u00f4ng."}, {"index": 53, "start": 223.96, "end": 228.44, "text": "B\\u1ea1n bi\\u1ebft \\u0111\\u1ea5y, h\\u00e3y th\\u1eed d\\u1ef1 \\u0111o\\u00e1n v\\u1ec1 vi\\u1ec7c b\\u1ea1n ngh\\u0129 m\\u00e3 n\\u00e0y s\\u1ebd l\\u00e0m g\\u00ec,"}, {"index": 54, "start": 228.44, "end": 233.76, "text": "sau \\u0111\\u00f3 nh\\u1ea5n Shift-Enter, v\\u00e0 nh\\u00ecn xem m\\u00e3 th\\u1ef1c s\\u1ef1 l\\u00e0m g\\u00ec."}, {"index": 55, "start": 233.76, "end": 237.04, "text": "V\\u00e0 n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n c\\u1ea3m th\\u1ea5y th\\u00edch, h\\u00e3y tho\\u1ea3i m\\u00e1i v\\u00e0o v\\u00e0 ch\\u1ec9nh s\\u1eeda m\\u00e3."}, {"index": 56, "start": 237.04, "end": 240.68, "text": "B\\u1ea1n bi\\u1ebft \\u0111\\u1ea5y, thay \\u0111\\u1ed5i m\\u00e3 v\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 ch\\u1ea1y n\\u00f3 v\\u00e0 xem \\u0111i\\u1ec1u g\\u00ec x\\u1ea3y ra."}, {"index": 57, "start": 240.68, "end": 244.2, "text": "V\\u00e0 n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n ch\\u01b0a t\\u1eebng tr\\u1ea3i nghi\\u1ec7m trong m\\u00f4i tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng s\\u1ed5 tay Jupyter tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc \\u0111\\u00e2y,"}, {"index": 58, "start": 244.2, "end": 248.72, "text": "T\\u00f4i hy v\\u1ecdng b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd quen thu\\u1ed9c h\\u01a1n v\\u1edbi Python trong m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed5 tay Jupyter."}, {"index": 59, "start": 248.72, "end": 251.76, "text": "T\\u00f4i \\u0111\\u00e3 d\\u00e0nh nhi\\u1ec1u gi\\u1edd ch\\u01a1i v\\u1edbi c\\u00e1c s\\u1ed5 tay Jupyter,"}, {"index": 60, "start": 251.76, "end": 254.92, "text": "V\\u00e0 t\\u00f4i hy v\\u1ecdng b\\u1ea1n c\\u0169ng s\\u1ebd c\\u00f3 nh\\u1eefng kho\\u1ea3nh kh\\u1eafc th\\u00fa v\\u1ecb v\\u1edbi ch\\u00fang."}, {"index": 61, "start": 254.92, "end": 258.52, "text": "Sau \\u0111\\u00f3, t\\u00f4i r\\u1ea5t mong \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c g\\u1eb7p l\\u1ea1i b\\u1ea1n trong video ti\\u1ebfp theo."}, {"index": 62, "start": 258.52, "end": 260.96, "text": "Trong \\u0111\\u00f3, ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd gi\\u1ea3i quy\\u1ebft v\\u1ea5n \\u0111\\u1ec1 h\\u1ecdc c\\u00f3 gi\\u00e1m s\\u00e1t."}, {"index": 63, "start": 260.96, "end": 265.8, "text": "V\\u00e0 b\\u1eaft \\u0111\\u1ea7u ph\\u00e1t tri\\u1ec3n thu\\u1eadt to\\u00e1n h\\u1ecdc c\\u00f3 gi\\u00e1m s\\u00e1t \\u0111\\u1ea7u ti\\u00ean c\\u1ee7a ch\\u00fang ta."}, {"index": 64, "start": 265.8, "end": 269.0, "text": "T\\u00f4i hy v\\u1ecdng \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3 c\\u0169ng s\\u1ebd th\\u00fa v\\u1ecb, v\\u00e0 mong \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c g\\u1eb7p b\\u1ea1n \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00f3."}], "segments_by_language": {"en": [{"index": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 8.48, "text": "So far in the videos, you've seen supervised learning and unsupervised learning, and also"}, {"index": 1, "start": 8.48, "end": 10.48, "text": "examples of both."}, {"index": 2, "start": 10.48, "end": 15.98, "text": "For you to more deeply understand these concepts, I'd like to invite you in this class to"}, {"index": 3, "start": 15.98, "end": 21.88, "text": "see, run, and maybe later write code yourself to implement these concepts."}, {"index": 4, "start": 21.88, "end": 26.64, "text": "The most widely used tool by machine learning and data science practitioners today is the"}, {"index": 5, "start": 26.64, "end": 28.36, "text": "Jupyter Notebook."}, {"index": 6, "start": 28.36, "end": 33.36, "text": "This is the default environment that a lot of us use to code up and experiment and try"}, {"index": 7, "start": 33.36, "end": 34.84, "text": "things out."}, {"index": 8, "start": 34.84, "end": 39.76, "text": "And so in this class, right here in your web browser, you'll be able to use a Jupyter"}, {"index": 9, "start": 39.76, "end": 45.0, "text": "Notebook environment to test out some of these ideas for yourself as well."}, {"index": 10, "start": 45.0, "end": 48.64, "text": "This is not some made-up, simplified environment."}, {"index": 11, "start": 48.64, "end": 54.16, "text": "This is the exact same environment, the exact same tool, the Jupyter Notebook that developers"}, {"index": 12, "start": 54.16, "end": 57.56, "text": "are using in many large companies right now."}, {"index": 13, "start": 57.56, "end": 62.28, "text": "One type of lab that you see throughout this class are optional labs, which are ones you"}, {"index": 14, "start": 62.28, "end": 69.96, "text": "can open and run one line at a time we're usually not needing to write any code yourself."}, {"index": 15, "start": 69.96, "end": 76.12, "text": "So optional labs are designed to be very easy, and I can guarantee you will get full masks"}, {"index": 16, "start": 76.12, "end": 79.96, "text": "for every single one of them, because there are no masks."}, {"index": 17, "start": 79.96, "end": 84.6, "text": "All you need to do is open it up and just run the code we've provided."}, {"index": 18, "start": 84.6, "end": 89.48, "text": "And by reading through and running the code in the optional labs, you see how machine learning"}, {"index": 19, "start": 89.48, "end": 91.28, "text": "code runs."}, {"index": 20, "start": 91.28, "end": 96.72, "text": "And you should be able to complete them, you know, relatively quickly, just by running"}, {"index": 21, "start": 96.72, "end": 100.6, "text": "it one line at a time from top to bottom."}, {"index": 22, "start": 100.6, "end": 104.48, "text": "Optional labs are completely optional, so you don't have to do them at all if you"}, {"index": 23, "start": 104.48, "end": 105.88, "text": "don't want to."}, {"index": 24, "start": 105.88, "end": 110.48, "text": "But I hope you will take a look, because running through them will give you a deeper"}, {"index": 25, "start": 110.48, "end": 115.28, "text": "feel, give you a little bit more experience with what machine learning algorithms, what"}, {"index": 26, "start": 115.28, "end": 119.04, "text": "machine learning code actually looks like."}, {"index": 27, "start": 119.04, "end": 123.28, "text": "Starting next week, there will also be some practice labs, which will give you an opportunity"}, {"index": 28, "start": 123.28, "end": 125.92, "text": "to write some of that code yourself."}, {"index": 29, "start": 125.92, "end": 129.04, "text": "But we'll get to that next week, so don't worry about it for now."}, {"index": 30, "start": 129.04, "end": 133.0, "text": "And I hope you just go through the next optional lab and get through the rest of"}, {"index": 31, "start": 133.0, "end": 135.28, "text": "the content for this week."}, {"index": 32, "start": 135.28, "end": 138.12, "text": "So let's take a look at an example of a notebook."}, {"index": 33, "start": 138.64, "end": 142.16, "text": "Here's what you see when you go to the first optional lab."}, {"index": 34, "start": 142.16, "end": 147.6, "text": "Feel free to scroll up and down and browse and mouse over the different menus and take"}, {"index": 35, "start": 147.6, "end": 151.12, "text": "a look at the different options here."}, {"index": 36, "start": 151.12, "end": 155.92, "text": "You might notice that there are two types of these blocks, also called cells"}, {"index": 37, "start": 155.92, "end": 157.4, "text": "in the notebook."}, {"index": 38, "start": 157.4, "end": 159.92, "text": "And there are two types of cells."}, {"index": 39, "start": 159.92, "end": 166.2, "text": "One is what's called a markdown cell, which means basically a bunch of text."}, {"index": 40, "start": 166.2, "end": 171.24, "text": "So here, you can actually edit the text if you don't like the text that we wrote."}, {"index": 41, "start": 171.24, "end": 175.2, "text": "But this is text that describes the code."}, {"index": 42, "start": 175.2, "end": 182.6, "text": "Then there's a second type of block, or cell, which looks like this, which is a code cell."}, {"index": 43, "start": 182.6, "end": 187.4, "text": "So here, we've already provided the code, and if you want to run this code cell,"}, {"index": 44, "start": 187.4, "end": 191.88, "text": "hitting Shift-Enter will run the code in this code cell."}, {"index": 45, "start": 191.88, "end": 195.0, "text": "Oh, and by the way, if you click on a markdown cell,"}, {"index": 46, "start": 195.0, "end": 201.44, "text": "so it's showing all this formatting, go ahead and hit Shift-Enter on your keyboard as well."}, {"index": 47, "start": 201.44, "end": 206.28, "text": "And that will also convert it back to this nicely formatted text."}, {"index": 48, "start": 206.28, "end": 209.6, "text": "This optional lab shows some common Python code."}, {"index": 49, "start": 209.6, "end": 214.28, "text": "So you can go ahead and run this afterward in your own Jupyter notebook."}, {"index": 50, "start": 214.28, "end": 219.32, "text": "When you jump into this notebook yourself, what I'd like you to do is select the cells"}, {"index": 51, "start": 219.32, "end": 221.4, "text": "and hit Shift-Enter."}, {"index": 52, "start": 221.4, "end": 223.96, "text": "Well, read through the code, see if it makes sense."}, {"index": 53, "start": 223.96, "end": 228.44, "text": "You know, try to make a prediction about what you think this code will do,"}, {"index": 54, "start": 228.44, "end": 233.76, "text": "and then hit Shift-Enter, and then see what the code actually does."}, {"index": 55, "start": 233.76, "end": 237.04, "text": "And if you feel like it, feel free to go in and edit the code."}, {"index": 56, "start": 237.04, "end": 240.68, "text": "You know, change the code and then run it and see what happens."}, {"index": 57, "start": 240.68, "end": 244.2, "text": "And if you haven't played in a Jupyter notebook environment before,"}, {"index": 58, "start": 244.2, "end": 248.72, "text": "I hope you become more familiar with Python in a Jupyter notebook."}, {"index": 59, "start": 248.72, "end": 251.76, "text": "I spend a lot of hours playing around in Jupyter notebooks,"}, {"index": 60, "start": 251.76, "end": 254.92, "text": "and so I hope you have fun with them too."}, {"index": 61, "start": 254.92, "end": 258.52, "text": "And after that, I look forward to seeing you in the next video"}, {"index": 62, "start": 258.52, "end": 260.96, "text": "where we'll take the supervised learning problem"}, {"index": 63, "start": 260.96, "end": 265.8, "text": "and start to flesh out our first supervised learning algorithm."}, {"index": 64, "start": 265.8, "end": 269.0, "text": "I hope that'll be fun too, and look forward to seeing you there."}], "vi": [{"index": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 8.48, "text": "Cho \\u0111\\u1ebfn nay trong c\\u00e1c video, b\\u1ea1n \\u0111\\u00e3 th\\u1ea5y h\\u1ecdc c\\u00f3 gi\\u00e1m s\\u00e1t v\\u00e0 h\\u1ecdc kh\\u00f4ng c\\u00f3 gi\\u00e1m s\\u00e1t, v\\u00e0 c\\u0169ng"}, {"index": 1, "start": 8.48, "end": 10.48, "text": "c\\u00e1c v\\u00ed d\\u1ee5 c\\u1ee7a c\\u1ea3 hai."}, {"index": 2, "start": 10.48, "end": 15.98, "text": "\\u0110\\u1ec3 b\\u1ea1n hi\\u1ec3u s\\u00e2u h\\u01a1n v\\u1ec1 nh\\u1eefng kh\\u00e1i ni\\u1ec7m n\\u00e0y, t\\u00f4i mu\\u1ed1n m\\u1eddi b\\u1ea1n trong l\\u1edbp h\\u1ecdc n\\u00e0y"}, {"index": 3, "start": 15.98, "end": 21.88, "text": "xem, ch\\u1ea1y v\\u00e0 c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 vi\\u1ebft m\\u00e3 t\\u1ef1 m\\u00ecnh \\u0111\\u1ec3 tri\\u1ec3n khai nh\\u1eefng kh\\u00e1i ni\\u1ec7m n\\u00e0y."}, {"index": 4, "start": 21.88, "end": 26.64, "text": "C\\u00f4ng c\\u1ee5 \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng r\\u1ed9ng r\\u00e3i nh\\u1ea5t b\\u1edfi nh\\u1eefng ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi th\\u1ef1c h\\u00e0nh h\\u1ecdc m\\u00e1y v\\u00e0 khoa h\\u1ecdc d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u hi\\u1ec7n nay l\\u00e0"}, {"index": 5, "start": 26.64, "end": 28.36, "text": "Jupyter Notebook."}, {"index": 6, "start": 28.36, "end": 33.36, "text": "\\u0110\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 m\\u00f4i tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng m\\u1eb7c \\u0111\\u1ecbnh m\\u00e0 nhi\\u1ec1u ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng \\u0111\\u1ec3 l\\u1eadp tr\\u00ecnh v\\u00e0 th\\u1ef1c nghi\\u1ec7m v\\u00e0 th\\u1eed"}, {"index": 7, "start": 33.36, "end": 34.84, "text": "c\\u00e1c \\u00fd t\\u01b0\\u1edfng."}, {"index": 8, "start": 34.84, "end": 39.76, "text": "V\\u00e0 v\\u00ec v\\u1eady trong l\\u1edbp h\\u1ecdc n\\u00e0y, ngay t\\u1ea1i \\u0111\\u00e2y trong tr\\u00ecnh duy\\u1ec7t web c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n, b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd c\\u00f3 kh\\u1ea3 n\\u0103ng s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng"}, {"index": 9, "start": 39.76, "end": 45.0, "text": "m\\u00f4i tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng Jupyter Notebook \\u0111\\u1ec3 th\\u1eed nghi\\u1ec7m m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 \\u00fd t\\u01b0\\u1edfng n\\u00e0y cho ch\\u00ednh b\\u1ea1n."}, {"index": 10, "start": 45.0, "end": 48.64, "text": "\\u0110\\u00e2y kh\\u00f4ng ph\\u1ea3i l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t m\\u00f4i tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng h\\u01b0 c\\u1ea5u, \\u0111\\u01a1n gi\\u1ea3n h\\u00f3a."}, {"index": 11, "start": 48.64, "end": 54.16, "text": "\\u0110\\u00e2y ch\\u00ednh x\\u00e1c l\\u00e0 m\\u00f4i tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng, ch\\u00ednh x\\u00e1c l\\u00e0 c\\u00f4ng c\\u1ee5, Jupyter Notebook m\\u00e0 c\\u00e1c nh\\u00e0 ph\\u00e1t tri\\u1ec3n"}, {"index": 12, "start": 54.16, "end": 57.56, "text": "\\u0111ang s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng t\\u1ea1i nhi\\u1ec1u c\\u00f4ng ty l\\u1edbn ngay b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd."}, {"index": 13, "start": 57.56, "end": 62.28, "text": "M\\u1ed9t lo\\u1ea1i ph\\u00f2ng th\\u00ed nghi\\u1ec7m m\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd th\\u1ea5y xuy\\u00ean su\\u1ed1t l\\u1edbp h\\u1ecdc n\\u00e0y l\\u00e0 c\\u00e1c ph\\u00f2ng th\\u00ed nghi\\u1ec7m t\\u00f9y ch\\u1ecdn,"}, {"index": 14, "start": 62.28, "end": 69.96, "text": "m\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 m\\u1edf ra v\\u00e0 ch\\u1ea1y t\\u1eebng d\\u00f2ng m\\u1ed9t m\\u00e0 th\\u01b0\\u1eddng kh\\u00f4ng c\\u1ea7n ph\\u1ea3i vi\\u1ebft m\\u00e3 n\\u00e0o."}, {"index": 15, "start": 69.96, "end": 76.12, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, c\\u00e1c ph\\u00f2ng th\\u00ed nghi\\u1ec7m t\\u00f9y ch\\u1ecdn \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c thi\\u1ebft k\\u1ebf \\u0111\\u1ec3 r\\u1ea5t d\\u1ec5 d\\u00e0ng, v\\u00e0 t\\u00f4i c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 \\u0111\\u1ea3m b\\u1ea3o b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd nh\\u1eadn \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c \\u0111i\\u1ec3m t\\u1ed1i \\u0111a"}, {"index": 16, "start": 76.12, "end": 79.96, "text": "cho t\\u1eebng c\\u00e1i, v\\u00ec kh\\u00f4ng c\\u00f3 \\u0111i\\u1ec3m s\\u1ed1."}, {"index": 17, "start": 79.96, "end": 84.6, "text": "T\\u1ea5t c\\u1ea3 nh\\u1eefng g\\u00ec b\\u1ea1n c\\u1ea7n l\\u00e0m l\\u00e0 m\\u1edf n\\u00f3 ra v\\u00e0 ch\\u1ec9 c\\u1ea7n ch\\u1ea1y m\\u00e3 m\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i cung c\\u1ea5p."}, {"index": 18, "start": 84.6, "end": 89.48, "text": "V\\u00e0 th\\u00f4ng qua vi\\u1ec7c \\u0111\\u1ecdc v\\u00e0 ch\\u1ea1y m\\u00e3 trong c\\u00e1c ph\\u00f2ng th\\u00ed nghi\\u1ec7m t\\u00f9y ch\\u1ecdn, b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd th\\u1ea5y c\\u00e1ch m\\u00e3 h\\u1ecdc m\\u00e1y"}, {"index": 19, "start": 89.48, "end": 91.28, "text": "ch\\u1ea1y."}, {"index": 20, "start": 91.28, "end": 96.72, "text": "V\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n n\\u00ean c\\u00f3 kh\\u1ea3 n\\u0103ng ho\\u00e0n th\\u00e0nh ch\\u00fang, b\\u1ea1n bi\\u1ebft \\u0111\\u1ea5y, t\\u01b0\\u01a1ng \\u0111\\u1ed1i nhanh ch\\u00f3ng, ch\\u1ec9 b\\u1eb1ng c\\u00e1ch ch\\u1ea1y"}, {"index": 21, "start": 96.72, "end": 100.6, "text": "n\\u00f3 t\\u1eebng d\\u00f2ng m\\u1ed9t t\\u1eeb tr\\u00ean xu\\u1ed1ng d\\u01b0\\u1edbi."}, {"index": 22, "start": 100.6, "end": 104.48, "text": "C\\u00e1c ph\\u00f2ng lab t\\u00f9y ch\\u1ecdn ho\\u00e0n to\\u00e0n l\\u00e0 t\\u00f9y ch\\u1ecdn, v\\u00ec v\\u1eady b\\u1ea1n kh\\u00f4ng c\\u1ea7n ph\\u1ea3i l\\u00e0m ch\\u00fang ch\\u00fat n\\u00e0o n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n"}, {"index": 23, "start": 104.48, "end": 105.88, "text": "kh\\u00f4ng mu\\u1ed1n."}, {"index": 24, "start": 105.88, "end": 110.48, "text": "Nh\\u01b0ng t\\u00f4i hy v\\u1ecdng b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd xem qua, v\\u00ec vi\\u1ec7c th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n ch\\u00fang s\\u1ebd mang l\\u1ea1i cho b\\u1ea1n m\\u1ed9t c\\u1ea3m nh\\u1eadn s\\u00e2u h\\u01a1n,"}, {"index": 25, "start": 110.48, "end": 115.28, "text": "v\\u00e0 mang l\\u1ea1i cho b\\u1ea1n th\\u00eam m\\u1ed9t ch\\u00fat kinh nghi\\u1ec7m v\\u1edbi c\\u00e1c thu\\u1eadt to\\u00e1n h\\u1ecdc m\\u00e1y, v\\u1edbi nh\\u1eefng g\\u00ec"}, {"index": 26, "start": 115.28, "end": 119.04, "text": "m\\u00e3 h\\u1ecdc m\\u00e1y th\\u1ef1c s\\u1ef1 tr\\u00f4ng nh\\u01b0 th\\u1ebf n\\u00e0o."}, {"index": 27, "start": 119.04, "end": 123.28, "text": "B\\u1eaft \\u0111\\u1ea7u t\\u1eeb tu\\u1ea7n t\\u1edbi, c\\u0169ng s\\u1ebd c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 ph\\u00f2ng lab th\\u1ef1c h\\u00e0nh, s\\u1ebd cung c\\u1ea5p cho b\\u1ea1n c\\u01a1 h\\u1ed9i"}, {"index": 28, "start": 123.28, "end": 125.92, "text": "\\u0111\\u1ec3 vi\\u1ebft m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 m\\u00e3 \\u0111\\u00f3 t\\u1ef1 yourself."}, {"index": 29, "start": 125.92, "end": 129.04, "text": "Nh\\u01b0ng ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd \\u0111\\u1ebfn v\\u1edbi \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3 v\\u00e0o tu\\u1ea7n t\\u1edbi, v\\u00ec v\\u1eady \\u0111\\u1eebng lo l\\u1eafng v\\u1ec1 n\\u00f3 b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd."}, {"index": 30, "start": 129.04, "end": 133.0, "text": "V\\u00e0 t\\u00f4i hy v\\u1ecdng b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd ho\\u00e0n th\\u00e0nh ph\\u00f2ng lab t\\u00f9y ch\\u1ecdn ti\\u1ebfp theo v\\u00e0 ti\\u1ebfp t\\u1ee5c v\\u1edbi ph\\u1ea7n c\\u00f2n l\\u1ea1i c\\u1ee7a"}, {"index": 31, "start": 133.0, "end": 135.28, "text": "n\\u1ed9i dung cho tu\\u1ea7n n\\u00e0y."}, {"index": 32, "start": 135.28, "end": 138.12, "text": "V\\u1eady h\\u00e3y c\\u00f9ng xem m\\u1ed9t v\\u00ed d\\u1ee5 v\\u1ec1 m\\u1ed9t notebook."}, {"index": 33, "start": 138.64, "end": 142.16, "text": "\\u0110\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 nh\\u1eefng g\\u00ec b\\u1ea1n th\\u1ea5y khi b\\u1ea1n \\u0111\\u1ebfn ph\\u00f2ng lab t\\u00f9y ch\\u1ecdn \\u0111\\u1ea7u ti\\u00ean."}, {"index": 34, "start": 142.16, "end": 147.6, "text": "H\\u00e3y tho\\u1ea3i m\\u00e1i cu\\u1ed9n l\\u00ean v\\u00e0 xu\\u1ed1ng v\\u00e0 duy\\u1ec7t v\\u00e0 di chu\\u1ed9t qua c\\u00e1c menu kh\\u00e1c nhau v\\u00e0 xem"}, {"index": 35, "start": 147.6, "end": 151.12, "text": "c\\u00e1c t\\u00f9y ch\\u1ecdn kh\\u00e1c nhau \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y."}, {"index": 36, "start": 151.12, "end": 155.92, "text": "B\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 nh\\u1eadn th\\u1ea5y r\\u1eb1ng c\\u00f3 hai lo\\u1ea1i c\\u00e1c kh\\u1ed1i n\\u00e0y, c\\u0169ng \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c g\\u1ecdi l\\u00e0 \\u00f4"}, {"index": 37, "start": 155.92, "end": 157.4, "text": "trong notebook."}, {"index": 38, "start": 157.4, "end": 159.92, "text": "V\\u00e0 c\\u00f3 hai lo\\u1ea1i \\u00f4."}, {"index": 39, "start": 159.92, "end": 166.2, "text": "M\\u1ed9t lo\\u1ea1i \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c g\\u1ecdi l\\u00e0 \\u00f4 markdown, c\\u00f3 ngh\\u0129a l\\u00e0 v\\u1ec1 c\\u01a1 b\\u1ea3n l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t lo\\u1ea1t v\\u0103n b\\u1ea3n."}, {"index": 40, "start": 166.2, "end": 171.24, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y, b\\u1ea1n th\\u1ef1c s\\u1ef1 c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 ch\\u1ec9nh s\\u1eeda v\\u0103n b\\u1ea3n n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n kh\\u00f4ng th\\u00edch v\\u0103n b\\u1ea3n m\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i \\u0111\\u00e3 vi\\u1ebft."}, {"index": 41, "start": 171.24, "end": 175.2, "text": "Nh\\u01b0ng \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 v\\u0103n b\\u1ea3n m\\u00f4 t\\u1ea3 m\\u00e3 ngu\\u1ed3n."}, {"index": 42, "start": 175.2, "end": 182.6, "text": "Sau \\u0111\\u00f3 c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t lo\\u1ea1i kh\\u1ed1i, ho\\u1eb7c \\u00f4 th\\u1ee9 hai, tr\\u00f4ng nh\\u01b0 th\\u1ebf n\\u00e0y, \\u0111\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 \\u00f4 m\\u00e3."}, {"index": 43, "start": 182.6, "end": 187.4, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y, ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i \\u0111\\u00e3 cung c\\u1ea5p m\\u00e3, v\\u00e0 n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n ch\\u1ea1y \\u00f4 m\\u00e3 n\\u00e0y,"}, {"index": 44, "start": 187.4, "end": 191.88, "text": "th\\u00ec vi\\u1ec7c nh\\u1ea5n Shift-Enter s\\u1ebd ch\\u1ea1y m\\u00e3 trong \\u00f4 m\\u00e3 n\\u00e0y."}, {"index": 45, "start": 191.88, "end": 195.0, "text": "\\u00c0, v\\u00e0 nh\\u00e2n ti\\u1ec7n, n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n nh\\u1ea5p v\\u00e0o m\\u1ed9t \\u00f4 markdown,"}, {"index": 46, "start": 195.0, "end": 201.44, "text": "n\\u00f3 s\\u1ebd hi\\u1ec3n th\\u1ecb t\\u1ea5t c\\u1ea3 \\u0111\\u1ecbnh d\\u1ea1ng n\\u00e0y, h\\u00e3y c\\u1ea3m th\\u1ea5y t\\u1ef1 do nh\\u1ea5n Shift-Enter tr\\u00ean b\\u00e0n ph\\u00edm c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n."}, {"index": 47, "start": 201.44, "end": 206.28, "text": "V\\u00e0 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3 c\\u0169ng s\\u1ebd chuy\\u1ec3n \\u0111\\u1ed5i l\\u1ea1i th\\u00e0nh v\\u0103n b\\u1ea3n \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c \\u0111\\u1ecbnh d\\u1ea1ng \\u0111\\u1eb9p."}, {"index": 48, "start": 206.28, "end": 209.6, "text": "Ph\\u00f2ng th\\u00ed nghi\\u1ec7m t\\u00f9y ch\\u1ecdn n\\u00e0y cho th\\u1ea5y m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 m\\u00e3 Python ph\\u1ed5 bi\\u1ebfn."}, {"index": 49, "start": 209.6, "end": 214.28, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 ti\\u1ebfp t\\u1ee5c v\\u00e0 ch\\u1ea1y m\\u00e3 n\\u00e0y sau trong s\\u1ed5 tay Jupyter c\\u1ee7a ri\\u00eang b\\u1ea1n."}, {"index": 50, "start": 214.28, "end": 219.32, "text": "Khi b\\u1ea1n t\\u1ef1 m\\u00ecnh v\\u00e0o s\\u1ed5 tay n\\u00e0y, \\u0111i\\u1ec1u t\\u00f4i mu\\u1ed1n b\\u1ea1n l\\u00e0m l\\u00e0 ch\\u1ecdn c\\u00e1c \\u00f4"}, {"index": 51, "start": 219.32, "end": 221.4, "text": "v\\u00e0 nh\\u1ea5n Shift-Enter."}, {"index": 52, "start": 221.4, "end": 223.96, "text": "Ch\\u00e0, h\\u00e3y \\u0111\\u1ecdc qua m\\u00e3, xem li\\u1ec7u n\\u00f3 c\\u00f3 h\\u1ee3p l\\u00fd kh\\u00f4ng."}, {"index": 53, "start": 223.96, "end": 228.44, "text": "B\\u1ea1n bi\\u1ebft \\u0111\\u1ea5y, h\\u00e3y th\\u1eed d\\u1ef1 \\u0111o\\u00e1n v\\u1ec1 vi\\u1ec7c b\\u1ea1n ngh\\u0129 m\\u00e3 n\\u00e0y s\\u1ebd l\\u00e0m g\\u00ec,"}, {"index": 54, "start": 228.44, "end": 233.76, "text": "sau \\u0111\\u00f3 nh\\u1ea5n Shift-Enter, v\\u00e0 nh\\u00ecn xem m\\u00e3 th\\u1ef1c s\\u1ef1 l\\u00e0m g\\u00ec."}, {"index": 55, "start": 233.76, "end": 237.04, "text": "V\\u00e0 n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n c\\u1ea3m th\\u1ea5y th\\u00edch, h\\u00e3y tho\\u1ea3i m\\u00e1i v\\u00e0o v\\u00e0 ch\\u1ec9nh s\\u1eeda m\\u00e3."}, {"index": 56, "start": 237.04, "end": 240.68, "text": "B\\u1ea1n bi\\u1ebft \\u0111\\u1ea5y, thay \\u0111\\u1ed5i m\\u00e3 v\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 ch\\u1ea1y n\\u00f3 v\\u00e0 xem \\u0111i\\u1ec1u g\\u00ec x\\u1ea3y ra."}, {"index": 57, "start": 240.68, "end": 244.2, "text": "V\\u00e0 n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n ch\\u01b0a t\\u1eebng tr\\u1ea3i nghi\\u1ec7m trong m\\u00f4i tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng s\\u1ed5 tay Jupyter tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc \\u0111\\u00e2y,"}, {"index": 58, "start": 244.2, "end": 248.72, "text": "T\\u00f4i hy v\\u1ecdng b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd quen thu\\u1ed9c h\\u01a1n v\\u1edbi Python trong m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed5 tay Jupyter."}, {"index": 59, "start": 248.72, "end": 251.76, "text": "T\\u00f4i \\u0111\\u00e3 d\\u00e0nh nhi\\u1ec1u gi\\u1edd ch\\u01a1i v\\u1edbi c\\u00e1c s\\u1ed5 tay Jupyter,"}, {"index"