: "A", "explanation": "T\\u00edch ch\\u1eadp l\\u00e0 ph\\u00e9p to\\u00e1n t\\u00edch ch\\u1eadp trong m\\u1ea1ng n\\u01a1-ron t\\u00edch ch\\u1eadp \\u0111\\u1ec3 ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u00e1c \\u0111\\u1eb7c tr\\u01b0ng trong h\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh.", "difficulty": "D\\u1ec5"}, {"question_text": "B\\u1ed9 ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ea1nh d\\u1ecdc trong h\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng nh\\u01b0 th\\u1ebf n\\u00e0o?", "options": {"A": "Ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u00e1c m\\u00e0u s\\u1eafc", "B": "Ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u00e1c c\\u1ea1nh d\\u1ecdc", "C": "Ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n \\u00e2m thanh", "D": "Ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n \\u0111\\u1ed9ng v\\u1eadt"}, "correct_answer": "B", "explanation": "B\\u1ed9 ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ea1nh d\\u1ecdc gi\\u00fap x\\u00e1c \\u0111\\u1ecbnh c\\u00e1c \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1eddng th\\u1eb3ng d\\u1ecdc trong h\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh, nh\\u01b0 lan can hay h\\u00ecnh d\\u1ea1ng ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi \\u0111i b\\u1ed9.", "difficulty": "Trung b\\u00ecnh"}, {"question_text": "Khi t\\u00edch ch\\u1eadp gi\\u1eefa h\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh 6x6 v\\u00e0 b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc 3x3, k\\u00edch th\\u01b0\\u1edbc \\u0111\\u1ea7u ra s\\u1ebd l\\u00e0?", "options": {"A": "6x6", "B": "5x5", "C": "4x4", "D": "3x3"}, "correct_answer": "C", "explanation": "Khi th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n ph\\u00e9p t\\u00edch ch\\u1eadp gi\\u1eefa ma tr\\u1eadn 6x6 v\\u00e0 3x3, k\\u1ebft qu\\u1ea3 s\\u1ebd l\\u00e0 ma tr\\u1eadn 4x4.", "difficulty": "Kh\\u00f3"}, {"question_text": "Trong ng\\u00f4n ng\\u1eef l\\u1eadp tr\\u00ecnh, h\\u00e0m n\\u00e0o th\\u01b0\\u1eddng \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng \\u0111\\u1ec3 th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n ph\\u00e9p t\\u00edch ch\\u1eadp?", "options": {"A": "Conv Forward", "B": "Matrix Multiply", "C": "Tensor Add", "D": "Vector Subtract"}, "correct_answer": "A", "explanation": "H\\u00e0m Conv Forward \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng trong l\\u1eadp tr\\u00ecnh \\u0111\\u1ec3 th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n ph\\u00e9p t\\u00edch ch\\u1eadp trong c\\u00e1c m\\u00f4 h\\u00ecnh h\\u1ecdc s\\u00e2u.", "difficulty": "Trung b\\u00ecnh"}, {"question_text": "\\u0110i\\u1ec1u g\\u00ec x\\u1ea3y ra khi b\\u1ea1n d\\u1ecbch b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc trong ph\\u00e9p t\\u00edch ch\\u1eadp?", "options": {"A": "B\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc kh\\u00f4ng c\\u00f3 hi\\u1ec7u l\\u1ef1c", "B": "K\\u1ebft qu\\u1ea3 s\\u1ebd kh\\u00f4ng thay \\u0111\\u1ed5i", "C": "C\\u00e1c gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb \\u0111\\u1ea7u ra s\\u1ebd kh\\u00e1c", "D": "Kh\\u00f4ng th\\u1ec3 d\\u1ecbch b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc"}, "correct_answer": "C", "explanation": "Khi d\\u1ecbch chuy\\u1ec3n b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc m\\u1ed9t v\\u1ecb tr\\u00ed, b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n l\\u1ea1i ph\\u00e9p nh\\u00e2n v\\u00e0 c\\u1ed9ng, d\\u1eabn \\u0111\\u1ebfn c\\u00e1c gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb \\u0111\\u1ea7u ra \\u0111\\u1ed5i kh\\u00e1c.", "difficulty": "Kh\\u00f3"}], "artifact_status": {"transcript": {"status": "ready", "error": null}, "summary": {"status": "ready", "error": null}, "timeline": {"status": "ready", "error": null}, "highlights": {"status": "ready", "error": null}, "questions": {"status": "ready", "error": null}, "briefing": {"status": "ready", "error": null}, "visual_data": {"status": "ready", "error": null}, "flashcards": {"status": "ready", "error": null}, "handsign_data": {"status": "ready", "error": null}, "quizzes": {"status": "ready", "error": null}}}	2026-05-15 12:18:08.564032
0d11bba6-cbb9-4e23-9229-d4dd56abc1bd	00c459cf-8727-412e-b214-e9f41e6b485e	data\\uploads\\videos\\00c459cf-8727-412e-b214-e9f41e6b485e.mp4	\N	\N	\N	\N	{"transcript": {"video_id": "00c459cf-8727-412e-b214-e9f41e6b485e", "language": "vi", "source_language": "en", "target_language": "vi", "available_languages": ["vi", "en"], "translation_status": {"vi": {"status": "completed", "error": null}}, "segments": [{"index": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 7.86, "text": "B\\u1ea1n \\u0111\\u00e3 th\\u1ea5y c\\u00e1ch m\\u00e0 ph\\u00e9p to\\u00e1n t\\u00edch ch\\u1eadp cho ph\\u00e9p b\\u1ea1n tri\\u1ec3n khai m\\u1ed9t b\\u1ed9 ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ea1nh theo ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng \\u0111\\u1ee9ng."}, {"index": 1, "start": 7.86, "end": 12.36, "text": "Trong video n\\u00e0y, b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd h\\u1ecdc s\\u1ef1 kh\\u00e1c bi\\u1ec7t gi\\u1eefa c\\u00e1c c\\u1ea1nh d\\u01b0\\u01a1ng v\\u00e0 \\u00e2m, t\\u1ee9c l\\u00e0 s\\u1ef1 kh\\u00e1c bi\\u1ec7t"}, {"index": 2, "start": 12.36, "end": 18.72, "text": "gi\\u1eefa s\\u1ef1 chuy\\u1ec3n ti\\u1ebfp t\\u1eeb s\\u00e1ng \\u0111\\u1ebfn t\\u1ed1i so v\\u1edbi t\\u1eeb t\\u1ed1i \\u0111\\u1ebfn s\\u00e1ng, v\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n c\\u0169ng s\\u1ebd th\\u1ea5y nh\\u1eefng lo\\u1ea1i"}, {"index": 3, "start": 18.72, "end": 23.64, "text": "b\\u1ed9 ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ea1nh kh\\u00e1c c\\u0169ng nh\\u01b0 c\\u00e1ch \\u0111\\u1ec3 cho m\\u1ed9t thu\\u1eadt to\\u00e1n h\\u1ecdc thay v\\u00ec \\u0111\\u1ec3 ch\\u00fang ta t\\u1ef1"}, {"index": 4, "start": 23.64, "end": 27.64, "text": "vi\\u1ebft m\\u00e3 cho m\\u1ed9t b\\u1ed9 ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ea1nh nh\\u01b0 ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 l\\u00e0m cho \\u0111\\u1ebfn nay. V\\u1eady h\\u00e3y b\\u1eaft \\u0111\\u1ea7u n\\u00e0o."}, {"index": 5, "start": 31.64, "end": 36.08, "text": "\\u0110\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 v\\u00ed d\\u1ee5 m\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n \\u0111\\u00e3 th\\u1ea5y t\\u1eeb video tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc, n\\u01a1i b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 h\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh k\\u00edch th\\u01b0\\u1edbc s\\u00e1u tr\\u00ean s\\u00e1u"}, {"index": 6, "start": 36.08, "end": 40.48, "text": "m\\u00e0 s\\u00e1ng \\u1edf b\\u00ean tr\\u00e1i v\\u00e0 t\\u1ed1i \\u1edf b\\u00ean ph\\u1ea3i, v\\u00e0 t\\u00edch ch\\u1eadp n\\u00f3 v\\u1edbi b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ea1nh theo ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng \\u0111\\u1ee9ng"}, {"index": 7, "start": 40.48, "end": 45.24, "text": "k\\u1ebft qu\\u1ea3 l\\u00e0 ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ea1nh d\\u1ecdc xu\\u1ed1ng gi\\u1eefa"}, {"index": 8, "start": 45.24, "end": 51.28, "text": "c\\u1ee7a h\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh. \\u0110i\\u1ec1u g\\u00ec s\\u1ebd x\\u1ea3y ra n\\u1ebfu m\\u1ed9t h\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh m\\u00e0 m\\u00e0u s\\u1eafc b\\u1ecb \\u0111\\u1ea3o ng\\u01b0\\u1ee3c"}, {"index": 9, "start": 51.28, "end": 56.48, "text": "khi n\\u00f3 t\\u1ed1i h\\u01a1n \\u1edf b\\u00ean tr\\u00e1i v\\u00e0 s\\u00e1ng h\\u01a1n \\u1edf b\\u00ean ph\\u1ea3i? V\\u1eady b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd c\\u00e1c y\\u1ebfu t\\u1ed1 l\\u00e0"}, {"index": 10, "start": 56.48, "end": 61.28, "text": "n\\u1eeda b\\u00ean ph\\u1ea3i c\\u1ee7a h\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh v\\u00e0 nh\\u1eefng gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb b\\u1eb1ng kh\\u00f4ng \\u1edf b\\u00ean tr\\u00e1i. N\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n ph\\u00e9p t\\u00edch ch\\u1eadp v\\u1edbi"}, {"index": 11, "start": 61.28, "end": 67.52, "text": "c\\u00f9ng m\\u1ed9t b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ea1nh, b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd nh\\u1eadn \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c c\\u00e1c gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb \\u00e2m 30 thay v\\u00ec 30 ch\\u1ea1y xu\\u1ed1ng"}, {"index": 12, "start": 67.52, "end": 72.92, "text": "gi\\u1eefa v\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 v\\u1ebd n\\u00f3 th\\u00e0nh m\\u1ed9t b\\u1ee9c tranh c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 tr\\u00f4ng nh\\u01b0 v\\u1eady. V\\u1eady n\\u00ean"}, {"index": 13, "start": 72.92, "end": 77.72, "text": "b\\u1edfi v\\u00ec \\u0111\\u1ed9 s\\u00e1ng c\\u1ee7a c\\u00e1c chuy\\u1ec3n ti\\u1ebfp ng\\u01b0\\u1ee3c l\\u1ea1i, c\\u00e1c gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb 30 b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd c\\u0169ng \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c \\u0111\\u1ea3o ng\\u01b0\\u1ee3c nh\\u01b0"}, {"index": 14, "start": 77.72, "end": 84.96, "text": "v\\u1eady v\\u00e0 c\\u00e1c gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb \\u00e2m 30 cho th\\u1ea5y r\\u1eb1ng \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t chuy\\u1ec3n ti\\u1ebfp t\\u1eeb t\\u1ed1i sang s\\u00e1ng thay v\\u00ec t\\u1eeb s\\u00e1ng sang"}, {"index": 15, "start": 84.96, "end": 90.02, "text": "t\\u1ed1i. V\\u00e0 n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n kh\\u00f4ng quan t\\u00e2m \\u0111\\u1ebfn vi\\u1ec7c \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t trong hai tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng h\\u1ee3p n\\u00e0o, b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3"}, {"index": 16, "start": 90.02, "end": 96.6, "text": "l\\u1ea5y gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb tuy\\u1ec7t \\u0111\\u1ed1i c\\u1ee7a ma tr\\u1eadn \\u0111\\u1ea7u ra n\\u00e0y. Nh\\u01b0ng b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc \\u0111\\u1eb7c bi\\u1ec7t n\\u00e0y th\\u1ef1c s\\u1ef1 t\\u1ea1o ra m\\u1ed9t"}, {"index": 17, "start": 96.6, "end": 102.6, "text": "s\\u1ef1 kh\\u00e1c bi\\u1ec7t gi\\u1eefa c\\u00e1c c\\u1ea1nh t\\u1eeb s\\u00e1ng sang t\\u1ed1i so v\\u1edbi t\\u1eeb t\\u1ed1i sang s\\u00e1ng. H\\u00e3y"}, {"index": 18, "start": 102.6, "end": 107.12, "text": "xem th\\u00eam m\\u1ed9t v\\u00e0i v\\u00ed d\\u1ee5 v\\u1ec1 ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ea1nh. B\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc ba tr\\u00ean ba n\\u00e0y m\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 th\\u1ea5y"}, {"index": 19, "start": 107.12, "end": 112.36, "text": "cho ph\\u00e9p b\\u1ea1n ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u00e1c c\\u1ea1nh th\\u1eb3ng \\u0111\\u1ee9ng. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd kh\\u00f4ng ng\\u1ea1c nhi\\u00ean qu\\u00e1 nhi\\u1ec1u"}, {"index": 20, "start": 112.36, "end": 118.24, "text": "r\\u1eb1ng b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc ba tr\\u00ean ba n\\u00e0y s\\u1ebd cho ph\\u00e9p b\\u1ea1n ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u00e1c c\\u1ea1nh ngang. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady"}, {"index": 21, "start": 118.24, "end": 123.04, "text": "nh\\u01b0 m\\u1ed9t l\\u1eddi nh\\u1eafc, m\\u1ed9t c\\u1ea1nh d\\u1ecdc theo b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc n\\u00e0y l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t v\\u00f9ng ba tr\\u00ean ba"}, {"index": 22, "start": 123.04, "end": 127.6, "text": "n\\u01a1i c\\u00e1c pixel t\\u01b0\\u01a1ng \\u0111\\u1ed1i s\\u00e1ng \\u1edf b\\u00ean tr\\u00e1i v\\u00e0 t\\u01b0\\u01a1ng \\u0111\\u1ed1i t\\u1ed1i \\u1edf b\\u00ean ph\\u1ea3i."}, {"index": 23, "start": 127.6, "end": 132.32, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, m\\u1ed9t c\\u1ea1nh ngang t\\u01b0\\u01a1ng t\\u1ef1 s\\u1ebd l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t v\\u00f9ng ba tr\\u00ean ba n\\u01a1i"}, {"index": 24, "start": 132.32, "end": 138.56, "text": "c\\u00e1c pixel t\\u01b0\\u01a1ng \\u0111\\u1ed1i s\\u00e1ng \\u1edf ph\\u00eda tr\\u00ean v\\u00e0 t\\u01b0\\u01a1ng \\u0111\\u1ed1i t\\u1ed1i \\u1edf h\\u00e0ng d\\u01b0\\u1edbi c\\u00f9ng. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady"}, {"index": 25, "start": 138.56, "end": 144.8, "text": "\\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t v\\u00ed d\\u1ee5. \\u0110\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t v\\u00ed d\\u1ee5 ph\\u1ee9c t\\u1ea1p h\\u01a1n khi b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 nh\\u1eefng s\\u1ed1 10 \\u1edf"}, {"index": 26, "start": 144.8, "end": 150.28, "text": "g\\u00f3c tr\\u00ean b\\u00ean tr\\u00e1i v\\u00e0 g\\u00f3c d\\u01b0\\u1edbi b\\u00ean ph\\u1ea3i. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, n\\u1ebfu ch\\u00fang ta v\\u1ebd \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y th\\u00e0nh h\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh, \\u0111\\u00e2y s\\u1ebd l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t"}, {"index": 27, "start": 150.28, "end": 155.6, "text": "h\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh s\\u1ebd t\\u1ed1i h\\u01a1n n\\u01a1i c\\u00f3 c\\u00e1c s\\u1ed1 0. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, t\\u00f4i s\\u1ebd t\\u00f4"}, {"index": 28, "start": 155.6, "end": 160.12, "text": "c\\u00e1c v\\u00f9ng t\\u1ed1i v\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 s\\u00e1ng h\\u01a1n \\u1edf g\\u00f3c tr\\u00ean b\\u00ean tr\\u00e1i v\\u00e0 g\\u00f3c d\\u01b0\\u1edbi"}, {"index": 29, "start": 160.12, "end": 165.88, "text": "b\\u00ean ph\\u1ea3i. V\\u00e0 n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n ph\\u00e9p t\\u00edch ch\\u1eadp n\\u00e0y v\\u1edbi b\\u1ed9 ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ea1nh ngang, b\\u1ea1n"}, {"index": 30, "start": 165.88, "end": 174.28, "text": "s\\u1ebd c\\u00f3 \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y. V\\u00e0 ch\\u1ec9 \\u0111\\u1ec3 l\\u1ea5y m\\u1ed9t v\\u00e0i v\\u00ed d\\u1ee5, s\\u1ed1 30 \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y t\\u01b0\\u01a1ng \\u1ee9ng"}, {"index": 31, "start": 174.28, "end": 179.52, "text": "v\\u1edbi v\\u00f9ng ba tr\\u00ean ba n\\u00e0y, n\\u01a1i th\\u1ef1c s\\u1ef1 c\\u00f3 c\\u00e1c pixel s\\u00e1ng \\u1edf tr\\u00ean v\\u00e0"}, {"index": 32, "start": 179.52, "end": 185.68, "text": "c\\u00e1c pixel t\\u1ed1i h\\u01a1n \\u1edf d\\u01b0\\u1edbi. N\\u00f3 \\u1edf quanh \\u0111\\u00e2y. V\\u00e0 v\\u00ec v\\u1eady n\\u00f3 t\\u00ecm th\\u1ea5y m\\u1ed9t"}, {"index": 33, "start": 186.0, "end": 193.6, "text": "c\\u1ea1nh d\\u01b0\\u01a1ng m\\u1ea1nh m\\u1ebd \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00f3. V\\u00e0 s\\u1ed1 \\u00e2m 30 n\\u00e0y t\\u01b0\\u01a1ng \\u1ee9ng v\\u1edbi v\\u00f9ng n\\u00e0y, m\\u00e0 th\\u1ef1c s\\u1ef1"}, {"index": 34, "start": 193.6, "end": 198.92, "text": "s\\u00e1ng h\\u01a1n \\u1edf d\\u01b0\\u1edbi v\\u00e0 t\\u1ed1i h\\u01a1n \\u1edf tr\\u00ean. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, \\u0111\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t c\\u1ea1nh \\u00e2m"}, {"index": 35, "start": 198.92, "end": 204.92, "text": "trong v\\u00ed d\\u1ee5 n\\u00e0y. V\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t l\\u1ea7n n\\u1eefa, \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t lo\\u1ea1i hi\\u1ec7n t\\u01b0\\u1ee3ng do th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf l\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i"}, {"index": 36, "start": 204.92, "end": 210.12, "text": "l\\u00e0m vi\\u1ec7c v\\u1edbi nh\\u1eefng h\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh t\\u01b0\\u01a1ng \\u0111\\u1ed1i nh\\u1ecf. B\\u1ea1n bi\\u1ebft \\u0111\\u1ea5y, \\u0111\\u00e2y ch\\u1ec9 l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t h\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh s\\u00e1u tr\\u00ean"}, {"index": 37, "start": 210.12, "end": 215.24, "text": "s\\u00e1u, nh\\u01b0ng nh\\u1eefng gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb trung gian nh\\u01b0 \\u00e2m 10 ch\\u1eb3ng h\\u1ea1n ch\\u1ec9"}, {"index": 38, "start": 215.28, "end": 220.16, "text": "ph\\u1ea3n \\u00e1nh th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf r\\u1eb1ng b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc n\\u00e0y, n\\u00f3 n\\u1eafm b\\u1eaft m\\u1ed9t ph\\u1ea7n c\\u1ee7a c\\u1ea1nh d\\u01b0\\u01a1ng \\u1edf"}, {"index": 39, "start": 220.16, "end": 224.72, "text": "b\\u00ean tr\\u00e1i v\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t ph\\u1ea7n c\\u1ee7a c\\u1ea1nh \\u00e2m \\u1edf b\\u00ean ph\\u1ea3i. V\\u00e0 v\\u00ec v\\u1eady vi\\u1ec7c pha tr\\u1ed9n nh\\u1eefng"}, {"index": 40, "start": 224.72, "end": 229.24, "text": "c\\u00f9ng nhau t\\u1ea1o ra m\\u1ed9t gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb trung gian. Nh\\u01b0ng n\\u1ebfu \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t h\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh l\\u1edbn, c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 l\\u00e0"}, {"index": 41, "start": 229.24, "end": 234.44, "text": "m\\u1ed9t ngh\\u00ecn tr\\u00ean m\\u1ed9t ngh\\u00ecn v\\u1edbi ki\\u1ec3u m\\u1eabu b\\u00e0n c\\u1edd n\\u00e0y, th\\u00ec b\\u1ea1n"}, {"index": 42, "start": 234.44, "end": 239.28, "text": "s\\u1ebd kh\\u00f4ng th\\u1ea5y nh\\u1eefng v\\u00f9ng chuy\\u1ec3n ti\\u1ebfp c\\u1ee7a h\\u00e0ng ch\\u1ee5c. C\\u00e1c gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb trung gian s\\u1ebd"}, {"index": 43, "start": 239.28, "end": 245.0, "text": "kh\\u00e1 nh\\u1ecf so v\\u1edbi k\\u00edch th\\u01b0\\u1edbc c\\u1ee7a h\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh. V\\u1eady t\\u00f3m l\\u1ea1i, c\\u00e1c"}, {"index": 44, "start": 245.08, "end": 252.04, "text": "b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc kh\\u00e1c nhau cho ph\\u00e9p b\\u1ea1n t\\u00ecm c\\u00e1c c\\u1ea1nh theo chi\\u1ec1u d\\u1ecdc v\\u00e0 chi\\u1ec1u ngang. H\\u00f3a ra r\\u1eb1ng b\\u1ed9"}, {"index": 45, "start": 252.04, "end": 257.16, "text": "l\\u1ecdc ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ea1nh d\\u1ecdc ba tr\\u00ean ba m\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng ch\\u1ec9 l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t trong nh\\u1eefng l\\u1ef1a ch\\u1ecdn"}, {"index": 46, "start": 257.16, "end": 261.12, "text": "c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3. V\\u00e0 trong l\\u1ecbch s\\u1eed, trong t\\u00e0i li\\u1ec7u v\\u1ec1 th\\u1ecb gi\\u00e1c m\\u00e1y t\\u00ednh, \\u0111\\u00e3 c\\u00f3 r\\u1ea5t nhi\\u1ec1u"}, {"index": 47, "start": 261.12, "end": 265.04, "text": "cu\\u1ed9c tranh lu\\u1eadn v\\u1ec1 b\\u1ed9 s\\u1ed1 n\\u00e0o l\\u00e0 t\\u1ed1t nh\\u1ea5t \\u0111\\u1ec3 s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0"}, {"index": 48, "start": 265.04, "end": 269.4, "text": "m\\u1ed9t \\u0111i\\u1ec1u kh\\u00e1c b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng, \\u0111\\u00f3 c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t, hai, m\\u1ed9t, kh\\u00f4ng, kh\\u00f4ng,"}, {"index": 49, "start": 269.96, "end": 276.08, "text": "\\u00e2m m\\u1ed9t, \\u00e2m hai, \\u00e2m m\\u1ed9t. \\u0110i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c g\\u1ecdi l\\u00e0 b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc Sobo. V\\u00e0"}, {"index": 50, "start": 276.08, "end": 281.04, "text": "l\\u1ee3i th\\u1ebf c\\u1ee7a \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y l\\u00e0 n\\u00f3 \\u0111\\u01b0a ra m\\u1ed9t tr\\u1ecdng s\\u1ed1 nhi\\u1ec1u h\\u01a1n cho h\\u00e0ng trung t\\u00e2m,"}, {"index": 51, "start": 281.04, "end": 286.76, "text": "pixel trung t\\u00e2m. V\\u00e0 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y khi\\u1ebfn cho n\\u00f3 c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 m\\u1ea1nh m\\u1ebd h\\u01a1n m\\u1ed9t ch\\u00fat. Nh\\u01b0ng"}, {"index": 52, "start": 286.76, "end": 290.44, "text": "c\\u00e1c nh\\u00e0 nghi\\u00ean c\\u1ee9u v\\u1ec1 th\\u1ecb gi\\u00e1c m\\u00e1y t\\u00ednh c\\u0169ng s\\u1ebd s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 b\\u1ed9 s\\u1ed1 kh\\u00e1c, nh\\u01b0"}, {"index": 53, "start": 290.44, "end": 295.16, "text": "c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 thay v\\u00ec m\\u1ed9t, hai, m\\u1ed9t, th\\u00ec n\\u00f3 n\\u00ean l\\u00e0 ba, m\\u01b0\\u1eddi, ba, \\u0111\\u00fang kh\\u00f4ng? V\\u00e0"}, {"index": 54, "start": 295.16, "end": 304.12, "text": "sau \\u0111\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 \\u00e2m ba, \\u00e2m m\\u01b0\\u1eddi, \\u00e2m ba. \\u0110i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c g\\u1ecdi l\\u00e0 b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc Shaw. V\\u00e0 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y"}, {"index": 55, "start": 304.12, "end": 309.6, "text": "c\\u00f3 nh\\u1eefng \\u0111\\u1eb7c t\\u00ednh kh\\u00e1c nhau m\\u1ed9t ch\\u00fat. V\\u00e0 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y ch\\u1ec9 d\\u00e0nh cho"}, {"index": 56, "start": 309.6, "end": 312.96, "text": "ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ea1nh d\\u1ecdc. V\\u00e0 n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n l\\u1eadt n\\u00f3 90 \\u0111\\u1ed9, b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd nh\\u1eadn \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ea1nh"}, {"index": 57, "start": 312.96, "end": 317.76, "text": "theo chi\\u1ec1u ngang. V\\u00e0 v\\u1edbi s\\u1ef1 ph\\u00e1t tri\\u1ec3n c\\u1ee7a h\\u1ecdc s\\u00e2u, m\\u1ed9t trong nh\\u1eefng \\u0111i\\u1ec1u m\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i"}, {"index": 58, "start": 317.76, "end": 321.64, "text": "\\u0111\\u00e3 h\\u1ecdc \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c l\\u00e0 khi b\\u1ea1n th\\u1ef1c s\\u1ef1 mu\\u1ed1n ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u00e1c c\\u1ea1nh trong m\\u1ed9t"}, {"index": 59, "start": 321.64, "end": 326.28, "text": "h\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh ph\\u1ee9c t\\u1ea1p, c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 b\\u1ea1n kh\\u00f4ng c\\u1ea7n thi\\u1ebft ph\\u1ea3i c\\u00f3 th\\u1ecb gi\\u00e1c m\\u00e1y t\\u00ednh"}, {"index": 60, "start": 326.28, "end": 330.32, "text": "c\\u00e1c nh\\u00e0 nghi\\u00ean c\\u1ee9u \\u0111\\u00e3 ch\\u1ecdn l\\u1ecdc m\\u01b0\\u1eddi s\\u1ed1 n\\u00e0y. C\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 b\\u1ea1n ch\\u1ec9 c\\u1ea7n h\\u1ecdc"}, {"index": 61, "start": 330.32, "end": 335.04, "text": "ch\\u00fang v\\u00e0 coi ch\\u00edn s\\u1ed1 c\\u1ee7a ma tr\\u1eadn n\\u00e0y nh\\u01b0 c\\u00e1c tham s\\u1ed1, m\\u00e0"}, {"index": 62, "start": 335.04, "end": 338.48, "text": "b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 h\\u1ecdc b\\u1eb1ng c\\u00e1ch lan truy\\u1ec1n ng\\u01b0\\u1ee3c. V\\u00e0 m\\u1ee5c ti\\u00eau l\\u00e0"}, {"index": 63, "start": 338.48, "end": 342.28, "text": "h\\u1ecdc ch\\u00edn tham s\\u1ed1 sao cho khi b\\u1ea1n l\\u1ea5y h\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh, b\\u1ee9c \\u1ea3nh"}, {"index": 64, "start": 342.28, "end": 345.68, "text": "s\\u00e1u tr\\u00ean s\\u00e1u v\\u00e0 k\\u1ebft h\\u1ee3p n\\u00f3 v\\u1edbi b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc ba tr\\u00ean ba c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n,"}, {"index": 65, "start": 345.96, "end": 350.76, "text": "th\\u00ec \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y s\\u1ebd cung c\\u1ea5p cho b\\u1ea1n m\\u1ed9t b\\u1ed9 ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ea1nh t\\u1ed1t. V\\u00e0 nh\\u1eefng g\\u00ec b\\u1ea1n th\\u1ea5y trong"}, {"index": 66, "start": 350.76, "end": 354.64, "text": "c\\u00e1c video sau n\\u00e0y l\\u00e0 ch\\u1ec9 b\\u1eb1ng c\\u00e1ch coi ch\\u00edn s\\u1ed1 n\\u00e0y nh\\u01b0"}, {"index": 67, "start": 354.64, "end": 360.32, "text": "c\\u00e1c tham s\\u1ed1, b\\u1ea1n bi\\u1ebft \\u0111\\u1ea5y, b\\u1ed9 sao l\\u01b0u c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 ch\\u1ecdn h\\u1ecdc 1110, tr\\u1eeb"}, {"index": 68, "start": 360.32, "end": 363.24, "text": "m\\u1ed9t, tr\\u1eeb m\\u1ed9t trong m\\u1ed7i tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng h\\u1ee3p, ho\\u1eb7c h\\u1ecdc b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc Sobo, ho\\u1eb7c h\\u1ecdc m\\u1ed9t"}, {"index": 69, "start": 363.24, "end": 366.72, "text": "b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc Shaw, ho\\u1eb7c c\\u00f3 kh\\u1ea3 n\\u0103ng h\\u01a1n l\\u00e0 h\\u1ecdc m\\u1ed9t c\\u00e1i g\\u00ec \\u0111\\u00f3 kh\\u00e1c th\\u1eadm ch\\u00ed"}, {"index": 70, "start": 366.72, "end": 370.12, "text": "t\\u1ed1t h\\u01a1n trong vi\\u1ec7c n\\u1eafm b\\u1eaft s\\u1ed1 li\\u1ec7u th\\u1ed1ng k\\u00ea c\\u1ee7a d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n h\\u01a1n b\\u1ea5t k\\u1ef3 c\\u00e1i n\\u00e0o"}, {"index": 71, "start": 370.12, "end": 374.64, "text": "nh\\u1eefng b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c m\\u00e3 h\\u00f3a tay n\\u00e0y. V\\u00e0 thay v\\u00ec ch\\u1ec9 ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ea1nh theo chi\\u1ec1u"}, {"index": 72, "start": 374.64, "end": 378.68, "text": "ngang d\\u1ecdc, c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 h\\u1ecdc \\u0111\\u1ec3 ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u00e1c c\\u1ea1nh \\u1edf 45"}, {"index": 73, "start": 378.72, "end": 383.8, "text": "\\u0111\\u1ed9 ho\\u1eb7c 70 \\u0111\\u1ed9 ho\\u1eb7c 73 \\u0111\\u1ed9 ho\\u1eb7c b\\u1ea5t k\\u1ef3 h\\u01b0\\u1edbng n\\u00e0o m\\u00e0 n\\u00f3"}, {"index": 74, "start": 383.8, "end": 389.32, "text": "ch\\u1ecdn. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, ch\\u1ec9 c\\u1ea7n \\u0111\\u1ec3 t\\u1ea5t c\\u1ea3 nh\\u1eefng s\\u1ed1 n\\u00e0y tr\\u1edf th\\u00e0nh"}, {"index": 75, "start": 389.32, "end": 393.28, "text": "c\\u00e1c tham s\\u1ed1 v\\u00e0 h\\u1ecdc ch\\u00fang t\\u1ef1 \\u0111\\u1ed9ng t\\u1eeb d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u, ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i nh\\u1eadn th\\u1ea5y"}, {"index": 76, "start": 393.28, "end": 396.08, "text": "r\\u1eb1ng m\\u1ea1ng n\\u01a1-ron th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 h\\u1ecdc c\\u00e1c \\u0111\\u1eb7c tr\\u01b0ng c\\u1ea5p th\\u1ea5p"}, {"index": 77, "start": 396.12, "end": 400.2, "text": "c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 h\\u1ecdc c\\u00e1c \\u0111\\u1eb7c tr\\u01b0ng nh\\u01b0 c\\u00e1c c\\u1ea1nh, th\\u1eadm ch\\u00ed m\\u1ed9t c\\u00e1ch m\\u1ea1nh m\\u1ebd h\\u01a1n"}, {"index": 78, "start": 400.44, "end": 404.28, "text": "so v\\u1edbi nh\\u1eefng g\\u00ec c\\u00e1c nh\\u00e0 nghi\\u00ean c\\u1ee9u m\\u00e1y t\\u00ednh th\\u01b0\\u1eddng c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 m\\u00e3 h\\u00f3a nh\\u1eefng th\\u1ee9 n\\u00e0y"}, {"index": 79, "start": 404.28, "end": 409.52, "text": "b\\u1eb1ng tay. Nh\\u01b0ng n\\u1ec1n t\\u1ea3ng c\\u1ee7a t\\u1ea5t c\\u1ea3 nh\\u1eefng t\\u00ednh to\\u00e1n n\\u00e0y v\\u1eabn l\\u00e0"}, {"index": 80, "start": 409.56, "end": 417.2, "text": "ph\\u00e9p to\\u00e1n t\\u00edch ch\\u1eadp, cho ph\\u00e9p qu\\u00e1 tr\\u00ecnh lan truy\\u1ec1n ng\\u01b0\\u1ee3c \\u0111\\u1ec3 h\\u1ecdc"}, {"index": 81, "start": 417.32, "end": 420.6, "text": "b\\u1ea5t k\\u1ef3 b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc ba tr\\u00ean ba n\\u00e0o m\\u1ed9t l\\u1ea7n, v\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 \\u00e1p d\\u1ee5ng n\\u00f3"}, {"index": 82, "start": 420.76, "end": 423.8, "text": "tr\\u00ean to\\u00e0n b\\u1ed9 h\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh, b\\u1ea1n bi\\u1ebft \\u0111\\u1ea5y, t\\u1ea1i v\\u1ecb tr\\u00ed n\\u00e0y, t\\u1ea1i"}, {"index": 83, "start": 423.8, "end": 428.56, "text": "v\\u1ecb tr\\u00ed n\\u00e0y, t\\u1ea1i v\\u1ecb tr\\u00ed n\\u00e0y, \\u0111\\u1ec3 xu\\u1ea5t ra b\\u1ea5t k\\u1ef3 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u g\\u00ec"}, {"index": 84, "start": 428.56, "end": 432.88, "text": "\\u0111\\u1eb7c tr\\u01b0ng \\u0111ang c\\u1ed1 g\\u1eafng ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u00e1c c\\u1ea1nh \\u0111\\u1ee9ng ho\\u1eb7c ngang"}, {"index": 85, "start": 432.92, "end": 435.48, "text": "c\\u1ea1nh, ho\\u1eb7c c\\u00e1c c\\u1ea1nh \\u1edf m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 g\\u00f3c nh\\u1ea5t \\u0111\\u1ecbnh, ho\\u1eb7c th\\u1eadm ch\\u00ed m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1"}, {"index": 86, "start": 435.48, "end": 439.52, "text": "b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc m\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 th\\u1eadm ch\\u00ed kh\\u00f4ng c\\u00f3 t\\u00ean trong ti\\u1ebfng Anh. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady"}, {"index": 87, "start": 439.52, "end": 442.0, "text": "\\u00fd t\\u01b0\\u1edfng r\\u1eb1ng b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 coi ch\\u00edn s\\u1ed1 n\\u00e0y nh\\u01b0"}, {"index": 88, "start": 442.0, "end": 445.08, "text": "c\\u00e1c tham s\\u1ed1 c\\u1ea7n \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c h\\u1ecdc \\u0111\\u00e3 tr\\u1edf th\\u00e0nh m\\u1ed9t trong nh\\u1eefng"}, {"index": 89, "start": 445.08, "end": 448.6, "text": "\\u00fd t\\u01b0\\u1edfng m\\u1ea1nh m\\u1ebd nh\\u1ea5t trong th\\u1ecb gi\\u00e1c m\\u00e1y t\\u00ednh. V\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 trong kh\\u00f3a h\\u1ecdc n\\u00e0y,"}, {"index": 90, "start": 448.6, "end": 451.72, "text": "cu\\u1ed1i tu\\u1ea7n n\\u00e0y, ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd th\\u1ef1c s\\u1ef1 n\\u00f3i v\\u1ec1 chi ti\\u1ebft c\\u00e1ch b\\u1ea1n"}, {"index": 91, "start": 451.72, "end": 454.72, "text": "th\\u1ef1c s\\u1ef1 s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng qu\\u00e1 tr\\u00ecnh lan truy\\u1ec1n ng\\u01b0\\u1ee3c \\u0111\\u1ec3 h\\u1ecdc nh\\u1eefng"}, {"index": 92, "start": 454.72, "end": 457.92, "text": "ch\\u00edn s\\u1ed1 \\u0111\\u00f3. Nh\\u01b0ng tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc ti\\u00ean, h\\u00e3y c\\u00f9ng n\\u00f3i v\\u1ec1 m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1"}, {"index": 93, "start": 457.92, "end": 460.24, "text": "chi ti\\u1ebft kh\\u00e1c, m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 bi\\u1ebfn th\\u1ec3 tr\\u00ean ph\\u00e9p to\\u00e1n"}, {"index": 94, "start": 460.24, "end": 463.6, "text": "t\\u00edch ch\\u1eadp c\\u01a1 b\\u1ea3n. Trong hai video ti\\u1ebfp theo, t\\u00f4i mu\\u1ed1n"}, {"index": 95, "start": 463.6, "end": 466.64, "text": "th\\u1ea3o lu\\u1eadn v\\u1edbi b\\u1ea1n v\\u1ec1 c\\u00e1ch s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng padding c\\u0169ng nh\\u01b0 c\\u00e1c"}, {"index": 96, "start": 466.64, "end": 469.84, "text": "b\\u01b0\\u1edbc nh\\u1ea3y kh\\u00e1c nhau cho c\\u00e1c ph\\u00e9p to\\u00e1n ch\\u1eadp. V\\u00e0 hai \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y s\\u1ebd"}, {"index": 97, "start": 470.04, "end": 473.12, "text": "tr\\u1edf th\\u00e0nh nh\\u1eefng ph\\u1ea7n quan tr\\u1ecdng trong kh\\u1ed1i x\\u00e2y d\\u1ef1ng t\\u00edch ch\\u1eadp"}, {"index": 98, "start": 473.32, "end": 475.72, "text": "c\\u1ee7a m\\u1ea1ng n\\u01a1-ron t\\u00edch ch\\u1eadp. V\\u1eady h\\u00e3y ti\\u1ebfp t\\u1ee5c \\u0111\\u1ebfn"}, {"index": 99, "start": 475.72, "end": 476.44, "text": "video ti\\u1ebfp theo."}], "segments_by_language": {"en": [{"index": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 7.86, "text": "You've seen how the convolution operation allows you to implement a vertical edge detector."}, {"index": 1, "start": 7.86, "end": 12.36, "text": "In this video, you learn the difference between positive and negative edges, that is the difference"}, {"index": 2, "start": 12.36, "end": 18.72, "text": "between light to dark versus dark to light-ish transitions, and you also see other types"}, {"index": 3, "start": 18.72, "end": 23.64, "text": "of edge detectors as well as how to have an algorithm learn rather than have us hand"}, {"index": 4, "start": 23.64, "end": 27.64, "text": "code an edge detector as we've been doing so far. So let's get started."}, {"index": 5, "start": 31.64, "end": 36.08, "text": "Here's the example you saw from the previous video where you have this image six by six"}, {"index": 6, "start": 36.08, "end": 40.48, "text": "that's light on the left and dark on the right, and convolving it with the vertical"}, {"index": 7, "start": 40.48, "end": 45.24, "text": "edge detection filter results in detecting the vertical edge down the"}, {"index": 8, "start": 45.24, "end": 51.28, "text": "middle of the image. What happens if an image where the colors are flipped"}, {"index": 9, "start": 51.28, "end": 56.48, "text": "where it is darker on the left and brighter on the right? So the tens are now on"}, {"index": 10, "start": 56.48, "end": 61.28, "text": "the right half of the image and the zeros on the left. If you convolve it with the"}, {"index": 11, "start": 61.28, "end": 67.52, "text": "same edge detection filter, you end up with negative 30s instead of 30 down the"}, {"index": 12, "start": 67.52, "end": 72.92, "text": "middle and you can plot that as a picture that maybe looks like that. So"}, {"index": 13, "start": 72.92, "end": 77.72, "text": "because the shade of the transitions is reverse, the 30s now gets reverse as"}, {"index": 14, "start": 77.72, "end": 84.96, "text": "well and the negative 30s shows that this is a dark to light rather than a light to"}, {"index": 15, "start": 84.96, "end": 90.02, "text": "dark transition. And if you don't care which of these two cases it is, you could"}, {"index": 16, "start": 90.02, "end": 96.6, "text": "take absolute values of this output matrix. But this particular filter does make a"}, {"index": 17, "start": 96.6, "end": 102.6, "text": "difference between the light to dark versus the dark to light edges. Let's"}, {"index": 18, "start": 102.6, "end": 107.12, "text": "see some more examples of edge detection. This three by three filter we've seen"}, {"index": 19, "start": 107.12, "end": 112.36, "text": "allows you to detect vertical edges. So maybe it should not surprise you too much"}, {"index": 20, "start": 112.36, "end": 118.24, "text": "that this three by three filter would allow you to detect horizontal edges. So"}, {"index": 21, "start": 118.24, "end": 123.04, "text": "as a reminder, a vertical edge according to this filter is a three by three region"}, {"index": 22, "start": 123.04, "end": 127.6, "text": "where the pixels are relatively bright on the left part and relatively dark on the"}, {"index": 23, "start": 127.6, "end": 132.32, "text": "right part. So similarly a horizontal edge would be a three by three region where"}, {"index": 24, "start": 132.32, "end": 138.56, "text": "the pixels are relatively bright on top and relatively dark in the bottom row. So"}, {"index": 25, "start": 138.56, "end": 144.8, "text": "here's one example. This is a more complex one where you have here tens in the"}, {"index": 26, "start": 144.8, "end": 150.28, "text": "upper left and lower right hand corner. So if we draw this as an image, this would be an"}, {"index": 27, "start": 150.28, "end": 155.6, "text": "image which is going to be darker where there's zeros. So I'm going to shade"}, {"index": 28, "start": 155.6, "end": 160.12, "text": "then the darker regions and then lighter in the upper left and lower"}, {"index": 29, "start": 160.12, "end": 165.88, "text": "right hand corners. And if you convolve this with a horizontal edge detector, you"}, {"index": 30, "start": 165.88, "end": 174.28, "text": "end up with this. And so just to take a couple examples, this 30 here corresponds"}, {"index": 31, "start": 174.28, "end": 179.52, "text": "to this three by three region where indeed there are bright pixels on top and"}, {"index": 32, "start": 179.52, "end": 185.68, "text": "darker pixels on the bottom. It's kind of over here. And so it finds a strong"}, {"index": 33, "start": 186.0, "end": 193.6, "text": "positive edge there. And this negative 30 here corresponds to this region, which is"}, {"index": 34, "start": 193.6, "end": 198.92, "text": "actually brighter on the bottom and darker on top. So that is a negative edge"}, {"index": 35, "start": 198.92, "end": 204.92, "text": "in this example. And again, this is kind of an artifact of the fact that we're"}, {"index": 36, "start": 204.92, "end": 210.12, "text": "working with relatively small images. You know, that this is just a six by"}, {"index": 37, "start": 210.12, "end": 215.24, "text": "six image, but these intermediate values like this minus 10 for example just"}, {"index": 38, "start": 215.28, "end": 220.16, "text": "reflects the fact that that filter here, it captures part of the positive edge on"}, {"index": 39, "start": 220.16, "end": 224.72, "text": "the left and part of the negative edge on the right. And so blending those"}, {"index": 40, "start": 224.72, "end": 229.24, "text": "together gives you some intermediate value. But if this is a very large, say a"}, {"index": 41, "start": 229.24, "end": 234.44, "text": "thousand by a thousand image with this type of checkerboard pattern, then you"}, {"index": 42, "start": 234.44, "end": 239.28, "text": "won't see these transition regions of the tens. The intermediate values would"}, {"index": 43, "start": 239.28, "end": 245.0, "text": "be quite small relative to the size of the image. So in summary, different"}, {"index": 44, "start": 245.08, "end": 252.04, "text": "filters allow you to find vertical and horizontal edges. It turns out that the"}, {"index": 45, "start": 252.04, "end": 257.16, "text": "three by three vertical edge detection filter with use is just one possible"}, {"index": 46, "start": 257.16, "end": 261.12, "text": "choice. And historically in the computer vision literature, there was a fair"}, {"index": 47, "start": 261.12, "end": 265.04, "text": "amount of debate about what is the best set of numbers to use. So here's"}, {"index": 48, "start": 265.04, "end": 269.4, "text": "something else you could use, which is maybe one, two, one, zero, zero,"}, {"index": 49, "start": 269.96, "end": 276.08, "text": "minus one, minus two, minus one. This is called a Sobo filter. And the"}, {"index": 50, "start": 276.08, "end": 281.04, "text": "advantage of this is it puts a little bit more weight to the central row, the"}, {"index": 51, "start": 281.04, "end": 286.76, "text": "central pixel. And this makes it maybe a little bit more robust. But"}, {"index": 52, "start": 286.76, "end": 290.44, "text": "computer vision researchers would use other sets of numbers as well, like"}, {"index": 53, "start": 290.44, "end": 295.16, "text": "maybe instead of a one, two, one, it should be three, 10, three, right? And"}, {"index": 54, "start": 295.16, "end": 304.12, "text": "then minus three, minus 10, minus three. This is called a Shaw filter. And this"}, {"index": 55, "start": 304.12, "end": 309.6, "text": "has yet other slightly different properties. And this is just for vertical"}, {"index": 56, "start": 309.6, "end": 312.96, "text": "edge detection. And if you flip it 90 degrees, you get horizontal edge"}, {"index": 57, "start": 312.96, "end": 317.76, "text": "detection. And with the rise of deep learning, one of the things we"}, {"index": 58, "start": 317.76, "end": 321.64, "text": "learned is that when you really want to detect edges in some"}, {"index": 59, "start": 321.64, "end": 326.28, "text": "complicated image, maybe you don't need to have computer vision"}, {"index": 60, "start": 326.28, "end": 330.32, "text": "researchers handpick these nine numbers. Maybe you can just learn"}, {"index": 61, "start": 330.32, "end": 335.04, "text": "them and treat the nine numbers of this matrix as parameters, which"}, {"index": 62, "start": 335.04, "end": 338.48, "text": "you can then learn using back propagation. And the goal is to"}, {"index": 63, "start": 338.48, "end": 342.28, "text": "learn nine parameters so that when you take the image, the six"}, {"index": 64, "start": 342.28, "end": 345.68, "text": "by six image and convolve it with your three by three filter,"}, {"index": 65, "start": 345.96, "end": 350.76, "text": "that this gives you a good edge detector. And what you see in"}, {"index": 66, "start": 350.76, "end": 354.64, "text": "later videos is that by just treating these nine numbers as"}, {"index": 67, "start": 354.64, "end": 360.32, "text": "parameters, you know, the backup can choose to learn 1110, minus"}, {"index": 68, "start": 360.32, "end": 363.24, "text": "one, minus one every once, or learn a Sobo filter, or learn a"}, {"index": 69, "start": 363.24, "end": 366.72, "text": "Shaw filter, or more likely learn something else that is even"}, {"index": 70, "start": 366.72, "end": 370.12, "text": "better at capturing the statistics of your data than any of"}, {"index": 71, "start": 370.12, "end": 374.64, "text": "these hand coded filters. And rather than just vertical"}, {"index": 72, "start": 374.64, "end": 378.68, "text": "horizontal edges, maybe can learn to detect edges there at 45"}, {"index": 73, "start": 378.72, "end": 383.8, "text": "degrees or 70 degrees or 73 degrees or whatever orientation it"}, {"index": 74, "start": 383.8, "end": 389.32, "text": "chooses. And so by just letting all of these numbers be"}, {"index": 75, "start": 389.32, "end": 393.28, "text": "parameters and learning them automatically from data, we find"}, {"index": 76, "start": 393.28, "end": 396.08, "text": "that neural networks can actually learn low level features"}, {"index": 77, "start": 396.12, "end": 400.2, "text": "can learn features such as edges, even more robustly than"}, {"index": 78, "start": 400.44, "end": 404.28, "text": "computer researchers are generally able to code up these things"}, {"index": 79, "start": 404.28, "end": 409.52, "text": "by hand. But underlying all these computations is still this"}, {"index": 80, "start": 409.56, "end": 417.2, "text": "convolution operation, which allows back propagation to learn"}, {"index": 81, "start": 417.32, "end": 420.6, "text": "whatever three by three filter once, and then to apply it"}, {"index": 82, "start": 420.76, "end": 423.8, "text": "throughout the entire image, you know, at this position, at"}, {"index": 83, "start": 423.8, "end": 428.56, "text": "this position, at this position, in order to output whatever"}, {"index": 84, "start": 428.56, "end": 432.88, "text": "feature is trying to detect the vertical edges or horizontal"}, {"index": 85, "start": 432.92, "end": 435.48, "text": "edges, or edges at some of the angle, or even some of the"}, {"index": 86, "start": 435.48, "end": 439.52, "text": "filter that we might not even have a name for in English. So"}, {"index": 87, "start": 439.52, "end": 442.0, "text": "the idea that you can treat these nine numbers as"}, {"index": 88, "start": 442.0, "end": 445.08, "text": "parameters to be learned has been one of the most powerful"}, {"index": 89, "start": 445.08, "end": 448.6, "text": "ideas in computer vision. And later in this course, later"}, {"index": 90, "start": 448.6, "end": 451.72, "text": "this week, we actually talk about the details of how you"}, {"index": 91, "start": 451.72, "end": 454.72, "text": "actually go about using back propagation to learn these"}, {"index": 92, "start": 454.72, "end": 457.92, "text": "nine numbers. But first, let's talk about some other"}, {"index": 93, "start": 457.92, "end": 460.24, "text": "details, some of the variations on the basic"}, {"index": 94, "start": 460.24, "end": 463.6, "text": "convolution operation. In the next two videos, I want to"}, {"index": 95, "start": 463.6, "end": 466.64, "text": "discuss with you how to use padding as well as different"}, {"index": 96, "start": 466.64, "end": 469.84, "text": "strides for convolutions. And these two will become"}, {"index": 97, "start": 470.04, "end": 473.12, "text": "important pieces of this convolutional building block"}, {"index": 98, "start": 473.32, "end": 475.72, "text": "of convolutional neural networks. So let's go on to"}, {"index": 99, "start": 475.72, "end": 476.44, "text": "the next video."}], "vi": [{"index": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 7.86, "text": "B\\u1ea1n \\u0111\\u00e3 th\\u1ea5y c\\u00e1ch m\\u00e0 ph\\u00e9p to\\u00e1n t\\u00edch ch\\u1eadp cho ph\\u00e9p b\\u1ea1n tri\\u1ec3n khai m\\u1ed9t b\\u1ed9 ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ea1nh theo ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng \\u0111\\u1ee9ng."}, {"index": 1, "start": 7.86, "end": 12.36, "text": "Trong video n\\u00e0y, b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd h\\u1ecdc s\\u1ef1 kh\\u00e1c bi\\u1ec7t gi\\u1eefa c\\u00e1c c\\u1ea1nh d\\u01b0\\u01a1ng v\\u00e0 \\u00e2m, t\\u1ee9c l\\u00e0 s\\u1ef1 kh\\u00e1c bi\\u1ec7t"}, {"index": 2, "start": 12.36, "end": 18.72, "text": "gi\\u1eefa s\\u1ef1 chuy\\u1ec3n ti\\u1ebfp t\\u1eeb s\\u00e1ng \\u0111\\u1ebfn t\\u1ed1i so v\\u1edbi t\\u1eeb t\\u1ed1i \\u0111\\u1ebfn s\\u00e1ng, v\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n c\\u0169ng s\\u1ebd th\\u1ea5y nh\\u1eefng lo\\u1ea1i"}, {"index": 3, "start": 18.72, "end": 23.64, "text": "b\\u1ed9 ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ea1nh kh\\u00e1c c\\u0169ng nh\\u01b0 c\\u00e1ch \\u0111\\u1ec3 cho m\\u1ed9t thu\\u1eadt to\\u00e1n h\\u1ecdc thay v\\u00ec \\u0111\\u1ec3 ch\\u00fang ta t\\u1ef1"}, {"index": 4, "start": 23.64, "end": 27.64, "text": "vi\\u1ebft m\\u00e3 cho m\\u1ed9t b\\u1ed9 ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ea1nh nh\\u01b0 ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 l\\u00e0m cho \\u0111\\u1ebfn nay. V\\u1eady h\\u00e3y b\\u1eaft \\u0111\\u1ea7u n\\u00e0o."}, {"index": 5, "start": 31.64, "end": 36.08, "text": "\\u0110\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 v\\u00ed d\\u1ee5 m\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n \\u0111\\u00e3 th\\u1ea5y t\\u1eeb video tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc, n\\u01a1i b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 h\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh k\\u00edch th\\u01b0\\u1edbc s\\u00e1u tr\\u00ean s\\u00e1u"}, {"index": 6, "start": 36.08, "end": 40.48, "text": "m\\u00e0 s\\u00e1ng \\u1edf b\\u00ean tr\\u00e1i v\\u00e0 t\\u1ed1i \\u1edf b\\u00ean ph\\u1ea3i, v\\u00e0 t\\u00edch ch\\u1eadp n\\u00f3 v\\u1edbi b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ea1nh theo ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng \\u0111\\u1ee9ng"}, {"index": 7, "start": 40.48, "end": 45.24, "text": "k\\u1ebft qu\\u1ea3 l\\u00e0 ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ea1nh d\\u1ecdc xu\\u1ed1ng gi\\u1eefa"}, {"index": 8, "start": 45.24, "end": 51.28, "text": "c\\u1ee7a h\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh. \\u0110i\\u1ec1u g\\u00ec s\\u1ebd x\\u1ea3y ra n\\u1ebfu m\\u1ed9t h\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh m\\u00e0 m\\u00e0u s\\u1eafc b\\u1ecb \\u0111\\u1ea3o ng\\u01b0\\u1ee3c"}, {"index": 9, "start": 51.28, "end": 56.48, "text": "khi n\\u00f3 t\\u1ed1i h\\u01a1n \\u1edf b\\u00ean tr\\u00e1i v\\u00e0 s\\u00e1ng h\\u01a1n \\u1edf b\\u00ean ph\\u1ea3i? V\\u1eady b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd c\\u00e1c y\\u1ebfu t\\u1ed1 l\\u00e0"}, {"index": 10, "start": 56.48, "end": 61.28, "text": "n\\u1eeda b\\u00ean ph\\u1ea3i c\\u1ee7a h\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh v\\u00e0 nh\\u1eefng gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb b\\u1eb1ng kh\\u00f4ng \\u1edf b\\u00ean tr\\u00e1i. N\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n ph\\u00e9p t\\u00edch ch\\u1eadp v\\u1edbi"}, {"index": 11, "start": 61.28, "end": 67.52, "text": "c\\u00f9ng m\\u1ed9t b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ea1nh, b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd nh\\u1eadn \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c c\\u00e1c gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb \\u00e2m 30 thay v\\u00ec 30 ch\\u1ea1y xu\\u1ed1ng"}, {"index": 12, "start": 67.52, "end": 72.92, "text": "gi\\u1eefa v\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 v\\u1ebd n\\u00f3 th\\u00e0nh m\\u1ed9t b\\u1ee9c tranh c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 tr\\u00f4ng nh\\u01b0 v\\u1eady. V\\u1eady n\\u00ean"}, {"index": 13, "start": 72.92, "end": 77.72, "text": "b\\u1edfi v\\u00ec \\u0111\\u1ed9 s\\u00e1ng c\\u1ee7a c\\u00e1c chuy\\u1ec3n ti\\u1ebfp ng\\u01b0\\u1ee3c l\\u1ea1i, c\\u00e1c gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb 30 b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd c\\u0169ng \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c \\u0111\\u1ea3o ng\\u01b0\\u1ee3c nh\\u01b0"}, {"index": 14, "start": 77.72, "end": 84.96, "text": "v\\u1eady v\\u00e0 c\\u00e1c gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb \\u00e2m 30 cho th\\u1ea5y r\\u1eb1ng \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t chuy\\u1ec3n ti\\u1ebfp t\\u1eeb t\\u1ed1i sang s\\u00e1ng thay v\\u00ec t\\u1eeb s\\u00e1ng sang"}, {"index": 15, "start": 84.96, "end": 90.02, "text": "t\\u1ed1i. V\\u00e0 n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n kh\\u00f4ng quan t\\u00e2m \\u0111\\u1ebfn vi\\u1ec7c \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t trong hai tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng h\\u1ee3p n\\u00e0o, b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3"}, {"index": 16, "start": 90.02, "end": 96.6, "text": "l\\u1ea5y gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb tuy\\u1ec7t \\u0111\\u1ed1i c\\u1ee7a ma tr\\u1eadn \\u0111\\u1ea7u ra n\\u00e0y. Nh\\u01b0ng b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc \\u0111\\u1eb7c bi\\u1ec7t n\\u00e0y th\\u1ef1c s\\u1ef1 t\\u1ea1o ra m\\u1ed9t"}, {"index": 17, "start": 96.6, "end": 102.6, "text": "s\\u1ef1 kh\\u00e1c bi\\u1ec7t gi\\u1eefa c\\u00e1c c\\u1ea1nh t\\u1eeb s\\u00e1ng sang t\\u1ed1i so v\\u1edbi t\\u1eeb t\\u1ed1i sang s\\u00e1ng. H\\u00e3y"}, {"index": 18, "start": 102.6, "end": 107.12, "text": "xem th\\u00eam m\\u1ed9t v\\u00e0i v\\u00ed d\\u1ee5 v\\u1ec1 ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ea1nh. B\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc ba tr\\u00ean ba n\\u00e0y m\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 th\\u1ea5y"}, {"index": 19, "start": 107.12, "end": 112.36, "text": "cho ph\\u00e9p b\\u1ea1n ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u00e1c c\\u1ea1nh th\\u1eb3ng \\u0111\\u1ee9ng. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd kh\\u00f4ng ng\\u1ea1c nhi\\u00ean qu\\u00e1 nhi\\u1ec1u"}, {"index": 20, "start": 112.36, "end": 118.24, "text": "r\\u1eb1ng b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc ba tr\\u00ean ba n\\u00e0y s\\u1ebd cho ph\\u00e9p b\\u1ea1n ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u00e1c c\\u1ea1nh ngang. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady"}, {"index": 21, "start": 118.24, "end": 123.04, "text": "nh\\u01b0 m\\u1ed9t l\\u1eddi nh\\u1eafc, m\\u1ed9t c\\u1ea1nh d\\u1ecdc theo b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc n\\u00e0y l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t v\\u00f9ng ba tr\\u00ean ba"}, {"index": 22, "start": 123.04, "end": 127.6, "text": "n\\u01a1i c\\u00e1c pixel t\\u01b0\\u01a1ng \\u0111\\u1ed1i s\\u00e1ng \\u1edf b\\u00ean tr\\u00e1i v\\u00e0 t\\u01b0\\u01a1ng \\u0111\\u1ed1i t\\u1ed1i \\u1edf b\\u00ean ph\\u1ea3i."}, {"index": 23, "start": 127.6, "end": 132.32, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, m\\u1ed9t c\\u1ea1nh ngang t\\u01b0\\u01a1ng t\\u1ef1 s\\u1ebd l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t v\\u00f9ng ba tr\\u00ean ba n\\u01a1i"}, {"index": 24, "start": 132.32, "end": 138.56, "text": "c\\u00e1c pixel t\\u01b0\\u01a1ng \\u0111\\u1ed1i s\\u00e1ng \\u1edf ph\\u00eda tr\\u00ean v\\u00e0 t\\u01b0\\u01a1ng \\u0111\\u1ed1i t\\u1ed1i \\u1edf h\\u00e0ng d\\u01b0\\u1edbi c\\u00f9ng. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady"}, {"index": 25, "start": 138.56, "end": 144.8, "text": "\\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t v\\u00ed d\\u1ee5. \\u0110\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t v\\u00ed d\\u1ee5 ph\\u1ee9c t\\u1ea1p h\\u01a1n khi b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 nh\\u1eefng s\\u1ed1 10 \\u1edf"}, {"index": 26, "start": 144.8, "end": 150.28, "text": "g\\u00f3c tr\\u00ean b\\u00ean tr\\u00e1i v\\u00e0 g\\u00f3c d\\u01b0\\u1edbi b\\u00ean ph\\u1ea3i. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, n\\u1ebfu ch\\u00fang ta v\\u1ebd \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y th\\u00e0nh h\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh, \\u0111\\u00e2y s\\u1ebd l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t"}, {"index": 27, "start": 150.28, "end": 155.6, "text": "h\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh s\\u1ebd t\\u1ed1i h\\u01a1n n\\u01a1i c\\u00f3 c\\u00e1c s\\u1ed1 0. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, t\\u00f4i s\\u1ebd t\\u00f4"}, {"index": 28, "start": 155.6, "end": 160.12, "text": "c\\u00e1c v\\u00f9ng t\\u1ed1i v\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 s\\u00e1ng h\\u01a1n \\u1edf g\\u00f3c tr\\u00ean b\\u00ean tr\\u00e1i v\\u00e0 g\\u00f3c d\\u01b0\\u1edbi"}, {"index": 29, "start": 160.12, "end": 165.88, "text": "b\\u00ean ph\\u1ea3i. V\\u00e0 n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n ph\\u00e9p t\\u00edch ch\\u1eadp n\\u00e0y v\\u1edbi b\\u1ed9 ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ea1nh ngang, b\\u1ea1n"}, {"index": 30, "start": 165.88, "end": 174.28, "text": "s\\u1ebd c\\u00f3 \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y. V\\u00e0 ch\\u1ec9 \\u0111\\u1ec3 l\\u1ea5y m\\u1ed9t v\\u00e0i v\\u00ed d\\u1ee5, s\\u1ed1 30 \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y t\\u01b0\\u01a1ng \\u1ee9ng"}, {"index": 31, "start": 174.28, "end": 179.52, "text": "v\\u1edbi v\\u00f9ng ba tr\\u00ean ba n\\u00e0y, n\\u01a1i th\\u1ef1c s\\u1ef1 c\\u00f3 c\\u00e1c pixel s\\u00e1ng \\u1edf tr\\u00ean v\\u00e0"}, {"index": 32, "start": 179.52, "end": 185.68, "text": "c\\u00e1c pixel t\\u1ed1i h\\u01a1n \\u1edf d\\u01b0\\u1edbi. N\\u00f3 \\u1edf quanh \\u0111\\u00e2y. V\\u00e0 v\\u00ec v\\u1eady n\\u00f3 t\\u00ecm th\\u1ea5y m\\u1ed9t"}, {"index": 33, "start": 186.0, "end": 193.6, "text": "c\\u1ea1nh d\\u01b0\\u01a1ng m\\u1ea1nh m\\u1ebd \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00f3. V\\u00e0 s\\u1ed1 \\u00e2m 30 n\\u00e0y t\\u01b0\\u01a1ng \\u1ee9ng v\\u1edbi v\\u00f9ng n\\u00e0y, m\\u00e0 th\\u1ef1c s\\u1ef1"}, {"index": 34, "start": 193.6, "end": 198.92, "text": "s\\u00e1ng h\\u01a1n \\u1edf d\\u01b0\\u1edbi v\\u00e0 t\\u1ed1i h\\u01a1n \\u1edf tr\\u00ean. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, \\u0111\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t c\\u1ea1nh \\u00e2m"}, {"index": 35, "start": 198.92, "end": 204.92, "text": "trong v\\u00ed d\\u1ee5 n\\u00e0y. V\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t l\\u1ea7n n\\u1eefa, \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t lo\\u1ea1i hi\\u1ec7n t\\u01b0\\u1ee3ng do th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf l\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i"}, {"index": 36, "start": 204.92, "end": 210.12, "text": "l\\u00e0m vi\\u1ec7c v\\u1edbi nh\\u1eefng h\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh t\\u01b0\\u01a1ng \\u0111\\u1ed1i nh\\u1ecf. B\\u1ea1n bi\\u1ebft \\u0111\\u1ea5y, \\u0111\\u00e2y ch\\u1ec9 l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t h\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh s\\u00e1u tr\\u00ean"}, {"index": 37, "start": 210.12, "end": 215.24, "text": "s\\u00e1u, nh\\u01b0ng nh\\u1eefng gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb trung gian nh\\u01b0 \\u00e2m 10 ch\\u1eb3ng h\\u1ea1n ch\\u1ec9"}, {"index": 38, "start": 215.28, "end": 220.16, "text": "ph\\u1ea3n \\u00e1nh th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf r\\u1eb1ng b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc n\\u00e0y, n\\u00f3 n\\u1eafm b\\u1eaft m\\u1ed9t ph\\u1ea7n c\\u1ee7a c\\u1ea1nh d\\u01b0\\u01a1ng \\u1edf"}, {"index": 39, "start": 220.16, "end": 224.72, "text": "b\\u00ean tr\\u00e1i v\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t ph\\u1ea7n c\\u1ee7a c\\u1ea1nh \\u00e2m \\u1edf b\\u00ean ph\\u1ea3i. V\\u00e0 v\\u00ec v\\u1eady vi\\u1ec7c pha tr\\u1ed9n nh\\u1eefng"}, {"index": 40, "start": 224.72, "end": 229.24, "text": "c\\u00f9ng nhau t\\u1ea1o ra m\\u1ed9t gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb trung gian. Nh\\u01b0ng n\\u1ebfu \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t h\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh l\\u1edbn, c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 l\\u00e0"}, {"index": 41, "start": 229.24, "end": 234.44, "text": "m\\u1ed9t ngh\\u00ecn tr\\u00ean m\\u1ed9t ngh\\u00ecn v\\u1edbi ki\\u1ec3u m\\u1eabu b\\u00e0n c\\u1edd n\\u00e0y, th\\u00ec b\\u1ea1n"}, {"index": 42, "start": 234.44, "end": 239.28, "text": "s\\u1ebd kh\\u00f4ng th\\u1ea5y nh\\u1eefng v\\u00f9ng chuy\\u1ec3n ti\\u1ebfp c\\u1ee7a h\\u00e0ng ch\\u1ee5c. C\\u00e1c gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb trung gian s\\u1ebd"}, {"index": 43, "start": 239.28, "end": 245.0, "text": "kh\\u00e1 nh\\u1ecf so v\\u1edbi k\\u00edch th\\u01b0\\u1edbc c\\u1ee7a h\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh. V\\u1eady t\\u00f3m l\\u1ea1i, c\\u00e1c"}, {"index": 44, "start": 245.08, "end": 252.04, "text": "b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc kh\\u00e1c nhau cho ph\\u00e9p b\\u1ea1n t\\u00ecm c\\u00e1c c\\u1ea1nh theo chi\\u1ec1u d\\u1ecdc v\\u00e0 chi\\u1ec1u ngang. H\\u00f3a ra r\\u1eb1ng b\\u1ed9"}, {"index": 45, "start": 252.04, "end": 257.16, "text": "l\\u1ecdc ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ea1nh d\\u1ecdc ba tr\\u00ean ba m\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng ch\\u1ec9 l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t trong nh\\u1eefng l\\u1ef1a ch\\u1ecdn"}, {"index": 46, "start": 257.16, "end": 261.12, "text": "c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3. V\\u00e0 trong l\\u1ecbch s\\u1eed, trong t\\u00e0i li\\u1ec7u v\\u1ec1 th\\u1ecb gi\\u00e1c m\\u00e1y t\\u00ednh, \\u0111\\u00e3 c\\u00f3 r\\u1ea5t nhi\\u1ec1u"}, {"index": 47, "start": 261.12, "end": 265.04, "text": "cu\\u1ed9c tranh lu\\u1eadn v\\u1ec1 b\\u1ed9 s\\u1ed1 n\\u00e0o l\\u00e0 t\\u1ed1t nh\\u1ea5t \\u0111\\u1ec3 s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0"}, {"index": 48, "start": 265.04, "end": 269.4, "text": "m\\u1ed9t \\u0111i\\u1ec1u kh\\u00e1c b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng, \\u0111\\u00f3 c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t, hai, m\\u1ed9t, kh\\u00f4ng, kh\\u00f4ng,"}, {"index": 49, "start": 269.96, "end": 276.08, "text": "\\u00e2m m\\u1ed9t, \\u00e2m hai, \\u00e2m m\\u1ed9t. \\u0110i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c g\\u1ecdi l\\u00e0 b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc Sobo. V\\u00e0"}, {"index": 50, "start": 276.08, "end": 281.04, "text": "l\\u1ee3i th\\u1ebf c\\u1ee7a \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y l\\u00e0 n\\u00f3 \\u0111\\u01b0a ra m\\u1ed9t tr\\u1ecdng s\\u1ed1 nhi\\u1ec1u h\\u01a1n cho h\\u00e0ng trung t\\u00e2m,"}, {"index": 51, "start": 281.04, "end": 286.76, "text": "pixel trung t\\u00e2m. V\\u00e0 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y khi\\u1ebfn cho n\\u00f3 c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 m\\u1ea1nh m\\u1ebd h\\u01a1n m\\u1ed9t ch\\u00fat. Nh\\u01b0ng"}, {"index": 52, "start": 286.76, "end": 290.44, "text": "c\\u00e1c nh\\u00e0 nghi\\u00ean c\\u1ee9u v\\u1ec1 th\\u1ecb gi\\u00e1c m\\u00e1y t\\u00ednh c\\u0169ng s\\u1ebd s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 b\\u1ed9 s\\u1ed1 kh\\u00e1c, nh\\u01b0"}, {"index": 53, "start": 290.44, "end": 295.16, "text": "c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 thay v\\u00ec m\\u1ed9t, hai, m\\u1ed9t, th\\u00ec n\\u00f3 n\\u00ean l\\u00e0 ba, m\\u01b0\\u1eddi, ba, \\u0111\\u00fang kh\\u00f4ng? V\\u00e0"}, {"index": 54, "start": 295.16, "end": 304.12, "text": "sau \\u0111\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 \\u00e2m ba, \\u00e2m m\\u01b0\\u1eddi, \\u00e2m ba. \\u0110i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c g\\u1ecdi l\\u00e0 b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc Shaw. V\\u00e0 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y"}, {"index": 55, "start": 304.12, "end": 309.6, "text": "c\\u00f3 nh\\u1eefng \\u0111\\u1eb7c t\\u00ednh kh\\u00e1c nhau m\\u1ed9t ch\\u00fat. V\\u00e0 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y ch\\u1ec9 d\\u00e0nh cho"}, {"index": 56, "start": 309.6, "end": 312.96, "text": "ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ea1nh d\\u1ecdc. V\\u00e0 n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n l\\u1eadt n\\u00f3 90 \\u0111\\u1ed9, b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd nh\\u1eadn \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ea1nh"}, {"index": 57, "start": 312.96, "end": 317.76, "text": "theo chi\\u1ec1u ngang. V\\u00e0 v\\u1edbi s\\u1ef1 ph\\u00e1t tri\\u1ec3n c\\u1ee7a h\\u1ecdc s\\u00e2u, m\\u1ed9t trong nh\\u1eefng \\u0111i\\u1ec1u m\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i"}, {"index": 58, "start": 317.76, "end": 321.64, "text": "\\u0111\\u00e3 h\\u1ecdc \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c l\\u00e0 khi b\\u1ea1n th\\u1ef1c s\\u1ef1 mu\\u1ed1n ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u00e1c c\\u1ea1nh trong m\\u1ed9t"}, {"index": 59, "start": 321.64, "end": 326.28, "text": "h\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh ph\\u1ee9c t\\u1ea1p, c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 b\\u1ea1n kh\\u00f4ng c\\u1ea7n thi\\u1ebft ph\\u1ea3i c\\u00f3 th\\u1ecb gi\\u00e1c m\\u00e1y t\\u00ednh"}, {"index": 60, "start": 326.28, "end": 330.32, "text": "c\\u00e1c nh\\u00e0 nghi\\u00ean c\\u1ee9u \\u0111\\u00e3 ch\\u1ecdn l\\u1ecdc m\\u01b0\\u1eddi s\\u1ed1 n\\u00e0y. C\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 b\\u1ea1n ch\\u1ec9 c\\u1ea7n h\\u1ecdc"}, {"index": 61, "start": 330.32, "end": 335.04, "text": "ch\\u00fang v\\u00e0 coi ch\\u00edn s\\u1ed1 c\\u1ee7a ma tr\\u1eadn n\\u00e0y nh\\u01b0 c\\u00e1c tham s\\u1ed1, m\\u00e0"}, {"index": 62, "start": 335.04, "end": 338.48, "text": "b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 h\\u1ecdc b\\u1eb1ng c\\u00e1ch lan truy\\u1ec1n ng\\u01b0\\u1ee3c. V\\u00e0 m\\u1ee5c ti\\u00eau l\\u00e0"}, {"index": 63, "start": 338.48, "end": 342.28, "text": "h\\u1ecdc ch\\u00edn tham s\\u1ed1 sao cho khi b\\u1ea1n l\\u1ea5y h\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh, b\\u1ee9c \\u1ea3nh"}, {"index": 64, "start": 342.28, "end": 345.68, "text": "s\\u00e1u tr\\u00ean s\\u00e1u v\\u00e0 k\\u1ebft h\\u1ee3p n\\u00f3 v\\u1edbi b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc ba tr\\u00ean ba c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n,"}, {"index": 65, "start": 345.96, "end": 350.76, "text": "th\\u00ec \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y s\\u1ebd cung c\\u1ea5p cho b\\u1ea1n m\\u1ed9t b\\u1ed9 ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ea1nh t\\u1ed1t. V\\u00e0 nh\\u1eefng g\\u00ec b\\u1ea1n th\\u1ea5y trong"}, {"index": 66, "start": 350.76, "end": 354.64, "text": "c\\u00e1c video sau n\\u00e0y l\\u00e0 ch\\u1ec9 b\\u1eb1ng c\\u00e1ch coi ch\\u00edn s\\u1ed1 n\\u00e0y nh\\u01b0"}, {"index": 67, "start": 354.64, "end": 360.32, "text": "c\\u00e1c tham s\\u1ed1, b\\u1ea1n bi\\u1ebft \\u0111\\u1ea5y, b\\u1ed9 sao l\\u01b0u c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 ch\\u1ecdn h\\u1ecdc 1110, tr\\u1eeb"}, {"index": 68, "start": 360.32, "end": 363.24, "text": "m\\u1ed9t, tr\\u1eeb m\\u1ed9t trong m\\u1ed7i tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng h\\u1ee3p, ho\\u1eb7c h\\u1ecdc b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc Sobo, ho\\u1eb7c h\\u1ecdc m\\u1ed9t"}, {"index": 69, "start": 363.24, "end": 366.72, "text": "b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc Shaw, ho\\u1eb7c c\\u00f3 kh\\u1ea3 n\\u0103ng h\\u01a1n l\\u00e0 h\\u1ecdc m\\u1ed9t c\\u00e1i g\\u00ec \\u0111\\u00f3 kh\\u00e1c th\\u1eadm ch\\u00ed"}, {"index": 70, "start": 366.72, "end": 370.12, "text": "t\\u1ed1t h\\u01a1n trong vi\\u1ec7c n\\u1eafm b\\u1eaft s\\u1ed1 li\\u1ec7u th\\u1ed1ng k\\u00ea c\\u1ee7a d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n h\\u01a1n b\\u1ea5t k\\u1ef3 c\\u00e1i n\\u00e0o"}, {"index": 71, "start": 370.12, "end": 374.64, "text": "nh\\u1eefng b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c m\\u00e3 h\\u00f3a tay n\\u00e0y. V\\u00e0 thay v\\u00ec ch\\u1ec9 ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ea1nh theo chi\\u1ec1u"}, {"index": 72, "start": 374.64, "end": 378.68, "text": "ngang d\\u1ecdc, c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 h\\u1ecdc \\u0111\\u1ec3 ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u00e1c c\\u1ea1nh \\u1edf 45"}, {"index": 73, "start": 378.72, "end": 383.8, "text": "\\u0111\\u1ed9 ho\\u1eb7c 70 \\u0111\\u1ed9 ho\\u1eb7c 73 \\u0111\\u1ed9 ho\\u1eb7c b\\u1ea5t k\\u1ef3 h\\u01b0\\u1edbng n\\u00e0o m\\u00e0 n\\u00f3"}, {"index": 74, "start": 383.8, "end": 389.32, "text": "ch\\u1ecdn. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, ch\\u1ec9 c\\u1ea7n \\u0111\\u1ec3 t\\u1ea5t c\\u1ea3 nh\\u1eefng s\\u1ed1 n\\u00e0y tr\\u1edf th\\u00e0nh"}, {"index": 75, "start": 389.32, "end": 393.28, "text": "c\\u00e1c tham s\\u1ed1 v\\u00e0 h\\u1ecdc ch\\u00fang t\\u1ef1 \\u0111\\u1ed9ng t\\u1eeb d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u, ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i nh\\u1eadn th\\u1ea5y"}, {"index": 76, "start": 393.28, "end": 396.08, "text": "r\\u1eb1ng m\\u1ea1ng n\\u01a1-ron th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 h\\u1ecdc c\\u00e1c \\u0111\\u1eb7c tr\\u01b0ng c\\u1ea5p th\\u1ea5p"}, {"index": 77, "start": 396.12, "end": 400.2, "text": "c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 h\\u1ecdc c\\u00e1c \\u0111\\u1eb7c tr\\u01b0ng nh\\u01b0 c\\u00e1c c\\u1ea1nh, th\\u1eadm ch\\u00ed m\\u1ed9t c\\u00e1ch m\\u1ea1nh m\\u1ebd h\\u01a1n"}, {"index": 78, "start": 400.44, "end": 404.28, "text": "so v\\u1edbi nh\\u1eefng g\\u00ec c\\u00e1c nh\\u00e0 nghi\\u00ean c\\u1ee9u m\\u00e1y t\\u00ednh th\\u01b0\\u1eddng c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 m\\u00e3 h\\u00f3a nh\\u1eefng th\\u1ee9 n\\u00e0y"}, {"index": 79, "start": 404.28, "end": 409.52, "text": "b\\u1eb1ng tay. Nh\\u01b0ng n\\u1ec1n t\\u1ea3ng c\\u1ee7a t\\u1ea5t c\\u1ea3 nh\\u1eefng t\\u00ednh to\\u00e1n n\\u00e0y v\\u1eabn l\\u00e0"}, {"index": 80, "start": 409.56, "end": 417.2, "text": "ph\\u00e9p to\\u00e1n t\\u00edch ch\\u1eadp, cho ph\\u00e9p qu\\u00e1 tr\\u00ecnh lan truy\\u1ec1n ng\\u01b0\\u1ee3c \\u0111\\u1ec3 h\\u1ecdc"}, {"index": 81, "start": 417.32, "end": 420.6, "text": "b\\u1ea5t k\\u1ef3 b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc ba tr\\u00ean ba n\\u00e0o m\\u1ed9t l\\u1ea7n, v\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 \\u00e1p d\\u1ee5ng n\\u00f3"}, {"index": 82, "start": 420.76, "end": 423.8, "text": "tr\\u00ean to\\u00e0n b\\u1ed9 h\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh, b\\u1ea1n bi\\u1ebft \\u0111\\u1ea5y, t\\u1ea1i v\\u1ecb tr\\u00ed n\\u00e0y, t\\u1ea1i"}, {"index": 83, "start": 423.8, "end": 428.56, "text": "v\\u1ecb tr\\u00ed n\\u00e0y, t\\u1ea1i v\\u1ecb tr\\u00ed n\\u00e0y, \\u0111\\u1ec3 xu\\u1ea5t ra b\\u1ea5t k\\u1ef3 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u g\\u00ec"}, {"index": 84, "start": 428.56, "end": 432.88, "text": "\\u0111\\u1eb7c tr\\u01b0ng \\u0111ang c\\u1ed1 g\\u1eafng ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u00e1c c\\u1ea1nh \\u0111\\u1ee9ng ho\\u1eb7c ngang"}, {"index": 85, "start": 432.92, "end": 435.48, "text": "c\\u1ea1nh, ho\\u1eb7c c\\u00e1c c\\u1ea1nh \\u1edf m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 g\\u00f3c nh\\u1ea5t \\u0111\\u1ecbnh, ho\\u1eb7c th\\u1eadm ch\\u00ed m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1"}, {"index": 86, "start": 435.48, "end": 439.52, "text": "b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc m\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 th\\u1eadm ch\\u00ed kh\\u00f4ng c\\u00f3 t\\u00ean trong ti\\u1ebfng Anh. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady"}, {"index": 87, "start": 439.52, "end": 442.0, "text": "\\u00fd t\\u01b0\\u1edfng r\\u1eb1ng b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 coi ch\\u00edn s\\u1ed1 n\\u00e0y nh\\u01b0"}, {"index": 88, "start": 442.0, "end": 445.08, "text": "c\\u00e1c tham s\\u1ed1 c\\u1ea7n \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c h\\u1ecdc \\u0111\\u00e3 tr\\u1edf th\\u00e0nh m\\u1ed9t trong nh\\u1eefng"}, {"index": 89, "start": 445.08, "end": 448.6, "text": "\\u00fd t\\u01b0\\u1edfng m\\u1ea1nh m\\u1ebd nh\\u1ea5t trong th\\u1ecb gi\\u00e1c m\\u00e1y t\\u00ednh. V\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 trong kh\\u00f3a h\\u1ecdc n\\u00e0y,"}, {"index": 90, "start": 448.6, "end": 451.72, "text": "cu\\u1ed1i tu\\u1ea7n n\\u00e0y, ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd th\\u1ef1c s\\u1ef1 n\\u00f3i v\\u1ec1 chi ti\\u1ebft c\\u00e1ch b\\u1ea1n"}, {"index": 91, "start": 451.72, "end": 454.72, "text": "th\\u1ef1c s\\u1ef1 s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng qu\\u00e1 tr\\u00ecnh lan truy\\u1ec1n ng\\u01b0\\u1ee3c \\u0111\\u1ec3 h\\u1ecdc nh\\u1eefng"}, {"index": 92, "start": 454.72, "end": 457.92, "text": "ch\\u00edn s\\u1ed1 \\u0111\\u00f3. Nh\\u01b0ng tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc ti\\u00ean, h\\u00e3y c\\u00f9ng n\\u00f3i v\\u1ec1 m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1"}, {"index": 93, "start": 457.92, "end": 460.24, "text": "chi ti\\u1ebft kh\\u00e1c, m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 bi\\u1ebfn th\\u1ec3 tr\\u00ean ph\\u00e9p to\\u00e1n"}, {"index": 94, "start": 460.24, "end": 463.6, "text": "t\\u00edch ch\\u1eadp c\\u01a1 b\\u1ea3n. Trong hai video ti\\u1ebfp theo, t\\u00f4i mu\\u1ed1n"}, {"index": 95, "start": 463.6, "end": 466.64, "text": "th\\u1ea3o lu\\u1eadn v\\u1edbi b\\u1ea1n v\\u1ec1 c\\u00e1ch s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng padding c\\u0169ng nh\\u01b0 c\\u00e1c"}, {"index": 96, "start": 466.64, "end": 469.84, "text": "b\\u01b0\\u1edbc nh\\u1ea3y kh\\u00e1c nhau cho c\\u00e1c ph\\u00e9p to\\u00e1n ch\\u1eadp. V\\u00e0 hai \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y s\\u1ebd"}, {"index": 97, "start": 470.04, "end": 473.12, "text": "tr\\u1edf th\\u00e0nh nh\\u1eefng ph\\u1ea7n quan tr\\u1ecdng trong kh\\u1ed1i x\\u00e2y d\\u1ef1ng t\\u00edch ch\\u1eadp"}, {"index": 98, "start": 473.32, "end": 475.72, "text": "c\\u1ee7a m\\u1ea1ng n\\u01a1-ron t\\u00edch ch\\u1eadp. V\\u1eady h\\u00e3y ti\\u1ebfp t\\u1ee5c \\u0111\\u1ebfn"}, {"index": 99, "start": 475.72, "end": 476.44, "text": "video ti\\u1ebfp theo."}]}}, "summary": ["- Ph\\u00e9p to\\u00e1n t\\u00edch ch\\u1eadp gi\\u00fap ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ea1nh theo ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng \\u0111\\u1ee9ng.", "- C\\u00f3 s\\u1ef1 kh\\u00e1c bi\\u1ec7t gi\\u1eefa c\\u1ea1nh d\\u01b0\\u01a1ng (s\\u00e1ng \\u0111\\u1ebfn t\\u1ed1i) v\\u00e0 c\\u1ea1nh \\u00e2m (t\\u1ed1i \\u0111\\u1ebfn s\\u00e1ng).", "- V\\u00ed d\\u1ee5: H\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh t\\u1ed1i h\\u01a1n b\\u00ean tr\\u00e1i v\\u00e0 s\\u00e1ng h\\u01a1n b\\u00ean ph\\u1ea3i cho k\\u1ebft qu\\u1ea3 gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb \\u00e2m.", "- L\\u1ea5y gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb tuy\\u1ec7t \\u0111\\u1ed1i c\\u1ee7a ma tr\\u1eadn \\u0111\\u1ea7u ra c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 gi\\u00fap ph\\u00e2n bi\\u1ec7t gi\\u1eefa c\\u00e1c c\\u1ea1nh.", "- B\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc ba tr\\u00ean ba ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ea1nh d\\u1ecdc, trong khi b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc t\\u01b0\\u01a1ng t\\u1ef1 ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ea1nh ngang.", "- V\\u00ed d\\u1ee5 ph\\u1ee9c t\\u1ea1p v\\u1edbi s\\u1ed1 10 \\u1edf c\\u00e1c g\\u00f3c cho th\\u1ea5y c\\u1ea1nh d\\u01b0\\u01a1ng v\\u00e0 \\u00e2m.", "- Gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb trung gian trong h\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh nh\\u1ecf c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 ph\\u1ea3n \\u00e1nh s\\u1ef1 pha tr\\u1ed9n gi\\u1eefa c\\u1ea1nh d\\u01b0\\u01a1ng v\\u00e0 \\u00e2m.", "- C\\u00e1c b\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc kh\\u00e1c nhau t\\u00ecm c\\u00e1c c\\u1ea1nh theo chi\\u1ec1u d\\u1ecdc v\\u00e0 ngang, v\\u1edbi nhi\\u1ec1u t\\u00f9y ch\\u1ecdn.", "- B\\u1ed9 l\\u1ecdc Sobo l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t trong nh\\u1eefng l\\u1ef1a ch\\u1ecdn, c\\u00f3 tr\\u1ecdng s\\u1ed1 cao cho pixel trung t\\u00e2m."], "timeline": [{"time": "00:00", "title": "Gi\\u1edbi thi\\u1ec7u v\\u1ec1 ph\\u00e9p to\\u00e1n t\\u00edch ch\\u1eadp v\\u00e0 ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ea1nh"}, {"time": "00:31", "title": "Ph\\u00e1t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ea1nh v\\u1edbi m\\u00e0u s\\u1eafc \\u01