": 38.28, "text": "V\\u00e0 b\\u00ean d\\u01b0\\u1edbi l\\u00e0 thu\\u1eadt to\\u00e1n gradient descent."}, {"index": 10, "start": 38.28, "end": 45.56, "text": "H\\u00f3a ra n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n t\\u00ednh c\\u00e1c \\u0111\\u1ea1o h\\u00e0m n\\u00e0y, \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 nh\\u1eefng th\\u00e0nh ph\\u1ea7n m\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd nh\\u1eadn \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c."}, {"index": 11, "start": 45.56, "end": 54.12, "text": "\\u0110\\u1ea1o h\\u00e0m theo w l\\u00e0 t\\u1ed5ng 1 tr\\u00ean m t\\u1eeb i b\\u1eb1ng 1 \\u0111\\u1ebfn m."}, {"index": 12, "start": 54.12, "end": 59.76, "text": "Sau \\u0111\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 th\\u00e0nh ph\\u1ea7n sai s\\u1ed1, t\\u1ee9c l\\u00e0 s\\u1ef1 ch\\u00eanh l\\u1ec7ch gi\\u1eefa gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb d\\u1ef1 \\u0111o\\u00e1n v\\u00e0 gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf,"}, {"index": 13, "start": 59.76, "end": 63.08, "text": "nh\\u00e2n v\\u1edbi \\u0111\\u1eb7c tr\\u01b0ng \\u0111\\u1ea7u v\\u00e0o xi."}, {"index": 14, "start": 63.08, "end": 68.56, "text": "V\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u1ea1o h\\u00e0m theo b l\\u00e0 c\\u00f4ng th\\u1ee9c n\\u00e0y \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y,"}, {"index": 15, "start": 68.56, "end": 75.88, "text": "n\\u00f3 tr\\u00f4ng gi\\u1ed1ng nh\\u01b0 ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng tr\\u00ecnh \\u1edf tr\\u00ean ngo\\u1ea1i tr\\u1eeb vi\\u1ec7c kh\\u00f4ng c\\u00f3 th\\u00e0nh ph\\u1ea7n xi \\u1edf cu\\u1ed1i."}, {"index": 16, "start": 75.88, "end": 80.44, "text": "V\\u00e0 n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng c\\u00e1c c\\u00f4ng th\\u1ee9c n\\u00e0y \\u0111\\u1ec3 t\\u00ednh c\\u00e1c \\u0111\\u1ea1o h\\u00e0m n\\u00e0y"}, {"index": 17, "start": 80.44, "end": 84.56, "text": "v\\u00e0 th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n gradient descent theo c\\u00e1ch n\\u00e0y, n\\u00f3 s\\u1ebd ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng."}, {"index": 18, "start": 84.56, "end": 88.92, "text": "B\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd, c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 b\\u1ea1n \\u0111ang t\\u1ef1 h\\u1ecfi, t\\u00f4i l\\u1ea5y nh\\u1eefng c\\u00f4ng th\\u1ee9c n\\u00e0y t\\u1eeb \\u0111\\u00e2u?"}, {"index": 19, "start": 88.92, "end": 91.28, "text": "Ch\\u00fang \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c suy ra b\\u1eb1ng c\\u00e1ch s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng ph\\u00e9p t\\u00ednh."}, {"index": 20, "start": 91.28, "end": 96.92, "text": "N\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n xem to\\u00e0n b\\u1ed9 quy tr\\u00ecnh suy di\\u1ec5n, t\\u00f4i s\\u1ebd nhanh ch\\u00f3ng tr\\u00ecnh b\\u00e0y quy tr\\u00ecnh \\u1ea5y tr\\u00ean slide ti\\u1ebfp theo."}, {"index": 21, "start": 96.92, "end": 101.56, "text": "Nh\\u01b0ng n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n kh\\u00f4ng nh\\u1edb ho\\u1eb7c kh\\u00f4ng quan t\\u00e2m \\u0111\\u1ebfn ph\\u00e9p t\\u00ednh vi t\\u00edch ph\\u00e2n, \\u0111\\u1eebng lo l\\u1eafng v\\u1ec1 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3."}, {"index": 22, "start": 101.56, "end": 104.48, "text": "B\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 ho\\u00e0n to\\u00e0n b\\u1ecf qua t\\u00e0i li\\u1ec7u tr\\u00ean slide ti\\u1ebfp theo."}, {"index": 23, "start": 104.48, "end": 110.28, "text": "v\\u00e0 v\\u1eabn c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng ph\\u00e1p gi\\u1ea3m gradient v\\u00e0 ho\\u00e0n th\\u00e0nh l\\u1edbp h\\u1ecdc n\\u00e0y, m\\u1ecdi th\\u1ee9 s\\u1ebd ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng t\\u1ed1t."}, {"index": 24, "start": 110.32, "end": 115.56, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, trong slide n\\u00e0y, m\\u1ed9t trong nh\\u1eefng slide mang t\\u00ednh to\\u00e1n h\\u1ecdc nh\\u1ea5t c\\u1ee7a to\\u00e0n b\\u1ed9 ch\\u01b0\\u01a1ng tr\\u00ecnh chuy\\u00ean s\\u00e2u."}, {"index": 25, "start": 115.56, "end": 121.8, "text": "v\\u00e0 l\\u1ea1i ho\\u00e0n to\\u00e0n l\\u00e0 t\\u00f9y ch\\u1ecdn, ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i s\\u1ebd ch\\u1ec9 cho b\\u1ea1n c\\u00e1ch t\\u00ednh c\\u00e1c bi\\u1ebfn s\\u1ed1 \\u0111\\u1ea1o h\\u00e0m."}, {"index": 26, "start": 121.8, "end": 124.08, "text": "H\\u00e3y b\\u1eaft \\u0111\\u1ea7u v\\u1edbi bi\\u1ebfn s\\u1ed1 \\u0111\\u1ea7u ti\\u00ean."}, {"index": 27, "start": 124.08, "end": 129.08, "text": "\\u0110\\u1ea1o h\\u00e0m c\\u1ee7a h\\u00e0m cos j theo w."}, {"index": 28, "start": 129.08, "end": 138.72, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd b\\u1eaft \\u0111\\u1ea7u b\\u1eb1ng c\\u00e1ch thay th\\u1ebf \\u0111\\u1ecbnh ngh\\u0129a c\\u1ee7a h\\u00e0m cos j, v\\u00ec v\\u1eady j c\\u1ee7a wb l\\u00e0 nh\\u01b0 th\\u1ebf n\\u00e0y."}, {"index": 29, "start": 138.72, "end": 145.56, "text": "V\\u1eady l\\u00e0 1 tr\\u00ean 2m nh\\u00e2n v\\u1edbi t\\u1ed5ng c\\u00e1c bi\\u1ebfn s\\u1ed1 sai s\\u1ed1 b\\u00ecnh ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng n\\u00e0y."}, {"index": 30, "start": 145.56, "end": 157.24, "text": "V\\u00e0 b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd, h\\u00e3y nh\\u1edb r\\u1eb1ng f c\\u1ee7a wb c\\u1ee7a xi b\\u1eb1ng v\\u1edbi h\\u1ea1ng t\\u1eed n\\u00e0y \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y,"}, {"index": 31, "start": 157.24, "end": 161.56, "text": "\\u0111\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 wxi c\\u1ed9ng b."}, {"index": 32, "start": 161.56, "end": 168.08, "text": "V\\u00e0 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u ch\\u00fang ta mu\\u1ed1n l\\u00e0m l\\u00e0 t\\u00ednh \\u0111\\u1ea1o h\\u00e0m, c\\u00f2n \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c g\\u1ecdi l\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u1ea1o h\\u00e0m ri\\u00eang"}, {"index": 33, "start": 168.08, "end": 175.0, "text": "theo w c\\u1ee7a ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng tr\\u00ecnh n\\u00e0y \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y b\\u00ean ph\\u1ea3i."}, {"index": 34, "start": 175.0, "end": 180.08, "text": "N\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n \\u0111\\u00e3 h\\u1ecdc m\\u1ed9t l\\u1edbp gi\\u1ea3i t\\u00edch tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc \\u0111\\u00e2y v\\u00e0 n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n ch\\u01b0a h\\u1ecdc th\\u00ec c\\u0169ng ho\\u00e0n to\\u00e0n kh\\u00f4ng sao,"}, {"index": 35, "start": 180.08, "end": 187.36, "text": "b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 bi\\u1ebft r\\u1eb1ng theo quy t\\u1eafc c\\u1ee7a gi\\u1ea3i t\\u00edch, \\u0111\\u1ea1o h\\u00e0m b\\u1eb1ng v\\u1edbi h\\u1ea1ng t\\u1eed n\\u00e0y \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y,"}, {"index": 36, "start": 187.36, "end": 193.16, "text": "\\u0111\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 l\\u00fd do t\\u1ea1i sao 2 \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y v\\u00e0 2 \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y h\\u1ee7y nhau,"}, {"index": 37, "start": 193.16, "end": 198.84, "text": "\\u0111\\u1ec3 l\\u1ea1i cho ch\\u00fang ta ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng tr\\u00ecnh m\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n \\u0111\\u00e3 th\\u1ea5y tr\\u00ean slide tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc."}, {"index": 38, "start": 198.84, "end": 206.08, "text": "V\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u00e2y c\\u0169ng l\\u00e0 l\\u00fd do t\\u1ea1i sao ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 ph\\u1ea3i t\\u00ecm h\\u00e0m cos v\\u1edbi m\\u1ed9t n\\u1eeda v\\u00e0o \\u0111\\u1ea7u tu\\u1ea7n n\\u00e0y,"}, {"index": 39, "start": 206.08, "end": 209.24, "text": "b\\u1edfi v\\u00ec \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3 gi\\u00fap cho \\u0111\\u1ea1o h\\u00e0m ri\\u00eang g\\u1ecdn g\\u00e0ng h\\u01a1n."}, {"index": 40, "start": 209.24, "end": 214.52, "text": "N\\u00f3 lo\\u1ea1i b\\u1ecf \\u0111i 2 xu\\u1ea5t hi\\u1ec7n t\\u1eeb vi\\u1ec7c t\\u00ednh \\u0111\\u1ea1o h\\u00e0m."}, {"index": 41, "start": 214.52, "end": 219.96, "text": "V\\u1edbi \\u0111\\u1ea1o h\\u00e0m kh\\u00e1c li\\u00ean quan \\u0111\\u1ebfn b, \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y kh\\u00e1 t\\u01b0\\u01a1ng t\\u1ef1."}, {"index": 42, "start": 219.96, "end": 229.76, "text": "T\\u00f4i c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 vi\\u1ebft l\\u1ea1i nh\\u01b0 th\\u1ebf n\\u00e0y v\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t l\\u1ea7n n\\u1eefa thay th\\u1ebf \\u0111\\u1ecbnh ngh\\u0129a c\\u1ee7a f c\\u1ee7a xi, cho ra ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng tr\\u00ecnh n\\u00e0y."}, {"index": 43, "start": 229.76, "end": 238.44, "text": "V\\u00e0 theo c\\u00e1c quy t\\u1eafc c\\u1ee7a ph\\u00e9p t\\u00ednh vi ph\\u00e2n, \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y b\\u1eb1ng v\\u1edbi \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y, n\\u01a1i kh\\u00f4ng c\\u00f2n xi n\\u1eefa \\u1edf cu\\u1ed1i."}, {"index": 44, "start": 238.44, "end": 247.12, "text": "V\\u00e0 v\\u00ec v\\u1eady, c\\u00e1c s\\u1ed1 2 l\\u1ea1i lo\\u1ea1i b\\u1ecf v\\u1edbi nhau v\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd c\\u00f3 bi\\u1ec3u th\\u1ee9c n\\u00e0y cho \\u0111\\u1ea1o h\\u00e0m li\\u00ean quan \\u0111\\u1ebfn b."}, {"index": 45, "start": 247.12, "end": 256.04, "text": "V\\u00e0 b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 hai bi\\u1ec3u th\\u1ee9c n\\u00e0y cho c\\u00e1c \\u0111\\u1ea1o h\\u00e0m v\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 thay th\\u1ebf ch\\u00fang v\\u00e0o thu\\u1eadt to\\u00e1n gi\\u1ea3m d\\u1ea7n theo gradient."}, {"index": 46, "start": 256.04, "end": 260.36, "text": "V\\u1eady \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 thu\\u1eadt to\\u00e1n gi\\u1ea3m d\\u1ea7n theo gradient cho h\\u1ed3i quy tuy\\u1ebfn t\\u00ednh."}, {"index": 47, "start": 260.36, "end": 266.4, "text": "B\\u1ea1n ti\\u1ebfp t\\u1ee5c th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n c\\u00e1c c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt n\\u00e0y cho w v\\u00e0 b cho \\u0111\\u1ebfn khi h\\u1ed9i t\\u1ee5."}, {"index": 48, "start": 266.4, "end": 275.92, "text": "Nh\\u1edb r\\u1eb1ng f c\\u1ee7a x l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t m\\u00f4 h\\u00ecnh h\\u1ed3i quy tuy\\u1ebfn t\\u00ednh, v\\u00ec v\\u1eady n\\u00f3 b\\u1eb1ng w nh\\u00e2n v\\u1edbi x c\\u1ed9ng v\\u1edbi b."}, {"index": 49, "start": 275.92, "end": 281.64, "text": "Bi\\u1ec3u th\\u1ee9c n\\u00e0y l\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u1ea1o h\\u00e0m c\\u1ee7a h\\u00e0m cos v\\u1edbi respect \\u0111\\u1ebfn w."}, {"index": 50, "start": 281.64, "end": 287.4, "text": "V\\u00e0 bi\\u1ec3u th\\u1ee9c n\\u00e0y l\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u1ea1o h\\u00e0m c\\u1ee7a h\\u00e0m cos v\\u1edbi respect \\u0111\\u1ebfn b."}, {"index": 51, "start": 287.4, "end": 294.48, "text": "V\\u00e0 nh\\u01b0 m\\u1ed9t l\\u1eddi nh\\u1eafc nh\\u1edf, b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt w v\\u00e0 b \\u0111\\u1ed3ng th\\u1eddi \\u1edf m\\u1ed7i b\\u01b0\\u1edbc."}, {"index": 52, "start": 294.48, "end": 298.28, "text": "B\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd h\\u00e3y l\\u00e0m quen v\\u1edbi c\\u00e1ch m\\u00e0 gi\\u1ea3m d\\u1ea7n theo gradient ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng."}, {"index": 53, "start": 298.28, "end": 305.44, "text": "M\\u1ed9t v\\u1ea5n \\u0111\\u1ec1 m\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang ta th\\u1ea5y v\\u1edbi gi\\u1ea3m d\\u1ea7n theo gradient l\\u00e0 n\\u00f3 c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 d\\u1eabn \\u0111\\u1ebfn m\\u1ed9t \\u0111i\\u1ec3m c\\u1ef1c ti\\u1ec3u c\\u1ee5c b\\u1ed9 thay v\\u00ec m\\u1ed9t \\u0111i\\u1ec3m c\\u1ef1c ti\\u1ec3u to\\u00e0n c\\u1ea7u,"}, {"index": 54, "start": 305.44, "end": 313.24, "text": "N\\u01a1i \\u0111i\\u1ec3m c\\u1ef1c ti\\u1ec3u to\\u00e0n c\\u1ea7u c\\u00f3 ngh\\u0129a l\\u00e0 \\u0111i\\u1ec3m c\\u00f3 gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb th\\u1ea5p nh\\u1ea5t c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 cho h\\u00e0m cos j, trong t\\u1ea5t c\\u1ea3 c\\u00e1c \\u0111i\\u1ec3m c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3."}, {"index": 55, "start": 313.24, "end": 321.88, "text": "B\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 nh\\u1edb b\\u1ee9c tranh b\\u1ec1 m\\u1eb7t n\\u00e0y tr\\u00f4ng nh\\u01b0 m\\u1ed9t c\\u00f4ng vi\\u00ean ngo\\u00e0i tr\\u1eddi v\\u1edbi m\\u1ed9t v\\u00e0i ng\\u1ecdn \\u0111\\u1ed3i c\\u00f3 c\\u1ecf v\\u00e0 chim ch\\u00f3c, m\\u1ed9t ng\\u1ecdn \\u0111\\u1ed3i th\\u01b0 gi\\u00e3n ngo\\u00e0i tr\\u1eddi."}, {"index": 56, "start": 321.88, "end": 325.04, "text": "H\\u00e0m n\\u00e0y c\\u00f3 nhi\\u1ec1u h\\u01a1n m\\u1ed9t \\u0111i\\u1ec3m c\\u1ef1c ti\\u1ec3u c\\u1ee5c b\\u1ed9."}, {"index": 57, "start": 325.04, "end": 332.4, "text": "Nh\\u1edb r\\u1eb1ng, t\\u00f9y thu\\u1ed9c v\\u00e0o n\\u01a1i b\\u1ea1n kh\\u1edfi t\\u1ea1o c\\u00e1c tham s\\u1ed1 w v\\u00e0 b, b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 k\\u1ebft th\\u00fac \\u1edf nh\\u1eefng \\u0111i\\u1ec3m c\\u1ef1c ti\\u1ec3u c\\u1ee5c b\\u1ed9 kh\\u00e1c nhau."}, {"index": 58, "start": 332.4, "end": 336.88, "text": "B\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 k\\u1ebft th\\u00fac \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y ho\\u1eb7c b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 k\\u1ebft th\\u00fac \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y."}, {"index": 59, "start": 336.88, "end": 342.12, "text": "Nh\\u01b0ng h\\u00f3a ra khi b\\u1ea1n s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng m\\u1ed9t h\\u00e0m cos l\\u1ed7i b\\u00ecnh ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng v\\u1edbi h\\u1ed3i quy tuy\\u1ebfn t\\u00ednh,"}, {"index": 60, "start": 342.12, "end": 347.4, "text": "H\\u00e0m cos kh\\u00f4ng v\\u00e0 s\\u1ebd kh\\u00f4ng bao gi\\u1edd c\\u00f3 nhi\\u1ec1u c\\u1ef1c ti\\u1ec3u c\\u1ee5c b\\u1ed9."}, {"index": 61, "start": 347.4, "end": 352.36, "text": "N\\u00f3 c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t c\\u1ef1c ti\\u1ec3u to\\u00e0n c\\u1ee5c duy nh\\u1ea5t v\\u00ec h\\u00ecnh d\\u1ea1ng nh\\u01b0 c\\u00e1i ch\\u00e9n n\\u00e0y."}, {"index": 62, "start": 352.36, "end": 358.76, "text": "Thu\\u1eadt ng\\u1eef k\\u1ef9 thu\\u1eadt cho \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y l\\u00e0 h\\u00e0m cos n\\u00e0y l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t h\\u00e0m l\\u1ed3i."}, {"index": 63, "start": 358.8, "end": 369.16, "text": "Kh\\u00f4ng ch\\u00ednh th\\u1ee9c, m\\u1ed9t h\\u00e0m l\\u1ed3i l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t h\\u00e0m c\\u00f3 h\\u00ecnh d\\u1ea1ng gi\\u1ed1ng c\\u00e1i b\\u00e1t v\\u00e0 n\\u00f3 kh\\u00f4ng th\\u1ec3 c\\u00f3 b\\u1ea5t k\\u1ef3 c\\u1ef1c ti\\u1ec3u c\\u1ee5c b\\u1ed9 n\\u00e0o kh\\u00e1c ngo\\u00e0i c\\u1ef1c ti\\u1ec3u to\\u00e0n c\\u1ee5c duy nh\\u1ea5t."}, {"index": 64, "start": 369.16, "end": 373.96, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, khi b\\u1ea1n th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng ph\\u00e1p gi\\u1ea3m d\\u1ea7n gradient tr\\u00ean m\\u1ed9t h\\u00e0m l\\u1ed3i,"}, {"index": 65, "start": 373.96, "end": 379.12, "text": "M\\u1ed9t \\u0111\\u1eb7c \\u0111i\\u1ec3m t\\u1ed1t l\\u00e0 mi\\u1ec5n l\\u00e0 t\\u1ef7 l\\u1ec7 h\\u1ecdc c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c ch\\u1ecdn m\\u1ed9t c\\u00e1ch ph\\u00f9 h\\u1ee3p,"}, {"index": 66, "start": 379.12, "end": 382.48, "text": "n\\u00f3 s\\u1ebd lu\\u00f4n h\\u1ed9i t\\u1ee5 v\\u1ec1 \\u0111i\\u1ec3m t\\u1ed1i thi\\u1ec3u to\\u00e0n c\\u1ee5c."}, {"index": 67, "start": 382.48, "end": 388.08, "text": "Ch\\u00fac m\\u1eebng, b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd b\\u1ea1n \\u0111\\u00e3 bi\\u1ebft c\\u00e1ch th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n thu\\u1eadt to\\u00e1n gradient descent cho h\\u1ed3i quy tuy\\u1ebfn t\\u00ednh."}, {"index": 68, "start": 388.08, "end": 390.92, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta ch\\u1ec9 c\\u00f2n m\\u1ed9t video cu\\u1ed1i c\\u00f9ng cho tu\\u1ea7n n\\u00e0y."}, {"index": 69, "start": 390.92, "end": 393.88, "text": "Trong video \\u0111\\u00f3, ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd xem thu\\u1eadt to\\u00e1n n\\u00e0y ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng."}, {"index": 70, "start": 393.88, "end": 396.04, "text": "H\\u00e3y c\\u00f9ng \\u0111\\u1ebfn video cu\\u1ed1i c\\u00f9ng \\u0111\\u00f3."}], "segments_by_language": {"en": [{"index": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 7.42, "text": "So previously you took a look at the linear regression model and then the cost function"}, {"index": 1, "start": 7.42, "end": 10.6, "text": "and then the gradient descent algorithm."}, {"index": 2, "start": 10.6, "end": 15.32, "text": "In this video, we're going to put it all together and use the squared error cost function"}, {"index": 3, "start": 15.32, "end": 19.4, "text": "for the linear regression model with gradient descent."}, {"index": 4, "start": 19.4, "end": 24.12, "text": "This will allow us to train the linear regression model to fit the straight line"}, {"index": 5, "start": 24.12, "end": 25.92, "text": "to our training data."}, {"index": 6, "start": 25.92, "end": 26.92, "text": "Let's get to it."}, {"index": 7, "start": 27.12, "end": 30.2, "text": "Here's the linear regression model."}, {"index": 8, "start": 30.2, "end": 34.8, "text": "And to the right is the squared error cost function."}, {"index": 9, "start": 34.8, "end": 38.28, "text": "And below is the gradient descent algorithm."}, {"index": 10, "start": 38.28, "end": 45.56, "text": "It turns out if you calculate these derivatives, these are the terms you would get."}, {"index": 11, "start": 45.56, "end": 54.12, "text": "The derivative with respect to w is this 1 over m sum from i equals 1 through m."}, {"index": 12, "start": 54.12, "end": 59.76, "text": "Then the error term, that is the difference between the predicted and the actual values,"}, {"index": 13, "start": 59.76, "end": 63.08, "text": "times the input feature xi."}, {"index": 14, "start": 63.08, "end": 68.56, "text": "And the derivative with respect to b is this formula over here,"}, {"index": 15, "start": 68.56, "end": 75.88, "text": "which looks the same as the equation above except that it doesn't have that xi term at the end."}, {"index": 16, "start": 75.88, "end": 80.44, "text": "And if you use these formulas to compute these two derivatives"}, {"index": 17, "start": 80.44, "end": 84.56, "text": "and implement gradient descent this way, it will work."}, {"index": 18, "start": 84.56, "end": 88.92, "text": "Now, you may be wondering, where did I get these formulas from?"}, {"index": 19, "start": 88.92, "end": 91.28, "text": "They're derived using calculus."}, {"index": 20, "start": 91.28, "end": 96.92, "text": "If you want to see the full derivation, I'll quickly run through the derivation on the next slide."}, {"index": 21, "start": 96.92, "end": 101.56, "text": "But if you don't remember or aren't interested in the calculus, don't worry about it."}, {"index": 22, "start": 101.56, "end": 104.48, "text": "You can skip the materials on the next slide entirely"}, {"index": 23, "start": 104.48, "end": 110.28, "text": "and still be able to implement gradient descent and finish this class and everything will work just fine."}, {"index": 24, "start": 110.32, "end": 115.56, "text": "So in this slide, which is one of the most mathematical slides of the entire specialization"}, {"index": 25, "start": 115.56, "end": 121.8, "text": "and again is completely optional, we'll show you how to calculate the derivative terms."}, {"index": 26, "start": 121.8, "end": 124.08, "text": "Let's start with the first term."}, {"index": 27, "start": 124.08, "end": 129.08, "text": "The derivative of the cos function j with respect to w."}, {"index": 28, "start": 129.08, "end": 138.72, "text": "We'll start by plugging in the definition of the cos function j, so j of wb is this."}, {"index": 29, "start": 138.72, "end": 145.56, "text": "So 1 over 2m times this sum of the squared error terms."}, {"index": 30, "start": 145.56, "end": 157.24, "text": "And now remember also that f of wb of xi is equal to this term over here,"}, {"index": 31, "start": 157.24, "end": 161.56, "text": "which is wxi plus b."}, {"index": 32, "start": 161.56, "end": 168.08, "text": "And so what we would like to do is compute the derivative also called the partial derivative"}, {"index": 33, "start": 168.08, "end": 175.0, "text": "with respect to w of this equation right here on the right."}, {"index": 34, "start": 175.0, "end": 180.08, "text": "If you've taken a calculus class before and again is totally fine if you haven't,"}, {"index": 35, "start": 180.08, "end": 187.36, "text": "you may know that by the rules of calculus, the derivative is equal to this term over here,"}, {"index": 36, "start": 187.36, "end": 193.16, "text": "which is why the 2 here and the 2 here cancel out,"}, {"index": 37, "start": 193.16, "end": 198.84, "text": "leaving us with this equation that you saw on the previous slide."}, {"index": 38, "start": 198.84, "end": 206.08, "text": "So this by the way is why we had to find the cos function with the one half earlier this week,"}, {"index": 39, "start": 206.08, "end": 209.24, "text": "is because it makes the partial derivative neater."}, {"index": 40, "start": 209.24, "end": 214.52, "text": "It cancels out the 2 that appears from computing the derivative."}, {"index": 41, "start": 214.52, "end": 219.96, "text": "For the other derivative with respect to b, this is quite similar."}, {"index": 42, "start": 219.96, "end": 229.76, "text": "I can write it out like this and once again plug in the definition of f of xi giving this equation."}, {"index": 43, "start": 229.76, "end": 238.44, "text": "And by the rules of calculus, this is equal to this where there's no xi anymore at the end."}, {"index": 44, "start": 238.44, "end": 247.12, "text": "And so the 2s cancel once more and you end up with this expression for the derivative with respect to b."}, {"index": 45, "start": 247.12, "end": 256.04, "text": "And so now you have these 2 expressions for the derivatives and you can plug them into the gradient descent algorithm."}, {"index": 46, "start": 256.04, "end": 260.36, "text": "So here's the gradient descent algorithm for linear regression."}, {"index": 47, "start": 260.36, "end": 266.4, "text": "You repeatedly carry out these updates to w and b until convergence."}, {"index": 48, "start": 266.4, "end": 275.92, "text": "Remember that this f of x is a linear regression model, so it's equal to w times x plus b."}, {"index": 49, "start": 275.92, "end": 281.64, "text": "This expression here is the derivative of the cos function with respect to w."}, {"index": 50, "start": 281.64, "end": 287.4, "text": "And this expression is the derivative of the cos function with respect to b."}, {"index": 51, "start": 287.4, "end": 294.48, "text": "And just as a reminder, you want to update w and b simultaneously on each step."}, {"index": 52, "start": 294.48, "end": 298.28, "text": "Now let's get familiar with how gradient descent works."}, {"index": 53, "start": 298.28, "end": 305.44, "text": "One issue we saw with gradient descent is that it can lead to a local minimum instead of a global minimum,"}, {"index": 54, "start": 305.44, "end": 313.24, "text": "where the global minimum means the point that has the lowest possible value for the cos function j, all of all possible points."}, {"index": 55, "start": 313.24, "end": 321.88, "text": "You may recall this surface plot that looks like an outdoor park with a few hills with the grass and the birds, this relaxing outdoor hill."}, {"index": 56, "start": 321.88, "end": 325.04, "text": "This function has more than one local minimum."}, {"index": 57, "start": 325.04, "end": 332.4, "text": "Remember, depending on where you initialize the parameters w and b, you can end up at different local minima."}, {"index": 58, "start": 332.4, "end": 336.88, "text": "You can end up here or you can end up here."}, {"index": 59, "start": 336.88, "end": 342.12, "text": "But it turns out when you're using a squared error cos function with linear regression,"}, {"index": 60, "start": 342.12, "end": 347.4, "text": "the cos function does not and will never have multiple local minima."}, {"index": 61, "start": 347.4, "end": 352.36, "text": "It has a single global minimum because of this bowl shape."}, {"index": 62, "start": 352.36, "end": 358.76, "text": "The technical term for this is that this cos function is a convex function."}, {"index": 63, "start": 358.8, "end": 369.16, "text": "Informally, a convex function is a bowl shaped function and it cannot have any local minima other than the single global minimum."}, {"index": 64, "start": 369.16, "end": 373.96, "text": "So when you implement gradient descent on a convex function,"}, {"index": 65, "start": 373.96, "end": 379.12, "text": "one nice property is that so long as your learning rate is chosen appropriately,"}, {"index": 66, "start": 379.12, "end": 382.48, "text": "it will always converge to the global minimum."}, {"index": 67, "start": 382.48, "end": 388.08, "text": "Congratulations, you now know how to implement gradient descent for linear regression."}, {"index": 68, "start": 388.08, "end": 390.92, "text": "We have just one last video for this week."}, {"index": 69, "start": 390.92, "end": 393.88, "text": "In that video, we'll see this algorithm in action."}, {"index": 70, "start": 393.88, "end": 396.04, "text": "Let's go to that last video."}], "vi": [{"index": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 7.42, "text": "V\\u1eady l\\u00e0 tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc \\u0111\\u00e2y b\\u1ea1n \\u0111\\u00e3 xem x\\u00e9t m\\u00f4 h\\u00ecnh h\\u1ed3i quy tuy\\u1ebfn t\\u00ednh v\\u00e0 h\\u00e0m chi ph\\u00ed"}, {"index": 1, "start": 7.42, "end": 10.6, "text": "v\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 thu\\u1eadt to\\u00e1n gradient descent."}, {"index": 2, "start": 10.6, "end": 15.32, "text": "Trong video n\\u00e0y, ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd k\\u1ebft h\\u1ee3p t\\u1ea5t c\\u1ea3 l\\u1ea1i v\\u00e0 s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng h\\u00e0m chi ph\\u00ed b\\u00ecnh ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng sai s\\u1ed1"}, {"index": 3, "start": 15.32, "end": 19.4, "text": "cho m\\u00f4 h\\u00ecnh h\\u1ed3i quy tuy\\u1ebfn t\\u00ednh v\\u1edbi gradient descent."}, {"index": 4, "start": 19.4, "end": 24.12, "text": "\\u0110i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y s\\u1ebd cho ph\\u00e9p ch\\u00fang ta hu\\u1ea5n luy\\u1ec7n m\\u00f4 h\\u00ecnh h\\u1ed3i quy tuy\\u1ebfn t\\u00ednh \\u0111\\u1ec3 ph\\u00f9 h\\u1ee3p v\\u1edbi \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1eddng th\\u1eb3ng"}, {"index": 5, "start": 24.12, "end": 25.92, "text": "cho d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u hu\\u1ea5n luy\\u1ec7n c\\u1ee7a ch\\u00fang ta."}, {"index": 6, "start": 25.92, "end": 26.92, "text": "H\\u00e3y b\\u1eaft \\u0111\\u1ea7u n\\u00e0o."}, {"index": 7, "start": 27.12, "end": 30.2, "text": "\\u0110\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 m\\u00f4 h\\u00ecnh h\\u1ed3i quy tuy\\u1ebfn t\\u00ednh."}, {"index": 8, "start": 30.2, "end": 34.8, "text": "V\\u00e0 b\\u00ean ph\\u1ea3i l\\u00e0 h\\u00e0m chi ph\\u00ed b\\u00ecnh ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng sai s\\u1ed1."}, {"index": 9, "start": 34.8, "end": 38.28, "text": "V\\u00e0 b\\u00ean d\\u01b0\\u1edbi l\\u00e0 thu\\u1eadt to\\u00e1n gradient descent."}, {"index": 10, "start": 38.28, "end": 45.56, "text": "H\\u00f3a ra n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n t\\u00ednh c\\u00e1c \\u0111\\u1ea1o h\\u00e0m n\\u00e0y, \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 nh\\u1eefng th\\u00e0nh ph\\u1ea7n m\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd nh\\u1eadn \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c."}, {"index": 11, "start": 45.56, "end": 54.12, "text": "\\u0110\\u1ea1o h\\u00e0m theo w l\\u00e0 t\\u1ed5ng 1 tr\\u00ean m t\\u1eeb i b\\u1eb1ng 1 \\u0111\\u1ebfn m."}, {"index": 12, "start": 54.12, "end": 59.76, "text": "Sau \\u0111\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 th\\u00e0nh ph\\u1ea7n sai s\\u1ed1, t\\u1ee9c l\\u00e0 s\\u1ef1 ch\\u00eanh l\\u1ec7ch gi\\u1eefa gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb d\\u1ef1 \\u0111o\\u00e1n v\\u00e0 gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf,"}, {"index": 13, "start": 59.76, "end": 63.08, "text": "nh\\u00e2n v\\u1edbi \\u0111\\u1eb7c tr\\u01b0ng \\u0111\\u1ea7u v\\u00e0o xi."}, {"index": 14, "start": 63.08, "end": 68.56, "text": "V\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u1ea1o h\\u00e0m theo b l\\u00e0 c\\u00f4ng th\\u1ee9c n\\u00e0y \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y,"}, {"index": 15, "start": 68.56, "end": 75.88, "text": "n\\u00f3 tr\\u00f4ng gi\\u1ed1ng nh\\u01b0 ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng tr\\u00ecnh \\u1edf tr\\u00ean ngo\\u1ea1i tr\\u1eeb vi\\u1ec7c kh\\u00f4ng c\\u00f3 th\\u00e0nh ph\\u1ea7n xi \\u1edf cu\\u1ed1i."}, {"index": 16, "start": 75.88, "end": 80.44, "text": "V\\u00e0 n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng c\\u00e1c c\\u00f4ng th\\u1ee9c n\\u00e0y \\u0111\\u1ec3 t\\u00ednh c\\u00e1c \\u0111\\u1ea1o h\\u00e0m n\\u00e0y"}, {"index": 17, "start": 80.44, "end": 84.56, "text": "v\\u00e0 th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n gradient descent theo c\\u00e1ch n\\u00e0y, n\\u00f3 s\\u1ebd ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng."}, {"index": 18, "start": 84.56, "end": 88.92, "text": "B\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd, c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 b\\u1ea1n \\u0111ang t\\u1ef1 h\\u1ecfi, t\\u00f4i l\\u1ea5y nh\\u1eefng c\\u00f4ng th\\u1ee9c n\\u00e0y t\\u1eeb \\u0111\\u00e2u?"}, {"index": 19, "start": 88.92, "end": 91.28, "text": "Ch\\u00fang \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c suy ra b\\u1eb1ng c\\u00e1ch s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng ph\\u00e9p t\\u00ednh."}, {"index": 20, "start": 91.28, "end": 96.92, "text": "N\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n xem to\\u00e0n b\\u1ed9 quy tr\\u00ecnh suy di\\u1ec5n, t\\u00f4i s\\u1ebd nhanh ch\\u00f3ng tr\\u00ecnh b\\u00e0y quy tr\\u00ecnh \\u1ea5y tr\\u00ean slide ti\\u1ebfp theo."}, {"index": 21, "start": 96.92, "end": 101.56, "text": "Nh\\u01b0ng n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n kh\\u00f4ng nh\\u1edb ho\\u1eb7c kh\\u00f4ng quan t\\u00e2m \\u0111\\u1ebfn ph\\u00e9p t\\u00ednh vi t\\u00edch ph\\u00e2n, \\u0111\\u1eebng lo l\\u1eafng v\\u1ec1 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3."}, {"index": 22, "start": 101.56, "end": 104.48, "text": "B\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 ho\\u00e0n to\\u00e0n b\\u1ecf qua t\\u00e0i li\\u1ec7u tr\\u00ean slide ti\\u1ebfp theo."}, {"index": 23, "start": 104.48, "end": 110.28, "text": "v\\u00e0 v\\u1eabn c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng ph\\u00e1p gi\\u1ea3m gradient v\\u00e0 ho\\u00e0n th\\u00e0nh l\\u1edbp h\\u1ecdc n\\u00e0y, m\\u1ecdi th\\u1ee9 s\\u1ebd ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng t\\u1ed1t."}, {"index": 24, "start": 110.32, "end": 115.56, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, trong slide n\\u00e0y, m\\u1ed9t trong nh\\u1eefng slide mang t\\u00ednh to\\u00e1n h\\u1ecdc nh\\u1ea5t c\\u1ee7a to\\u00e0n b\\u1ed9 ch\\u01b0\\u01a1ng tr\\u00ecnh chuy\\u00ean s\\u00e2u."}, {"index": 25, "start": 115.56, "end": 121.8, "text": "v\\u00e0 l\\u1ea1i ho\\u00e0n to\\u00e0n l\\u00e0 t\\u00f9y ch\\u1ecdn, ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i s\\u1ebd ch\\u1ec9 cho b\\u1ea1n c\\u00e1ch t\\u00ednh c\\u00e1c bi\\u1ebfn s\\u1ed1 \\u0111\\u1ea1o h\\u00e0m."}, {"index": 26, "start": 121.8, "end": 124.08, "text": "H\\u00e3y b\\u1eaft \\u0111\\u1ea7u v\\u1edbi bi\\u1ebfn s\\u1ed1 \\u0111\\u1ea7u ti\\u00ean."}, {"index": 27, "start": 124.08, "end": 129.08, "text": "\\u0110\\u1ea1o h\\u00e0m c\\u1ee7a h\\u00e0m cos j theo w."}, {"index": 28, "start": 129.08, "end": 138.72, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd b\\u1eaft \\u0111\\u1ea7u b\\u1eb1ng c\\u00e1ch thay th\\u1ebf \\u0111\\u1ecbnh ngh\\u0129a c\\u1ee7a h\\u00e0m cos j, v\\u00ec v\\u1eady j c\\u1ee7a wb l\\u00e0 nh\\u01b0 th\\u1ebf n\\u00e0y."}, {"index": 29, "start": 138.72, "end": 145.56, "text": "V\\u1eady l\\u00e0 1 tr\\u00ean 2m nh\\u00e2n v\\u1edbi t\\u1ed5ng c\\u00e1c bi\\u1ebfn s\\u1ed1 sai s\\u1ed1 b\\u00ecnh ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng n\\u00e0y."}, {"index": 30, "start": 145.56, "end": 157.24, "text": "V\\u00e0 b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd, h\\u00e3y nh\\u1edb r\\u1eb1ng f c\\u1ee7a wb c\\u1ee7a xi b\\u1eb1ng v\\u1edbi h\\u1ea1ng t\\u1eed n\\u00e0y \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y,"}, {"index": 31, "start": 157.24, "end": 161.56, "text": "\\u0111\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 wxi c\\u1ed9ng b."}, {"index": 32, "start": 161.56, "end": 168.08, "text": "V\\u00e0 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u ch\\u00fang ta mu\\u1ed1n l\\u00e0m l\\u00e0 t\\u00ednh \\u0111\\u1ea1o h\\u00e0m, c\\u00f2n \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c g\\u1ecdi l\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u1ea1o h\\u00e0m ri\\u00eang"}, {"index": 33, "start": 168.08, "end": 175.0, "text": "theo w c\\u1ee7a ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng tr\\u00ecnh n\\u00e0y \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y b\\u00ean ph\\u1ea3i."}, {"index": 34, "start": 175.0, "end": 180.08, "text": "N\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n \\u0111\\u00e3 h\\u1ecdc m\\u1ed9t l\\u1edbp gi\\u1ea3i t\\u00edch tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc \\u0111\\u00e2y v\\u00e0 n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n ch\\u01b0a h\\u1ecdc th\\u00ec c\\u0169ng ho\\u00e0n to\\u00e0n kh\\u00f4ng sao,"}, {"index": 35, "start": 180.08, "end": 187.36, "text": "b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 bi\\u1ebft r\\u1eb1ng theo quy t\\u1eafc c\\u1ee7a gi\\u1ea3i t\\u00edch, \\u0111\\u1ea1o h\\u00e0m b\\u1eb1ng v\\u1edbi h\\u1ea1ng t\\u1eed n\\u00e0y \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y,"}, {"index": 36, "start": 187.36, "end": 193.16, "text": "\\u0111\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 l\\u00fd do t\\u1ea1i sao 2 \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y v\\u00e0 2 \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y h\\u1ee7y nhau,"}, {"index": 37, "start": 193.16, "end": 198.84, "text": "\\u0111\\u1ec3 l\\u1ea1i cho ch\\u00fang ta ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng tr\\u00ecnh m\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n \\u0111\\u00e3 th\\u1ea5y tr\\u00ean slide tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc."}, {"index": 38, "start": 198.84, "end": 206.08, "text": "V\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u00e2y c\\u0169ng l\\u00e0 l\\u00fd do t\\u1ea1i sao ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 ph\\u1ea3i t\\u00ecm h\\u00e0m cos v\\u1edbi m\\u1ed9t n\\u1eeda v\\u00e0o \\u0111\\u1ea7u tu\\u1ea7n n\\u00e0y,"}, {"index": 39, "start": 206.08, "end": 209.24, "text": "b\\u1edfi v\\u00ec \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3 gi\\u00fap cho \\u0111\\u1ea1o h\\u00e0m ri\\u00eang g\\u1ecdn g\\u00e0ng h\\u01a1n."}, {"index": 40, "start": 209.24, "end": 214.52, "text": "N\\u00f3 lo\\u1ea1i b\\u1ecf \\u0111i 2 xu\\u1ea5t hi\\u1ec7n t\\u1eeb vi\\u1ec7c t\\u00ednh \\u0111\\u1ea1o h\\u00e0m."}, {"index": 41, "start": 214.52, "end": 219.96, "text": "V\\u1edbi \\u0111\\u1ea1o h\\u00e0m kh\\u00e1c li\\u00ean quan \\u0111\\u1ebfn b, \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y kh\\u00e1 t\\u01b0\\u01a1ng t\\u1ef1."}, {"index": 42, "start": 219.96, "end": 229.76, "text": "T\\u00f4i c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 vi\\u1ebft l\\u1ea1i nh\\u01b0 th\\u1ebf n\\u00e0y v\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t l\\u1ea7n n\\u1eefa thay th\\u1ebf \\u0111\\u1ecbnh ngh\\u0129a c\\u1ee7a f c\\u1ee7a xi, cho ra ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng tr\\u00ecnh n\\u00e0y."}, {"index": 43, "start": 229.76, "end": 238.44, "text": "V\\u00e0 theo c\\u00e1c quy t\\u1eafc c\\u1ee7a ph\\u00e9p t\\u00ednh vi ph\\u00e2n, \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y b\\u1eb1ng v\\u1edbi \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y, n\\u01a1i kh\\u00f4ng c\\u00f2n xi n\\u1eefa \\u1edf cu\\u1ed1i."}, {"index": 44, "start": 238.44, "end": 247.12, "text": "V\\u00e0 v\\u00ec v\\u1eady, c\\u00e1c s\\u1ed1 2 l\\u1ea1i lo\\u1ea1i b\\u1ecf v\\u1edbi nhau v\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd c\\u00f3 bi\\u1ec3u th\\u1ee9c n\\u00e0y cho \\u0111\\u1ea1o h\\u00e0m li\\u00ean quan \\u0111\\u1ebfn b."}, {"index": 45, "start": 247.12, "end": 256.04, "text": "V\\u00e0 b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 hai bi\\u1ec3u th\\u1ee9c n\\u00e0y cho c\\u00e1c \\u0111\\u1ea1o h\\u00e0m v\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 thay th\\u1ebf ch\\u00fang v\\u00e0o thu\\u1eadt to\\u00e1n gi\\u1ea3m d\\u1ea7n theo gradient."}, {"index": 46, "start": 256.04, "end": 260.36, "text": "V\\u1eady \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 thu\\u1eadt to\\u00e1n gi\\u1ea3m d\\u1ea7n theo gradient cho h\\u1ed3i quy tuy\\u1ebfn t\\u00ednh."}, {"index": 47, "start": 260.36, "end": 266.4, "text": "B\\u1ea1n ti\\u1ebfp t\\u1ee5c th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n c\\u00e1c c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt n\\u00e0y cho w v\\u00e0 b cho \\u0111\\u1ebfn khi h\\u1ed9i t\\u1ee5."}, {"index": 48, "start": 266.4, "end": 275.92, "text": "Nh\\u1edb r\\u1eb1ng f c\\u1ee7a x l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t m\\u00f4 h\\u00ecnh h\\u1ed3i quy tuy\\u1ebfn t\\u00ednh, v\\u00ec v\\u1eady n\\u00f3 b\\u1eb1ng w nh\\u00e2n v\\u1edbi x c\\u1ed9ng v\\u1edbi b."}, {"index": 49, "start": 275.92, "end": 281.64, "text": "Bi\\u1ec3u th\\u1ee9c n\\u00e0y l\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u1ea1o h\\u00e0m c\\u1ee7a h\\u00e0m cos v\\u1edbi respect \\u0111\\u1ebfn w."}, {"index": 50, "start": 281.64, "end": 287.4, "text": "V\\u00e0 bi\\u1ec3u th\\u1ee9c n\\u00e0y l\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u1ea1o h\\u00e0m c\\u1ee7a h\\u00e0m cos v\\u1edbi respect \\u0111\\u1ebfn b."}, {"index": 51, "start": 287.4, "end": 294.48, "text": "V\\u00e0 nh\\u01b0 m\\u1ed9t l\\u1eddi nh\\u1eafc nh\\u1edf, b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt w v\\u00e0 b \\u0111\\u1ed3ng th\\u1eddi \\u1edf m\\u1ed7i b\\u01b0\\u1edbc."}, {"index": 52, "start": 294.48, "end": 298.28, "text": "B\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd h\\u00e3y l\\u00e0m quen v\\u1edbi c\\u00e1ch m\\u00e0 gi\\u1ea3m d\\u1ea7n theo gradient ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng."}, {"index": 53, "start": 298.28, "end": 305.44, "text": "M\\u1ed9t v\\u1ea5n \\u0111\\u1ec1 m\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang ta th\\u1ea5y v\\u1edbi gi\\u1ea3m d\\u1ea7n theo gradient l\\u00e0 n\\u00f3 c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 d\\u1eabn \\u0111\\u1ebfn m\\u1ed9t \\u0111i\\u1ec3m c\\u1ef1c ti\\u1ec3u c\\u1ee5c b\\u1ed9 thay v\\u00ec m\\u1ed9t \\u0111i\\u1ec3m c\\u1ef1c ti\\u1ec3u to\\u00e0n c\\u1ea7u,"}, {"index": 54, "start": 305.44, "end": 313.24, "text": "N\\u01a1i \\u0111i\\u1ec3m c\\u1ef1c ti\\u1ec3u to\\u00e0n c\\u1ea7u c\\u00f3 ngh\\u0129a l\\u00e0 \\u0111i\\u1ec3m c\\u00f3 gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb th\\u1ea5p nh\\u1ea5t c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 cho h\\u00e0m cos j, trong t\\u1ea5t c\\u1ea3 c\\u00e1c \\u0111i\\u1ec3m c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3."}, {"index": 55, "start": 313.24, "end": 321.88, "text": "B\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 nh\\u1edb b\\u1ee9c tranh b\\u1ec1 m\\u1eb7t n\\u00e0y tr\\u00f4ng nh\\u01b0 m\\u1ed9t c\\u00f4ng vi\\u00ean ngo\\u00e0i tr\\u1eddi v\\u1edbi m\\u1ed9t v\\u00e0i ng\\u1ecdn \\u0111\\u1ed3i c\\u00f3 c\\u1ecf v\\u00e0 chim ch\\u00f3c, m\\u1ed9t ng\\u1ecdn \\u0111\\u1ed3i th\\u01b0 gi\\u00e3n ngo\\u00e0i tr\\u1eddi."}, {"index": 56, "start": 321.88, "end": 325.04, "text": "H\\u00e0m n\\u00e0y c\\u00f3 nhi\\u1ec1u h\\u01a1n m\\u1ed9t \\u0111i\\u1ec3m c\\u1ef1c ti\\u1ec3u c\\u1ee5c b\\u1ed9."}, {"index": 57, "start": 325.04, "end": 332.4, "text": "Nh\\u1edb r\\u1eb1ng, t\\u00f9y thu\\u1ed9c v\\u00e0o n\\u01a1i b\\u1ea1n kh\\u1edfi t\\u1ea1o c\\u00e1c tham s\\u1ed1 w v\\u00e0 b, b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 k\\u1ebft th\\u00fac \\u1edf nh\\u1eefng \\u0111i\\u1ec3m c\\u1ef1c ti\\u1ec3u c\\u1ee5c b\\u1ed9 kh\\u00e1c nhau."}, {"index": 58, "start": 332.4, "end": 336.88, "text": "B\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 k\\u1ebft th\\u00fac \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y ho\\u1eb7c b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 k\\u1ebft th\\u00fac \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y."}, {"index": 59, "start": 336.88, "end": 342.12, "text": "Nh\\u01b0ng h\\u00f3a ra khi b\\u1ea1n s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng m\\u1ed9t h\\u00e0m cos l\\u1ed7i b\\u00ecnh ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng v\\u1edbi h\\u1ed3i quy tuy\\u1ebfn t\\u00ednh,"}, {"index": 60, "start": 342.12, "end": 347.4, "text": "H\\u00e0m cos kh\\u00f4ng v\\u00e0 s\\u1ebd kh\\u00f4ng bao gi\\u1edd c\\u00f3 nhi\\u1ec1u c\\u1ef1c ti\\u1ec3u c\\u1ee5c b\\u1ed9."}, {"index": 61, "start": 347.4, "end": 352.36, "text": "N\\u00f3 c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t c\\u1ef1c ti\\u1ec3u to\\u00e0n c\\u1ee5c duy nh\\u1ea5t v\\u00ec h\\u00ecnh d\\u1ea1ng nh\\u01b0 c\\u00e1i ch\\u00e9n n\\u00e0y."}, {"index": 62, "start": 352.36, "end": 358.76, "text": "Thu\\u1eadt ng\\u1eef k\\u1ef9 thu\\u1eadt cho \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y l\\u00e0 h\\u00e0m cos n\\u00e0y l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t h\\u00e0m l\\u1ed3i."}, {"index": 63, "start": 358.8, "end": 369.16, "text": "Kh\\u00f4ng ch\\u00ednh th\\u1ee9c, m\\u1ed9t h\\u00e0m l\\u1ed3i l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t h\\u00e0m c\\u00f3 h\\u00ecnh d\\u1ea1ng gi\\u1ed1ng c\\u00e1i b\\u00e1t v\\u00e0 n\\u00f3 kh\\u00f4ng th\\u1ec3 c\\u00f3 b\\u1ea5t k\\u1ef3 c\\u1ef1c ti\\u1ec3u c\\u1ee5c b\\u1ed9 n\\u00e0o kh\\u00e1c ngo\\u00e0i c\\u1ef1c ti\\u1ec3u to\\u00e0n c\\u1ee5c duy nh\\u1ea5t."}, {"index": 64, "start": 369.16, "end": 373.96, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, khi b\\u1ea1n th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng ph\\u00e1p gi\\u1ea3m d\\u1ea7n gradient tr\\u00ean m\\u1ed9t h\\u00e0m l\\u1ed3i,"}, {"index": 65, "start": 373.96, "end": 379.12, "text": "M\\u1ed9t \\u0111\\u1eb7c \\u0111i\\u1ec3m t\\u1