ph\\u00e1t video. N\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n nh\\u1ea5p v\\u00e0o n\\u00fat ph\\u00e1t tr\\u00ean tr\\u00ecnh ph\\u00e1t video n\\u00e0y, t\\u00f4i s\\u1ebd t\\u1eebng b\\u01b0\\u1edbc"}, {"index": 8, "start": 36.76, "end": 41.88, "text": "gi\\u1ea3i th\\u00edch m\\u00e3 c\\u00f9ng b\\u1ea1n l\\u00fac \\u0111\\u00f3 v\\u00e0 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u duy nh\\u1ea5t b\\u1ea1n c\\u1ea7n nh\\u1edb"}, {"index": 9, "start": 41.88, "end": 47.76, "text": "cho b\\u00e0i t\\u1eadp t\\u00f9y ch\\u1ecdn n\\u00e0y l\\u00e0 l\\u1ec7nh shift enter v\\u00ec trong"}, {"index": 10, "start": 47.76, "end": 51.76, "text": "m\\u00f4i tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng l\\u1eadp tr\\u00ecnh b\\u00ean tr\\u00e1i, \\u0111\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 l\\u1ec7nh duy nh\\u1ea5t b\\u1ea1n c\\u1ea7n th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n"}, {"index": 11, "start": 51.76, "end": 58.04, "text": "\\u0111\\u1ec3 v\\u01b0\\u1ee3t qua m\\u00e3. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, \\u0111\\u1ec3 th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n b\\u00e0i t\\u1eadp t\\u00f9y ch\\u1ecdn n\\u00e0y, vui l\\u00f2ng chuy\\u1ec3n"}, {"index": 12, "start": 58.04, "end": 63.2, "text": "\\u0111\\u1ebfn m\\u1ee5c ti\\u1ebfp theo v\\u00e0 nh\\u1ea5n n\\u00fat ph\\u00e1t trong giao di\\u1ec7n ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi d\\u00f9ng n\\u00e0y tr\\u00ean"}, {"index": 13, "start": 63.2, "end": 67.72, "text": "n\\u1ec1n t\\u1ea3ng deeplearning.ai v\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd c\\u00f9ng nhau xem qua v\\u00ed d\\u1ee5 m\\u00e3."}, {"index": 14, "start": 67.72, "end": 72.6, "text": "Khi ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u1ebfn n\\u1ec1n t\\u1ea3ng \\u0111\\u00f3, b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd th\\u1ea5y m\\u00e3 tr\\u00f4ng nh\\u01b0 th\\u1ebf n\\u00e0y v\\u00e0 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u duy"}, {"index": 15, "start": 72.6, "end": 76.68, "text": "nh\\u1ea5t b\\u1ea1n ph\\u1ea3i l\\u00e0m l\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u1ebfn m\\u00e3 v\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 nh\\u1ea5n shift enter \\u0111\\u1ec3 ch\\u1ea1y"}, {"index": 16, "start": 76.68, "end": 81.4, "text": "m\\u00e3 n\\u00e0y v\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 nh\\u1ea5n shift enter \\u0111\\u1ec3 ch\\u1ea1y m\\u00e3 n\\u00e0y v\\u1edbi th\\u00f4ng b\\u00e1o m\\u00e0 t\\u00f4i \\u0111\\u00e3 cho"}, {"index": 17, "start": 81.44, "end": 85.72, "text": "b\\u1ea1n v\\u1eeba r\\u1ed3i \\u0111\\u1ec3 nh\\u1eadn di\\u1ec7n n\\u00f3 nh\\u01b0 t\\u1ed1t. N\\u00f3 \\u0111\\u00e3 t\\u00ecm ra r\\u1eb1ng b\\u00e1nh pudding chu\\u1ed1i"}, {"index": 18, "start": 85.72, "end": 91.44, "text": "th\\u1ef1c s\\u1ef1 r\\u1ea5t ngon, c\\u00f3 c\\u1ea3m x\\u00fac t\\u00edch c\\u1ef1c. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, b\\u1ea1n kh\\u00f4ng c\\u1ea7n ph\\u1ea3i th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n"}, {"index": 19, "start": 91.44, "end": 97.04, "text": "b\\u00e0i t\\u1eadp n\\u00e0y v\\u1edbi m\\u00e3 \\u0111\\u1ec3 ho\\u00e0n th\\u00e0nh kh\\u00f3a h\\u1ecdc v\\u1ec1 GenSafe AI n\\u00e0y."}, {"index": 20, "start": 97.04, "end": 101.56, "text": "N\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n l\\u00e0m nh\\u01b0 v\\u1eady, t\\u00f4i hy v\\u1ecdng b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd th\\u1ea5y th\\u00fa v\\u1ecb v\\u1edbi n\\u00f3 v\\u00e0 n\\u00f3 s\\u1ebd quay l\\u1ea1i \\u0111\\u1ec3 th\\u1ea3o lu\\u1eadn v\\u1ec1"}, {"index": 21, "start": 101.56, "end": 105.64, "text": "v\\u00f2ng \\u0111\\u1eddi c\\u1ee7a m\\u1ed9t d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n AI GenSafe."}], "segments_by_language": {"en": [{"index": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 4.44, "text": "Thanks for joining me for this optional video."}, {"index": 1, "start": 4.44, "end": 9.24, "text": "In the next item on the Coursera website, you will be able to click on a link to take"}, {"index": 2, "start": 9.24, "end": 14.2, "text": "you to the deeplearning.ai platform which will let you try out some code for yourself."}, {"index": 3, "start": 14.2, "end": 17.44, "text": "Let me just show you what you see when you get there."}, {"index": 4, "start": 17.44, "end": 21.4, "text": "When the deeplearning.ai platform loads, you see a user interface that looks like"}, {"index": 5, "start": 21.4, "end": 27.2, "text": "this with some code on the left and if the code looks unfamiliar to you, don't"}, {"index": 6, "start": 27.2, "end": 31.64, "text": "worry about it. We'll step through every single step with you and on the right is a"}, {"index": 7, "start": 31.64, "end": 36.76, "text": "video player. If you click on the play button on this video player, I will step"}, {"index": 8, "start": 36.76, "end": 41.88, "text": "through at that time the code with you and the only thing you need to remember"}, {"index": 9, "start": 41.88, "end": 47.76, "text": "for this optional exercise is the command shift enter because in this"}, {"index": 10, "start": 47.76, "end": 51.76, "text": "programming environment on the left, that's the one command you need to run"}, {"index": 11, "start": 51.76, "end": 58.04, "text": "in order to get through the code. So to go through this optional exercise, please go"}, {"index": 12, "start": 58.04, "end": 63.2, "text": "on to that next item and hit the play button in this user interface on the"}, {"index": 13, "start": 63.2, "end": 67.72, "text": "deeplearning.ai platform and we'll walk through the code example together then."}, {"index": 14, "start": 67.72, "end": 72.6, "text": "When we get to that platform, you see code that looks like this and the only"}, {"index": 15, "start": 72.6, "end": 76.68, "text": "thing you have to do is go to the code and then hit shift enter to run"}, {"index": 16, "start": 76.68, "end": 81.4, "text": "this code and then shift enter to run this code with the prompt that I showed"}, {"index": 17, "start": 81.44, "end": 85.72, "text": "you just now to have it recognize this as so good. It's found it has the banana"}, {"index": 18, "start": 85.72, "end": 91.44, "text": "pudding was really tasty, has a positive sentiment. So you don't have to do this"}, {"index": 19, "start": 91.44, "end": 97.04, "text": "little playing with code exercise to fully complete this course on GenSafe AI but"}, {"index": 20, "start": 97.04, "end": 101.56, "text": "if you do, I hope you have fun with it and it will come back to discuss the"}, {"index": 21, "start": 101.56, "end": 105.64, "text": "