, "options": {"A": "none", "B": "null", "C": "nil", "D": "undefined"}, "correct_answer": "A", "explanation": "Trong Python, gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb kh\\u00f4ng g\\u00e1n \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c bi\\u1ec3u di\\u1ec5n b\\u1eb1ng t\\u1eeb kh\\u00f3a 'none'.", "difficulty": "D\\u1ec5"}, {"question_text": "Lo\\u1ea1i s\\u1ed1 n\\u00e0o sau \\u0111\\u00e2y kh\\u00f4ng ph\\u1ea3i l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t lo\\u1ea1i d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u s\\u1ed1 trong Python?", "options": {"A": "int", "B": "str", "C": "float", "D": "complex"}, "correct_answer": "B", "explanation": "Trong Python, 'str' l\\u00e0 ki\\u1ec3u chu\\u1ed7i, kh\\u00f4ng ph\\u1ea3i l\\u00e0 ki\\u1ec3u s\\u1ed1.", "difficulty": "Trung b\\u00ecnh"}, {"question_text": "H\\u00e0m n\\u00e0o \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng \\u0111\\u1ec3 chuy\\u1ec3n \\u0111\\u1ed5i t\\u1eeb float sang int trong Python?", "options": {"A": "parse", "B": "int", "C": "float", "D": "convert"}, "correct_answer": "B", "explanation": "H\\u00e0m 'int' \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng \\u0111\\u1ec3 chuy\\u1ec3n \\u0111\\u1ed5i gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb float th\\u00e0nh gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb int.", "difficulty": "D\\u1ec5"}, {"question_text": "K\\u00fd hi\\u1ec7u n\\u00e0o \\u0111\\u1ea1i di\\u1ec7n cho s\\u1ed1 ph\\u1ee9c trong Python?", "options": {"A": "i", "B": "j", "C": "k", "D": "p"}, "correct_answer": "B", "explanation": "Trong Python, s\\u1ed1 \\u1ea3o trong s\\u1ed1 ph\\u1ee9c \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c bi\\u1ec3u di\\u1ec5n b\\u1eb1ng ch\\u1eef 'j'.", "difficulty": "Kh\\u00f3"}, {"question_text": "\\u00dd ngh\\u0129a c\\u1ee7a gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb boolean trong l\\u1eadp tr\\u00ecnh l\\u00e0 g\\u00ec?", "options": {"A": "M\\u1ed9t chu\\u1ed7i k\\u00fd t\\u1ef1", "B": "M\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 th\\u1ef1c", "C": "\\u0110\\u00fang ho\\u1eb7c sai", "D": "M\\u1ed9t t\\u1eadp h\\u1ee3p"}, "correct_answer": "C", "explanation": "Gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb boolean ch\\u1ec9 c\\u00f3 hai tr\\u1ea1ng th\\u00e1i: '\\u0111\\u00fang' v\\u00e0 'sai', d\\u00f9ng \\u011