get n\\u00e0y, ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i \\u0111ang l\\u1ea5y t\\u1ea5t c\\u1ea3 s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m"}, {"index": 6, "start": 28.0, "end": 35.12, "text": "v\\u00e0 trong ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng th\\u1ee9c get n\\u00e0y, ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i \\u0111ang l\\u1ea5y s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m theo ID c\\u1ee7a n\\u00f3 v\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i \\u0111ang th\\u00eam m\\u1ed9t c\\u00e1i m\\u1edbi"}, {"index": 7, "start": 35.12, "end": 41.12, "text": "s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m. \\u0110\\u01b0\\u1ee3c r\\u1ed3i, v\\u1eady b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd h\\u00e3y th\\u1eed c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt n\\u00f3. Nh\\u01b0ng tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc khi l\\u00e0m \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3, th\\u1ef1c ra c\\u00f2n r\\u1ea5t nhi\\u1ec1u"}, {"index": 8, "start": 41.12, "end": 46.08, "text": "\\u0111i\\u1ec1u m\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang ta ph\\u1ea3i l\\u00e0m tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc khi th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3 b\\u1edfi v\\u00ec n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n nh\\u00ecn th\\u1ea5y m\\u00e0u \\u00e1o c\\u1ee7a t\\u00f4i \\u0111\\u00e3 thay \\u0111\\u1ed5i,"}, {"index": 9, "start": 46.08, "end": 49.52, "text": "\\u0111\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t ng\\u00e0y m\\u1edbi v\\u00e0 t\\u00f4i ph\\u1ea3i l\\u00e0m l\\u1ea1i c\\u00e1c b\\u01b0\\u1edbc \\u0111\\u00f3 \\u0111\\u1ec3 ch\\u1ea1y \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y."}, {"index": 10, "start": 50.56, "end": 55.6, "text": "V\\u1eady tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc ti\\u00ean, t\\u00f4i s\\u1ebd ch\\u1ea1y m\\u00e1y ch\\u1ee7 n\\u00e0y, nh\\u01b0ng tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc \\u0111\\u00f3 t\\u00f4i c\\u1ea7n thay \\u0111\\u1ed5i m\\u00f4i tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng c\\u1ee7a m\\u00ecnh. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady,"}, {"index": 11, "start": 55.6, "end": 59.44, "text": "m\\u00f4i tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng \\u1ea3o, n\\u00f3 \\u0111ang s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd ho\\u1eb7c ch\\u1ec9 c\\u1ea7n t\\u1ea1o m\\u1ed9t m\\u00f4i tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng m\\u1edbi. Kh\\u00f4ng, kh\\u00f4ng,"}, {"index": 12, "start": 59.44, "end": 65.68, "text": "\\u0111\\u1eebng t\\u1ea1o m\\u1ed9t m\\u00f4i tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng m\\u1edbi. T\\u00f4i \\u0111ang s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng m\\u1ed9t \\u0111i\\u1ec1u sai. T\\u00f4i c\\u1ea7n k\\u00edch ho\\u1ea1t n\\u00f3. V\\u1eady l\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u00e3 k\\u00edch ho\\u1ea1t xong"}, {"index": 13, "start": 65.68, "end": 72.24, "text": "v\\u00e0 b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd \\u0111\\u1ebfn l\\u00fac ch\\u1ea1y \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y v\\u00e0 t\\u00f4i c\\u0169ng s\\u1ebd t\\u1eaft co-pilot c\\u1ee7a m\\u00ecnh ho\\u1eb7c t\\u1ea1m th\\u1eddi d\\u1eebng n\\u00f3 l\\u1ea1i"}, {"index": 14, "start": 72.24, "end": 76.56, "text": "v\\u00e0 h\\u00e3y ch\\u1ea1y \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y, c\\u00e1i n\\u00e0y s\\u1ebd t\\u1ea3i m\\u00e1y ch\\u1ee7, kh\\u00f4ng v\\u1ea5n \\u0111\\u1ec1 g\\u00ec v\\u1edbi vi\\u1ec7c t\\u1ea3i m\\u00e1y ch\\u1ee7."}, {"index": 15, "start": 76.56, "end": 81.52, "text": "v\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang ta c\\u0169ng ph\\u1ea3i ch\\u1ea1y ph\\u1ea7n frontend. \\u0110\\u1ea3m b\\u1ea3o r\\u1eb1ng b\\u1ea1n kh\\u00f4ng ch\\u1ea1y \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y trong m\\u00f4i tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng."}, {"index": 16, "start": 81.52, "end": 86.08, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, b\\u1ea1n ph\\u1ea3i v\\u00f4 hi\\u1ec7u h\\u00f3a \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y \\u0111\\u1ec3 tho\\u00e1t ra kh\\u1ecfi m\\u00f4i tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng v\\u00e0 b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 ch\\u1ea1y"}, {"index": 17, "start": 86.08, "end": 92.16, "text": "ph\\u1ea7n frontend v\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n ph\\u1ea3i chuy\\u1ec3n sang frontend v\\u00e0 g\\u00f5 npm start. B\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd ph\\u1ea7n frontend c\\u0169ng \\u0111\\u00e3 kh\\u1edfi \\u0111\\u1ed9ng."}, {"index": 18, "start": 92.8, "end": 97.52, "text": "Nh\\u01b0ng m\\u1ed9t l\\u1ea7n n\\u1eefa, ph\\u1ea7n frontend ch\\u01b0a \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c c\\u1ea5u h\\u00ecnh ho\\u00e0n to\\u00e0n v\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 l\\u00fd do t\\u1ea1i sao b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 th\\u1ea5y n\\u00f3 \\u0111\\u00e3 kh\\u00f4ng th\\u00e0nh c\\u00f4ng trong vi\\u1ec7c"}, {"index": 19, "start": 97.52, "end": 101.6, "text": "l\\u1ea5y d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, kh\\u00f4ng c\\u1ea7n thi\\u1ebft ph\\u1ea3i ch\\u1ea1y ph\\u1ea7n frontend. T\\u00f4i kh\\u00f4ng bi\\u1ebft t\\u1ea1i sao t\\u00f4i l\\u1ea1i ch\\u1ea1y \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3,"}, {"index": 20, "start": 101.6, "end": 106.24, "text": "c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 l\\u00e0 tr\\u00ed nh\\u1edb c\\u01a1 b\\u1eafp. Nh\\u01b0ng h\\u00e3y \\u0111\\u1ec3 t\\u00f4i theo c\\u00e1ch n\\u00e0y. C\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t v\\u1ea5n \\u0111\\u1ec1 v\\u1edbi frontend,"}, {"index": 21, "start": 106.24, "end": 110.32, "text": "th\\u00ec c\\u0169ng kh\\u00f4ng sao. \\u0110\\u01b0\\u1ee3c r\\u1ed3i, nh\\u01b0ng backend v\\u1eabn \\u0111ang ch\\u1ea1y v\\u00e0 c\\u00e1ch b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 ki\\u1ec3m tra n\\u00f3,"}, {"index": 22, "start": 110.32, "end": 117.2, "text": "b\\u1ea1n ch\\u1ec9 c\\u1ea7n truy c\\u1eadp localhost c\\u1ed5ng 88, 8000 v\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 d\\u1ea5u g\\u1ea1ch ch\\u00e9o. \\u1ede \\u0111\\u00e2y ch\\u00fang ta c\\u1ea7n ch\\u1ec9 ra docs, \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y s\\u1ebd t\\u1ea3i"}, {"index": 23, "start": 117.2, "end": 124.56, "text": "swagger c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n m\\u00e0 t\\u1ea1i \\u0111\\u00f3 b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 ki\\u1ec3m tra m\\u1ecdi th\\u1ee9 v\\u00e0 tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc ti\\u00ean ch\\u00fang ta c\\u1ea7n ki\\u1ec3m tra n\\u00f3 xem c\\u00f3 ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng hay kh\\u00f4ng"}, {"index": 24, "start": 124.56, "end": 130.16, "text": "\\u0111\\u1ec3 ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 ti\\u1ebfp t\\u1ee5c. V\\u1eady l\\u00e0 n\\u00f3 v\\u1eabn ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng. Ch\\u01b0a c\\u00f3 g\\u00ec sai c\\u1ea3. \\u0110\\u01b0\\u1ee3c r\\u1ed3i, v\\u1eady h\\u00e3y quay l\\u1ea1i"}, {"index": 25, "start": 130.16, "end": 135.68, "text": "b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd l\\u00e0 l\\u00fac \\u0111\\u1ec3 c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt. N\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m, b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd l\\u00e0m nh\\u01b0 th\\u1ebf n\\u00e0o?"}, {"index": 26, "start": 135.68, "end": 141.44, "text": "\\u0110\\u1ea7u ti\\u00ean, b\\u1ea1n c\\u1ea7n m\\u1ed9t h\\u00e0m v\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd \\u0111\\u1eb7t t\\u00ean cho h\\u00e0m n\\u00e0y l\\u00e0 h\\u00e0m c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m v\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 h\\u00e0m n\\u00e0y s\\u1ebd"}, {"index": 27, "start": 142.8, "end": 148.0, "text": "c\\u0169ng ch\\u1ea5p nh\\u1eadn ch\\u00ednh s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m \\u0111\\u00f3. Nh\\u01b0ng v\\u1edbi s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m, ch\\u00fang ta c\\u0169ng ph\\u1ea3i cung c\\u1ea5p ID. V\\u1eady th\\u00ec"}, {"index": 28, "start": 148.0, "end": 153.28, "text": "s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m c\\u1ee5 th\\u1ec3 n\\u00e0o b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt, \\u0111\\u00fang kh\\u00f4ng? V\\u1eady b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 y\\u00eau c\\u1ea7u ID. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, t\\u00f4i s\\u1ebd n\\u00f3i ID"}, {"index": 29, "start": 153.28, "end": 158.0, "text": "c\\u00f3 ki\\u1ec3u int v\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 b\\u1ea1n c\\u0169ng s\\u1ebd h\\u1ecfi v\\u1ec1 s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m v\\u00ec \\u0111\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 nh\\u1eefng g\\u00ec b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd"}, {"index": 30, "start": 158.0, "end": 162.72, "text": "c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt. B\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt m\\u1ed9t tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng c\\u1ee5 th\\u1ec3 c\\u1ee7a m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m, b\\u1ea1n c\\u0169ng c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng patch,"}, {"index": 31, "start": 162.72, "end": 167.28, "text": "nh\\u01b0ng ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd kh\\u00f4ng l\\u00e0m \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3 \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y. Ch\\u00fang ta ch\\u1ec9 s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng put v\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 n\\u01a1i b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt."}, {"index": 32, "start": 167.28, "end": 172.24, "text": "V\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i c\\u0169ng th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n \\u00e1nh x\\u1ea1 cho \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y. \\u0110i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y ph\\u1ea3i l\\u00e0 app dot. B\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd thay v\\u00ec s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng get ho\\u1eb7c post,"}, {"index": 33, "start": 172.24, "end": 177.68, "text": "ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i s\\u1ebd s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng put v\\u00e0 \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i s\\u1ebd n\\u00f3i \\u0111\\u1ebfn c\\u00f9ng m\\u1ed9t URL, \\u0111\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m. Ng\\u1ea7u \\u0111\\u00fang kh\\u00f4ng?"}, {"index": 34, "start": 178.24, "end": 185.36, "text": "V\\u00e0 b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd t\\u00f4i c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 vi\\u1ebft logic \\u0111\\u1ec3 c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m c\\u1ee7a ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i. N\\u00f3 n\\u00f3i r\\u1eb1ng c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t l\\u1ed7i"}, {"index": 35, "start": 185.36, "end": 190.96, "text": "tr\\u00ean d\\u00f2ng s\\u1ed1 36 v\\u00e0 c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t l\\u1ed7i. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 n\\u00f3i r\\u1eb1ng n\\u00f3 \\u0111ang mong \\u0111\\u1ee3i m\\u1ed9t kh\\u1ed1i."}, {"index": 36, "start": 191.76, "end": 197.04, "text": "Nh\\u01b0ng t\\u00f4i s\\u1ebd vi\\u1ebft m\\u1ed9t \\u0111o\\u1ea1n m\\u00e3 \\u0111\\u1ec3 c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt. Gi\\u1edd \\u0111\\u00e2y, khi b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt, b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt"}, {"index": 37, "start": 197.76, "end": 203.84, "text": "s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m t\\u1eeb danh s\\u00e1ch s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m v\\u1edbi s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m c\\u1ee5 th\\u1ec3 n\\u00e0y, \\u0111\\u00fang kh\\u00f4ng? V\\u00e0 c\\u00e1i n\\u00e0o \\u0111\\u1ec3"}, {"index": 38, "start": 203.84, "end": 209.92, "text": "c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt? B\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd b\\u1ea1n c\\u1ea7n l\\u1eb7p qua c\\u00e1c s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m n\\u00e0y \\u0111\\u1ec3 t\\u00ecm ra ID n\\u00e0o"}, {"index": 39, "start": 209.92, "end": 215.28, "text": "kh\\u1edbp v\\u1edbi m\\u1ed9t, hai ho\\u1eb7c n\\u0103m v\\u00e0 s\\u00e1u v\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, trong tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng h\\u1ee3p \\u0111\\u00f3, t\\u00f4i c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 n\\u00f3i"}, {"index": 40, "start": 216.08, "end": 223.04, "text": "s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng m\\u1ed9t v\\u00f2ng l\\u1eb7p for. T\\u00f4i s\\u1ebd b\\u1eaft \\u0111\\u1ea7u v\\u1edbi I trong ph\\u1ea1m vi ho\\u1eb7c c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 t\\u00f4i c\\u0169ng c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng product,"}, {"index": 41, "start": 223.04, "end": 228.0, "text": "nh\\u01b0ng sau \\u0111\\u00f3 t\\u00f4i kh\\u00f4ng th\\u1ec3 thay th\\u1ebf n\\u00f3. V\\u1eady h\\u00e3y s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng ch\\u00ednh ph\\u1ea1m vi v\\u00ec t\\u00f4i mu\\u1ed1n c\\u00f3 ch\\u1ec9 s\\u1ed1 c\\u1ee7a n\\u00f3."}, {"index": 42, "start": 228.0, "end": 236.48, "text": "V\\u1eady t\\u00f4i s\\u1ebd n\\u00f3i for I trong ph\\u1ea1m vi v\\u00e0 t\\u00f4i s\\u1ebd \\u0111i \\u0111\\u1ebfn gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb cu\\u1ed1i c\\u00f9ng v\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u1ec3 l\\u00e0m \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3 t\\u00f4i ph\\u1ea3i n\\u00f3i,"}, {"index": 43, "start": 236.48, "end": 240.56, "text": "\\u00fd t\\u00f4i l\\u00e0, gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc cu\\u1ed1i, v\\u1eady chi\\u1ec1u d\\u00e0i c\\u1ee7a s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m. B\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd khi b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 ph\\u1ea1m vi n\\u00e0y,"}, {"index": 44, "start": 241.12, "end": 246.32, "text": "n\\u00f3 s\\u1ebd b\\u1eaft \\u0111\\u1ea7u t\\u1eeb zero. N\\u00f3 s\\u1ebd k\\u1ebft th\\u00fac \\u1edf ba v\\u00ec ch\\u00fang ta ch\\u1ec9 c\\u00f3 b\\u1ed1n s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y, \\u0111\\u00fang kh\\u00f4ng?"}, {"index": 45, "start": 246.32, "end": 250.56, "text": "V\\u00e0 t\\u1ea5t nhi\\u00ean, trong t\\u01b0\\u01a1ng lai, n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n th\\u00eam s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m m\\u1edbi, \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y s\\u1ebd \\u0111i \\u0111\\u1ebfn gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc cu\\u1ed1i. V\\u1eady th\\u00ec"}, {"index": 46, "start": 250.56, "end": 255.44, "text": "gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb n\\u1ebfu chi\\u1ec1u d\\u00e0i l\\u00e0 10, n\\u00f3 s\\u1ebd \\u0111i \\u0111\\u1ebfn ch\\u00edn. \\u0110\\u01b0\\u1ee3c r\\u1ed3i, sau \\u0111\\u00f3 b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd ki\\u1ec3m tra cho t\\u1eebng"}, {"index": 47, "start": 255.44, "end": 261.92, "text": "s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 ki\\u1ec3m tra s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m c\\u1ee7a zero ho\\u1eb7c xin l\\u1ed7i, s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m c\\u1ee7a I v\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 b\\u1ea1n"}, {"index": 48, "start": 261.92, "end": 268.24, "text": "c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 ki\\u1ec3m tra ID n\\u1ebfu n\\u00f3 tr\\u00f9ng kh\\u1edbp. \\u0110\\u01b0\\u1ee3c r\\u1ed3i, n\\u1ebfu n\\u00f3 tr\\u00f9ng kh\\u1edbp, \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3 c\\u00f3 ngh\\u0129a l\\u00e0 t\\u00f4i ph\\u1ea3i s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng if."}, {"index": 49, "start": 268.24, "end": 274.0, "text": "N\\u1ebfu n\\u00f3 tr\\u00f9ng kh\\u1edbp v\\u1edbi ID, b\\u1ea5t c\\u1ee9 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u g\\u00ec b\\u1ea1n \\u0111\\u00e3 truy\\u1ec1n v\\u00e0o trong tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng h\\u1ee3p \\u0111\\u00f3 cho v\\u1ecb tr\\u00ed \\u0111\\u00f3,"}, {"index": 50, "start": 274.0, "end": 279.84, "text": "\\u0110i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3 c\\u00f3 ngh\\u0129a l\\u00e0 c\\u00e1c s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m c\\u1ee7a I cho v\\u1ecb tr\\u00ed \\u0111\\u00f3, thay th\\u1ebf n\\u00f3 b\\u1eb1ng s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m m\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n \\u0111\\u00e3 nh\\u1eadn \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c t\\u1eeb"}, {"index": 51, "start": 279.84, "end": 286.88, "text": "kh\\u00e1ch h\\u00e0ng. Nghe c\\u00f3 v\\u1ebb t\\u1ed1t. V\\u00e0 n\\u1ebfu \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y th\\u00e0nh c\\u00f4ng, b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd nh\\u1eadn \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c th\\u00f4ng b\\u00e1o s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m \\u0111\\u00e3 \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c th\\u00eam th\\u00e0nh c\\u00f4ng."}, {"index": 52, "start": 287.52, "end": 290.96, "text": "M\\u1ed9t l\\u1ea7n n\\u1eefa, d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u n\\u00e0y n\\u00ean l\\u00e0 d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u k\\u1ec1 nhau, nh\\u01b0ng t\\u00f4i \\u0111ang g\\u1eedi m\\u1ed9t v\\u0103n b\\u1ea3n thu\\u1ea7n t\\u00fay, nh\\u01b0ng \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3 kh\\u00f4ng sao."}, {"index": 53, "start": 291.04, "end": 296.0, "text": "N\\u00f3 ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng. V\\u00e0 n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n kh\\u00f4ng t\\u00ecm th\\u1ea5y b\\u1ea5t k\\u1ef3 s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m n\\u00e0o? T\\u1ea5t nhi\\u00ean, \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y s\\u1ebd xu\\u1ea5t ph\\u00e1t t\\u1eeb \\u0111\\u00f3."}, {"index": 54, "start": 296.72, "end": 303.52, "text": "V\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd n\\u00f3i kh\\u00f4ng t\\u00ecm th\\u1ea5y s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m n\\u00e0o, ho\\u1eb7c b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 n\\u00f3i s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m kh\\u00f4ng t\\u1ed3n t\\u1ea1i, b\\u1ea5t c\\u1ee9 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u g\\u00ec ph\\u00f9 h\\u1ee3p."}, {"index": 55, "start": 303.52, "end": 308.48, "text": "\\u0110\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 m\\u00e3 c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt. V\\u00e0 t\\u00f4i mu\\u1ed1n x\\u00e1c minh xem \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y c\\u00f3 ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng kh\\u00f4ng. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, ngay khi t\\u00f4i l\\u01b0u l\\u1ea1i,"}, {"index": 56, "start": 308.48, "end": 315.6, "text": "n\\u00f3 \\u0111\\u00e3 \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c t\\u1ea3i l\\u1ea1i. T\\u00f4i c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 quay l\\u1ea1i Swagger b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd, ho\\u1eb7c t\\u00e0i li\\u1ec7u \\u0111\\u1ec1 c\\u1eadp \\u0111\\u1ebfn \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y. V\\u00e0 tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc ti\\u00ean,"}, {"index": 57, "start": 315.6, "end": 321.36, "text": "h\\u00e3y l\\u1ea5y t\\u1ea5t c\\u1ea3 s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m t\\u1eeb \\u0111\\u00e2y v\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt m\\u1ed9t trong s\\u1ed1 \\u0111\\u00f3. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, h\\u00e3y th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n v\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n \\u0111\\u00e3 c\\u00f3 t\\u1ea5t c\\u1ea3"}, {"index": 58, "start": 321.36, "end": 325.92, "text": "c\\u00e1c s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m. Gi\\u1ea3 s\\u1eed t\\u00f4i mu\\u1ed1n c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt b\\u1ea3ng n\\u00e0y \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, t\\u00f4i s\\u1ebd ch\\u1ec9 sao ch\\u00e9p c\\u00e1i n\\u00e0y v\\u00e0 \\u00fd t\\u01b0\\u1edfng l\\u00e0"}, {"index": 59, "start": 325.92, "end": 331.44, "text": "s\\u00e1u. Nh\\u1edb quay l\\u1ea1i \\u0111\\u1ec3 th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n v\\u00ec \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 nh\\u1eefng g\\u00ec b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n l\\u00e0m, c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m v\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n"}, {"index": 60, "start": 331.44, "end": 336.64, "text": "s\\u1ebd c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt. V\\u1eady b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd n\\u00f3i th\\u1eed nh\\u1eadp v\\u00e0o \\u0111\\u00e2y s\\u1ed1 s\\u00e1u v\\u00e0 thay th\\u1ebf l\\u01b0\\u1ee3c \\u0111\\u1ed3 n\\u00e0y b\\u1eb1ng l\\u01b0\\u1ee3c \\u0111\\u1ed3 c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n."}, {"index": 61, "start": 336.64, "end": 340.96, "text": "Th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf, b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 thay \\u0111\\u1ed5i c\\u00e1c gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb t\\u1eeb \\u0111\\u00e2y, nh\\u01b0ng t\\u00f4i s\\u1ebd ch\\u1ec9 d\\u00e1n n\\u00f3. Sau \\u0111\\u00f3, t\\u00f4i s\\u1ebd gi\\u1eef l\\u1ea1i"}, {"index": 62, "start": 341.04, "end": 348.96, "text": "\\u00fd t\\u01b0\\u1edfng gi\\u1ed1ng nhau. T\\u00f4i s\\u1ebd thay \\u0111\\u1ed5i n\\u00f3 th\\u00e0nh b\\u00e0n l\\u00e0m vi\\u1ec7c v\\u00e0 t\\u00f4i kh\\u00f4ng mu\\u1ed1n b\\u00e0n cho m\\u00e1y t\\u00ednh c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n."}, {"index": 63, "start": 350.24, "end": 354.56, "text": "V\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3, gi\\u00e1 c\\u1ea3 v\\u00ec ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 th\\u00eam m\\u00f4 t\\u1ea3 n\\u00e0y, gi\\u00e1 c\\u1ea3 n\\u00ean t\\u0103ng l\\u00ean. \\u0110\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 nh\\u1eefng g\\u00ec ch\\u00fang ta l\\u00e0m."}, {"index": 64, "start": 355.52, "end": 360.96, "text": "V\\u00e0 gi\\u1ea3 s\\u1eed s\\u1ed1 l\\u01b0\\u1ee3ng gi\\u1eef nguy\\u00ean l\\u00e0 20. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 thay \\u0111\\u1ed5i t\\u00ean, gi\\u00e1 c\\u1ea3, m\\u00f4 t\\u1ea3,"}, {"index": 65, "start": 360.96, "end": 365.92, "text": "nh\\u01b0ng kh\\u00f4ng ph\\u1ea3i \\u00fd t\\u01b0\\u1edfng v\\u00e0 s\\u1ed1 l\\u01b0\\u1ee3ng. H\\u00e3y \\u0111\\u1ec3 t\\u00f4i th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n. Ch\\u00fang ta h\\u00e3y xem \\u0111i\\u1ec1u g\\u00ec sai x\\u1ea3y ra. Kh\\u00f4ng c\\u00f3 g\\u00ec sai \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y."}, {"index": 66, "start": 366.88, "end": 371.76, "text": "N\\u00f3 n\\u00f3i s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m \\u0111\\u00e3 \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c th\\u00eam th\\u00e0nh c\\u00f4ng. Th\\u1eadt tuy\\u1ec7t. \\u0110i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3 c\\u00f3 ngh\\u0129a l\\u00e0 n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n quay l\\u1ea1i b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd,"}, {"index": 67, "start": 372.8, "end": 381.36, "text": "\\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y, v\\u00e0 n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n th\\u1eed th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y m\\u1ed9t l\\u1ea7n n\\u1eefa v\\u00e0 nh\\u00ecn v\\u00e0o s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m. V\\u1eady ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 c\\u00f3 b\\u00e0n l\\u00e0m vi\\u1ec7c,"}, {"index": 68, "start": 381.36, "end": 387.52, "text": "\\u0111\\u00e3 thay \\u0111\\u1ed5i m\\u00f4 t\\u1ea3, \\u0111\\u00e3 thay \\u0111\\u1ed5i gi\\u00e1, thay \\u0111\\u1ed5i. \\u0110\\u01b0\\u1ee3c r\\u1ed3i, \\u0111\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 c\\u00e1ch c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng. Nh\\u01b0ng b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd h\\u00e3y"}, {"index": 69, "start": 387.52, "end": 393.12, "text": "l\\u00e0m vi\\u1ec7c v\\u1edbi vi\\u1ec7c x\\u00f3a. V\\u1eady h\\u00e3y quay l\\u1ea1i \\u0111\\u00e2y v\\u00e0 b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd b\\u1ea1n gi\\u00fap t\\u00f4i. Kh\\u00f4ng sao c\\u1ea3. Gi\\u1edd c\\u00e2u h\\u1ecfi l\\u00e0"}, {"index": 70, "start": 393.12, "end": 397.52, "text": "B\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd gi\\u00fap t\\u00f4i nh\\u01b0 th\\u1ebf n\\u00e0o khi b\\u1ea1n \\u0111ang xem video n\\u00e0y? H\\u00e3y ngh\\u0129 v\\u1ec1 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3. Logic s\\u1ebd ra sao?"}, {"index": 71, "start": 397.52, "end": 405.76, "text": "T\\u00f4i s\\u1ebd l\\u1ea5y n\\u00f3 qua telemetry. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, t\\u00f4i s\\u1ebd n\\u00f3i \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng. N\\u00f3 n\\u00ean x\\u00f3a ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng th\\u1ee9c. \\u0110\\u01b0\\u1ee3c r\\u1ed3i. V\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 b\\u1ea1n"}, {"index": 72, "start": 405.76, "end": 411.12, "text": "c\\u0169ng ph\\u1ea3i truy\\u1ec1n URI. Ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng c\\u00f9ng m\\u1ed9t URI. V\\u00e0 nh\\u01b0 t\\u00f4i \\u0111\\u00e3 \\u0111\\u1ec1 c\\u1eadp tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc \\u0111\\u00f3, t\\u1ea5t c\\u1ea3 c\\u00e1c URI n\\u00e0y"}, {"index": 73, "start": 411.12, "end": 416.8, "text": "l\\u00e0 gi\\u1ed1ng nhau. \\u0110i\\u1ec1u thay \\u0111\\u1ed5i l\\u00e0 ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng th\\u1ee9c \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y. \\u0110\\u01b0\\u1ee3c r\\u1ed3i, v\\u1eady h\\u00e3y \\u0111\\u1ecbnh ngh\\u0129a m\\u1ed9t ph\\u01b0\\u01a1ng th\\u1ee9c. T\\u00f4i s\\u1ebd n\\u00f3i"}, {"index": 74, "start": 416.8, "end": 424.16, "text": "\\u0111\\u1ecbnh ngh\\u0129a x\\u00f3a ho\\u1eb7c def x\\u00f3a s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m. \\u0110\\u01b0\\u1ee3c r\\u1ed3i, gi\\u1edd c\\u00e2u h\\u1ecfi \\u0111\\u1eb7t ra l\\u00e0 d\\u1ef1a tr\\u00ean gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb n\\u00e0o b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n"}, {"index": 75, "start": 424.16, "end": 428.24, "text": "x\\u00f3a. C\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi d\\u00f9ng s\\u1ebd g\\u1eedi to\\u00e0n b\\u1ed9 s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m v\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 x\\u00f3a n\\u00f3 ho\\u1eb7c"}, {"index": 76, "start": 429.12, "end": 433.6, "text": "ID l\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u1ee7, \\u0111\\u00fang kh\\u00f4ng? B\\u1edfi v\\u00ec m\\u1ed7i s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m s\\u1ebd kh\\u00e1c nhau d\\u1ef1a tr\\u00ean ID c\\u1ee7a n\\u00f3. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 \\u0111\\u01a1n gi\\u1ea3n"}, {"index": 77, "start": 433.6, "end": 441.84, "text": "truy\\u1ec1n m\\u1ed9t ID \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y. H\\u00e3y l\\u00e0m \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, ch\\u1ea5p nh\\u1eadn ID. N\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t ID d\\u1ea5u hai ch\\u1ea5m s\\u1ed1 nguy\\u00ean v\\u00e0 d\\u1ef1a tr\\u00ean ID,"}, {"index": 78, "start": 441.84, "end": 445.28, "text": "b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd x\\u00f3a n\\u00f3. Nh\\u01b0ng l\\u1ea1i m\\u1ed9t l\\u1ea7n n\\u1eefa, b\\u1ea1n ph\\u1ea3i l\\u1eb7p qua \\u0111\\u00fang kh\\u00f4ng? B\\u1edfi v\\u00ec b\\u1ea1n ph\\u1ea3i"}, {"index": 79, "start": 445.28, "end": 450.32, "text": "kh\\u1edbp v\\u1edbi ID \\u0111ang kh\\u1edbp v\\u1edbi. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i s\\u1ebd n\\u00f3i cho, th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf l\\u00e0 c\\u00f9ng m\\u1ed9t m\\u00e3 m\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i \\u0111\\u00e3 vi\\u1ebft tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc \\u0111\\u00f3,"}, {"index": 80, "start": 450.32, "end": 458.56, "text": "cho ph\\u1ea1m vi. V\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u00e2y s\\u1ebd l\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u1ed9 d\\u00e0i c\\u1ee7a c\\u00e1c s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m. V\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 ki\\u1ec3m tra n\\u1ebfu s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m c\\u1ee7a I,"}, {"index": 81, "start": 459.68, "end": 463.84, "text": "th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf, b\\u1ea1n ph\\u1ea3i kh\\u1edbp v\\u1edbi ID. N\\u1ebfu n\\u00f3 kh\\u1edbp v\\u1edbi ID m\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n \\u0111\\u00e3 \\u0111\\u1ec1 c\\u1eadp t\\u1eeb"}, {"index": 82, "start": 463.84, "end": 472.56, "text": "ph\\u00eda kh\\u00e1ch h\\u00e0ng, trong tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng h\\u1ee3p \\u0111\\u00f3, x\\u00f3a s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m c\\u1ee7a I \\u0111\\u01a1n gi\\u1ea3n nh\\u01b0 v\\u1eady. V\\u00e0 n\\u1ebfu \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y"}, {"index": 83, "start": 472.56, "end": 478.24, "text": "ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng, b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 tr\\u1ea3 l\\u1ea1i s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m \\u0111\\u00e3 x\\u00f3a. C\\u00f2n n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n kh\\u00f4ng t\\u00ecm th\\u1ea5y s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m? V\\u1eady b\\u1ea1n ph\\u1ea3i"}, {"index": 84, "start": 478.24, "end": 484.56, "text": "\\u0111\\u1ec1 c\\u1eadp \\u0111i\\u1ec1u g\\u00ec \\u0111\\u00f3 \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2u \\u0111\\u00f3. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, tr\\u1ea3 l\\u1ea1i \\u0111i\\u1ec1u t\\u01b0\\u01a1ng t\\u1ef1, s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m kh\\u00f4ng t\\u00ecm th\\u1ea5y. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, m\\u1ed9t khi ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111ang vi\\u1ebft kh\\u00f4ng"}, {"index": 85, "start": 484.56, "end": 491.04, "text": "t\\u00ecm th\\u1ea5y s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m v\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t khi ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111ang vi\\u1ebft s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m kh\\u00f4ng t\\u00ecm th\\u1ea5y, n\\u00ean c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 s\\u1ef1 nh\\u1ea5t qu\\u00e1n,"}, {"index": 86, "start": 491.04, "end": 496.08, "text": "\\u0111\\u00fang kh\\u00f4ng? V\\u00e0 t\\u00f4i kh\\u00f4ng l\\u00e0m nh\\u01b0 v\\u1eady. \\u0110\\u01b0\\u1ee3c r\\u1ed3i, v\\u00ec v\\u1eady ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 c\\u00f3 s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m n\\u00e0y \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y, \\u0111\\u00fang kh\\u00f4ng? B\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd t\\u00f4i mu\\u1ed1n x\\u00f3a,"}, {"index": 87, "start": 496.08, "end": 501.04, "text": "gi\\u1ea3 s\\u1eed, s\\u1ed1 s\\u00e1u, ho\\u1eb7c c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 \\u1edf gi\\u1eefa, gi\\u1ea3 s\\u1eed t\\u00f4i mu\\u1ed1n x\\u00f3a c\\u00e1i th\\u1ee9 hai n\\u1eefa."}, {"index": 88, "start": 501.84, "end": 507.68, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, ID l\\u00e0 hai, \\u0111\\u1ec3 quay l\\u1ea1i, \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c r\\u1ed3i, t\\u00f4i ngh\\u0129 ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd ph\\u1ea3i t\\u1ea3i l\\u1ea1i c\\u00e1i n\\u00e0y."}, {"index": 89, "start": 509.6, "end": 515.36, "text": "Put v\\u00e0 delete, x\\u00f3a \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y. V\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i s\\u1ebd x\\u00f3a s\\u1ed1 hai. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, t\\u00f4i s\\u1ebd ch\\u1ec9 g\\u00f5 hai \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y"}, {"index": 90, "start": 515.36, "end": 522.4, "text": "v\\u00e0 th\\u1ef1c thi kh\\u00f4ng c\\u00f3 g\\u00ec nhi\\u1ec1u. V\\u00e0 n\\u00f3 n\\u00f3i s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m \\u0111\\u00e3 x\\u00f3a, th\\u1eadt tuy\\u1ec7t. H\\u00e3y quay l\\u1ea1i \\u0111\\u1ec3 l\\u1ea5y"}, {"index": 91, "start": 522.4, "end": 529.68, "text": "t\\u1ea5t c\\u1ea3 c\\u00e1c s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m, th\\u1eed nghi\\u1ec7m, th\\u1ef1c thi. V\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u00e2y r\\u1ed3i, b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 th\\u1ea5y ch\\u00fang ta kh\\u00f4ng c\\u00f2n s\\u1ed1 hai n\\u1eefa."}, {"index": 92, "start": 529.68, "end": 534.48, "text": "V\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 c\\u00e1ch b\\u1ea1n c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt v\\u00e0 x\\u00f3a. Nh\\u01b0ng t\\u00f4i mu\\u1ed1n cho b\\u1ea1n xem l\\u1ea1i m\\u00e3 m\\u1ed9t l\\u1ea7n n\\u1eefa."}, {"index": 93, "start": 534.48, "end": 540.24, "text": "V\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 n\\u00f3. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m, n\\u01a1i b\\u1ea1n \\u0111ang l\\u1ea5y ID, l\\u1ea5y s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m,"}, {"index": 94, "start": 540.24, "end": 545.68, "text": "c\\u00e1c chi ti\\u1ebft m\\u1edbi m\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n th\\u00eam. V\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 b\\u1ea1n \\u0111ang l\\u1eb7p qua. V\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 b\\u1ea1n c\\u01a1 b\\u1ea3n"}, {"index": 95, "start": 545.68, "end": 549.76, "text": "ki\\u1ec3m tra cho m\\u1ed7i ID xem n\\u00f3 c\\u00f3 kh\\u1edbp hay kh\\u00f4ng. Kho\\u1ea3nh kh\\u1eafc b\\u1ea1n t\\u00ecm th\\u1ea5y s\\u1ef1 kh\\u1edbp,"}, {"index": 96, "start": 549.76, "end": 554.72, "text": "b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m t\\u1eeb danh s\\u00e1ch. V\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 c\\u00e1ch b\\u1ea1n c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt cho vi\\u1ec7c x\\u00f3a."}, {"index": 97, "start": 554.72, "end": 560.96, "text": "M\\u00e3 gi\\u1ed1ng nhau ch\\u1ec9 kh\\u00e1c l\\u00e0 thay v\\u00ec c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt, ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111ang x\\u00f3a n\\u00f3. Ng\\u1ea7u, \\u0111\\u00fang kh\\u00f4ng? Nh\\u01b0ng h\\u00e3y nh\\u1edb"}, {"index": 98, "start": 560.96, "end": 566.16, "text": "m\\u1ecdi th\\u1ee9 m\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 l\\u00e0m b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd, ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111ang l\\u00e0m v\\u1edbi danh s\\u00e1ch trong b\\u1ed9 nh\\u1edb. V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t danh s\\u00e1ch."}, {"index": 99, "start": 566.16, "end": 570.48, "text": "Nh\\u01b0ng trong th\\u1ebf gi\\u1edbi th\\u1ef1c, ch\\u00fang ta kh\\u00f4ng s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng danh s\\u00e1ch, \\u0111\\u00fang kh\\u00f4ng? Ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng l\\u01b0u tr\\u1eef v\\u0129nh vi\\u1ec5n,"}, {"index": 100, "start": 570.48, "end": 575.28, "text": "c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 l\\u00e0 Postgres ho\\u1eb7c MySQL ho\\u1eb7c b\\u1ea5t k\\u1ef3 lo\\u1ea1i c\\u01a1 s\\u1edf d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u n\\u00e0o. N\\u00f3 c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 l\\u00e0 RDBMs, c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 l\\u00e0 NoSQL"}, {"index": 101, "start": 575.28, "end": 582.16, "text": "c\\u00e1c c\\u01a1 s\\u1edf d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u ho\\u1eb7c \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2u \\u0111\\u00f3, c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t t\\u1ec7p ho\\u1eb7c c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t t\\u1ec7p CSV. V\\u1eady h\\u00e3y xem, ch\\u00fang ta l\\u00e0m \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3 nh\\u01b0 th\\u1ebf n\\u00e0o trong"}, {"index": 102, "start": 582.16, "end": 584.16, "text": "c\\u00e1c video s\\u1eafp t\\u1edbi."}], "segments_by_language": {"en": [{"index": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 6.16, "text": "And now it's time to focus on put and delete. So basically if you want to update the product"}, {"index": 1, "start": 6.16, "end": 10.24, "text": "or you want to delete a product, how will you do it? So that's what we are going to see now."}, {"index": 2, "start": 10.88, "end": 14.4, "text": "Now before I do that, I just want to remove these extra spaces from here"}, {"index": 3, "start": 14.4, "end": 18.64, "text": "and let's look at the code. So basically we got this main.py where we got"}, {"index": 4, "start": 19.44, "end": 23.04, "text": "all the product in the list. We are still not working with database and we basically"}, {"index": 5, "start": 23.04, "end": 28.0, "text": "have these methods like get and post. Now in this get, we are fetching all the products"}, {"index": 6, "start": 28.0, "end": 35.12, "text": "and in this get, we are fetching our product by its ID and then here we are basically adding a new"}, {"index": 7, "start": 35.12, "end": 41.12, "text": "product. Okay, so now let's try to update it. But before we do that, in fact, there are a lot of"}, {"index": 8, "start": 41.12, "end": 46.08, "text": "things we have to do before we do that because if you can see my shirt color has changed,"}, {"index": 9, "start": 46.08, "end": 49.52, "text": "it's a new day and I have to do that steps once again to run this."}, {"index": 10, "start": 50.56, "end": 55.6, "text": "So first of all, I will run this server before that I have to change my environment. So the"}, {"index": 11, "start": 55.6, "end": 59.44, "text": "virtual environment, it is using now or just creating a new environment. No, no,"}, {"index": 12, "start": 59.44, "end": 65.68, "text": "don't create a new environment. I'm using a wrong thing. I have to activate it. So activation done"}, {"index": 13, "start": 65.68, "end": 72.24, "text": "and now it's time to run this and also I will disable my co-pilot or snooze it for some time"}, {"index": 14, "start": 72.24, "end": 76.56, "text": "and let's run this and this will load the server, no problem with the server loading"}, {"index": 15, "start": 76.56, "end": 81.52, "text": "and we have to also run the frontend. Make sure that you don't run this in the environment."}, {"index": 16, "start": 81.52, "end": 86.08, "text": "So you have to deactivate this so that you will come out of the environment and now you can run"}, {"index": 17, "start": 86.08, "end": 92.16, "text": "the frontend and you have to switch to frontend and say npm start. Now the frontend started as well."}, {"index": 18, "start": 92.8, "end": 97.52, "text": "But again, the frontend is not fully configured yet and that's why you can see it has failed to"}, {"index": 19, "start": 97.52, "end": 101.6, "text": "fetch. So there's no need to run the frontend. I don't know why I ran that,"}, {"index": 20, "start": 101.6, "end": 106.24, "text": "muscle memory maybe. But let me just go with this. So there's a problem with the frontend,"}, {"index": 21, "start": 106.24, "end": 110.32, "text": "that's fine. Okay, but the backend is running and the way you can test it,"}, {"index": 22, "start": 110.32, "end": 117.2, "text": "you can just go to localhost colon 88, 8000 and then slash. Here we have to say docs which will load"}, {"index": 23, "start": 117.2, "end": 124.56, "text": "your swagger in which you can test all the things and we need to first test it out if it is working"}, {"index": 24, "start": 124.56, "end": 130.16, "text": "so that we can continue. So it's still working. Nothing is wrong yet. Okay, so let's go back"}, {"index": 25, "start": 130.16, "end": 135.68, "text": "here and now it's time for the update. Now if you want to update a product, how will you do it?"}, {"index": 26, "start": 135.68, "end": 141.44, "text": "First of all, you need a function and we'll name this as update product function and then this will"}, {"index": 27, "start": 142.8, "end": 148.0, "text": "also accept the product itself. But then with product, we have to also pass the ID. So which"}, {"index": 28, "start": 148.0, "end": 153.28, "text": "particular product you want to update, right? So you can ask for the ID. So I will say ID"}, {"index": 29, "start": 153.28, "end": 158.0, "text": "of type int and then you will also ask for the product because that's what you're going to"}, {"index": 30, "start": 158.0, "end": 162.72, "text": "update. Now if you want to update a particular field of a product, you can also use patch,"}, {"index": 31, "start": 162.72, "end": 167.28, "text": "but we'll not be doing that here. We'll be only using put and this is where you will update."}, {"index": 32, "start": 167.28, "end": 172.24, "text": "And we also do the mapping for this. This should be app dot. Now instead of using get or post,"}, {"index": 33, "start": 172.24, "end": 177.68, "text": "we are going to use put and here we'll say the same URL which is product. Cool, right?"}, {"index": 34, "start": 178.24, "end": 185.36, "text": "And now I can basically write the logic for updating our product. So it says there's an error"}, {"index": 35, "start": 185.36, "end": 190.96, "text": "on line number 36 and there is an error. So you can say it is expecting a block."}, {"index": 36, "start": 191.76, "end": 197.04, "text": "But I'm going to write a code for updating. Now when you want to update, you want to update"}, {"index": 37, "start": 197.76, "end": 203.84, "text": "the product from the products list with this particular product, right? And which one to"}, {"index": 38, "start": 203.84, "end": 209.92, "text": "update? Now you have to basically iterate between these products to find which ID it is"}, {"index": 39, "start": 209.92, "end": 215.28, "text": "matching with one, two or five and six and then you can do it. So in that case, I can say"}, {"index": 40, "start": 216.08, "end": 223.04, "text": "use a for loop. I'm going to start with I in range or maybe I can also use product,"}, {"index": 41, "start": 223.04, "end": 228.0, "text": "but then I can't replace it. So let's go with the range itself because I want the index of it."}, {"index": 42, "start": 228.0, "end": 236.48, "text": "So I will say for I in range and I will go till the last value and for that I have to say,"}, {"index": 43, "start": 236.48, "end": 240.56, "text": "I mean, second last value, so length of products. Now once you have this range,"}, {"index": 44, "start": 241.12, "end": 246.32, "text": "it will start from zero. It will end at three because we only got four products here, right?"}, {"index": 45, "start": 246.32, "end": 250.56, "text": "And of course, in future, if you add new products, this will go to the second last value. So the"}, {"index": 46, "start": 250.56, "end": 255.44, "text": "value if the length is 10, it will go till nine. Okay, then you will basically check for"}, {"index": 47, "start": 255.44, "end": 261.92, "text": "each product. So you can check products of zero or sorry, products of I and then you"}, {"index": 48, "start": 261.92, "end": 268.24, "text": "can check the ID if it is matching. Okay, if it is matching, that means I have to use if."}, {"index": 49, "start": 268.24, "end": 274.0, "text": "If it is matching with the ID, whatever you have passed in that case for that location,"}, {"index": 50, "start": 274.0, "end": 279.84, "text": "that means products of I for that location, replace it with the product which you got from"}, {"index": 51, "start": 279.84, "end": 286.88, "text": "the client. Looks good. And if this is successful, you will return product added successfully."}, {"index": 52, "start": 287.52, "end": 290.96, "text": "Again, this should be adjacent data, but I'm sending a plain text, but that's fine."}, {"index": 53, "start": 291.04, "end": 296.0, "text": "It works. And what if you don't find any products? Of course, this will come out from there."}, {"index": 54, "start": 296.72, "end": 303.52, "text": "And then you will say return no product found, or you can say product not found, whatever works."}, {"index": 55, "start": 303.52, "end": 308.48, "text": "So this is the update code. And I want to verify if this is working. So the moment I saved it,"}, {"index": 56, "start": 308.48, "end": 315.6, "text": "this got reloaded. I can go back to Swagger now, or the docs refers this. And first of all,"}, {"index": 57, "start": 315.6, "end": 321.36, "text": "let's get all the products from here and we'll update one of it. So execute and you got all the"}, {"index": 58, "start": 321.36, "end": 325.92, "text": "products. Let's say I want to update this table here. So I will just copy this and the idea is"}, {"index": 59, "start": 325.92, "end": 331.44, "text": "six. Remember that go back to put because this is what you want to do update product and you"}, {"index": 60, "start": 331.44, "end": 336.64, "text": "will update. So you will say try it out type here six and replace this schema with your schema."}, {"index": 61, "start": 336.64, "end": 340.96, "text": "In fact, you can change the values from here, but I will just paste it. Then I will keep"}, {"index": 62, "start": 341.04, "end": 348.96, "text": "the idea same. I will change it to table desk and I wo