y t\\u1eeb \\u0111i\\u1ec3n t\\u1eeb s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m v\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 gi\\u1ea3i n\\u00e9n \\u0111\\u1ec3 bi\\u1ebfn n\\u00f3 th\\u00e0nh m\\u00f4 h\\u00ecnh c\\u01a1 s\\u1edf d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u.", "difficulty": "Kh\\u00f3"}], "artifact_status": {"transcript": {"status": "ready", "error": null}, "summary": {"status": "ready", "error": null}, "timeline": {"status": "ready", "error": null}, "highlights": {"status": "ready", "error": null}, "questions": {"status": "ready", "error": null}, "briefing": {"status": "ready", "error": null}, "visual_data": {"status": "ready", "error": null}, "flashcards": {"status": "ready", "error": null}, "handsign_data": {"status": "ready", "error": null}, "quizzes": {"status": "ready", "error": null}}}	2026-05-16 01:32:34.220441
9f17906a-c910-49e3-bae3-f4b8db5dd4e8	6941d4aa-4a06-41af-8654-7ac47be4a8c7	data\\uploads\\videos\\6941d4aa-4a06-41af-8654-7ac47be4a8c7.mp4	\N	\N	\N	\N	{"transcript": {"video_id": "6941d4aa-4a06-41af-8654-7ac47be4a8c7", "language": "en", "source_language": "en", "target_language": "vi", "available_languages": ["en"], "translation_status": {"vi": {"status": "translation_failed", "error": "Khong the dich transcript sang vi."}}, "segments": [{"index": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 9.86, "text": "Welcome back Aliens, my name is Devan Reddy and in this video we will talk about Django."}, {"index": 1, "start": 9.86, "end": 16.1, "text": "The Django. Django is a free and open source web application framework. Now you will say"}, {"index": 2, "start": 16.1, "end": 20.82, "text": "okay we know about free part, we know about open source part but what is a framework."}, {"index": 3, "start": 20.82, "end": 25.7, "text": "Now framework is a combination of certain components and packages. Of course if you"}, {"index": 4, "start": 25.7, "end": 29.94, "text": "want to build some complex application there are certain things you need ready"}, {"index": 5, "start": 29.94, "end": 33.34, "text": "made. Example if you want to build web application you don't want to do"}, {"index": 6, "start": 33.34, "end": 37.02, "text": "everything from scratch. It will be time-consuming right. So we will be"}, {"index": 7, "start": 37.02, "end": 41.42, "text": "using a framework here. Now Django is not the only framework available. The"}, {"index": 8, "start": 41.42, "end": 45.26, "text": "moment you say web app we have certain frameworks available. One of them is or"}, {"index": 9, "start": 45.26, "end": 50.14, "text": "one of the famous one is Django. But why we have to learn Django there? Now"}, {"index": 10, "start": 50.14, "end": 53.78, "text": "Django as we know is a web application framework that means you can"}, {"index": 11, "start": 53.78, "end": 58.06, "text": "build web application. But hold on our websites are so important of course right"}, {"index": 12, "start": 58.06, "end": 62.58, "text": "if you talk about any business they need their own online presence. In fact"}, {"index": 13, "start": 62.58, "end": 66.26, "text": "most of the virtual solutions which we use nowadays are web applications."}, {"index": 14, "start": 66.26, "end": 70.42, "text": "Example if you want to buy something online we have Amazon, we have Flipkart, we"}, {"index": 15, "start": 70.42, "end": 75.5, "text": "have eBay. If you want to book a cab we have Uber right. We have so many"}, {"index": 16, "start": 75.5, "end": 79.94, "text": "applications available which are based on web. So if you want to build them"}, {"index": 17, "start": 79.94, "end": 83.5, "text": "you will be using Django there. But the moment you talk about websites we"}, {"index": 18, "start": 83.54, "end": 88.3, "text": "know that you can build websites with the help of HTML, CSS and JavaScript. So"}, {"index": 19, "start": 88.3, "end": 94.02, "text": "basically we use HTML to design the page. You can think HTML as the makeup for"}, {"index": 20, "start": 94.02, "end": 97.78, "text": "you. Now then we have CSS. If you want to improve your design if you want to"}, {"index": 21, "start": 97.78, "end": 101.94, "text": "have that uniformity in the design that's why you will use CSS. So we"}, {"index": 22, "start": 101.94, "end": 107.3, "text": "have HTML CSS for designing. To make your website interactive we can use"}, {"index": 23, "start": 107.3, "end": 112.18, "text": "JavaScript. So yes we use HTML CSS JavaScript in the front end. What"}, {"index": 24, "start": 112.18, "end": 115.9, "text": "about the back end part? What if you want to make your website as a"}, {"index": 25, "start": 115.9, "end": 120.26, "text": "dynamic website? Example let's say if you go to Facebook you know everyone will"}, {"index": 26, "start": 120.26, "end": 123.46, "text": "get different feeds. You will not see the same message which everyone is"}, {"index": 27, "start": 123.46, "end": 126.82, "text": "saying. So your feeds will be different from them. If you go to"}, {"index": 28, "start": 126.82, "end": 131.26, "text": "Amazon you can buy stuff online, you can pay, you can transfer amount online"}, {"index": 29, "start": 131.26, "end": 135.06, "text": "and all this thing needs certain operations or certain processing done"}, {"index": 30, "start": 135.06, "end": 138.74, "text": "on the back end side. And that's where we need a language which will"}, {"index": 31, "start": 138.78, "end": 142.78, "text": "work on the back end. But which one? So we have some options there. We"}, {"index": 32, "start": 142.78, "end": 146.3, "text": "have Java using, if you heard about Savlets we can do that there. We"}, {"index": 33, "start": 146.3, "end": 150.5, "text": "have PHP, we have ASP, we have Python. But hold on, how can we do"}, {"index": 34, "start": 150.5, "end": 153.7, "text": "that in Python? And that's where we have Django. So you can use"}, {"index": 35, "start": 153.7, "end": 159.46, "text": "Django to build web application the back end part in Python. Okay, as"}, {"index": 36, "start": 159.46, "end": 163.5, "text": "I mentioned before Django is not the only web framework available but"}, {"index": 37, "start": 163.5, "end": 166.82, "text": "it's quite famous there. Now when it comes to web application one thing"}, {"index": 38, "start": 166.86, "end": 170.18, "text": "is very famous which is MVC. Now it doesn't matter which language"}, {"index": 39, "start": 170.18, "end": 175.14, "text": "you'll learn maybe Java, PHP or ASP. We have this thing common"}, {"index": 40, "start": 175.14, "end": 179.42, "text": "which is MVC, model view controller. Now basically we do"}, {"index": 41, "start": 179.42, "end": 183.06, "text": "that so that we can separate the concerns. We have model for"}, {"index": 42, "start": 183.06, "end": 186.86, "text": "data, we have view the HTML format which you see on this"}, {"index": 43, "start": 186.86, "end": 189.42, "text": "screen and then we have a controller which will control"}, {"index": 44, "start": 189.42, "end": 193.26, "text": "these operations. In fact, we have a separate video on what"}, {"index": 45, "start": 193.26, "end": 196.66, "text": "is MVC but then in general when you say MVC it will help you"}, {"index": 46, "start": 196.7, "end": 200.7, "text": "to build a good web application. But in Django we have"}, {"index": 47, "start": 200.7, "end": 204.5, "text": "something similar to MVC, not exactly MVC which we normally"}, {"index": 48, "start": 204.5, "end": 210.14, "text": "call as MVT or MVT it doesn't matter. So that MVT which is"}, {"index": 49, "start": 210.14, "end": 215.14, "text": "model view template. So basically in MVT we are replacing"}, {"index": 50, "start": 215.18, "end": 217.78, "text": "controller with view and we are replacing view with"}, {"index": 51, "start": 217.78, "end": 220.9, "text": "template again how that works we'll see that later in the"}, {"index": 52, "start": 220.9, "end": 225.18, "text": "practical video. But then Django basically follows MVT. So if"}, {"index": 53, "start": 225.18, "end": 228.5, "text": "you have worked on MVC on different language don't worry"}, {"index": 54, "start": 228.5, "end": 232.06, "text": "it's almost same but with some changes. But why to choose"}, {"index": 55, "start": 232.06, "end": 234.34, "text": "Django when you have other web frameworks available in"}, {"index": 56, "start": 234.34, "end": 237.78, "text": "Python? The first reason Django is fast which simply"}, {"index": 57, "start": 237.78, "end": 240.14, "text": "means if you want to build something you should not be"}, {"index": 58, "start": 240.14, "end": 243.26, "text": "spending much time in just for the configuration. So Django"}, {"index": 59, "start": 243.26, "end": 246.74, "text": "will help you to build application faster. Second one"}, {"index": 60, "start": 246.78, "end": 249.34, "text": "the number of components available. Now think about"}, {"index": 61, "start": 249.34, "end": 251.9, "text": "this if you want to record a video you need certain"}, {"index": 62, "start": 251.9, "end": 254.1, "text": "components with your right you need a camera you need"}, {"index": 63, "start": 254.1, "end": 256.86, "text": "lights you need a mic in the same way if you want to"}, {"index": 64, "start": 256.86, "end": 259.18, "text": "build a web application you need login you need"}, {"index": 65, "start": 259.18, "end": 261.82, "text": "database connectivity and all this thing comes"}, {"index": 66, "start": 261.86, "end": 265.5, "text": "bundled in Django. That's an advantage and drawback"}, {"index": 67, "start": 265.5, "end": 268.02, "text": "as well advantages you have everything with you the"}, {"index": 68, "start": 268.02, "end": 271.42, "text": "drawback is you have everything on you. The third"}, {"index": 69, "start": 271.42, "end": 273.66, "text": "one is security. Now if you are building an"}, {"index": 70, "start": 273.66, "end": 276.22, "text": "application where a user will interact of course"}, {"index": 71, "start": 276.38, "end": 278.62, "text": "they will be sending their data and you want to"}, {"index": 72, "start": 278.62, "end": 281.3, "text": "secure them you want to secure your users. So"}, {"index": 73, "start": 281.3, "end": 283.62, "text": "Django will provide you that security and the"}, {"index": 74, "start": 283.62, "end": 287.58, "text": "fourth one is scalability what if in future your"}, {"index": 75, "start": 287.58, "end": 290.58, "text": "website skills you want to have multiple users you"}, {"index": 76, "start": 290.58, "end": 292.94, "text": "want to have more features so Django will give you"}, {"index": 77, "start": 292.94, "end": 295.34, "text": "that option as well and that's the reason you"}, {"index": 78, "start": 295.34, "end": 297.5, "text": "should be learning Django now. So Django is"}, {"index": 79, "start": 297.5, "end": 299.42, "text": "interesting so if you have done your Python"}, {"index": 80, "start": 299.42, "end": 301.86, "text": "course before on this channel now you can also"}, {"index": 81, "start": 301.86, "end": 303.9, "text": "learn Django because that's the next step you"}, {"index": 82, "start": 303.9, "end": 306.62, "text": "can take. So that's it from this video I hope"}, {"index": 83, "start": 306.62, "end": 308.54, "text": "you are enjoying this channel in the comment"}, {"index": 84, "start": 308.54, "end": 311.78, "text": "section and do subscribe for the videos. Bye bye."}], "segments_by_language": {"en": [{"index": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 9.86, "text": "Welcome back Aliens, my name is Devan Reddy and in this video we will talk about Django."}, {"index": 1, "start": 9.86, "end": 16.1, "text": "The Django. Django is a free and open source web application framework. Now you will say"}, {"index": 2, "start": 16.1, "end": 20.82, "text": "okay we know about free part, we know about open source part but what is a framework."}, {"index": 3, "start": 20.82, "end": 25.7, "text": "Now framework is a combination of certain components and packages. Of course if you"}, {"index": 4, "start": 25.7, "end": 29.94, "text": "want to build some complex application there are certain things you need ready"}, {"index": 5, "start": 29.94, "end": 33.34, "text": "made. Example if you want to build web application you don't want to do"}, {"index": 6, "start": 33.34, "end": 37.02, "text": "everything from scratch. It will be time-consuming right. So we will be"}, {"index": 7, "start": 37.02, "end": 41.42, "text": "using a framework here. Now Django is not the only framework available. The"}, {"index": 8, "start": 41.42, "end": 45.26, "text": "moment you say web app we have certain frameworks available. One of them is or"}, {"index": 9, "start": 45.26, "end": 50.14, "text": "one of the famous one is Django. But why we have to learn Django there? Now"}, {"index": 10, "start": 50.14, "end": 53.78, "text": "Django as we know is a web application framework that means you can"}, {"index": 11, "start": 53.78, "end": 58.06, "text": "build web application. But hold on our websites are so important of course right"}, {"index": 12, "start": 58.06, "end": 62.58, "text": "if you talk about any business they need their own online presence. In fact"}, {"index": 13, "start": 62.58, "end": 66.26, "text": "most of the virtual solutions which we use nowadays are web applications."}, {"index": 14, "start": 66.26, "end": 70.42, "text": "Example if you want to buy something online we have Amazon, we have Flipkart, we"}, {"index": 15, "start": 70.42, "end": 75.5, "text": "have eBay. If you want to book a cab we have Uber right. We have so many"}, {"index": 16, "start": 75.5, "end": 79.94, "text": "applications available which are based on web. So if you want to build them"}, {"index": 17, "start": 79.94, "end": 83.5, "text": "you will be using Django there. But the moment you talk about websites we"}, {"index": 18, "start": 83.54, "end": 88.3, "text": "know that you can build websites with the help of HTML, CSS and JavaScript. So"}, {"index": 19, "start": 88.3, "end": 94.02, "text": "basically we use HTML to design the page. You can think HTML as the makeup for"}, {"index": 20, "start": 94.02, "end": 97.78, "text": "you. Now then we have CSS. If you want to improve your design if you want to"}, {"index": 21, "start": 97.78, "end": 101.94, "text": "have that uniformity in the design that's why you will use CSS. So we"}, {"index": 22, "start": 101.94, "end": 107.3, "text": "have HTML CSS for designing. To make your website interactive we can use"}, {"index": 23, "start": 107.3, "end": 112.18, "text": "JavaScript. So yes we use HTML CSS JavaScript in the front end. What"}, {"index": 24, "start": 112.18, "end": 115.9, "text": "about the back end part? What if you want to make your website as a"}, {"index": 25, "start": 115.9, "end": 120.26, "text": "dynamic website? Example let's say if you go to Facebook you know everyone will"}, {"index": 26, "start": 120.26, "end": 123.46, "text": "get different feeds. You will not see the same message which everyone is"}, {"index": 27, "start": 123.46, "end": 126.82, "text": "saying. So your feeds will be different from them. If you go to"}, {"index": 28, "start": 126.82, "end": 131.26, "text": "Amazon you can buy stuff online, you can pay, you can transfer amount online"}, {"index": 29, "start": 131.26, "end": 135.06, "text": "and all this thing needs certain operations or certain processing done"}, {"index": 30, "start": 135.06, "end": 138.74, "text": "on the back end side. And that's where we need a language which will"}, {"index": 31, "start": 138.78, "end": 142.78, "text": "work on the back end. But which one? So we have some options there. We"}, {"index": 32, "start": 142.78, "end": 146.3, "text": "have Java using, if you heard about Savlets we can do that there. We"}, {"index": 33, "start": 146.3, "end": 150.5, "text": "have PHP, we have ASP, we have Python. But hold on, how can we do"}, {"index": 34, "start": 150.5, "end": 153.7, "text": "that in Python? And that's where we have Django. So you can use"}, {"index": 35, "start": 153.7, "end": 159.46, "text": "Django to build web application the back end part in Python. Okay, as"}, {"index": 36, "start": 159.46, "end": 163.5, "text": "I mentioned before Django is not the only web framework available but"}, {"index": 37, "start": 163.5, "end": 166.82, "text": "it's quite famous there. Now when it comes to web application one thing"}, {"index": 38, "start": 166.86, "end": 170.18, "text": "is very famous which is MVC. Now it doesn't matter which language"}, {"index": 39, "start": 170.18, "end": 175.14, "text": "you'll learn maybe Java, PHP or ASP. We have this thing common"}, {"index": 40, "start": 175.14, "end": 179.42, "text": "which is MVC, model view controller. Now basically we do"}, {"index": 41, "start": 179.42, "end": 183.06, "text": "that so that we can separate the concerns. We have model for"}, {"index": 42, "start": 183.06, "end": 186.86, "text": "data, we have view the HTML format which you see on this"}, {"index": 43, "start": 186.86, "end": 189.42, "text": "screen and then we have a controller which will control"}, {"index": 44, "start": 189.42, "end": 193.26, "text": "these operations. In fact, we have a separate video on what"}, {"index": 45, "start": 193.26, "end": 196.66, "text": "is MVC but then in general when you say MVC it will help you"}, {"index": 46, "start": 196.7, "end": 200.7, "text": "to build a good web application. But in Django we have"}, {"index": 47, "start": 200.7, "end": 204.5, "text": "something similar to MVC, not exactly MVC which we normally"}, {"index": 48, "start": 204.5, "end": 210.14, "text": "call as MVT or MVT it doesn't matter. So that MVT which is"}, {"index": 49, "start": 210.14, "end": 215.14, "text": "model view template. So basically in MVT we are replacing"}, {"index": 50, "start": 215.18, "end": 217.78, "text": "controller with view and we are replacing view with"}, {"index": 51, "start": 217.78, "end": 220.9, "text": "template again how that works we'll see that later in the"}, {"index": 52, "start": 220.9, "end": 225.18, "text": "practical video. But then Django basically follows MVT. So if"}, {"index": 53, "start": 225.18, "end": 228.5, "text": "you have worked on MVC on different language don't worry"}, {"index": 54, "start": 228.5, "end": 232.06, "text": "it's almost same but with some changes. But why to choose"}, {"index": 55, "start": 232.06, "end": 234.34, "text": "Django when you have other web frameworks available in"}, {"index": 56, "start": 234.34, "end": 237.78, "text": "Python? The first reason Django is fast which simply"}, {"index": 57, "start": 237.78, "end": 240.14, "text": "means if you want to build something you should not be"}, {"index": 58, "start": 240.14, "end": 243.26, "text": "spending much time in just for the configuration. So Django"}, {"index": 59, "start": 243.26, "end": 246.74, "text": "will help you to build application faster. Second one"}, {"index": 60, "start": 246.78, "end": 249.34, "text": "the number of components available. Now think about"}, {"index": 61, "start": 249.34, "end": 251.9, "text": "this if you want to record a video you need certain"}, {"index": 62, "start": 251.9, "end": 254.1, "text": "components with your right you need a camera you need"}, {"index": 63, "start": 254.1, "end": 256.86, "text": "lights you need a mic in the same way if you want to"}, {"index": 64, "start": 256.86, "end": 259.18, "text": "build a web application you need login you need"}, {"index": 65, "start": 259.18, "end": 261.82, "text": "database connectivity and all this thing comes"}, {"index": 66, "start": 261.86, "end": 265.5, "text": "bundled in Django. That's an advantage and drawback"}, {"index": 67, "start": 265.5, "end": 268.02, "text": "as well advantages you have everything with you the"}, {"index": 68, "start": 268.02, "end": 271.42, "text": "drawback is you have everything on you. The third"}, {"index": 69, "start": 271.42, "end": 273.66, "text": "one is security. Now if you are building an"}, {"index": 70, "start": 273.66, "end": 276.22, "text": "application where a user will interact of course"}, {"index": 71, "start": 276.38, "end": 278.62, "text": "they will be sending their data and you want to"}, {"index": 72, "start": 278.62, "end": 281.3, "text": "secure them you want to secure your users. So"}, {"index": 73, "start": 281.3, "end": 283.62, "text": "Django will provide you that security and the"}, {"index": 74, "start": 283.62, "end": 287.58, "text": "fourth one is scalability what if in future your"}, {"index": 75, "start": 287.58, "end": 290.58, "text": "website skills you want to have multiple users you"}, {"index": 76, "start": 290.58, "end": 292.94, "text": "want to have more features so Django will give you"}, {"index": 77, "start": 292.94, "end": 295.34, "text": "that option as well and that's the reason you"}, {"index": 78, "start": 295.34, "end": 297.5, "text": "should be learning Django now. So Django is"}, {"index": 79, "start": 297.5, "end": 299.42, "text": "interesting so if you have done your Python"}, {"index": 80, "start": 299.42, "end": 301.86, "text": "course before on this channel now you can also"}, {"index": 81, "start": 301.86, "end": 303.9, "text": "learn Django because that's the next step you"}, {"index": 82, "start": 303.9, "end": 306.62, "text": "can take. So that's it from this video I hope"}, {"index": 83, "start": 306.62, "end": 308.54, "text": "you are enjoying this channel in the comment"}, {"index": 84, "start": 308.54, "end": 311.78, "text": "section and do subscribe for the videos. Bye bye."}]}}, "summary": ["L\\u1ed7i t\\u00f3m t\\u1eaft: Connection error."], "timeline": [], "highlights": [], "questions": [], "briefing": {}, "visual_data": {}, "cover_image_url": null, "handsign_data": [], "flashcards": [], "quizzes": [], "artifact_status": {"transcript": {"status": "ready", "error": null}, "summary": {"status": "ready", "error": null}, "timeline": {"status": "failed", "error": "Connection error."}, "highlights": {"status": "failed", "error": "Connection error."}, "questions": {"status": "failed", "error": "Connection error."}, "briefing": {"status": "failed", "error": "Connection error."}, "visual_data": {"status": "failed", "error": "Connection error."}, "flashcards": {"status": "failed", "error": "Connection error."}, "handsign_data": {"status": "empty", "error": null}, "quizzes": {"status": "empty", "error": null}}}	2026-05-16 01:37:28.838047
931ac569-eeab-4063-a72b-d2d8cd55d4b0	60213e11-d0ed-4a92-b8fa-13c12e5ddccd	data\\uploads\\videos\\60213e11-d0ed-4a92-b8fa-13c12e5ddccd.mp4	\N	\N	\N	\N	{"transcript": {"video_id": "60213e11-d0ed-4a92-b8fa-13c12e5ddccd", "language": "en", "source_language": "en", "target_language": "vi", "available_languages": ["en"], "translation_status": {"vi": {"status": "translation_failed", "error": "Khong the dich transcript sang vi."}}, "segments": [{"index": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 10.0, "text": "Welcome back Aliens, my name is Avin Reddy and in this video we will create our first"}, {"index": 1, "start": 10.0, "end": 11.44, "text": "Django project."}, {"index": 2, "start": 11.44, "end": 16.36, "text": "But hold on, to work with Django we have to install Django first and unfortunately we"}, {"index": 3, "start": 16.36, "end": 18.36, "text": "don't have a setup here."}, {"index": 4, "start": 18.36, "end": 22.24, "text": "Now when you say you want to install Django, of course you have to be specific with the"}, {"index": 5, "start": 22.24, "end": 26.16, "text": "OS you are working with because for different type of OS we have a different setup for"}, {"index": 6, "start": 26.16, "end": 27.16, "text": "Django."}, {"index": 7, "start": 27.48, "end": 32.16, "text": "If you are using a Linux based OS or if you are using Mac they have almost the same"}, {"index": 8, "start": 32.16, "end": 36.2, "text": "step but in Windows we have different settings to work with."}, {"index": 9, "start": 36.2, "end": 40.32, "text": "Now in this series we are going to start with Windows for various reasons."}, {"index": 10, "start": 40.32, "end": 45.36, "text": "The recording software which we are using is it works well on Windows and most of"}, {"index": 11, "start": 45.36, "end": 46.52, "text": "the people are using Windows."}, {"index": 12, "start": 46.52, "end": 51.16, "text": "I will still suggest you to move from Windows to Linux to enjoy programming but just"}, {"index": 13, "start": 51.16, "end": 53.4, "text": "to get started let's start with Windows."}, {"index": 14, "start": 53.4, "end": 58.16, "text": "Of course the coding part will remain same, doesn't matter which OS you are working with."}, {"index": 15, "start": 58.16, "end": 59.16, "text": "So let's get started."}, {"index": 16, "start": 59.16, "end": 61.04, "text": "First of all you need a setup."}, {"index": 17, "start": 61.04, "end": 65.52, "text": "Now if you want to work with Django as we mentioned Django is a web framework for"}, {"index": 18, "start": 65.52, "end": 66.52, "text": "Python."}, {"index": 19, "start": 66.52, "end": 70.24, "text": "That means if you want to work with Django you need a Python setup."}, {"index": 20, "start": 70.24, "end": 74.08, "text": "Now if you have seen my Python series we have done the Python setup there and"}, {"index": 21, "start": 74.08, "end": 76.36, "text": "then we have learned so many things right."}, {"index": 22, "start": 76.36, "end": 79.08, "text": "So if you have done those things, if you have done the setup you don't have"}, {"index": 23, "start": 79.08, "end": 82.04, "text": "to install Python again, it's there in your machine."}, {"index": 24, "start": 82.04, "end": 85.52, "text": "And what if you don't have a Python setup so that's where you will install it."}, {"index": 25, "start": 85.52, "end": 89.2, "text": "Now when you say you want to install something there is one little question which is"}, {"index": 26, "start": 89.2, "end": 90.76, "text": "about the version."}, {"index": 27, "start": 90.76, "end": 92.04, "text": "Which version we are going for."}, {"index": 28, "start": 92.04, "end": 95.84, "text": "So for Django we are going for version 2 to be specific it is 2.2."}, {"index": 29, "start": 95.84, "end": 98.68, "text": "Of course if you are watching this video after some time you will be having"}, {"index": 30, "start": 98.68, "end": 102.76, "text": "some new versions but don't worry at least for 2x they will not be having"}, {"index": 31, "start": 102.76, "end": 108.72, "text": "any major update so that you can just check that on the documentation."}, {"index": 32, "start": 108.72, "end": 110.68, "text": "Now what about Python setup you need."}, {"index": 33, "start": 110.68, "end": 114.84, "text": "So if you want to work with Django 2.2 you need a latest version of Python"}, {"index": 34, "start": 114.84, "end": 117.92, "text": "which is more than 3.4 I guess."}, {"index": 35, "start": 117.92, "end": 122.0, "text": "So you just have to go to Google just search for Python download that's the"}, {"index": 36, "start": 122.0, "end": 124.28, "text": "website you have to go and click on that."}, {"index": 37, "start": 124.28, "end": 126.96, "text": "Now once you come to this website you can see we have an option of download"}, {"index": 38, "start": 126.96, "end": 132.0, "text": "Python 3.7.3 which will surely work it is more than 3.4 right."}, {"index": 39, "start": 132.0, "end": 135.4, "text": "But you have to also check one more thing which is the type of windows you"}, {"index": 40, "start": 135.4, "end": 136.4, "text": "are working with."}, {"index": 41, "start": 137.12, "end": 141.96, "text": "32-bit OS or 64-bit OS and based on that you can do the setup."}, {"index": 42, "start": 141.96, "end": 144.92, "text": "So download the version which you have with you."}, {"index": 43, "start": 144.92, "end": 148.64, "text": "So this is 64-bit OS so I am downloading that."}, {"index": 44, "start": 148.64, "end": 151.56, "text": "So once you got setup with you you just have to go to downloads."}, {"index": 45, "start": 151.56, "end": 153.8, "text": "So you just have to click on the setup which you got downloaded."}, {"index": 46, "start": 153.8, "end": 157.24, "text": "So you have to make sure if your windows version is 64 just do that."}, {"index": 47, "start": 157.24, "end": 161.4, "text": "Okay 64 OS and then you have to also make sure that you do this."}, {"index": 48, "start": 161.4, "end": 164.68, "text": "You have to say add a Python in your path so that you don't have to do"}, {"index": 49, "start": 164.68, "end": 166.24, "text": "that setup later."}, {"index": 50, "start": 166.24, "end": 170.44, "text": "Just check that and here click on install allow it does take some time."}, {"index": 51, "start": 170.44, "end": 174.08, "text": "Okay so it says setup done for Python click on close."}, {"index": 52, "start": 174.08, "end": 177.12, "text": "Now once you got your Python installed how do you verify it?"}, {"index": 53, "start": 177.12, "end": 180.76, "text": "Best way open CMD and that's your CMD prompt here."}, {"index": 54, "start": 180.76, "end": 183.84, "text": "Okay so here we have to check for the Python version."}, {"index": 55, "start": 183.84, "end": 186.24, "text": "So the way you can do that is by saying Python."}, {"index": 56, "start": 186.24, "end": 188.52, "text": "iPhone you have to say version."}, {"index": 57, "start": 188.52, "end": 193.0, "text": "Now it will give you the version of Python which you have which is 3.7.3."}, {"index": 58, "start": 193.0, "end": 194.96, "text": "The next thing you need is PIP."}, {"index": 59, "start": 194.96, "end": 198.48, "text": "Now PIP is a installer manager for Python."}, {"index": 60, "start": 198.48, "end": 201.6, "text": "So when you install Python you will get PIP as well."}, {"index": 61, "start": 201.6, "end": 205.56, "text": "So just simply say PIP and let's check the version of this as well."}, {"index": 62, "start": 205.56, "end": 209.64, "text": "And it should be 19.1 or 19.0.3 both works."}, {"index": 63, "start": 209.64, "end": 213.44, "text": "So you can see I have 19.1 the latest version."}, {"index": 64, "start": 213.44, "end": 218.36, "text": "Now once you got Python with you once you got PIP we have to also check for Django."}, {"index": 65, "start": 218.36, "end": 220.6, "text": "Of course we don't have a Django setup."}, {"index": 66, "start": 220.64, "end": 225.32, "text": "The way you can verify that is by saying Django-admin version."}, {"index": 67, "start": 225.32, "end": 230.0, "text": "That's how you that's the Django command you can use."}, {"index": 68, "start": 230.0, "end": 232.8, "text": "And you can see it says there's no Django available."}, {"index": 69, "start": 232.8, "end": 234.96, "text": "So of course we have not installed it yet."}, {"index": 70, "start": 234.96, "end": 237.0, "text": "So we got Python we got PIP."}, {"index": 71, "start": 237.0, "end": 238.32, "text": "Let's install Django."}, {"index": 72, "start": 238.32, "end": 241.88, "text": "Now if you install Django here it will be available for the entire machine."}, {"index": 73, "start": 241.88, "end": 245.4, "text": "Okay so what if you want to have a different configuration for"}, {"index": 74, "start": 245.4, "end": 247.44, "text": "Django for different projects."}, {"index": 75, "start": 247.44, "end": 249.76, "text": "So let's say if you're working with multiple projects you want to have"}, {"index": 76, "start": 249.76, "end": 251.48, "text": "a different set for Django there."}, {"index": 77, "start": 251.48, "end": 256.88, "text": "So just imagine from the entire system you are getting isolated space for your projects."}, {"index": 78, "start": 256.88, "end": 260.24, "text": "So which will not be affecting the other projects which you have."}, {"index": 79, "start": 260.24, "end": 264.32, "text": "And the way you can do that is by installing a virtual environment wrapper."}, {"index": 80, "start": 264.32, "end": 265.16, "text": "So let's do that."}, {"index": 81, "start": 265.16, "end": 270.6, "text": "So the command is PIP install virtual ANV wrapper hyphen when."}, {"index": 82, "start": 270.6, "end": 272.76, "text": "And you just have to say enter."}, {"index": 83, "start": 272.76, "end": 276.12, "text": "So it will install the virtual environment for you and that's done."}, {"index": 84, "start": 276.12, "end": 278.56, "text": "You can see we got the setup."}, {"index": 85, "start": 278.6, "end": 281.56, "text": "So once you've got this setup for the environment we have to actually create"}, {"index": 86, "start": 281.56, "end": 283.6, "text": "the environment because this will not give you the environment."}, {"index": 87, "start": 283.6, "end": 288.24, "text": "This will just install the wrapper or the environment wrapper."}, {"index": 88, "start": 288.24, "end": 290.0, "text": "So we have to create the environment here."}, {"index": 89, "start": 290.0, "end": 295.68, "text": "The way you can do that is by saying it's MK virtual ANV space."}, {"index": 90, "start": 295.68, "end": 297.24, "text": "And you just have to give any name to it."}, {"index": 91, "start": 297.24, "end": 301.4, "text": "So I mean I will say test because I'm testing it and you will say enter."}, {"index": 92, "start": 301.4, "end": 305.12, "text": "So it does take some time and like so you can see we got our environment."}, {"index": 93, "start": 305.12, "end": 308.04, "text": "So what we have done is we have installed Python and"}, {"index": 94, "start": 308.04, "end": 312.56, "text": "then we have installed a virtual environment wrapper."}, {"index": 95, "start": 312.56, "end": 314.8, "text": "And then we have actually created the environment."}, {"index": 96, "start": 314.8, "end": 318.8, "text": "So the environment name here is test a small environment which very can work."}, {"index": 97, "start": 318.8, "end": 320.4, "text": "And you can also see it says test here."}, {"index": 98, "start": 320.4, "end": 326.08, "text": "So just before your command we have test there which means we are into environment."}, {"index": 99, "start": 326.08, "end": 329.4, "text": "Now once you are in the environment now we have to install Django."}, {"index": 100, "start": 329.4, "end": 330.64, "text": "Let's do that."}, {"index": 101, "start": 330.64, "end": 333.76, "text": "And is it difficult of course not we have a simple command here."}, {"index": 102, "start": 333.76, "end": 337.56, "text": "So we can simply say PIP install Django."}, {"index": 103, "start": 337.6, "end": 341.84, "text": "I know we are working with command prompt and some people don't like it but"}, {"index": 104, "start": 341.84, "end": 344.76, "text": "come on you're a programmer like this is something you should be you should be"}, {"index": 105, "start": 344.76, "end": 346.24, "text": "loving love doing."}, {"index": 106, "start": 346.24, "end": 350.56, "text": "So we have PIP space install space Django and it will install Django for you."}, {"index": 107, "start": 350.56, "end": 351.96, "text": "Simply say enter."}, {"index": 108, "start": 351.96, "end": 356.32, "text": "Now based on your internet speed based on the system speed it will take some time."}, {"index": 109, "start": 356.32, "end": 357.04, "text": "And that's done."}, {"index": 110, "start": 357.04, "end": 360.36, "text": "You can see it says installed Django 2.2."}, {"index": 111, "start": 360.36, "end": 361.64, "text": "This is what we wanted."}, {"index": 112, "start": 361.64, "end": 363.48, "text": "In fact you can you can actually check the version now."}, {"index": 113, "start": 363.52, "end": 370.48, "text": "So you can say Django-admin version."}, {"index": 114, "start": 370.48, "end": 373.76, "text": "So you can see we got something went wrong."}, {"index": 115, "start": 373.76, "end": 375.12, "text": "Yeah, so we got 2.2."}, {"index": 116, "start": 375.12, "end": 377.92, "text": "So that's the version which you are working with."}, {"index": 117, "start": 377.92, "end": 384.56, "text": "Okay, but what if I open CMD again and if I check do we have Django available here."}, {"index": 118, "start": 384.56, "end": 387.0, "text": "And you can see it says Django is not available."}, {"index": 119, "start": 387.0, "end": 387.68, "text": "So that's the thing."}, {"index": 120, "start": 387.68, "end": 391.24, "text": "So Django is there only in our environment is not there for the system."}, {"index": 121, "start": 391.24, "end": 392.68, "text": "And that's what we want, right?"}, {"index": 122, "start": 392.68, "end": 395.72, "text": "We don't want to disturb the entire system just for our project."}, {"index": 123, "start": 395.72, "end": 398.48, "text": "So we have the environment where we have Django available."}, {"index": 124, "start": 398.48, "end": 403.04, "text": "So we got Python, we got Django and now let's create our first project."}, {"index": 125, "start": 403.04, "end": 405.72, "text": "Yes, that will be done using Kamana itself."}, {"index": 126, "start": 405.72, "end": 407.6, "text": "Okay, but then how will you do it?"}, {"index": 127, "start": 407.6, "end": 409.56, "text": "Now we can do that in a particular project."}, {"index": 128, "start": 409.56, "end": 413.64, "text": "So what normally I prefer is I keep all my projects in one particular folder."}, {"index": 129, "start": 413.64, "end": 414.16, "text": "So let's do that."}, {"index": 130, "start": 414.16, "end": 416.48, "text": "Let me create a folder here."}, {"index": 131, "start": 416.48, "end": 420.92, "text": "So we'll say MKMDR and we'll say projects."}, {"index": 132, "start": 420.92, "end": 423.52, "text": "This is where I will have all my projects."}, {"index": 133, "start": 423.52, "end": 427.56, "text": "So we got a folder which is projects and let's move to that folder."}, {"index": 134, "start": 427.56, "end": 432.64, "text": "So we'll say CD projects, oh sorry, projects."}, {"index": 135, "start": 432.64, "end": 435.2, "text": "And now you can see we are in that project."}, {"index": 136, "start": 435.2, "end": 435.76, "text": "So that's great."}, {"index": 137, "start": 435.76, "end": 440.68, "text": "We got a folder and we are into it and let's create our project here."}, {"index": 138, "start": 440.68, "end": 443.28, "text": "Then to do that, we have to use a command again."}, {"index": 139, "start": 443.28, "end": 445.92, "text": "But don't worry once you will get used to it."}, {"index": 140, "start": 445.92, "end": 450.4, "text": "So we'll say Django hyphen admin."}, {"index": 141, "start": 450.84, "end": 452.64, "text": "So whatever you'll do, you have to do with this thing."}, {"index": 142, "start": 452.64, "end": 459.76, "text": "You have to say Django hyphen admin and you have to create a project which is start project."}, {"index": 143, "start": 459.76, "end": 461.04, "text": "And I will give a project name."}, {"index": 144, "start": 461.04, "end": 461.68, "text": "So that's the command."}, {"index": 145, "start": 461.68, "end": 464.6, "text": "So Django admin and then you have to say start project."}, {"index": 146, "start": 464.6, "end": 466.6, "text": "And you can give any project name you want."}, {"index": 147, "start": 466.6, "end": 470.52, "text": "So let's since we are Telesco, let's give a project name as Telesco itself."}, {"index": 148, "start": 470.52, "end": 471.48, "text": "And we'll say enter."}, {"index": 149, "start": 471.48, "end": 476.0, "text": "But before doing enter, let me just go to this project folder just to see if it is empty or not."}, {"index": 150, "start": 476.0, "end": 479.76, "text": "So I'm in my C drive and so in user we have Telesco."}, {"index": 151, "start": 479.8, "end": 483.88, "text": "Let's go there and you can see here we have a project's folder which is empty."}, {"index": 152, "start": 483.88, "end": 489.52, "text": "And the moment I say enter here, it will create a project for you."}, {"index": 153, "start": 489.52, "end": 492.92, "text": "Let's go back to the folder and you can see we got a Telesco project."}, {"index": 154, "start": 492.92, "end": 493.68, "text": "Now what do you think?"}, {"index": 155, "start": 493.68, "end": 494.68, "text": "Will it be empty or not?"}, {"index": 156, "start": 494.68, "end": 497.96, "text": "Let's double click here and you can see we do it's not an empty folder."}, {"index": 157, "start": 497.96, "end": 500.12, "text": "We have a managed pilot file."}, {"index": 158, "start": 500.12, "end": 502.12, "text": "I don't know why we need this."}, {"index": 159, "start": 502.12, "end": 503.16, "text": "Let's see that later."}, {"index": 160, "start": 503.16, "end": 507.2, "text": "And then we got a Telesco folder in which you have four different files."}, {"index": 161, "start": 507.2, "end": 508.6, "text": "We'll talk about these things later."}, {"index": 162, "start": 508.6, "end": 510.72, "text": "You know what exactly these things are."}, {"index": 163, "start": 510.72, "end": 513.92, "text": "But as of now, the important file here is manage."}, {"index": 164, "start": 513.92, "end": 517.64, "text": "Okay, to access that manage, first of all, we'll navigate to the project which we have created."}, {"index": 165, "start": 517.64, "end": 519.08, "text": "So the project name is Telesco."}, {"index": 166, "start": 519.08, "end": 521.08, "text": "So we can see we are in Telesco now."}, {"index": 167, "start": 521.08, "end": 523.96, "text": "And if I say LS, that's Linux."}, {"index": 168, "start": 523.96, "end": 528.4, "text": "If I say DIR, you can see we have a folder which is managed.py."}, {"index": 169, "start": 528.4, "end": 529.48, "text": "So we have this file."}, {"index": 170, "start": 529.48, "end": 532.76, "text": "And then in Telesco as well, we have settings file which is important."}, {"index": 171, "start": 532.76, "end": 534.84, "text": "We have URL."}, {"index": 172, "start": 534.84, "end": 536.04, "text": "We are building a website, right?"}, {"index": 173, "start": 536.04, "end": 538.52, "text": "So of course in the website you'll be having a lot of URLs."}, {"index": 174, "start": 538.56, "end": 541.92, "text": "So this will be used to handle that."}, {"index": 175, "start": 541.92, "end": 547.04, "text": "This is something which will be used to deploy your project on the production server."}, {"index": 176, "start": 547.04, "end": 549.64, "text": "Because while you're working, while you're learning stuff,"}, {"index": 177, "start": 549.64, "end": 552.12, "text": "you will not be working on the production server."}, {"index": 178, "start": 552.12, "end": 555.96, "text": "You'll be working on a development server, the testing server basically."}, {"index": 179, "start": 555.96, "end": 557.24, "text": "So we'll be using this."}, {"index": 180, "start": 557.24, "end": 560.64, "text": "We don't actually use init, so we'll not talk about that."}, {"index": 181, "start": 560.64, "end": 562.36, "text": "Okay, so we got our project."}, {"index": 182, "start": 562.36, "end": 563.84, "text": "We are into that project now."}, {"index": 183, "start": 563.84, "end": 565.84, "text": "But what next?"}, {"index": 184, "start": 565.84, "end": 567.84, "text": "We have not done any coding as of now."}, {"index": 185, "start": 567.84, "end": 572.04, "text": "But still, you can run this particular project."}, {"index": 186, "start": 572.04, "end": 574.28, "text": "And you can run this on a particular server."}, {"index": 187, "start": 574.28, "end": 576.8, "text": "Of course, you need a server, right?"}, {"index": 188, "start": 576.8, "end": 578.36, "text": "Django says, hey, don't worry."}, {"index": 189, "start": 578.36, "end": 582.16, "text": "Since you are installing Django, we will also give you a lightweight server."}, {"index": 190, "start": 582.16, "end": 585.36, "text": "And to access that, we have to say Python."}, {"index": 191, "start": 585.36, "end": 589.4, "text": "And we have to use a file which is managed.py."}, {"index": 192, "start": 589.4, "end": 591.0, "text": "We have seen this file before."}, {"index": 193, "start": 591.0, "end": 593.48, "text": "And then the command we have to use is run server."}, {"index": 194, "start": 593.48, "end": 598.12, "text": "And the moment you say enter, you can see you got your server up"}, {"index": 195, "start": 598.12, "end": 600.72, "text": "and running without any errors."}, {"index": 196, "start": 600.72, "end": 602.28, "text": "It also says some different stuff."}, {"index": 197, "start": 602.28, "end": 603.76, "text": "We'll talk about that later."}, {"index": 198, "start": 603.76, "end": 606.44, "text": "In fact, in the theory video, we have talked about MVT, right?"}, {"index": 199, "start": 606.44, "end": 608.44, "text": "Which is model view template."}, {"index": 200, "start": 608.44, "end": 610.48, "text": "In model, it works for database, right?"}, {"index": 201, "start": 610.48, "end": 612.28, "text": "It's handle data."}, {"index": 202, "start": 612.28, "end": 613.72, "text": "That's why it is giving you those warnings."}, {"index": 203, "start": 613.72, "end": 615.72, "text": "But as of now, let's ignore them."}, {"index": 204, "start": 615.72, "end": 620.44, "text": "What is important is it says your server started at this IP address."}, {"index": 205, "start": 620.44, "end": 622.36, "text": "So this is your local host address, basically."}, {"index": 206, "start": 622.36, "end": 624.6, "text": "And the port number is 8000."}, {"index": 207, "start": 624.6, "end": 626.72, "text": "Of course, you can change this port number."}, {"index": 208, "start": 626.72, "end": 628.24, "text": "But I will just go here."}, {"index": 209, "start": 628.24, "end": 633.52, "text": "I will say 127.0.0.1.8000."}, {"index": 210, "start": 633.52, "end": 637.12, "text": "And you can see this is your Django home page."}, {"index": 211, "start": 637.12, "end": 638.36, "text": "OK, why we are getting this?"}, {"index": 212, "start": 638.36, "end": 639.88, "text": "Why not our own project data?"}, {"index": 213, "start": 639.88, "end": 642.16, "text": "Because we have not done any coding as of now."}, {"index": 214, "start": 642.16, "end": 644.0, "text": "And that's why you're saying this."}, {"index": 215, "start": 644.0, "end": 645.96, "text": "If you want to experiment, you can simply click on."}, {"index": 216, "start": 645.96, "end": 649.4, "text": "You can see below we have tutorials, a polling app."}, {"index": 217, "start": 649.4, "end": 650.52, "text": "You can just go there."}, {"index": 218, "start": 650.52, "end": 653.0, "text": "It will show you the steps how to get a project."}, {"index": 219, "start": 653.0, "end": 655.52, "text": "You know, I just love documentation part here."}, {"index": 220, "start": 655.52, "end": 658.48, "text": "So you can follow this documentation just to learn more."}, {"index": 221, "start": 658.48, "end": 661.0, "text": "So that's how you do a setup for Python, for Django."}, {"index": 222, "start": 661.0, "end": 663.28, "text": "And we have created our first project"}, {"index": 223, "start": 663.28, "end": 665.28, "text": "without any coding, of course."}, {"index": 224, "start": 665.28, "end": 666.84, "text": "So in the next video, we'll write some code"}, {"index": 225, "start": 666.84, "end": 668.48, "text": "and we'll do some experiment here."}, {"index": 226, "start": 668.48, "end": 669.88, "text": "So I hope you enjoyed this video."}, {"index": 227, "start": 669.88, "end": 671.4, "text": "Let me know in the comments section."}, {"index": 228, "start": 671.4, "end": 673.76, "text": "And do subscribe for other videos."}, {"index": 229, "start": 673.76, "end": 675.32, "text": "Bye-bye."}], "segments_by_language": {"en": [{"index": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 10.0, "text": "Welcome back Aliens, my name is Avin Reddy and in this video we will create our first"}, {"index": 1, "start": 10.0, "end": 11.44, "text": "Django project."}, {"index": 2, "start": 11.44, "end": 16.36, "text": "But hold on, to work with Django we have to install Django first and unfortunately we"}, {"index": 3, "start": 16.36, "end": 18.36, "text": "don't have a setup here."}, {"index": 4, "start": 18.36, "end": 22.24, "text": "Now when you say you want to install Django, of course you have to be specific with the"}, {"index": 5, "start": 22.24, "end": 26.16, "text": "OS you are working with because for different type of OS we have a different setup for"}, {"index": 6, "start": 26.16, "end": 27.16, "text": "Django."}, {"index": 7, "start": 27.48, "end": 32.16, "text": "If you are using a Linux based OS or if you are using Mac they have almost the same"}, {"index": 8, "start": 32.16, "end": 36.2, "text": "step but in Windows we have different settings to work with."}, {"index": 9, "start": 36.2, "end": 40.32, "text": "Now in this series we are going to start with Windows for various reasons."}, {"index": 10, "start": 40.32, "end": 45.36, "text": "The recording software which we are using is it works well on Windows and most of"}, {"index": 11, "start": 45.36, "end": 46.52, "text": "the people are using Windows."}, {"index": 12, "start": 46.52, "end": 51.16, "text": "I will still suggest you to move from Windows to Linux to enjoy programming but just"}, {"index": 13, "start": 51.16, "end": 53.4, "text": "to get started let's start with Windows."}, {"index": 14, "start": 53.4, "end": 58.16, "text": "Of course the coding part will remain same, doesn't matter which OS you are working with."}, {"index": 15, "start": 58.16, "end": 59.16, "text": "So let's get started."}, {"index": 16, "start": 59.16, "end": 61.04, "text": "First of all you need a setup."}, {"index": 17, "start": 61.04, "end": 65.52, "text": "Now if you want to work with Django as we mentioned Django is a web framework for"}, {"index": 18, "start": 65.52, "end": 66.52, "text": "Python."}, {"index": 19, "start": 66.52, "end": 70.24, "text": "That means if you want to work with Django you need a Python setup."}, {"index": 20, "start": 70.24, "end": 74.08, "text": "Now if you have seen my Python series we have done the Python setup there and"}, {"index": 21, "start": 74.08, "end": 76.36, "text": "then we have learned so many things right."}, {"index": 22, "start": 76.36, "end": 79.08, "text": "So if you have done those things, if you have done the setup you don't have"}, {"index": 23, "start": 79.08, "end": 82.04, "text": "to install Python again, it's there in your machine."}, {"index": 24, "start": 82.04, "end": 85.52, "text": "And what if you don't have a Python setup so that's where you will install it."}, {"index": 25, "start": 85.52, "end": 89.2, "text": "Now when you say you want to install something there is one little question which is"}, {"index": 26, "start": 89.2, "end": 90.76, "text": "about the version."}, {"index": 27, "start": 90.76, "end": 92.04, "text": "Which version we are going for."}, {"index": 28, "start": 92.04, "end": 95.84, "text": "So for Django we are going for version 2 to be specific it is 2.2."}, {"index": 29, "start": 95.84, "end": 98.68, "text": "Of course if you are watching this video after some time you will be having"}, {"index": 30, "start": 98.68, "end": 102.76, "text": "some new versions but don't worry at least for 2x they will not be having"}, {"index": 31, "start": 102.76, "end": 108.72, "text": "any major update so that you can just check that on the documentation."}, {"index": 32, "start": 108.72, "end": 110.68, "text": "Now what about Python setup you need."}, {"index": 33, "start": 110.68, "end": 114.84, "text": "So if you want to work with Django 2.2 you need a latest version of Python"}, {"index": 34, "start": 114.84, "end": 117.92, "text": "which is more than 3.4 I guess."}, {"index": 35, "start": 117.92, "end": 122.0, "text": "So you just have to go to Google just search for Python download that's the"}, {"index": 36, "start": 122.0, "end": 124.28, "text": "website you have to go and click on that."}, {"index": 37, "start": 124.28, "end": 126.96, "text": "Now once you come to this website you can see we have an option of download"}, {"index": 38, "start": 126.96, "end": 132.0, "text": "Python 3.7.3 which will surely work it is more than 3.4 right."}, {"index": 39, "start": 132.0, "end": 135.4, "text": "But you have to also check one more thing which is the type of windows you"}, {"index": 40, "start": 135.4, "end": 136.4, "text": "are working with."}, {"index": 41, "start": 137.12, "end": 141.96, "text": "32-bit OS or 64-bit OS and based on that you can do the setup."}, {"index": 42, "start": 141.96, "end": 144.92, "text": "So download the version which you have with you."}, {"index": 43, "start": 144.92, "end": 148.64, "text": "So this is 64-bit OS so I am downloading that."}, {"index": 44, "start": 148.64, "end": 151.56, "text": "So once you got setup with you you just have to go to downloads."}, {"index": 45, "start": 151.56, "end": 153.8, "text": "So you just have to click on the setup which you got downloaded."}, {"index": 46, "start": 153.8, "end": 157.24, "text": "So you have to make sure if your windows version is 64 just do that."}, {"index": 47, "start": 157.24, "end": 161.4, "text": "Okay 64 OS and then you have to also make sure that you do this."}, {"index": 48, "start": 161.4, "end": 164.68, "text": "You have to say add a Python in your path so that you don't have to do"}, {"index": 49, "start": 164.68, "end": 166.24, "text": "that setup later."}, {"index": 50, "start": 166.24, "end": 170.44, "text": "Just check that and here click on install allow it does take some time."}, {"index": 51, "start": 170.44, "end": 174.08, "text": "Okay so it says setup done for Python click on close."}, {"index": 52, "start": 174.08, "end": 177.12, "text": "Now once you got your Python installed how do you verify it?"}, {"index": 53, "start": 177.12, "end": 180.76, "text": "Best way open CMD and that's your CMD prompt here."}, {"index": 54, "start": 180.76, "end": 183.84, "text": "Okay so here we have to check for the Python version."}, {"index": 55, "start": 183.84, "end": 186.24, "text": "So the way you can do that is by saying Python."}, {"index": 56, "start": 186.24, "end": 188.52, "text": "iPhone you have to say version."}, {"index": 57, "start": 188.52, "end": 193.0, "text": "Now it will give you the version of Python which you have which is 3.7.3."}, {"index": 58, "start": 193.0, "end": 194.96, "text": "The next thing you need is PIP."}, {"index": 59, "start": 194.96, "end": 198.48, "text": "Now PIP is a installer manager for Python."}, {"index": 60, "start": 198.48, "end": 201.6, "text": "So when you install Python you will get PIP as well."}, {"index": 61, "start": 201.6, "end": 205.56, "text": "So just simply say PIP and let's check the version of this as well."}, {"index": 62, "start": 205.56, "end": 209.64, "text": "And it should be 19.1 or 19.0.3 both works."}, {"index": 63, "start": 209.64, "end": 213.44, "text": "So you can see I have 19.1 the latest version."}, {"index": 64, "start": 213.44, "end": 218.36, "text": "Now once you got Python with you once you got PIP we have to also check for Django."}, {"index": 65, "start": 218.36, "end": 220.6, "text": "Of course we don't have a Django setup."}, {"index": 66, "start": 220.64, "end": 225.32, "text": "The way you can verify that is by saying Django-admin version."}, {"index": 67, "start": 225.32, "end": 230.0, "text": "That's how you that's the Django command you can use."}, {"index": 68, "start": 230.0, "end": 232.8, "text": "And you can see it says there's no Django available."}, {"index": 69, "start": 232.8, "end": 234.96, "text": "So of course we have not installed it yet."}, {"index": 70, "start": 234.96, "end": 237.0, "text": "So we got Python we got PIP."}, {"index": 71, "start": 237.0, "end": 238.32, "text": "Let's install Django."}, {"index": 72, "start": 238.32, "end": 241.88, "text": "Now if you install Django here it will be available for the entire machine."}, {"index": 73, "start": 241.88, "end": 245.4, "text": "Okay so what if you want to have a different configuration for"}, {"index": 74, "start": 245.4, "end": 247.44, "text": "Django for different projects."}, {"index": 75, "start": 247.44, "end": 249.76, "text": "So let's say if you're working with multiple projects you want to have"}, {"index": 76, "start": 249.76, "end": 251.48, "text": "a different set for Django there."}, {"index": 77, "start": 251.48, "end": 256.88, "text": "So just imagine from the entire system you are getting isolated space for your projects."}, {"index": 78, "start": 256.88, "end": 260.24, "text": "So which will not be affecting the other projects which you have."}, {"index": 79, "start": 260.24, "end": 264.32, "text": "And the way you can do that is by installing a virtual environment wrapper."}, {"index": 80, "start": 264.32, "end": 265.16, "text": "So let's do that."}, {"index": 81, "start": 265.16, "end": 270.6, "text": "So the command is PIP install virtual ANV wrapper hyphen when."}, {"index": 82, "start": 270.6, "end": 272.76, "text": "And you just have to say enter."}, {"index": 83, "start": 272.76, "end": 276.12, "text": "So it will install the virtual environment for you and that's done."}, {"index": 84, "start": 276.12, "end": 278.56, "text": "You can see we got the setup."}, {"index": 85, "start": 278.6, "end": 281.56, "text": "So once you've got this setup for the environment we have to actually create"}, {"index": 86, "start": 281.56, "end": 283.6, "text": "the environment because this will not give you the environment."}, {"index": 87, "start": 283.6, "end": 288.24, "text": "This will just install the wrapper or the environment wrapper."}, {"index": 88, "start": 288.24, "end": 290.0, "text": "So we have to create the environment here."}, {"index": 89, "start": 290.0, "end": 295.68, "text": "The way you can do that is by saying it's MK virtual ANV space."}, {"index": 90, "start": 295.68, "end": 297.24, "text": "And you just have to give any name to it."}, {"index": 91, "start": 297.24, "end": 301.4, "text": "So I mean I will say test because I'm testing it and you will say enter."}, {"index": 92, "start": 301.4, "end": 305.12, "text": "So it does take some time and like so you can see we got our environment."}, {"index": 93, "start": 305.12, "end": 308.04, "text": "So what we have done is we have installed Python and"}, {"index": 94, "start": 308.04, "end": 312.56, "text": "then we have installed a virtual environment wrapper."}, {"index": 95, "start": 312.56, "end": 314.8, "text": "And then we have actually created the environment."}, {"index": 96, "start": 314.8, "end": 318.8, "text": "So the environment name here is test a small environment which very can work."}, {"index": 97, "start": 318.8, "end": 320.4, "text": "And you can also see it says test here."}, {"index": 98, "start": 320.4, "end": 326.08, "text": "So just before your command we have test there which means we are into environment."}, {"index": 99, "start": 326.08, "end": 329.4, "text": "Now once you are in the environment now we have to install Django."}, {"index": 100, "start": 329.4, "end": 330.64, "text": "Let's do that."}, {"index": 101, "start": 330.64, "end": 333.76, "text": "And is it difficult of course not we have a simple command here."}, {"index": 102, "start": 333.76, "end": 337.56, "text": "So we can simply say PIP install Django."}, {"index": 103, "start": 337.6, "end": 341.84, "text": "I know we are working with command prompt and some people don't like it but"}, {"index": 104, "start": 341.84, "end": 344.76, "text": "come on you're a programmer like this is something you should be you should be"}, {"index": 105, "start": 344.76, "end": 346.24, "text": "loving love doing."}, {"index": 106, "start": 346.24, "end": 350.56, "text": "So we have PIP space install space Django and it will install Django for you."}, {"index": 107, "start": 350.56, "end": 351.96, "text": "Simply say enter."}, {"index": 108, "start": 351.96, "end": 356.32, "text": "Now based on your internet speed based on the system speed it will take some time."}, {"index": 109, "start": 356.32, "end": 357.04, "text": "And that's done."}, {"index": 110, "start": 357.04, "end": 360.36, "text": "You can see it says installed Django 2.2."}, {"index": 111, "start": 360.36, "end": 361.64, "text": "This is what we wanted."}, {"index": 112, "start": 361.64, "end": 363.48, "text": "In fact you can you can actually check the version now."}, {"index": 113, "start": 363.52, "end": 370.48, "text": "So you can say Django-admin version."}, {"index": 114, "start": 370.48, "end": 373.76, "text": "So you can see we got something went wrong."}, {"index": 115, "start": 373.76, "end": 375.12, "text": "Yeah, so we got 2.2."}, {"index": 116, "start": 375.12, "end": 377.92, "text": "So that's the version which you are working with."}, {"index": 117, "start": 377.92, "end": 384.56, "text": "Okay, but what if I open CMD again and if I check do we have Django available here."}, {"index": 118, "start": 384.56, "end": 387.0, "text": "And you can see it says Django is not available."}, {"index": 119, "start": 387.0, "end": 387.68, "text": "So that's the thing."}, {"index": 120, "start": 387.68, "end": 391.24, "text": "So Django is there only in our environment is not there for the system."}, {"index": 121, "start": 391.24, "end": 392.68, "text": "And that's what we want, right?"}, {"index": 122, "start": 392.68, "end": 395.72, "text": "We don't want to disturb the entire system just for our project."}, {"index": 123, "start": 395.72, "end": 398.48, "text": "So we have the environment where we have Django available."}, {"index": 124, "start": 398.48, "end": 403.04, "text": "So we got Python, we got Django and now let's create our first project."}, {"index": 125, "start": 403.04, "end": 405.72, "text": "Yes, that will be done using Kamana itself."}, {"index": 126, "start": 405.72, "end": 407.6, "text": "Okay, but then how will you do it?"}, {"index": 127, "start": 407.6, "end": 409.56, "text": "Now we can do that in a particular project."}, {"index": 128, "start": 409.56, "end": 413.64, "text": "So what normally I prefer is I keep all my projects in one particular folder."}, {"index": 129, "start": 413.64, "end": 414.16, "text": "So let's do that."}, {"index": 130, "start": 414.16, "end": 416.48, "text": "Let me create a folder here."}, {"index": 131, "start": 416.48, "end": 420.92, "text": "So we'll say MKMDR and we'll say projects."}, {"index": 132, "start": 420.92, "end": 423.52, "text": "This is where I will have all my projects."}, {"index": 133, "start": 423.52, "end": 427.56, "text": "So we got a folder which is projects and let's move to that folder."}, {"index": 134, "start": 427.56, "end": 432.64, "text": "So we'll say CD projects, oh sorry, projects."}, {"index": 135, "start": 432.64, "end": 435.2, "text": "And now you can see we are in that project."}, {"index": 136, "start": 435.2, "end": 435.76, "text": "So that's great."}, {"index": 137, "start": 435.76, "end": 440.68, "text": "We got a folder and we are into it and let's create our project here."}, {"index": 138, "start": 440.68, "end": 443.28, "text": "Then to do that, we have to use a command again."}, {"index": 139, "start": 443.28, "end": 445.92, "text": "But don't worry once you will get used to it."}, {"index": 140, "start": 445.92, "end": 450.4, "text": "So we'll say Django hyphen admin."}, {"index": 141, "start": 450.84, "end": 452.64, "text": "So whatever you'll do, you have to do with this thing."}, {"index": 142, "start": 452.64, "end": 459.76, "text": "You have to say Django hyphen admin and you have to create a project which is start project."}, {"index": 143, "start": 459.76, "end": 461.04, "text": "And I will give a project name."}, {"index": 144, "start": 461.04, "end": 461.68, "text": "So that's the command."}, {"index": 145, "start": 461.68, "end": 464.6, "text": "So Django admin and then you have to say start project."}, {"index": 146, "start": 464.6, "end": 466.6, "text": "And you can give any project name you want."}, {"index": 147, "start": 466.6, "end": 470.52, "text": "So let's since we are Telesco, let's give a project name as Telesco itself."}, {"index": 148, "start": 470.52, "end": 471.48, "text": "And we'll say enter."}, {"index": 149, "start": 471.48, "end": 476.0, "text": "But before doing enter, let me just go to this project folder just to see if it is empty or not."}, {"index": 150, "start": 476.0, "end": 479.76, "text": "So I'm in my C drive and so in user we have Telesco."}, {"index": 151, "start": 479.8, "end": 483.88, "text": "Let's go there and you can see here we have a project's folder which is empty."}, {"index": 152, "start": 483.88, "end": 489.52, "text": "And the moment I say enter here, it will create a project for you."}, {"index": 153, "start": 489.52, "end": 492.92, "text": "Let's go back to the folder and you can see we got a Telesco project."}, {"index": 154, "start": 492.92, "end": 493.68, "text": "Now what do you think?"}, {"index": 155, "start": 493.68, "end": 494.68, "text": "Will it be empty or not?"}, {"index": 156, "start": 494.68, "end": 497.96, "text": "Let's double click here and you can see we do it's not an empty folder."}, {"index": 157, "start": 497.96, "end": 500.12, "text": "We have a managed pilot file."}, {"index": 158, "start": 500.12, "end": 502.12, "text": "I don't know why we need this."}, {"index": 159, "start": 502.12, "end": 503.16, "text": "Let's see that later."}, {"index": 160, "start": 503.16, "end": 507.2, "text": "And then we got a Telesco folder in which you have four different files."}, {"index": 161, "start": 507.2, "end": 508.6, "text": "We'll talk about these things later."}, {"index": 162, "start": 508.6, "end": 510.72, "text": "You know what exactly these things are."}, {"index": 163, "start": 510.72, "end": 513.92, "text": "But as of now, the important file here is manage."}, {"index": 164, "start": 513.92, "end": 517.64, "text": "Okay, to access that manage, first of all, we'll navigate to the project which we have created."}, {"index": 165, "start": 517.64, "end": 519.08, "text": "So the project name is Telesco."}, {"index": 166, "start": 519.08, "end": 521.08, "text": "So we can see we are in Telesco now."}, {"index": 167, "start": 521.08, "end": 523.96, "text": "And if I say LS, that's Linux."}, {"index": 168, "start": 523.96, "end": 528.4, "text": "If I say DIR, you can see we have a folder which is managed.py."}, {"index": 169, "start": 528.4, "end": 529.48, "text": "So we have this file."}, {"index": 170, "start": 529.48, "end": 532.76, "text": "And then in Telesco as well, we have settings file which is important."}, {"index": 171, "start": 532.76, "end": 534.84, "text": "We have URL."}, {"index": 172, "start": 534.84, "end": 536.04, "text": "We are building a website, right?"}, {"index": 173, "start": 536.04, "end": 538.52, "text": "So of course in the website you'll be having a lot of URLs."}, {"index": 174, "start": 538.56, "end": 541.92, "text": "So this will be used to handle that."}, {"index": 175, "start": 541.92, "end": 547.04, "text": "This is something which will be used to deploy your project on the production server."}, {"index": 176, "start": 547.04, "end": 549.64, "text": "Because while you're working, while you're learning stuff,"}, {"index": 177, "start": 549.64, "end": 552.12, "text": "you will not be working on the production server."}, {"index": 178, "start": 552.12, "end": 555.96, "text": "You'll be working on a development server, the testing server basically."}, {"index": 179, "start": 555.96, "end": 557.24, "text": "So we'll be using this."}, {"index": 180, "start": 557.24, "end": 560.64, "text": "We don't actually use init, so we'll not talk about that."}, {"index": 181, "start": 560.64, "end": 562.36, "text": "Okay, so we got our project."}, {"index": 182, "start": 562.36, "end": 563.84, "text": "We are into that project now."}, {"index": 183, "start": 563.84, "end": 565.84, "text": "But what next?"}, {"index": 184, "start": 565.84, "end": 567.84, "text": "We have not done any coding as of now."}, {"index": 185, "start": 567.84, "end": 572.04, "text": "But still, you can run this particular project."}, {"index": 186, "start": 572.04, "end": 574.28, "text": "And you can run this on a particular server."}, {"index": 187, "start": 574.28, "end": 576.8, "text": "Of course, you need a server, right?"}, {"index": 188, "start": 576.8, "end": 578.36, "text": "Django says, hey, don't worry."}, {"index": 189, "start": 578.36, "end": 582.16, "text": "Since you are installing Django, we will also give you a lightweight server."}, {"index": 190, "start": 582.16, "end": 585.36, "text": "And to access that, we have to say Python."}, {"index": 191, "start": 585.36, "end": 589.4, "text": "And we have to use a file which is managed.py."}, {"index": 192, "start": 589.4, "end": 591.0, "text": "We have seen this file before."}, {"index": 193, "start": 591.0, "end": 593.48, "text": "And then the command we have to use is run server."}, {"index": 194, "start": 593.48, "end": 598.12, "text": "And the moment you say enter, you can see you got your server up"}, {"index": 195, "start": 598.12, "end": 600.72, "text": "and running without any errors."}, {"index": 196, "start": 600.72, "end": 602.28, "text": "It also says some different stuff."}, {"index": 197, "start": 602.28, "end": 603.76, "text": "We'll talk about that later."}, {"index": 198, "start": 603.76, "end": 606.44, "text": "In fact, in the theory video, we have talked about MVT, right?"}, {"index": 199, "start": 606.44, "end": 608.44, "text": "Which is model view template."}, {"index": 200, "start": 608.44, "end": 610.48, "text": "In model, it works for database, right?"}, {"index": 201, "start": 610.48, "end": 612.28, "text": "It's handle data."}, {"index": 202, "start": 612.28, "end": 613.72, "text": "That's why it is giving you those warnings."}, {"index": 203, "start": 613.72, "end": 615.72, "text": "But as of now, let's ignore them."}, {"index": 204, "start": 615.72, "end": 620.44, "text": "What is important is it says your server started at this IP address."}, {"index": 205, "start": 620.44, "end": 622.36, "text": "So this is your local host address, basically."}, {"index": 206, "start": 622.36, "end": 624.6, "text": "And the port number is 8000."}, {"index": 207, "start": 624.6, "end": 626.72, "text": "Of course, you can change this port number."}, {"index": 208, "start": 626.72, "end": 628.24, "text": "But I will just go here."}, {"index": 209, "start": 628.24, "end": 633.52, "text": "I will say 127.0.0.1.8000."}, {"index": 210, "start": 633.52, "end": 637.12, "text": "And you can see this is your Django home page."}, {"index": 211, "start": 637.12, "end": 638.36, "text": "OK, why we are getting this?"}, {"index": 212, "start": 638.36, "end": 639.88, "text": "Why not our own project data?"}, {"index": 213, "start": 639.88, "end": 642.16, "text": "Because we have not done any coding as of now."}, {"index": 214, "start": 642.16, "end": 644.0, "text": "And that's why you're saying this."}, {"index": 215, "start": 644.0, "end": 645.96, "text": "If you want to experiment, you can simply click on."}, {"index": 216, "start": 645.96, "end": 649.4, "text": "You can see below we have tutorials, a polling app."}, {"index": 217, "start": 649.4, "end": 650.52, "text": "You can just go there."}, {"index": 218, "start": 650.52, "end": 653.0, "text": "It will show you the steps how to get a project."}, {"index": 219, "start": 653.0, "end": 655.52, "text": "You know, I just love documentation part here."}, {"index": 220, "start": 655.52, "end": 658.48, "text": "So you can follow this documentation just to learn more."}, {"index": 221, "start": 658.48, "end": 661.0, "text": "So that's how you do a setup for Python, for Django."}, {"index": 222, "start": 661.0, "end": 663.28, "text": "And we have created our first project"}, {"index": 223, "start": 663.28, "end": 665.28, "text": "without any coding, of course."}, {"index": 224, "start": 665.28, "end": 666.84, "text": "So in the next video, we'll write some code"}, {"index": 225, "start": 666.84, "end": 668.48, "text": "and we'll do some experiment here."}, {"index": 226, "start": 668.48, "end": 669.88, "text": "So I hope you enjoyed this video."}, {"index": 227, "start": 669.88, "end": 671.4, "text": "Let me know in the comments section."}, {"index": 228, "start": 671.4, "end": 673.76, "text": "And do subscribe for other videos."}, {"index": 229, "start": 673.76, "end": 675.32, "text": "Bye-bye."}]}}, "summary": ["L\\u1ed7i t\\u00f3m t\\u1eaft: Connection error."], "timeline": [], "highlights": [], "questions": [], "briefing": {}, "visual_data": {}, "cover_image_url": null, "handsign_data": [], "flashcards": [], "quizzes": [], "artifact_status": {"transcript": {"status": "ready", "error": null}, "summary": {"status": "ready", "error": null}, "timeline": {"status": "failed", "error": "Connection error."}, "highlights": {"status": "failed", "error": "Connection error."}, "questions": {"status": "failed", "error": "Connection error."}, "briefing": {"status": "failed", "error": "Connection error."}, "visual_data": {"status": "failed", "error": "Connection error."}, "flashcards": {"status": "failed", "error": "Connection error."}, "handsign_data": {"status": "empty", "error": null}, "quizzes": {"status": "empty", "error": null}}}	2026-05-16 01:47:01.547002
d0a74efc-5a43-4af8-ab79-0ba8164f4e4a	5ed68363-0fe3-45eb-ba88-39552d6b5833	data\\uploads\\videos\\5ed68363-0fe3-45eb-ba88-39552d6b5833.mp4	\N	\N	\N	\N	{"transcript": {"video_id": "5ed68363-0fe3-45eb-ba88-39552d6b5833", "language": "vi", "source_language": "en", "target_language": "vi", "available_languages": ["vi", "en"], "translation_status": {"vi": {"status": "completed", "error": null}}, "segments": [{"index": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 5.0, "text": "Ch\\u00e0o m\\u1eebng tr\\u1edf l\\u1ea1i, c\\u00e1c b\\u1ea1n, t\\u00f4i t\\u00ean l\\u00e0 Dhavin Reddy v\\u00e0 h\\u00e3y ti\\u1ebfp t\\u1ee5c v\\u1edbi series n\\u00e0y v\\u1ec1 Django."}, {"index": 1, "start": 5.0, "end": 10.0, "text": "Trong video tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc, ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 th\\u1ea5y c\\u00e1ch thi\\u1ebft l\\u1eadp Django tr\\u00ean m\\u00e1y t\\u00ednh c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n, \\u00edt nh\\u1ea5t l\\u00e0 tr\\u00ean Windows."}, {"index": 2, "start": 10.0, "end": 15.0, "text": "V\\u00e0 b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd, h\\u00e3y c\\u00f9ng vi\\u1ebft m\\u00e3, v\\u00ec trong video tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc ch\\u00fang ta ch\\u1ec9 m\\u1edbi t\\u1ea1o d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n."}, {"index": 3, "start": 15.0, "end": 19.0, "text": "v\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 ch\\u1ea1y m\\u1ed9t m\\u00e1y ch\\u1ee7, m\\u1ed9t m\\u00e1y ch\\u1ee7 nh\\u1eb9 m\\u00e0 Django cung c\\u1ea5p."}, {"index": 4, "start": 19.0, "end": 22.0, "text": "N\\u00f3 \\u0111\\u00e3 ch\\u1ea1y, v\\u00ec v\\u1eady b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 th\\u1ea5y \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 m\\u00e3 m\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n."}, {"index": 5, "start": 22.0, "end": 26.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 nh\\u1eadp l\\u1ec7nh n\\u00e0y, \\u0111\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 python manage.py, \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 file qu\\u1ea3n l\\u00fd c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n."}, {"index": 6, "start": 26.0, "end": 29.0, "text": "v\\u00e0 ch\\u1ea1y m\\u00e1y ch\\u1ee7, \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y s\\u1ebd kh\\u1edfi \\u0111\\u1ed9ng m\\u00e1y ch\\u1ee7."}, {"index": 7, "start": 29.0, "end": 32.0, "text": "Sau \\u0111\\u00f3, b\\u1ea1n ch\\u1ec9 c\\u1ea7n s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng b\\u1ea5t k\\u1ef3 tr\\u00ecnh duy\\u1ec7t n\\u00e0o m\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n th\\u00edch."}, {"index": 8, "start": 32.0, "end": 35.0, "text": "T\\u00f4i \\u0111ang s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng Chrome \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y v\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n ch\\u1ec9 c\\u1ea7n nh\\u1eadp \\u0111\\u1ecba ch\\u1ec9 IP."}, {"index": 9, "start": 35.0, "end": 40.0, "text": "B\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u1ecba ch\\u1ec9 IP, m\\u00e0 c\\u01a1 b\\u1ea3n l\\u00e0 localhost v\\u00e0 s\\u1ed1 c\\u1ed5ng l\\u00e0 8000."}, {"index": 10, "start": 40.0, "end": 44.0, "text": "v\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 ch\\u1ea1y m\\u00e1y ch\\u1ee7 v\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 ch\\u00fang ta c\\u0169ng nh\\u1eadn \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c \\u0111\\u1ea7u ra."}, {"index": 11, "start": 44.0, "end": 47.0, "text": "Nh\\u01b0ng sau \\u0111\\u00f3 ch\\u00fang ta kh\\u00f4ng mu\\u1ed1n \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y, ch\\u00fang ta mu\\u1ed1n \\u0111i\\u1ec1u g\\u00ec \\u0111\\u00f3 b\\u1ed5 sung, \\u0111\\u00fang kh\\u00f4ng?"}, {"index": 12, "start": 47.0, "end": 49.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta mu\\u1ed1n x\\u00e2y d\\u1ef1ng m\\u1ed9t \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng web."}, {"index": 13, "start": 49.0, "end": 50.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 nh\\u1eefng g\\u00ec ch\\u00fang ta l\\u00e0m, \\u0111\\u00fang kh\\u00f4ng?"}, {"index": 14, "start": 50.0, "end": 55.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, khi b\\u1ea1n n\\u00f3i r\\u1eb1ng b\\u1ea1n \\u0111ang s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng Django, \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3 c\\u00f3 ngh\\u0129a l\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n x\\u00e2y d\\u1ef1ng m\\u1ed9t \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng web."}, {"index": 15, "start": 55.0, "end": 58.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u01b0\\u1ee3c r\\u1ed3i, b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd c\\u00f3 hai lo\\u1ea1i \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng m\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 n\\u00f3i \\u0111\\u1ebfn."}, {"index": 16, "start": 58.0, "end": 62.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 c\\u00e1c trang t\\u0129nh v\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 c\\u00e1c trang \\u0111\\u1ed9ng."}, {"index": 17, "start": 62.0, "end": 67.0, "text": "B\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd t\\u1ea5t c\\u1ea3 c\\u00e1c trang web m\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng ng\\u00e0y nay, m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 trang m\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n truy c\\u1eadp l\\u00e0 c\\u00e1c trang t\\u0129nh"}, {"index": 18, "start": 67.0, "end": 70.0, "text": "c\\u00f3 ngh\\u0129a l\\u00e0 m\\u1ecdi ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi s\\u1ebd th\\u1ea5y c\\u00f9ng m\\u1ed9t trang."}, {"index": 19, "start": 70.0, "end": 73.0, "text": "C\\u00e1c trang \\u0111\\u1ed9ng th\\u00ec kh\\u00e1c nhau \\u0111\\u1ed1i v\\u1edbi t\\u1eebng ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi."}, {"index": 20, "start": 73.0, "end": 76.0, "text": "N\\u1ebfu t\\u00f4i v\\u00e0o Facebook, th\\u1ef1c ra, ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 n\\u00f3i v\\u1ec1 v\\u00ed d\\u1ee5 n\\u00e0y."}, {"index": 21, "start": 76.0, "end": 79.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, n\\u1ebfu t\\u00f4i v\\u00e0o Facebook, t\\u00f4i s\\u1ebd th\\u1ea5y nh\\u1eefng th\\u00f4ng tin c\\u1ee7a ri\\u00eang m\\u00ecnh."}, {"index": 22, "start": 79.0, "end": 80.0, "text": "T\\u00f4i s\\u1ebd th\\u1ea5y th\\u00f4ng tin c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n t\\u00f4i."}, {"index": 23, "start": 80.0, "end": 82.0, "text": "B\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd kh\\u00f4ng th\\u1ea5y th\\u00f4ng tin c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n t\\u00f4i, \\u0111\\u00fang kh\\u00f4ng?"}, {"index": 24, "start": 82.0, "end": 84.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd nh\\u1eadn \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c nh\\u1eefng th\\u00f4ng tin c\\u1ee7a ri\\u00eang b\\u1ea1n \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00f3."}, {"index": 25, "start": 84.0, "end": 89.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, n\\u1ebfu t\\u00f4i v\\u00e0o t\\u00e0i kho\\u1ea3n ng\\u00e2n h\\u00e0ng c\\u1ee7a m\\u00ecnh, t\\u00f4i s\\u1ebd th\\u1ea5y s\\u1ed1 d\\u01b0 ng\\u00e2n h\\u00e0ng c\\u1ee7a m\\u00ecnh, ch\\u1ee9 kh\\u00f4ng ph\\u1ea3i s\\u1ed1 d\\u01b0 c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n."}, {"index": 26, "start": 89.0, "end": 92.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, c\\u01a1 b\\u1ea3n l\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t n\\u1ed9i dung \\u0111\\u1ed9ng \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00f3."}, {"index": 27, "start": 92.0, "end": 96.0, "text": "B\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd, khi b\\u1ea1n n\\u00f3i b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n x\\u00e2y d\\u1ef1ng n\\u1ed9i dung t\\u0129nh, ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng HTML, CSS, JavaScript, xong."}, {"index": 28, "start": 96.0, "end": 100.0, "text": "Nh\\u01b0ng ngay khi b\\u1ea1n n\\u00f3i b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n l\\u00e0m cho n\\u00f3 \\u0111\\u1ed9ng, b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 x\\u1eed l\\u00fd,"}, {"index": 29, "start": 100.0, "end": 102.0, "text": "\\u0111\\u00f3 ch\\u00ednh l\\u00e0 nh\\u1eefng g\\u00ec ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111ang l\\u00e0m \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y."}, {"index": 30, "start": 102.0, "end": 105.0, "text": "V\\u1eady h\\u00e3y t\\u1ea1o m\\u1ed9t \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng web \\u0111\\u01a1n gi\\u1ea3n."}, {"index": 31, "start": 105.0, "end": 108.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u01b0\\u1ee3c r\\u1ed3i, khi t\\u00f4i n\\u00f3i \\u0111\\u01a1n gi\\u1ea3n, ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd \\u0111i theo \\u0111i\\u1ec1u c\\u01a1 b\\u1ea3n."}, {"index": 32, "start": 108.0, "end": 112.0, "text": "B\\u1ea1n bi\\u1ebft ch\\u00fang ta l\\u00e0m g\\u00ec khi b\\u1ea1n h\\u1ecdc c\\u00e1ch l\\u1ea5y m\\u1ed9t trang web, b\\u1ea1n vi\\u1ebft 'hello world', \\u0111\\u00fang kh\\u00f4ng?"}, {"index": 33, "start": 112.0, "end": 113.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 nh\\u1eefng g\\u00ec ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd l\\u00e0m ngay b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd."}, {"index": 34, "start": 113.0, "end": 118.0, "text": "T\\u00f4i bi\\u1ebft b\\u1ea1n \\u0111ang mong \\u0111\\u1ee3i \\u0111i\\u1ec1u g\\u00ec \\u0111\\u00f3, nh\\u01b0ng v\\u1ea5n \\u0111\\u1ec1 \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang ta mu\\u1ed1n h\\u1ecdc Django."}, {"index": 35, "start": 118.0, "end": 121.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta kh\\u00f4ng mu\\u1ed1n h\\u1ecdc l\\u1eadp tr\\u00ecnh ph\\u1ee9c t\\u1ea1p \\u1edf th\\u1eddi \\u0111i\\u1ec3m n\\u00e0y."}, {"index": 36, "start": 121.0, "end": 125.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta bi\\u1ebft Python, v\\u00ec v\\u1eady ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 vi\\u1ebft c\\u00e1c \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng, nh\\u01b0ng b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd ch\\u00fang ta c\\u1ea7n hi\\u1ec3u v\\u1ec1 framework."}, {"index": 37, "start": 125.0, "end": 129.0, "text": "V\\u1eady h\\u00e3y x\\u00e2y d\\u1ef1ng m\\u1ed9t c\\u00e1i g\\u00ec \\u0111\\u00f3 m\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 in hello world tr\\u00ean trang."}, {"index": 38, "start": 129.0, "end": 133.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u00fang v\\u1eady, b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 l\\u00e0m \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3 b\\u1eb1ng HTML, nh\\u01b0ng h\\u00e3y l\\u00e0m cho n\\u00f3 tr\\u1edf n\\u00ean \\u0111\\u1ed9ng \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y."}, {"index": 39, "start": 133.0, "end": 137.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u01b0\\u1ee3c r\\u1ed3i, \\u0111\\u1ec3 l\\u00e0m \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3, b\\u1ea1n c\\u1ea7n s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng m\\u1ed9t lo\\u1ea1i IDE n\\u00e0o \\u0111\\u00f3."}, {"index": 40, "start": 137.0, "end": 141.0, "text": "Th\\u1ef1c ra, khi b\\u1ea1n n\\u00f3i v\\u1ec1 IDE, ch\\u00fang ta c\\u0169ng c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng m\\u1ed9t notepad \\u0111\\u1ec3 g\\u00f5 m\\u00e3."}, {"index": 41, "start": 141.0, "end": 142.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u01b0\\u1ee3c r\\u1ed3i, \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3 ho\\u00e0n to\\u00e0n \\u1ed5n."}, {"index": 42, "start": 142.0, "end": 145.0, "text": "B\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng Sublime v\\u00ec r\\u1ea5t nhi\\u1ec1u ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi \\u0111ang d\\u00f9ng."}, {"index": 43, "start": 145.0, "end": 147.0, "text": "\\u1ede \\u0111\\u00e2y ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng Visual Studio."}, {"index": 44, "start": 147.0, "end": 150.0, "text": "B\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 t\\u1ea3i Visual Studio b\\u1eb1ng c\\u00e1ch t\\u00ecm tr\\u00ean Google."}, {"index": 45, "start": 150.0, "end": 153.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, khi b\\u1ea1n t\\u00ecm ki\\u1ebfm t\\u1ea3i Visual Studio, \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 nh\\u1eefng g\\u00ec b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd nh\\u1eadn \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c."}, {"index": 46, "start": 153.0, "end": 155.0, "text": "Ch\\u1ec9 c\\u1ea7n v\\u00e0o trang web v\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 t\\u1ea3i v\\u1ec1."}, {"index": 47, "start": 155.0, "end": 159.0, "text": "Tr\\u00ean th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf, m\\u1ed7i phi\\u00ean b\\u1ea3n m\\u1edbi \\u0111\\u1ec1u cung c\\u1ea5p nh\\u1eefng t\\u00ednh n\\u0103ng tuy\\u1ec7t v\\u1eddi."}, {"index": 48, "start": 159.0, "end": 160.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, h\\u00e3y th\\u1eed s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng nh\\u00e9."}, {"index": 49, "start": 160.0, "end": 163.0, "text": "M\\u1ed9t trong nh\\u1eefng IDE t\\u1ed1t nh\\u1ea5t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u00f3 cho l\\u1eadp tr\\u00ecnh vi\\u00ean."}, {"index": 50, "start": 163.0, "end": 165.0, "text": "Nh\\u01b0ng m\\u1ed9t l\\u1ea7n n\\u1eefa, phi\\u00ean b\\u1ea3n c\\u1ed9ng \\u0111\\u1ed3ng l\\u00e0 mi\\u1ec5n ph\\u00ed."}, {"index": 51, "start": 165.0, "end": 168.0, "text": "N\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n d\\u00f9ng phi\\u00ean b\\u1ea3n chuy\\u00ean nghi\\u1ec7p, b\\u1ea1n ph\\u1ea3i tr\\u1ea3 ti\\u1ec1n cho n\\u00f3."}, {"index": 52, "start": 168.0, "end": 172.0, "text": "Nh\\u01b0ng \\u00edt nh\\u1ea5t \\u1edf th\\u1eddi \\u0111i\\u1ec3m n\\u00e0y, ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i r\\u1ea5t vui khi l\\u00e0m vi\\u1ec7c v\\u1edbi phi\\u00ean b\\u1ea3n mi\\u1ec5n ph\\u00ed."}, {"index": 53, "start": 172.0, "end": 174.0, "text": "N\\u00f3 ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng r\\u1ea5t t\\u1ed1t."}, {"index": 54, "start": 174.0, "end": 177.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, h\\u00e3y t\\u1ea3i n\\u00f3 v\\u1ec1 v\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n ch\\u1ec9 c\\u1ea7n th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n nh\\u1eefng b\\u01b0\\u1edbc c\\u00e0i \\u0111\\u1eb7t \\u0111\\u01a1n gi\\u1ea3n."}, {"index": 55, "start": 177.0, "end": 179.0, "text": "B\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd tr\\u00ean m\\u00e1y n\\u00e0y, t\\u00f4i \\u0111\\u00e3 c\\u00f3 Visual Studio."}, {"index": 56, "start": 179.0, "end": 180.0, "text": "V\\u1eady \\u0111\\u1ec3 t\\u00f4i m\\u1edf n\\u00f3 l\\u00ean."}, {"index": 57, "start": 180.0, "end": 182.0, "text": "Nh\\u01b0 b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 th\\u1ea5y, ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 Visual Studio \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y."}, {"index": 58, "start": 182.0, "end": 184.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 giao di\\u1ec7n n\\u1ebfu ch\\u1ecdn ch\\u1ebf \\u0111\\u1ed9 t\\u1ed1i."}, {"index": 59, "start": 184.0, "end": 185.0, "text": "B\\u1ea1n c\\u0169ng c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 ch\\u1ecdn ch\\u1ebf \\u0111\\u1ed9 s\\u00e1ng."}, {"index": 60, "start": 185.0, "end": 186.0, "text": "N\\u00f3 c\\u0169ng c\\u00f3 s\\u1eb5n \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y."}, {"index": 61, "start": 186.0, "end": 190.0, "text": "T\\u00f9y thu\\u1ed9c v\\u00e0o m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 l\\u1eadp tr\\u00ecnh vi\\u00ean th\\u01b0\\u1eddng th\\u00edch giao di\\u1ec7n m\\u00e0u \\u0111en ho\\u1eb7c t\\u1ed1i,"}, {"index": 62, "start": 190.0, "end": 192.0, "text": "nh\\u1eefng ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi l\\u00e0m YouTube ho\\u1eb7c c\\u00e1c nh\\u00e0 s\\u00e1ng t\\u1ea1o n\\u1ed9i dung, h\\u1ecd th\\u00edch giao di\\u1ec7n m\\u00e0u tr\\u1eafng"}, {"index": 63, "start": 192.0, "end": 194.0, "text": "b\\u1edfi v\\u00ec vi\\u1ec7c ghi h\\u00ecnh ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng t\\u1ed1t."}, {"index": 64, "start": 194.0, "end": 199.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u01b0\\u1ee3c r\\u1ed3i, b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd khi b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 Visual Studio, ch\\u00fang ta ph\\u1ea3i m\\u1edf d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n."}, {"index": 65, "start": 199.0, "end": 201.0, "text": "B\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n nh\\u1edb trong video tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc, ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 l\\u00e0m \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3."}, {"index": 66, "start": 201.0, "end": 203.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 t\\u1ea1o d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n thi\\u00ean v\\u0103n."}, {"index": 67, "start": 203.0, "end": 204.0, "text": "V\\u1eady h\\u00e3y m\\u1edf th\\u01b0 m\\u1ee5c \\u0111\\u00f3."}, {"index": 68, "start": 204.0, "end": 206.0, "text": "Ch\\u1ec9 c\\u1ea7n \\u0111i \\u0111\\u1ebfn th\\u01b0 m\\u1ee5c d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n."}, {"index": 69, "start": 206.0, "end": 209.0, "text": "H\\u00e3y nh\\u1edb r\\u1eb1ng ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 t\\u1ea1o th\\u01b0 m\\u1ee5c d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n n\\u00e0y."}, {"index": 70, "start": 209.0, "end": 211.0, "text": "V\\u00e0 b\\u00ean trong th\\u01b0 m\\u1ee5c n\\u00e0y, ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n thi\\u00ean v\\u0103n,"}, {"index": 71, "start": 211.0, "end": 213.0, "text": "m\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 t\\u1ea1o ra b\\u1eb1ng l\\u1ec7nh."}, {"index": 72, "start": 213.0, "end": 215.0, "text": "V\\u00e0 t\\u1ea5t nhi\\u00ean, h\\u00e3y ch\\u1ecdn d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n thi\\u00ean v\\u0103n \\u0111\\u00f3 v\\u00e0 nh\\u1ea5p v\\u00e0o m\\u1edf."}, {"index": 73, "start": 215.0, "end": 216.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 nh\\u1eefng g\\u00ec b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd nh\\u1eadn \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c."}, {"index": 74, "start": 216.0, "end": 218.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd th\\u1ea5y d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n c\\u1ee7a m\\u00ecnh \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y, \\u0111\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 thi\\u00ean v\\u0103n."}, {"index": 75, "start": 218.0, "end": 220.0, "text": "V\\u00e0 b\\u00ean trong, b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 th\\u1ea5y c\\u00f3 nhi\\u1ec1u t\\u1ec7p."}, {"index": 76, "start": 220.0, "end": 222.0, "text": "Th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf, ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 n\\u00f3i v\\u1ec1 ch\\u00fang tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc \\u0111\\u00e2y."}, {"index": 77, "start": 222.0, "end": 225.0, "text": "Nh\\u01b0ng ch\\u1ec9 \\u0111\\u1ec3 t\\u00f3m t\\u1eaft nhanh, ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 file manage.py,"}, {"index": 78, "start": 225.0, "end": 227.0, "text": "c\\u00e1i n\\u00e0y r\\u1ea5t h\\u1eefu \\u00edch \\u0111\\u1ec3 qu\\u1ea3n l\\u00fd d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n."}, {"index": 79, "start": 227.0, "end": 230.0, "text": "V\\u00e0 n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 c\\u00e0i \\u0111\\u1eb7t trong d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n c\\u1ee7a m\\u00ecnh,"}, {"index": 80, "start": 230.0, "end": 232.0, "text": "\\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y r\\u1ea5t quan tr\\u1ecdng, t\\u1ec7p settings.py."}, {"index": 81, "start": 232.0, "end": 235.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n ki\\u1ec3m tra t\\u1ec7p n\\u00e0y, b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd th\\u1ea5y ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t kh\\u00f3a b\\u00ed m\\u1eadt,"}, {"index": 82, "start": 235.0, "end": 238.0, "text": "\\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng ch\\u1ee7 y\\u1ebfu cho vi\\u1ec7c tri\\u1ec3n khai tr\\u00ean m\\u00e1y ch\\u1ee7."}, {"index": 83, "start": 238.0, "end": 240.0, "text": "V\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 ch\\u1ebf \\u0111\\u1ed9 g\\u1ee1 l\\u1ed7i."}, {"index": 84, "start": 240.0, "end": 243.0, "text": "Ch\\u1ebf \\u0111\\u1ed9 g\\u1ee1 l\\u1ed7i s\\u1ebd cung c\\u1ea5p cho b\\u1ea1n r\\u1ea5t nhi\\u1ec1u th\\u00f4ng tin khi b\\u1ea1n g\\u1eb7p kh\\u00f3 kh\\u0103n."}, {"index": 85, "start": 243.0, "end": 245.0, "text": "\\u0110i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y th\\u1ef1c s\\u1ef1 r\\u1ea5t quan tr\\u1ecdng."}, {"index": 86, "start": 245.0, "end": 247.0, "text": "Gi\\u1ea3 s\\u1eed b\\u1ea1n \\u0111ang x\\u00e2y d\\u1ef1ng m\\u1ed9t d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n"}, {"index": 87, "start": 247.0, "end": 249.0, "text": "v\\u00e0 n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n bi\\u1ebft \\u0111i\\u1ec1u g\\u00ec \\u0111ang x\\u1ea3y ra \\u0111\\u1eb1ng sau,"}, {"index": 88, "start": 249.0, "end": 252.0, "text": "ch\\u1ec9 c\\u1ea7n \\u0111\\u1eb7t g\\u1ee1 l\\u1ed7i b\\u1eb1ng 2 v\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd nh\\u1eadn \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c t\\u1ea5t c\\u1ea3 th\\u00f4ng tin."}, {"index": 89, "start": 252.0, "end": 255.0, "text": "Nh\\u01b0ng h\\u00e3y ch\\u1eafc ch\\u1eafn r\\u1eb1ng tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc khi tri\\u1ec3n khai l\\u00ean m\\u00e1y ch\\u1ee7,"}, {"index": 90, "start": 255.0, "end": 258.0, "text": "h\\u00e3y \\u0111\\u1eb7t n\\u00f3 th\\u00e0nh false v\\u00ec ai \\u0111\\u00f3 c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 hack m\\u00e1y c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n"}, {"index": 91, "start": 258.0, "end": 260.0, "text": "v\\u00e0 h\\u1ecd c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 th\\u1ea5y t\\u1ea5t c\\u1ea3 c\\u00e1c nh\\u1eadt k\\u00fd."}, {"index": 92, "start": 260.0, "end": 262.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u01b0\\u1ee3c r\\u1ed3i, v\\u00e0 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y r\\u1ea5t quan tr\\u1ecdng."}, {"index": 93, "start": 262.0, "end": 263.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 c\\u00e1c \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng \\u0111\\u00e3 \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c c\\u00e0i \\u0111\\u1eb7t."}, {"index": 94, "start": 263.0, "end": 265.0, "text": "Trong d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n, \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 c\\u00e1c \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng \\u0111\\u00e3 \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c c\\u00e0i \\u0111\\u1eb7t s\\u1eb5n."}, {"index": 95, "start": 265.0, "end": 267.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd n\\u00f3i v\\u1ec1 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y sau."}, {"index": 96, "start": 267.0, "end": 269.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 c\\u00f3 c\\u00e1c \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng c\\u1ee7a ri\\u00eang m\\u00ecnh."}, {"index": 97, "start": 269.0, "end": 272.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 nh\\u1eefng c\\u00e1ch trung gian, s\\u1ebd gi\\u00fap b\\u1ea1n v\\u1ec1 v\\u1ea5n \\u0111\\u1ec1 b\\u1ea3o m\\u1eadt."}, {"index": 98, "start": 272.0, "end": 274.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t m\\u1eabu."}, {"index": 99, "start": 274.0, "end": 277.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 th\\u1ea5y m\\u1eabu Django n\\u00e0y s\\u1ebd gi\\u00fap b\\u1ea1n cung c\\u1ea5p n\\u1ed9i dung m\\u1eabu."}, {"index": 100, "start": 277.0, "end": 279.0, "text": "C\\u00f2n v\\u1ec1 c\\u01a1 s\\u1edf d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u th\\u00ec sao?"}, {"index": 101, "start": 279.0, "end": 281.0, "text": "T\\u1ea5t nhi\\u00ean, n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n \\u0111ang t\\u1ea1o m\\u1ed9t \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng web,"}, {"index": 102, "start": 281.0, "end": 283.0, "text": "b\\u1ea1n c\\u0169ng c\\u1ea7n c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t c\\u01a1 s\\u1edf d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u \\u0111\\u1ec3 h\\u1ed7 tr\\u1ee3 ph\\u00eda sau,"}, {"index": 103, "start": 283.0, "end": 286.0, "text": "c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 l\\u00e0 MySQL, Postgres ho\\u1eb7c SQLite."}, {"index": 104, "start": 286.0, "end": 288.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, theo m\\u1eb7c \\u0111\\u1ecbnh, n\\u00f3 cung c\\u1ea5p cho b\\u1ea1n SQLite,"}, {"index": 105, "start": 288.0, "end": 290.0, "text": "nh\\u01b0ng b\\u1ea1n c\\u0169ng c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng Postgres \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00f3."}, {"index": 106, "start": 290.0, "end": 293.0, "text": "V\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3, ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 th\\u00f4ng tin v\\u1ec1 m\\u1eadt kh\\u1ea9u \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y \\u0111\\u1ec3 x\\u00e1c th\\u1ef1c."}, {"index": 107, "start": 293.0, "end": 295.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd h\\u00e3y kh\\u00f4ng t\\u1eadp trung v\\u00e0o t\\u1ec7p n\\u00e0y"}, {"index": 108, "start": 295.0, "end": 298.0, "text": "b\\u1edfi v\\u00ec ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i kh\\u00f4ng th\\u1ef1c s\\u1ef1 ch\\u1ec9nh s\\u1eeda t\\u1ec7p n\\u00e0y th\\u01b0\\u1eddng xuy\\u00ean."}, {"index": 109, "start": 298.0, "end": 299.0, "text": "H\\u00e3y gi\\u1eef n\\u00f3 \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00f3."}, {"index": 110, "start": 299.0, "end": 301.0, "text": "Nh\\u01b0ng \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t t\\u1ec7p r\\u1ea5t quan tr\\u1ecdng."}, {"index": 111, "start": 301.0, "end": 303.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u01b0\\u1ee3c r\\u1ed3i, v\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 c\\u00e1c URL."}, {"index": 112, "start": 303.0, "end": 306.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 th\\u1ea5y ch\\u00fang ta ch\\u1ec9 c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t URL \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y,"}, {"index": 113, "start": 306.0, "end": 308.0, "text": "\\u0111\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 cho c\\u00e1c t\\u00e1c v\\u1ee5 qu\\u1ea3n tr\\u1ecb."}, {"index": 114, "start": 308.0, "end": 310.0, "text": "V\\u1eady l\\u00e0 t\\u1ea1m th\\u1eddi nh\\u01b0 v\\u1eady."}, {"index": 115, "start": 310.0, "end": 312.0, "text": "H\\u00e3y t\\u1ea1o \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng \\u0111\\u1ea7u ti\\u00ean c\\u1ee7a ch\\u00fang ta, nh\\u01b0ng khoan \\u0111\\u00e3."}, {"index": 116, "start": 312.0, "end": 314.0, "text": "C\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 b\\u1ea1n \\u0111ang ngh\\u0129 ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n, \\u0111\\u00fang kh\\u00f4ng?"}, {"index": 117, "start": 314.0, "end": 316.0, "text": "T\\u1ea1i sao ch\\u00fang ta ph\\u1ea3i t\\u1ea1o m\\u1ed9t \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng ri\\u00eang?"}, {"index": 118, "start": 316.0, "end": 319.0, "text": "\\u0110i\\u1ec1u quan tr\\u1ecdng l\\u00e0, trong Django, nh\\u1eefng g\\u00ec ch\\u00fang ta l\\u00e0m l\\u00e0 c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n."}, {"index": 119, "start": 319.0, "end": 322.0, "text": "Gi\\u1ea3 s\\u1eed n\\u1ebfu t\\u00f4i mu\\u1ed1n t\\u1ea1o m\\u1ed9t \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng web l\\u1edbn,"}, {"index": 120, "start": 322.0, "end": 324.0, "text": "s\\u1ebd c\\u00f3 r\\u1ea5t nhi\\u1ec1u t\\u00ednh n\\u0103ng, b\\u1ea1n bi\\u1ebft \\u0111\\u1ea5y,"}, {"index": 121, "start": 324.0, "end": 326.0, "text": "c\\u00e1c c\\u00f4ng vi\\u1ec7c qu\\u1ea3n tr\\u1ecb, ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1,"}, {"index": 122, "start": 326.0, "end": 327.0, "text": "gi\\u1ea3 s\\u1eed l\\u00e0 trang web th\\u01b0\\u01a1ng m\\u1ea1i \\u0111i\\u1ec7n t\\u1eed."}, {"index": 123, "start": 327.0, "end": 329.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 c\\u00f3 s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m nh\\u01b0 m\\u1ed9t m\\u00f4-\\u0111un."}, {"index": 124, "start": 329.0, "end": 331.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 c\\u00f3 v\\u1eadn chuy\\u1ec3n nh\\u01b0 m\\u1ed9t m\\u00f4-\\u0111un."}, {"index": 125, "start": 331.0, "end": 332.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t t\\u1eadp h\\u1ee3p kh\\u00e1c."}, {"index": 126, "start": 332.0, "end": 333.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 nh\\u1eefng \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng kh\\u00e1c nhau."}, {"index": 127, "start": 333.0, "end": 336.0, "text": "V\\u00e0 t\\u1ea5t c\\u1ea3 c\\u00e1c \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng n\\u00e0y tr\\u00ean trang web s\\u1ebd \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c cung c\\u1ea5p"}, {"index": 128, "start": 336.0, "end": 338.0, "text": "trong m\\u1ed9t d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n c\\u1ee5 th\\u1ec3, \\u0111\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 trang web c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n n\\u00f3i chung."}, {"index": 129, "start": 338.0, "end": 340.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, vi\\u1ec7c \\u0111\\u0103ng nh\\u1eadp s\\u1ebd l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng."}, {"index": 130, "start": 340.0, "end": 342.0, "text": "Sau \\u0111\\u00f3, hi\\u1ec3n th\\u1ecb c\\u00e1c s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m s\\u1ebd l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng."}, {"index": 131, "start": 342.0, "end": 343.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 c\\u00e1ch m\\u00e0."}, {"index": 132, "start": 343.0, "end": 345.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, h\\u00e3y t\\u1ea1o m\\u1ed9t d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n \\u0111\\u01a1n gi\\u1ea3n \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y."}, {"index": 133, "start": 345.0, "end": 348.0, "text": "C\\u00e1ch \\u0111\\u1ec3 l\\u00e0m \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 b\\u1eb1ng c\\u00e1ch truy c\\u1eadp v\\u00e0o m\\u1ed9t terminal."}, {"index": 134, "start": 348.0, "end": 349.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 th\\u1ea5y \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 terminal."}, {"index": 135, "start": 349.0, "end": 351.0, "text": "V\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 n\\u01a1i b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 nh\\u1eadp."}, {"index": 136, "start": 351.0, "end": 354.0, "text": "V\\u1eady l\\u00e0m th\\u1ebf n\\u00e0o ch\\u00fang ta t\\u1ea1o ra m\\u1ed9t \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng v\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd \\u0111\\u1eb7t t\\u00ean n\\u00f3 nh\\u01b0 th\\u1ebf n\\u00e0o?"}, {"index": 137, "start": 354.0, "end": 357.0, "text": "Hi\\u1ec7n t\\u1ea1i, t\\u00f4i ch\\u1ec9 mu\\u1ed1n \\u0111\\u1eb7t t\\u00ean n\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 Calc"}, {"index": 138, "start": 357.0, "end": 360.0, "text": "b\\u1edfi v\\u00ec t\\u00f4i y\\u00eau Hello World v\\u00e0 v\\u00ed d\\u1ee5 ti\\u1ebfp theo s\\u1ebd l\\u00e0 Calc."}, {"index": 139, "start": 360.0, "end": 362.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, h\\u00e3y t\\u1ea1o m\\u1ed9t \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng Calc."}, {"index": 140, "start": 362.0, "end": 364.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u1ec3 l\\u00e0m \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3, ch\\u00fang ta ph\\u1ea3i g\\u00f5 m\\u1ed9t l\\u1ec7nh."}, {"index": 141, "start": 364.0, "end": 366.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, b\\u1ea1n ph\\u1ea3i n\\u00f3i python manage.py."}, {"index": 142, "start": 366.0, "end": 367.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 file m\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111ang s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng."}, {"index": 143, "start": 367.0, "end": 369.0, "text": "V\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3, b\\u1ea1n ph\\u1ea3i \\u0111\\u1ec1 c\\u1eadp \\u0111\\u1ebfn t\\u00ean c\\u1ee7a \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n."}, {"index": 144, "start": 369.0, "end": 371.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, cho \\u0111\\u1ebfn gi\\u1edd, ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng Calc."}, {"index": 145, "start": 371.0, "end": 374.0, "text": "Ngay khi b\\u1ea1n nh\\u1ea5n enter, ch\\u00fang ta g\\u1eb7p ph\\u1ea3i m\\u1ed9t l\\u1ed7i."}, {"index": 146, "start": 374.0, "end": 377.0, "text": "V\\u1ea5n \\u0111\\u1ec1 l\\u00e0 b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111ang s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng m\\u1ed9t command prompt kh\\u00e1c."}, {"index": 147, "start": 377.0, "end": 380.0, "text": "T\\u00f4i kh\\u00f4ng mong \\u0111\\u1ee3i \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y, nh\\u01b0ng sau \\u0111\\u00f3 ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111ang s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng m\\u1ed9t command prompt kh\\u00e1c."}, {"index": 148, "start": 380.0, "end": 382.0, "text": "Ban \\u0111\\u1ea7u, ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng command prompt c\\u1ee7a Windows."}, {"index": 149, "start": 382.0, "end": 384.0, "text": "B\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111ang s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng n\\u00f3 th\\u00f4ng qua Visual Studio."}, {"index": 150, "start": 384.0, "end": 388.0, "text": "V\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3, n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f2n nh\\u1edb, ch\\u00fang ta c\\u0169ng ph\\u1ea3i thi\\u1ebft l\\u1eadp m\\u00f4i tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng \\u1ea3o."}, {"index": 151, "start": 388.0, "end": 391.0, "text": "V\\u1eady m\\u00f4i tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng \\u1ea3o m\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111ang s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 test."}, {"index": 152, "start": 391.0, "end": 392.0, "text": "V\\u1eady ch\\u00fang ta ph\\u1ea3i s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng c\\u00e1i \\u0111\\u00f3."}, {"index": 153, "start": 392.0, "end": 394.0, "text": "V\\u1eady ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd \\u0111\\u00f3ng c\\u00e1i n\\u00e0y l\\u1ea1i v\\u00e0 s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng test."}, {"index": 154, "start": 394.0, "end": 396.0, "text": "V\\u1eady, l\\u00e0m th\\u1ebf n\\u00e0o \\u0111\\u1ec3 b\\u1ea1n s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng c\\u00e1c m\\u00f4i tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng c\\u1ee7a ch\\u00fang ta?"}, {"index": 155, "start": 396.0, "end": 398.0, "text": "B\\u1ea1n ph\\u1ea3i n\\u00f3i work on test."}, {"index": 156, "start": 398.0, "end": 399.0, "text": "V\\u1eady b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111ang \\u1edf trong test."}, {"index": 157, "start": 399.0, "end": 401.0, "text": "B\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd ch\\u00fang ta ph\\u1ea3i g\\u00f5 m\\u1ed9t l\\u1ec7nh."}, {"index": 158, "start": 401.0, "end": 404.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, ch\\u00fang ta ph\\u1ea3i n\\u00f3i python manage.py."}, {"index": 159, "start": 404.0, "end": 406.0, "text": "\\u00d4i, \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 qu\\u00ean m\\u1ed9t \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u1eefa."}, {"index": 160, "start": 406.0, "end": 407.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, b\\u1ea1n ph\\u1ea3i n\\u00f3i b\\u1eaft \\u0111\\u1ea7u \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng."}, {"index": 161, "start": 407.0, "end": 408.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 nh\\u1eefng g\\u00ec t\\u00f4i l\\u00e0m."}, {"index": 162, "start": 408.0, "end": 410.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, b\\u1ea1n ph\\u1ea3i n\\u00f3i b\\u1eaft \\u0111\\u1ea7u \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng v\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n ph\\u1ea3i \\u0111\\u1ec1 c\\u1eadp \\u0111\\u1ebfn Calc."}, {"index": 163, "start": 410.0, "end": 412.0, "text": "Ngay khi b\\u1ea1n n\\u00f3i nh\\u1eadp ngay, b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 th\\u1ea5y \\u1edf b\\u00ean tr\\u00e1i,"}, {"index": 164, "start": 412.0, "end": 414.0, "text": "ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t Calc."}, {"index": 165, "start": 414.0, "end": 415.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u00e2y c\\u01a1 b\\u1ea3n l\\u00e0 \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n."}, {"index": 166, "start": 415.0, "end": 417.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n \\u0111ang di\\u1ec5n ra."}, {"index": 167, "start": 417.0, "end": 418.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n."}, {"index": 168, "start": 418.0, "end": 420.0, "text": "B\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd, n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 th\\u1ea5y, ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 t\\u1ec7p kh\\u00e1c nhau \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00f3."}, {"index": 169, "start": 420.0, "end": 422.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta kh\\u00f4ng c\\u00f3 c\\u00e0i \\u0111\\u1eb7t \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y, nh\\u01b0ng ch\\u00fang ta kh\\u00f4ng c\\u00f3 c\\u00e0i \\u0111\\u1eb7t \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y."}, {"index": 170, "start": 422.0, "end": 426.0, "text": "B\\u1edfi v\\u00ec c\\u00e0i \\u0111\\u1eb7t n\\u00e0y l\\u00e0 cho d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n v\\u00e0 m\\u1ed7i \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng s\\u1ebd c\\u00f3 c\\u00e1c th\\u1ee9 ri\\u00eang."}, {"index": 171, "start": 426.0, "end": 430.0, "text": "V\\u00ed d\\u1ee5, gi\\u1ea3 s\\u1eed n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n n\\u00f3i v\\u1ec1 \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng, ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 th\\u1ee9 qu\\u1ea3n tr\\u1ecb \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y."}, {"index": 172, "start": 430.0, "end": 432.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd kh\\u00f4ng l\\u00e0m \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3 ngay b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd, nh\\u01b0ng ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 c\\u00e1c th\\u1ee9 qu\\u1ea3n tr\\u1ecb."}, {"index": 173, "start": 432.0, "end": 434.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 c\\u00e1c \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng."}, {"index": 174, "start": 434.0, "end": 435.0, "text": "T\\u00ean n\\u00e0y l\\u00e0 quan tr\\u1ecdng."}, {"index": 175, "start": 435.0, "end": 436.0, "text": "Ch\\u1ec9 c\\u1ea7n nh\\u00ecn v\\u00e0o t\\u00ean n\\u00e0y."}, {"index": 176, "start": 436.0, "end": 438.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111ang c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t l\\u1edbp v\\u1edbi t\\u00ean l\\u00e0 Calconfig."}, {"index": 177, "start": 438.0, "end": 440.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng n\\u00f3."}, {"index": 178, "start": 440.0, "end": 441.0, "text": "Sau \\u0111\\u00f3, ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 c\\u00e1c m\\u00f4 h\\u00ecnh."}, {"index": 179, "start": 441.0, "end": 445.0, "text": "B\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd, n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n n\\u00f3i v\\u1ec1 Django, n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n x\\u00e2y d\\u1ef1ng m\\u1ed9t \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng web,"}, {"index": 180, "start": 445.0, "end": 447.0, "text": "T\\u1ea5t nhi\\u00ean, b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n l\\u00e0m vi\\u1ec7c v\\u1edbi c\\u01a1 s\\u1edf d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u, \\u0111\\u00fang kh\\u00f4ng?"}, {"index": 181, "start": 447.0, "end": 451.0, "text": "V\\u00e0 trong Django, ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t kh\\u00e1i ni\\u1ec7m tuy\\u1ec7t v\\u1eddi g\\u1ecdi l\\u00e0 ORM."}, {"index": 182, "start": 451.0, "end": 455.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd n\\u00f3i v\\u1ec1 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3 sau, nh\\u01b0ng m\\u00f4 h\\u00ecnh n\\u00e0y s\\u1ebd \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng cho vi\\u1ec7c \\u0111\\u00f3."}, {"index": 183, "start": 455.0, "end": 457.0, "text": "N\\u00f3i chung, n\\u00f3 \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng \\u0111\\u1ec3 l\\u01b0u tr\\u1eef d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u."}, {"index": 184, "start": 457.0, "end": 458.0, "text": "V\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 c\\u00e1c b\\u00e0i ki\\u1ec3m tra."}, {"index": 185, "start": 458.0, "end": 462.0, "text": "N\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 t\\u00ecnh hu\\u1ed1ng ki\\u1ec3m tra, n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n ki\\u1ec3m tra \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng c\\u1ee7a m\\u00ecnh,"}, {"index": 186, "start": 462.0, "end": 464.0, "text": "th\\u00ec \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 c\\u00e1ch ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 l\\u00e0m \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3."}, {"index": 187, "start": 464.0, "end": 465.0, "text": "V\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 c\\u00e1c views."}, {"index": 188, "start": 465.0, "end": 468.0, "text": "Nh\\u1edb khi ch\\u00fang ta g\\u1eedi m\\u1ed9t y\\u00eau c\\u1ea7u, ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 n\\u00f3i v\\u1ec1 MVT,"}, {"index": 189, "start": 468.0, "end": 470.0, "text": "n\\u01a1i m\\u00e0 c\\u00e1c view s\\u1ebd x\\u1eed l\\u00fd y\\u00eau c\\u1ea7u c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n."}, {"index": 190, "start": 470.0, "end": 472.0, "text": "B\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 l\\u00e0m \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3 \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y."}, {"index": 191, "start": 472.0, "end": 474.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u01b0\\u1ee3c r\\u1ed3i, nh\\u01b0ng ch\\u00fang ta mu\\u1ed1n x\\u00e2y d\\u1ef1ng Hello World, \\u0111\\u00fang kh\\u00f4ng?"}, {"index": 192, "start": 474.0, "end": 475.0, "text": "V\\u1eady b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd l\\u00e0m \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3 nh\\u01b0 th\\u1ebf n\\u00e0o?"}, {"index": 193, "start": 475.0, "end": 477.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd th\\u1ea5y \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3 trong video ti\\u1ebfp theo."}, {"index": 194, "start": 477.0, "end": 480.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, trong video n\\u00e0y, ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 n\\u00f3i v\\u1ec1 c\\u00e1ch t\\u1ea1o m\\u1ed9t \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng trong d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n"}, {"index": 195, "start": 480.0, "end": 481.0, "text": "trong Visual Studio, t\\u1ea5t nhi\\u00ean."}, {"index": 196, "start": 481.0, "end": 482.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 nh\\u1eefng g\\u00ec ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111ang s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y."}, {"index": 197, "start": 482.0, "end": 484.0, "text": "V\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 xem c\\u00e1c t\\u1ec7p."}, {"index": 198, "start": 484.0, "end": 486.0, "text": "Trong video ti\\u1ebfp theo, ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd ch\\u1ea1y m\\u00e3 n\\u00e0y."}, {"index": 199, "start": 486.0, "end": 490.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, tr\\u00ean trang ch\\u1ee7, ch\\u1eb3ng h\\u1ea1n, n\\u1ebfu t\\u00f4i v\\u00e0o trang ch\\u1ee7 v\\u00e0 l\\u00e0m m\\u1edbi,"}, {"index": 200, "start": 490.0, "end": 493.0, "text": "T\\u00f4i n\\u00ean nh\\u1eadn \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c m\\u1ed9t c\\u00e1i g\\u00ec \\u0111\\u00f3 gi\\u1ed1ng nh\\u01b0 Hello World, m\\u1ed9t c\\u00e1i g\\u00ec \\u0111\\u00f3 nh\\u01b0 v\\u1eady."}, {"index": 201, "start": 493.0, "end": 495.0, "text": "B\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y kh\\u00f4ng ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng, nh\\u01b0ng ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd l\\u00e0m cho n\\u00f3 ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng."}, {"index": 202, "start": 495.0, "end": 498.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta mu\\u1ed1n Hello World \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y, t\\u1ea1i trang ch\\u00ednh."}, {"index": 203, "start": 498.0, "end": 499.0, "text": "V\\u1eady l\\u00e0 h\\u1ebft n\\u1ed9i dung c\\u1ee7a video n\\u00e0y."}, {"index": 204, "start": 499.0, "end": 500.0, "text": "Hy v\\u1ecdng b\\u1ea1n th\\u00edch n\\u00f3."}, {"index": 205, "start": 500.0, "end": 503.0, "text": "H\\u00e3y cho t\\u00f4i bi\\u1ebft trong ph\\u1ea7n b\\u00ecnh lu\\u1eadn v\\u00e0 h\\u00e3y \\u0111\\u0103ng k\\u00fd \\u0111\\u1ec3 xem c\\u00e1c video kh\\u00e1c."}, {"index": 206, "start": 503.0, "end": 504.0, "text": "T\\u1ea1m bi\\u1ec7t."}], "segments_by_language": {"en": [{"index": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 5.0, "text": "Welcome back Aliens, my name is Dhavin Reddy and let's continue with this series on Django."}, {"index": 1, "start": 5.0, "end": 10.0, "text": "In the last video we have seen how do you set up Django in your machine on Windows at least."}, {"index": 2, "start": 10.0, "end": 15.0, "text": "And then now let's write a code because in the last video we have just created the project"}, {"index": 3, "start": 15.0, "end": 19.0, "text": "and then we were running a server, a lightweight server with Django provides."}, {"index": 4, "start": 19.0, "end": 22.0, "text": "It was running so you can see this is the code which we have done."}, {"index": 5, "start": 22.0, "end": 26.0, "text": "We enter this command which is python manage.py which is your management file"}, {"index": 6, "start": 26.0, "end": 29.0, "text": "and run server which will run the server."}, {"index": 7, "start": 29.0, "end": 32.0, "text": "And then you just have to use any browser which you like."}, {"index": 8, "start": 32.0, "end": 35.0, "text": "I am using Chrome here and you just have to enter the IP address."}, {"index": 9, "start": 35.0, "end": 40.0, "text": "Now this is the IP address which is basically local host and the port number is 8000"}, {"index": 10, "start": 40.0, "end": 44.0, "text": "and we are able to run the server and then we got the output as well."}, {"index": 11, "start": 44.0, "end": 47.0, "text": "But then we don't want this, we want something extra, right?"}, {"index": 12, "start": 47.0, "end": 49.0, "text": "We want to build a web application."}, {"index": 13, "start": 49.0, "end": 50.0, "text": "That's what we do, right?"}, {"index": 14, "start": 50.0, "end": 55.0, "text": "So when you say you are using Django, it means you want to build a web application."}, {"index": 15, "start": 55.0, "end": 58.0, "text": "Okay, now there are two types of applications we can talk about."}, {"index": 16, "start": 58.0, "end": 62.0, "text": "We have static pages and then we have dynamic pages."}, {"index": 17, "start": 62.0, "end": 67.0, "text": "Now all the websites which we use nowadays, some of the pages which you visit are static pages"}, {"index": 18, "start": 67.0, "end": 70.0, "text": "which means everyone will see the same page."}, {"index": 19, "start": 70.0, "end": 73.0, "text": "Dynamic pages are different for every one example."}, {"index": 20, "start": 73.0, "end": 76.0, "text": "If I go to Facebook, in fact, we have talked about this example."}, {"index": 21, "start": 76.0, "end": 79.0, "text": "So if I go to Facebook, I will see my own feeds."}, {"index": 22, "start": 79.0, "end": 80.0, "text": "I will see my friend's feed."}, {"index": 23, "start": 80.0, "end": 82.0, "text": "You will not see my friend's feed, right?"}, {"index": 24, "start": 82.0, "end": 84.0, "text": "That's you will get your own feeds there."}, {"index": 25, "start": 84.0, "end": 89.0, "text": "So if I go to my bank account, I will see my own bank balance, not your bank balance."}, {"index": 26, "start": 89.0, "end": 92.0, "text": "So basically we have a dynamic content there."}, {"index": 27, "start": 92.0, "end": 96.0, "text": "Now when you say you want to build static content, we can use HTML, CSS, JavaScript, done."}, {"index": 28, "start": 96.0, "end": 100.0, "text": "But the moment you say you want to make it dynamic, you want to do some processing,"}, {"index": 29, "start": 100.0, "end": 102.0, "text": "that's what we are doing here."}, {"index": 30, "start": 102.0, "end": 105.0, "text": "So let's make a simple web application."}, {"index": 31, "start": 105.0, "end": 108.0, "text": "Okay, when I say simple, we are going for the basic."}, {"index": 32, "start": 108.0, "end": 112.0, "text": "You know what we do when you learn how to get a web page, you write hello world, right?"}, {"index": 33, "start": 112.0, "end": 113.0, "text": "That's what we'll do now."}, {"index": 34, "start": 113.0, "end": 118.0, "text": "I know you are expecting something, but the thing is here we want to learn Django."}, {"index": 35, "start": 118.0, "end": 121.0, "text": "We don't want to learn the complex programming as at this point."}, {"index": 36, "start": 121.0, "end": 125.0, "text": "We know Python, so we can write the applications, but now we have to understand the framework."}, {"index": 37, "start": 125.0, "end": 129.0, "text": "So let's build something using which you can print hello world on the page."}, {"index": 38, "start": 129.0, "end": 133.0, "text": "Yes, you can do that in HTML as well, but let's make it dynamic here."}, {"index": 39, "start": 133.0, "end": 137.0, "text": "Okay, so for that, what you do is you have to use some sort of IDE."}, {"index": 40, "start": 137.0, "end": 141.0, "text": "Now basically, when you say IDE, we can also use a notepad to type the code."}, {"index": 41, "start": 141.0, "end": 142.0, "text": "Okay, that's completely fine."}, {"index": 42, "start": 142.0, "end": 145.0, "text": "You can use sublime because that's a lot of people use."}, {"index": 43, "start": 145.0, "end": 147.0, "text": "Here we are going to use Visual Studio."}, {"index": 44, "start": 147.0, "end": 150.0, "text": "You can download Visual Studio by going to Google."}, {"index": 45, "start": 150.0, "end": 153.0, "text": "So when you search for Visual Studio download, this is what you will get."}, {"index": 46, "start": 153.0, "end": 155.0, "text": "Just go to the website and you can download."}, {"index": 47, "start": 155.0, "end": 159.0, "text": "In fact, every new version, they are providing amazing features."}, {"index": 48, "start": 159.0, "end": 160.0, "text": "So just try it out."}, {"index": 49, "start": 160.0, "end": 163.0, "text": "One of the best idea available for programmers now."}, {"index": 50, "start": 163.0, "end": 165.0, "text": "But again, the community version is free."}, {"index": 51, "start": 165.0, "end": 168.0, "text": "If you want to go for professional version, you have to pay for it."}, {"index": 52, "start": 168.0, "end": 172.0, "text": "But at least at this point, we are happy to work with the free version."}, {"index": 53, "start": 172.0, "end": 174.0, "text": "It works well."}, {"index": 54, "start": 174.0, "end": 177.0, "text": "So just download that and you have to install simple steps."}, {"index": 55, "start": 177.0, "end": 179.0, "text": "Now in this machine, I already have Visual Studio."}, {"index": 56, "start": 179.0, "end": 180.0, "text": "So let me just open that."}, {"index": 57, "start": 180.0, "end": 182.0, "text": "So you can see we have Visual Studio here."}, {"index": 58, "start": 182.0, "end": 184.0, "text": "This is how it looks like dark theme."}, {"index": 59, "start": 184.0, "end": 185.0, "text": "You can also go for a light theme."}, {"index": 60, "start": 185.0, "end": 186.0, "text": "It's also available here."}, {"index": 61, "start": 186.0, "end": 190.0, "text": "Depending upon some programmers normally prefer black or dark theme,"}, {"index": 62, "start": 190.0, "end": 192.0, "text": "YouTubers or the content creators, they prefer white theme"}, {"index": 63, "start": 192.0, "end": 194.0, "text": "because the recording works well."}, {"index": 64, "start": 194.0, "end": 199.0, "text": "Okay, so now once you have Visual Studio, we have to open the project."}, {"index": 65, "start": 199.0, "end": 201.0, "text": "Now if you remember in the last video, we have done that."}, {"index": 66, "start": 201.0, "end": 203.0, "text": "We have created the project telescope."}, {"index": 67, "start": 203.0, "end": 204.0, "text": "So let's open that folder."}, {"index": 68, "start": 204.0, "end": 206.0, "text": "So just have to go to the folder projects."}, {"index": 69, "start": 206.0, "end": 209.0, "text": "Remember we have created this folder projects."}, {"index": 70, "start": 209.0, "end": 211.0, "text": "And inside this project, we have a telescope project,"}, {"index": 71, "start": 211.0, "end": 213.0, "text": "which we have created using command."}, {"index": 72, "start": 213.0, "end": 215.0, "text": "And of course, select that telescope and click on open."}, {"index": 73, "start": 215.0, "end": 216.0, "text": "This is what you will get."}, {"index": 74, "start": 216.0, "end": 218.0, "text": "So you will get your project here, which is telescope."}, {"index": 75, "start": 218.0, "end": 220.0, "text": "And inside this, you can see we have a lot of files."}, {"index": 76, "start": 220.0, "end": 222.0, "text": "In fact, we have talked about them before."}, {"index": 77, "start": 222.0, "end": 225.0, "text": "But just to go for a quick recap, we have this manage.py,"}, {"index": 78, "start": 225.0, "end": 227.0, "text": "which is useful to manage your project."}, {"index": 79, "start": 227.0, "end": 230.0, "text": "And then if you want to do some settings in your project,"}, {"index": 80, "start": 230.0, "end": 232.0, "text": "this is very important, the settings.py file."}, {"index": 81, "start": 232.0, "end": 235.0, "text": "So if you explore this file, you can see we have a secret key,"}, {"index": 82, "start": 235.0, "end": 238.0, "text": "which is basically used for deployment in the server."}, {"index": 83, "start": 238.0, "end": 240.0, "text": "And then we have a debug."}, {"index": 84, "start": 240.0, "end": 243.0, "text": "So debug will give you a lot of information when you get stuck somewhere."}, {"index": 85, "start": 243.0, "end": 245.0, "text": "And this is very important actually."}, {"index": 86, "start": 245.0, "end": 247.0, "text": "So let's say if you are building a project"}, {"index": 87, "start": 247.0, "end": 249.0, "text": "and if you want to know what is happening behind the scene,"}, {"index": 88, "start": 249.0, "end": 252.0, "text": "just make debug equal to 2 and it will give you all the information."}, {"index": 89, "start": 252.0, "end": 255.0, "text": "But make sure before deploying it on the server,"}, {"index": 90, "start": 255.0, "end": 258.0, "text": "just make it false because someone can hack your machine"}, {"index": 91, "start": 258.0, "end": 260.0, "text": "and they can see all the logs."}, {"index": 92, "start": 260.0, "end": 262.0, "text": "Okay, and then this is important."}, {"index": 93, "start": 262.0, "end": 263.0, "text": "This is the installed app."}, {"index": 94, "start": 263.0, "end": 265.0, "text": "So in your project, these are the apps that are already installed."}, {"index": 95, "start": 265.0, "end": 267.0, "text": "Again, we'll talk about it later."}, {"index": 96, "start": 267.0, "end": 269.0, "text": "We can have our own apps."}, {"index": 97, "start": 269.0, "end": 272.0, "text": "So these are the middle ways, which will help you for security purpose as well."}, {"index": 98, "start": 272.0, "end": 274.0, "text": "We have a template."}, {"index": 99, "start": 274.0, "end": 277.0, "text": "So you can see this Django template will help you to provide template stuff."}, {"index": 100, "start": 277.0, "end": 279.0, "text": "What about database?"}, {"index": 101, "start": 279.0, "end": 281.0, "text": "Of course, if you are making a web application,"}, {"index": 102, "start": 281.0, "end": 283.0, "text": "you also want some database behind the scene,"}, {"index": 103, "start": 283.0, "end": 286.0, "text": "maybe MySQL, Postgres or SQLite."}, {"index": 104, "start": 286.0, "end": 288.0, "text": "So by default, it gives you SQLite,"}, {"index": 105, "start": 288.0, "end": 290.0, "text": "but you can also use Postgres there."}, {"index": 106, "start": 290.0, "end": 293.0, "text": "And then we have some password stuff here for validation."}, {"index": 107, "start": 293.0, "end": 295.0, "text": "So let's not focus on this file as of now"}, {"index": 108, "start": 295.0, "end": 298.0, "text": "because we don't actually edit this file very frequently."}, {"index": 109, "start": 298.0, "end": 299.0, "text": "So let's keep it there."}, {"index": 110, "start": 299.0, "end": 301.0, "text": "But this is very important file."}, {"index": 111, "start": 301.0, "end": 303.0, "text": "Okay, and then we have URLs."}, {"index": 112, "start": 303.0, "end": 306.0, "text": "So you can see we might be having only one URL here,"}, {"index": 113, "start": 306.0, "end": 308.0, "text": "which is for admin stuff."}, {"index": 114, "start": 308.0, "end": 310.0, "text": "So that's it as of now."}, {"index": 115, "start": 310.0, "end": 312.0, "text": "Let's create our first app, but hold on."}, {"index": 116, "start": 312.0, "end": 314.0, "text": "You might be thinking we got a project, right?"}, {"index": 117, "start": 314.0, "end": 316.0, "text": "Why we have to get a separate app?"}, {"index": 118, "start": 316.0, "end": 319.0, "text": "The thing is, in Django, what we do is we have a project."}, {"index": 119, "start": 319.0, "end": 322.0, "text": "Let's say if I want to make a big web application,"}, {"index": 120, "start": 322.0, "end": 324.0, "text": "which will have a lot of features, you know,"}, {"index": 121, "start": 324.0, "end": 326.0, "text": "the admin stuff, we will be having some,"}, {"index": 122, "start": 326.0, "end": 327.0, "text": "let's say e-commerce website."}, {"index": 123, "start": 327.0, "end": 329.0, "text": "We can have product as a module."}, {"index": 124, "start": 329.0, "end": 331.0, "text": "We can have shipping as a module."}, {"index": 125, "start": 331.0, "end": 332.0, "text": "So we can have a different set."}, {"index": 126, "start": 332.0, "end": 333.0, "text": "Those are different apps."}, {"index": 127, "start": 333.0, "end": 336.0, "text": "And all these apps in the website will be provided"}, {"index": 128, "start": 336.0, "end": 338.0, "text": "in one particular project, which is your website in general."}, {"index": 129, "start": 338.0, "end": 340.0, "text": "So login stuff will be one app."}, {"index": 130, "start": 340.0, "end": 342.0, "text": "Then showing the products will be one app."}, {"index": 131, "start": 342.0, "end": 343.0, "text": "That's how."}, {"index": 132, "start": 343.0, "end": 345.0, "text": "So let's create a simple project here."}, {"index": 133, "start": 345.0, "end": 348.0, "text": "The way you do that is by going to a terminal."}, {"index": 134, "start": 348.0, "end": 349.0, "text": "So you can see this is terminal."}, {"index": 135, "start": 349.0, "end": 351.0, "text": "And this is where you can type."}, {"index": 136, "start": 351.0, "end": 354.0, "text": "So how do we create an app and what you will name it?"}, {"index": 137, "start": 354.0, "end": 357.0, "text": "So as of now, I just want to name it as Calc"}, {"index": 138, "start": 357.0, "end": 360.0, "text": "because I love Hello World and then the next example will be Calc."}, {"index": 139, "start": 360.0, "end": 362.0, "text": "So let's create a Calc app."}, {"index": 140, "start": 362.0, "end": 364.0, "text": "To do that, we have to type a command."}, {"index": 141, "start": 364.0, "end": 366.0, "text": "So you have to say python manage.py."}, {"index": 142, "start": 366.0, "end": 367.0, "text": "That's the file we are using."}, {"index": 143, "start": 367.0, "end": 369.0, "text": "And then you have to mention the name of your app."}, {"index": 144, "start": 369.0, "end": 371.0, "text": "So as of now, we'll go for Calc."}, {"index": 145, "start": 371.0, "end": 374.0, "text": "The moment you say enter, we got an error."}, {"index": 146, "start": 374.0, "end": 377.0, "text": "The problem is now we are using a different command prompt."}, {"index": 147, "start": 377.0, "end": 380.0, "text": "I was not expecting this, but then we are using a different command prompt."}, {"index": 148, "start": 380.0, "end": 382.0, "text": "Initially, we were using the Windows command prompt."}, {"index": 149, "start": 382.0, "end": 384.0, "text": "Now we are using it through Visual Studio."}, {"index": 150, "start": 384.0, "end": 388.0, "text": "And then if you remember, we have to also set the virtual environment."}, {"index": 151, "start": 388.0, "end": 391.0, "text": "So the virtual environment we were using here is test."}, {"index": 152, "start": 391.0, "end": 392.0, "text": "So we have to use that."}, {"index": 153, "start": 392.0, "end": 394.0, "text": "So we'll close this and we'll use test."}, {"index": 154, "start": 394.0, "end": 396.0, "text": "So how do you use our environments?"}, {"index": 155, "start": 396.0, "end": 398.0, "text": "You have to say work on test."}, {"index": 156, "start": 398.0, "end": 399.0, "text": "So now we are in test."}, {"index": 157, "start": 399.0, "end": 401.0, "text": "Now we have to file a command."}, {"index": 158, "start": 401.0, "end": 404.0, "text": "So we have to say python manage.py."}, {"index": 159, "start": 404.0, "end": 406.0, "text": "Oh, we have here forgot one more thing."}, {"index": 160, "start": 406.0, "end": 407.0, "text": "So you have to say start app."}, {"index": 161, "start": 407.0, "end": 408.0, "text": "That's what I do."}, {"index": 162, "start": 408.0, "end": 410.0, "text": "So you have to say start app and you have to mention Calc."}, {"index": 163, "start": 410.0, "end": 412.0, "text": "The moment you say enter now, you can see on the left-hand side,"}, {"index": 164, "start": 412.0, "end": 414.0, "text": "we got a Calc."}, {"index": 165, "start": 414.0, "end": 415.0, "text": "This is basically your app."}, {"index": 166, "start": 415.0, "end": 417.0, "text": "So this is your project that is going."}, {"index": 167, "start": 417.0, "end": 418.0, "text": "This is your app."}, {"index": 168, "start": 418.0, "end": 420.0, "text": "Now, if you can see, we have some different files there."}, {"index": 169, "start": 420.0, "end": 422.0, "text": "We don't have settings here, but we don't have settings here."}, {"index": 170, "start": 422.0, "end": 426.0, "text": "Because this settings is for the project and every app will have its own stuff."}, {"index": 171, "start": 426.0, "end": 430.0, "text": "Example, let's say if you talk about the app, we have some admin stuff here."}, {"index": 172, "start": 430.0, "end": 432.0, "text": "We'll not be doing that as of now, but we have admin stuff."}, {"index": 173, "start": 432.0, "end": 434.0, "text": "We have apps."}, {"index": 174, "start": 434.0, "end": 435.0, "text": "This name is important."}, {"index": 175, "start": 435.0, "end": 436.0, "text": "Just look at this name."}, {"index": 176, "start": 436.0, "end": 438.0, "text": "We are getting a class named as Calconfig."}, {"index": 177, "start": 438.0, "end": 440.0, "text": "We are going to use it."}, {"index": 178, "start": 440.0, "end": 441.0, "text": "Then we have models."}, {"index": 179, "start": 441.0, "end": 445.0, "text": "Now, if you talk about Django, if you want to build a web application,"}, {"index": 180, "start": 445.0, "end": 447.0, "text": "of course you want to work with database, right?"}, {"index": 181, "start": 447.0, "end": 451.0, "text": "And in Django, we have this awesome concept named as ORM."}, {"index": 182, "start": 451.0, "end": 455.0, "text": "So we'll talk about that later, but then this model will be used for that."}, {"index": 183, "start": 455.0, "end": 457.0, "text": "Or basically it is used to hold data."}, {"index": 184, "start": 457.0, "end": 458.0, "text": "And then we have tests."}, {"index": 185, "start": 458.0, "end": 462.0, "text": "So if you want to do some test cases, if you want to test your application,"}, {"index": 186, "start": 462.0, "end": 464.0, "text": "this is how we can do it."}, {"index": 187, "start": 464.0, "end": 465.0, "text": "And then we have views."}, {"index": 188, "start": 465.0, "end": 468.0, "text": "Remember when we send a request, we have talked about MVT,"}, {"index": 189, "start": 468.0, "end": 470.0, "text": "where views will handle your request."}, {"index": 190, "start": 470.0, "end": 472.0, "text": "You can do that here."}, {"index": 191, "start": 472.0, "end": 474.0, "text": "Okay, but we want to build Hello World, right?"}, {"index": 192, "start": 474.0, "end": 475.0, "text": "So how will you do that?"}, {"index": 193, "start": 475.0, "end": 477.0, "text": "That we'll see in the next video."}, {"index": 194, "start": 477.0, "end": 480.0, "text": "So in this video, we have talked about how to create an app in the project"}, {"index": 195, "start": 480.0, "end": 481.0, "text": "in Visual Studio, of course."}, {"index": 196, "start": 481.0, "end": 482.0, "text": "That's what we are using here."}, {"index": 197, "start": 482.0, "end": 484.0, "text": "And then we have seen the files."}, {"index": 198, "start": 484.0, "end": 486.0, "text": "In the next video, we'll run this code."}, {"index": 199, "start": 486.0, "end": 490.0, "text": "So in the home page, for example, if I go to home page and if I refresh,"}, {"index": 200, "start": 490.0, "end": 493.0, "text": "I should be getting something like Hello World, something like that."}, {"index": 201, "start": 493.0, "end": 495.0, "text": "This is not working now, but we'll make it work."}, {"index": 202, "start": 495.0, "end": 498.0, "text": "We want Hello World here at the home page."}, {"index": 203, "start": 498.0, "end": 499.0, "text": "So that's it from this video."}, {"index": 204, "start": 499.0, "end": 500.0, "text": "I hope you enjoyed."}, {"index": 205, "start": 500.0, "end": 503.0, "text": "Let me know in the comment section and do subscribe for other videos."}, {"index": 206, "start": 503.0, "end": 504.0, "text": "Bye-bye."}], "vi": [{"index": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 5.0, "text": "Ch\\u00e0o m\\u1eebng tr\\u1edf l\\u1ea1i, c\\u00e1c b\\u1ea1n, t\\u00f4i t\\u00ean l\\u00e0 Dhavin Reddy v\\u00e0 h\\u00e3y ti\\u1ebfp t\\u1ee5c v\\u1edbi series n\\u00e0y v\\u1ec1 Django."}, {"index": 1, "start": 5.0, "end": 10.0, "text": "Trong video tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc, ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 th\\u1ea5y c\\u00e1ch thi\\u1ebft l\\u1eadp Django tr\\u00ean m\\u00e1y t\\u00ednh c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n, \\u00edt nh\\u1ea5t l\\u00e0 tr\\u00ean Windows."}, {"index": 2, "start": 10.0, "end": 15.0, "text": "V\\u00e0 b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd, h\\u00e3y c\\u00f9ng vi\\u1ebft m\\u00e3, v\\u00ec trong video tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc ch\\u00fang ta ch\\u1ec9 m\\u1edbi t\\u1ea1o d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n."}, {"index": 3, "start": 15.0, "end": 19.0, "text": "v\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 ch\\u1ea1y m\\u1ed9t m\\u00e1y ch\\u1ee7, m\\u1ed9t m\\u00e1y ch\\u1ee7 nh\\u1eb9 m\\u00e0 Django cung c\\u1ea5p."}, {"index": 4, "start": 19.0, "end": 22.0, "text": "N\\u00f3 \\u0111\\u00e3 ch\\u1ea1y, v\\u00ec v\\u1eady b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 th\\u1ea5y \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 m\\u00e3 m\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n."}, {"index": 5, "start": 22.0, "end": 26.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 nh\\u1eadp l\\u1ec7nh n\\u00e0y, \\u0111\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 python manage.py, \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 file qu\\u1ea3n l\\u00fd c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n."}, {"index": 6, "start": 26.0, "end": 29.0, "text": "v\\u00e0 ch\\u1ea1y m\\u00e1y ch\\u1ee7, \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y s\\u1ebd kh\\u1edfi \\u0111\\u1ed9ng m\\u00e1y ch\\u1ee7."}, {"index": 7, "start": 29.0, "end": 32.0, "text": "Sau \\u0111\\u00f3, b\\u1ea1n ch\\u1ec9 c\\u1ea7n s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng b\\u1ea5t k\\u1ef3 tr\\u00ecnh duy\\u1ec7t n\\u00e0o m\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n th\\u00edch."}, {"index": 8, "start": 32.0, "end": 35.0, "text": "T\\u00f4i \\u0111ang s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng Chrome \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y v\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n ch\\u1ec9 c\\u1ea7n nh\\u1eadp \\u0111\\u1ecba ch\\u1ec9 IP."}, {"index": 9, "start": 35.0, "end": 40.0, "text": "B\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u1ecba ch\\u1ec9 IP, m\\u00e0 c\\u01a1 b\\u1ea3n l\\u00e0 localhost v\\u00e0 s\\u1ed1 c\\u1ed5ng l\\u00e0 8000."}, {"index": 10, "start": 40.0, "end": 44.0, "text": "v\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 ch\\u1ea1y m\\u00e1y ch\\u1ee7 v\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 ch\\u00fang ta c\\u0169ng nh\\u1eadn \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c \\u0111\\u1ea7u ra."}, {"index": 11, "start": 44.0, "end": 47.0, "text": "Nh\\u01b0ng sau \\u0111\\u00f3 ch\\u00fang ta kh\\u00f4ng mu\\u1ed1n \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y, ch\\u00fang ta mu\\u1ed1n \\u0111i\\u1ec1u g\\u00ec \\u0111\\u00f3 b\\u1ed5 sung, \\u0111\\u00fang kh\\u00f4ng?"}, {"index": 12, "start": 47.0, "end": 49.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta mu\\u1ed1n x\\u00e2y d\\u1ef1ng m\\u1ed9t \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng web."}, {"index": 13, "start": 49.0, "end": 50.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 nh\\u1eefng g\\u00ec ch\\u00fang ta l\\u00e0m, \\u0111\\u00fang kh\\u00f4ng?"}, {"index": 14, "start": 50.0, "end": 55.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, khi b\\u1ea1n n\\u00f3i r\\u1eb1ng b\\u1ea1n \\u0111ang s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng Django, \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3 c\\u00f3 ngh\\u0129a l\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n x\\u00e2y d\\u1ef1ng m\\u1ed9t \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng web."}, {"index": 15, "start": 55.0, "end": 58.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u01b0\\u1ee3c r\\u1ed3i, b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd c\\u00f3 hai lo\\u1ea1i \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng m\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 n\\u00f3i \\u0111\\u1ebfn."}, {"index": 16, "start": 58.0, "end": 62.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 c\\u00e1c trang t\\u0129nh v\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 c\\u00e1c trang \\u0111\\u1ed9ng."}, {"index": 17, "start": 62.0, "end": 67.0, "text": "B\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd t\\u1ea5t c\\u1ea3 c\\u00e1c trang web m\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng ng\\u00e0y nay, m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 trang m\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n truy c\\u1eadp l\\u00e0 c\\u00e1c trang t\\u0129nh"}, {"index": 18, "start": 67.0, "end": 70.0, "text": "c\\u00f3 ngh\\u0129a l\\u00e0 m\\u1ecdi ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi s\\u1ebd th\\u1ea5y c\\u00f9ng m\\u1ed9t trang."}, {"index": 19, "start": 70.0, "end": 73.0, "text": "C\\u00e1c trang \\u0111\\u1ed9ng th\\u00ec kh\\u00e1c nhau \\u0111\\u1ed1i v\\u1edbi t\\u1eebng ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi."}, {"index": 20, "start": 73.0, "end": 76.0, "text": "N\\u1ebfu t\\u00f4i v\\u00e0o Facebook, th\\u1ef1c ra, ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 n\\u00f3i v\\u1ec1 v\\u00ed d\\u1ee5 n\\u00e0y."}, {"index": 21, "start": 76.0, "end": 79.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, n\\u1ebfu t\\u00f4i v\\u00e0o Facebook, t\\u00f4i s\\u1ebd th\\u1ea5y nh\\u1eefng th\\u00f4ng tin c\\u1ee7a ri\\u00eang m\\u00ecnh."}, {"index": 22, "start": 79.0, "end": 80.0, "text": "T\\u00f4i s\\u1ebd th\\u1ea5y th\\u00f4ng tin c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n t\\u00f4i."}, {"index": 23, "start": 80.0, "end": 82.0, "text": "B\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd kh\\u00f4ng th\\u1ea5y th\\u00f4ng tin c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n t\\u00f4i, \\u0111\\u00fang kh\\u00f4ng?"}, {"index": 24, "start": 82.0, "end": 84.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd nh\\u1eadn \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c nh\\u1eefng th\\u00f4ng tin c\\u1ee7a ri\\u00eang b\\u1ea1n \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00f3."}, {"index": 25, "start": 84.0, "end": 89.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, n\\u1ebfu t\\u00f4i v\\u00e0o t\\u00e0i kho\\u1ea3n ng\\u00e2n h\\u00e0ng c\\u1ee7a m\\u00ecnh, t\\u00f4i s\\u1ebd th\\u1ea5y s\\u1ed1 d\\u01b0 ng\\u00e2n h\\u00e0ng c\\u1ee7a m\\u00ecnh, ch\\u1ee9 kh\\u00f4ng ph\\u1ea3i s\\u1ed1 d\\u01b0 c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n."}, {"index": 26, "start": 89.0, "end": 92.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, c\\u01a1 b\\u1ea3n l\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t n\\u1ed9i dung \\u0111\\u1ed9ng \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00f3."}, {"index": 27, "start": 92.0, "end": 96.0, "text": "B\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd, khi b\\u1ea1n n\\u00f3i b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n x\\u00e2y d\\u1ef1ng n\\u1ed9i dung t\\u0129nh, ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng HTML, CSS, JavaScript, xong."}, {"index": 28, "start": 96.0, "end": 100.0, "text": "Nh\\u01b0ng ngay khi b\\u1ea1n n\\u00f3i b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n l\\u00e0m cho n\\u00f3 \\u0111\\u1ed9ng, b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 x\\u1eed l\\u00fd,"}, {"index": 29, "start": 100.0, "end": 102.0, "text": "\\u0111\\u00f3 ch\\u00ednh l\\u00e0 nh\\u1eefng g\\u00ec ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111ang l\\u00e0m \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y."}, {"index": 30, "start": 102.0, "end": 105.0, "text": "V\\u1eady h\\u00e3y t\\u1ea1o m\\u1ed9t \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng web \\u0111\\u01a1n gi\\u1ea3n."}, {"index": 31, "start": 105.0, "end": 108.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u01b0\\u1ee3c r\\u1ed3i, khi t\\u00f4i n\\u00f3i \\u0111\\u01a1n gi\\u1ea3n, ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd \\u0111i theo \\u0111i\\u1ec1u c\\u01a1 b\\u1ea3n."}, {"index": 32, "start": 108.0, "end": 112.0, "text": "B\\u1ea1n bi\\u1ebft ch\\u00fang ta l\\u00e0m g\\u00ec khi b\\u1ea1n h\\u1ecdc c\\u00e1ch l\\u1ea5y m\\u1ed9t trang web, b\\u1ea1n vi\\u1ebft 'hello world', \\u0111\\u00fang kh\\u00f4ng?"}, {"index": 33, "start": 112.0, "end": 113.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 nh\\u1eefng g\\u00ec ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd l\\u00e0m ngay b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd."}, {"index": 34, "start": 113.0, "end": 118.0, "text": "T\\u00f4i bi\\u1ebft b\\u1ea1n \\u0111ang mong \\u0111\\u1ee3i \\u0111i\\u1ec1u g\\u00ec \\u0111\\u00f3, nh\\u01b0ng v\\u1ea5n \\u0111\\u1ec1 \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang ta mu\\u1ed1n h\\u1ecdc Django."}, {"index": 35, "start": 118.0, "end": 121.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta kh\\u00f4ng mu\\u1ed1n h\\u1ecdc l\\u1eadp tr\\u00ecnh ph\\u1ee9c t\\u1ea1p \\u1edf th\\u1eddi \\u0111i\\u1ec3m n\\u00e0y."}, {"index": 36, "start": 121.0, "end": 125.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta bi\\u1ebft Python, v\\u00ec v\\u1eady ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 vi\\u1ebft c\\u00e1c \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng, nh\\u01b0ng b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd ch\\u00fang ta c\\u1ea7n hi\\u1ec3u v\\u1ec1 framework."}, {"index": 37, "start": 125.0, "end": 129.0, "text": "V\\u1eady h\\u00e3y x\\u00e2y d\\u1ef1ng m\\u1ed9t c\\u00e1i g\\u00ec \\u0111\\u00f3 m\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 in hello world tr\\u00ean trang."}, {"index": 38, "start": 129.0, "end": 133.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u00fang v\\u1eady, b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 l\\u00e0m \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3 b\\u1eb1ng HTML, nh\\u01b0ng h\\u00e3y l\\u00e0m cho n\\u00f3 tr\\u1edf n\\u00ean \\u0111\\u1ed9ng \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y."}, {"index": 39, "start": 133.0, "end": 137.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u01b0\\u1ee3c r\\u1ed3i, \\u0111\\u1ec3 l\\u00e0m \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3, b\\u1ea1n c\\u1ea7n s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng m\\u1ed9t lo\\u1ea1i IDE n\\u00e0o \\u0111\\u00f3."}, {"index": 40, "start": 137.0, "end": 141.0, "text": "Th\\u1ef1c ra, khi b\\u1ea1n n\\u00f3i v\\u1ec1 IDE, ch\\u00fang ta c\\u0169ng c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng m\\u1ed9t notepad \\u0111\\u1ec3 g\\u00f5 m\\u00e3."}, {"index": 41, "start": 141.0, "end": 142.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u01b0\\u1ee3c r\\u1ed3i, \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3 ho\\u00e0n to\\u00e0n \\u1ed5n."}, {"index": 42, "start": 142.0, "end": 145.0, "text": "B\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng Sublime v\\u00ec r\\u1ea5t nhi\\u1ec1u ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi \\u0111ang d\\u00f9ng."}, {"index": 43, "start": 145.0, "end": 147.0, "text": "\\u1ede \\u0111\\u00e2y ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng Visual Studio."}, {"index": 44, "start": 147.0, "end": 150.0, "text": "B\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 t\\u1ea3i Visual Studio b\\u1eb1ng c\\u00e1ch t\\u00ecm tr\\u00ean Google."}, {"index": 45, "start": 150.0, "end": 153.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, khi b\\u1ea1n t\\u00ecm ki\\u1ebfm t\\u1ea3i Visual Studio, \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 nh\\u1eefng g\\u00ec b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd nh\\u1eadn \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c."}, {"index": 46, "start": 153.0, "end": 155.0, "text": "Ch\\u1ec9 c\\u1ea7n v\\u00e0o trang web v\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 t\\u1ea3i v\\u1ec1."}, {"index": 47, "start": 155.0, "end": 159.0, "text": "Tr\\u00ean th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf, m\\u1ed7i phi\\u00ean b\\u1ea3n m\\u1edbi \\u0111\\u1ec1u cung c\\u1ea5p nh\\u1eefng t\\u00ednh n\\u0103ng tuy\\u1ec7t v\\u1eddi."}, {"index": 48, "start": 159.0, "end": 160.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, h\\u00e3y th\\u1eed s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng nh\\u00e9."}, {"index": 49, "start": 160.0, "end": 163.0, "text": "M\\u1ed9t trong nh\\u1eefng IDE t\\u1ed1t nh\\u1ea5t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u00f3 cho l\\u1eadp tr\\u00ecnh vi\\u00ean."}, {"index": 50, "start": 163.0, "end": 165.0, "text": "Nh\\u01b0ng m\\u1ed9t l\\u1ea7n n\\u1eefa, phi\\u00ean b\\u1ea3n c\\u1ed9ng \\u0111\\u1ed3ng l\\u00e0 mi\\u1ec5n ph\\u00ed."}, {"index": 51, "start": 165.0, "end": 168.0, "text": "N\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n d\\u00f9ng phi\\u00ean b\\u1ea3n chuy\\u00ean nghi\\u1ec7p, b\\u1ea1n ph\\u1ea3i tr\\u1ea3 ti\\u1ec1n cho n\\u00f3."}, {"index": 52, "start": 168.0, "end": 172.0, "text": "Nh\\u01b0ng \\u00edt nh\\u1ea5t \\u1edf th\\u1eddi \\u0111i\\u1ec3m n\\u00e0y, ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i r\\u1ea5t vui khi l\\u00e0m vi\\u1ec7c v\\u1edbi phi\\u00ean b\\u1ea3n mi\\u1ec5n ph\\u00ed."}, {"index": 53, "start": 172.0, "end": 174.0, "text": "N\\u00f3 ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng r\\u1ea5t t\\u1ed1t."}, {"index": 54, "start": 174.0, "end": 177.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, h\\u00e3y t\\u1ea3i n\\u00f3 v\\u1ec1 v\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n ch\\u1ec9 c\\u1ea7n th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n nh\\u1eefng b\\u01b0\\u1edbc c\\u00e0i \\u0111\\u1eb7t \\u0111\\u01a1n gi\\u1ea3n."}, {"index": 55, "start": 177.0, "end": 179.0, "text": "B\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd tr\\u00ean m\\u00e1y n\\u00e0y, t\\u00f4i \\u0111\\u00e3 c\\u00f3 Visual Studio."}, {"index": 56, "start": 179.0, "end": 180.0, "text": "V\\u1eady \\u0111\\u1ec3 t\\u00f4i m\\u1edf n\\u00f3 l\\u00ean."}, {"index": 57, "start": 180.0, "end": 182.0, "text": "Nh\\u01b0 b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 th\\u1ea5y, ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 Visual Studio \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y."}, {"index": 58, "start": 182.0, "end": 184.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 giao di\\u1ec7n n\\u1ebfu ch\\u1ecdn ch\\u1ebf \\u0111\\u1ed9 t\\u1ed1i."}, {"index": 59, "start": 184.0, "end": 185.0, "text": "B\\u1ea1n c\\u0169ng c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 ch\\u1ecdn ch\\u1ebf \\u0111\\u1ed9 s\\u00e1ng."}, {"index": 60, "start": 185.0, "end": 186.0, "text": "N\\u00f3 c\\u0169ng c\\u00f3 s\\u1eb5n \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y."}, {"index": 61, "start": 186.0, "end": 190.0, "text": "T\\u00f9y thu\\u1ed9c v\\u00e0o m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 l\\u1eadp tr\\u00ecnh vi\\u00ean th\\u01b0\\u1eddng th\\u00edch giao di\\u1ec7n m\\u00e0u \\u0111en ho\\u1eb7c t\\u1ed1i,"}, {"index": 62, "start": 190.0, "end": 192.0, "text": "nh\\u1eefng ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi l\\u00e0m YouTube ho\\u1eb7c c\\u00e1c nh\\u00e0 s\\u00e1ng t\\u1ea1o n\\u1ed9i dung, h\\u1ecd th\\u00edch giao di\\u1ec7n m\\u00e0u tr\\u1eafng"}, {"index": 63, "start": 192.0, "end": 194.0, "text": "b\\u1edfi v\\u00ec vi\\u1ec7c ghi h\\u00ecnh ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng t\\u1ed1t."}, {"index": 64, "start": 194.0, "end": 199.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u01b0\\u1ee3c r\\u1ed3i, b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd khi b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 Visual Studio, ch\\u00fang ta ph\\u1ea3i m\\u1edf d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n."}, {"index": 65, "start": 199.0, "end": 201.0, "text": "B\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n nh\\u1edb trong video tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc, ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 l\\u00e0m \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3."}, {"index": 66, "start": 201.0, "end": 203.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 t\\u1ea1o d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n thi\\u00ean v\\u0103n."}, {"index": 67, "start": 203.0, "end": 204.0, "text": "V\\u1eady h\\u00e3y m\\u1edf th\\u01b0 m\\u1ee5c \\u0111\\u00f3."}, {"index": 68, "start": 204.0, "end": 206.0, "text": "Ch\\u1ec9 c\\u1ea7n \\u0111i \\u0111\\u1ebfn th\\u01b0 m\\u1ee5c d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n."}, {"index": 69, "start": 206.0, "end": 209.0, "text": "H\\u00e3y nh\\u1edb r\\u1eb1ng ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 t\\u1ea1o th\\u01b0 m\\u1ee5c d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n n\\u00e0y."}, {"index": 70, "start": 209.0, "end": 211.0, "text": "V\\u00e0 b\\u00ean trong th\\u01b0 m\\u1ee5c n\\u00e0y, ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n thi\\u00ean v\\u0103n,"}, {"index": 71, "start": 211.0, "end": 213.0, "text": "m\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 t\\u1ea1o ra b\\u1eb1ng l\\u1ec7nh."}, {"index": 72, "start": 213.0, "end": 215.0, "text": "V\\u00e0 t\\u1ea5t nhi\\u00ean, h\\u00e3y ch\\u1ecdn d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n thi\\u00ean v\\u0103n \\u0111\\u00f3 v\\u00e0 nh\\u1ea5p v\\u00e0o m\\u1edf."}, {"index": 73, "start": 215.0, "end": 216.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 nh\\u1eefng g\\u00ec b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd nh\\u1eadn \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c."}, {"index": 74, "start": 216.0, "end": 218.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd th\\u1ea5y d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n c\\u1ee7a m\\u00ecnh \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y, \\u0111\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 thi\\u00ean v\\u0103n."}, {"index": 75, "start": 218.0, "end": 220.0, "text": "V\\u00e0 b\\u00ean trong, b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 th\\u1ea5y c\\u00f3 nhi\\u1ec1u t\\u1ec7p."}, {"index": 76, "start": 220.0, "end": 222.0, "text": "Th\\u1ef1c t\\u1ebf, ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 n\\u00f3i v\\u1ec1 ch\\u00fang tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc \\u0111\\u00e2y."}, {"index": 77, "start": 222.0, "end": 225.0, "text": "Nh\\u01b0ng ch\\u1ec9 \\u0111\\u1ec3 t\\u00f3m t\\u1eaft nhanh, ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 file manage.py,"}, {"index": 78, "start": 225.0, "end": 227.0, "text": "c\\u00e1i n\\u00e0y r\\u1ea5t h\\u1eefu \\u00edch \\u0111\\u1ec3 qu\\u1ea3n l\\u00fd d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n."}, {"index": 79, "start": 227.0, "end": 230.0, "text": "V\\u00e0 n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 c\\u00e0i \\u0111\\u1eb7t trong d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n c\\u1ee7a m\\u00ecnh,"}, {"index": 80, "start": 230.0, "end": 232.0, "text": "\\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y r\\u1ea5t quan tr\\u1ecdng, t\\u1ec7p settings.py."}, {"index": 81, "start": 232.0, "end": 235.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n ki\\u1ec3m tra t\\u1ec7p n\\u00e0y, b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd th\\u1ea5y ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t kh\\u00f3a b\\u00ed m\\u1eadt,"}, {"index": 82, "start": 235.0, "end": 238.0, "text": "\\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng ch\\u1ee7 y\\u1ebfu cho vi\\u1ec7c tri\\u1ec3n khai tr\\u00ean m\\u00e1y ch\\u1ee7."}, {"index": 83, "start": 238.0, "end": 240.0, "text": "V\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 ch\\u1ebf \\u0111\\u1ed9 g\\u1ee1 l\\u1ed7i."}, {"index": 84, "start": 240.0, "end": 243.0, "text": "Ch\\u1ebf \\u0111\\u1ed9 g\\u1ee1 l\\u1ed7i s\\u1ebd cung c\\u1ea5p cho b\\u1ea1n r\\u1ea5t nhi\\u1ec1u th\\u00f4ng tin khi b\\u1ea1n g\\u1eb7p kh\\u00f3 kh\\u0103n."}, {"index": 85, "start": 243.0, "end": 245.0, "text": "\\u0110i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y th\\u1ef1c s\\u1ef1 r\\u1ea5t quan tr\\u1ecdng."}, {"index": 86, "start": 245.0, "end": 247.0, "text": "Gi\\u1ea3 s\\u1eed b\\u1ea1n \\u0111ang x\\u00e2y d\\u1ef1ng m\\u1ed9t d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n"}, {"index": 87, "start": 247.0, "end": 249.0, "text": "v\\u00e0 n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n bi\\u1ebft \\u0111i\\u1ec1u g\\u00ec \\u0111ang x\\u1ea3y ra \\u0111\\u1eb1ng sau,"}, {"index": 88, "start": 249.0, "end": 252.0, "text": "ch\\u1ec9 c\\u1ea7n \\u0111\\u1eb7t g\\u1ee1 l\\u1ed7i b\\u1eb1ng 2 v\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd nh\\u1eadn \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c t\\u1ea5t c\\u1ea3 th\\u00f4ng tin."}, {"index": 89, "start": 252.0, "end": 255.0, "text": "Nh\\u01b0ng h\\u00e3y ch\\u1eafc ch\\u1eafn r\\u1eb1ng tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc khi tri\\u1ec3n khai l\\u00ean m\\u00e1y ch\\u1ee7,"}, {"index": 90, "start": 255.0, "end": 258.0, "text": "h\\u00e3y \\u0111\\u1eb7t n\\u00f3 th\\u00e0nh false v\\u00ec ai \\u0111\\u00f3 c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 hack m\\u00e1y c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n"}, {"index": 91, "start": 258.0, "end": 260.0, "text": "v\\u00e0 h\\u1ecd c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 th\\u1ea5y t\\u1ea5t c\\u1ea3 c\\u00e1c nh\\u1eadt k\\u00fd."}, {"index": 92, "start": 260.0, "end": 262.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u01b0\\u1ee3c r\\u1ed3i, v\\u00e0 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y r\\u1ea5t quan tr\\u1ecdng."}, {"index": 93, "start": 262.0, "end": 263.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 c\\u00e1c \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng \\u0111\\u00e3 \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c c\\u00e0i \\u0111\\u1eb7t."}, {"index": 94, "start": 263.0, "end": 265.0, "text": "Trong d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n, \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 c\\u00e1c \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng \\u0111\\u00e3 \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c c\\u00e0i \\u0111\\u1eb7t s\\u1eb5n."}, {"index": 95, "start": 265.0, "end": 267.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd n\\u00f3i v\\u1ec1 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y sau."}, {"index": 96, "start": 267.0, "end": 269.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 c\\u00f3 c\\u00e1c \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng c\\u1ee7a ri\\u00eang m\\u00ecnh."}, {"index": 97, "start": 269.0, "end": 272.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 nh\\u1eefng c\\u00e1ch trung gian, s\\u1ebd gi\\u00fap b\\u1ea1n v\\u1ec1 v\\u1ea5n \\u0111\\u1ec1 b\\u1ea3o m\\u1eadt."}, {"index": 98, "start": 272.0, "end": 274.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t m\\u1eabu."}, {"index": 99, "start": 274.0, "end": 277.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 th\\u1ea5y m\\u1eabu Django n\\u00e0y s\\u1ebd gi\\u00fap b\\u1ea1n cung c\\u1ea5p n\\u1ed9i dung m\\u1eabu."}, {"index": 100, "start": 277.0, "end": 279.0, "text": "C\\u00f2n v\\u1ec1 c\\u01a1 s\\u1edf d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u th\\u00ec sao?"}, {"index": 101, "start": 279.0, "end": 281.0, "text": "T\\u1ea5t nhi\\u00ean, n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n \\u0111ang t\\u1ea1o m\\u1ed9t \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng web,"}, {"index": 102, "start": 281.0, "end": 283.0, "text": "b\\u1ea1n c\\u0169ng c\\u1ea7n c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t c\\u01a1 s\\u1edf d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u \\u0111\\u1ec3 h\\u1ed7 tr\\u1ee3 ph\\u00eda sau,"}, {"index": 103, "start": 283.0, "end": 286.0, "text": "c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 l\\u00e0 MySQL, Postgres ho\\u1eb7c SQLite."}, {"index": 104, "start": 286.0, "end": 288.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, theo m\\u1eb7c \\u0111\\u1ecbnh, n\\u00f3 cung c\\u1ea5p cho b\\u1ea1n SQLite,"}, {"index": 105, "start": 288.0, "end": 290.0, "text": "nh\\u01b0ng b\\u1ea1n c\\u0169ng c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng Postgres \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00f3."}, {"index": 106, "start": 290.0, "end": 293.0, "text": "V\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3, ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 th\\u00f4ng tin v\\u1ec1 m\\u1eadt kh\\u1ea9u \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y \\u0111\\u1ec3 x\\u00e1c th\\u1ef1c."}, {"index": 107, "start": 293.0, "end": 295.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd h\\u00e3y kh\\u00f4ng t\\u1eadp trung v\\u00e0o t\\u1ec7p n\\u00e0y"}, {"index": 108, "start": 295.0, "end": 298.0, "text": "b\\u1edfi v\\u00ec ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i kh\\u00f4ng th\\u1ef1c s\\u1ef1 ch\\u1ec9nh s\\u1eeda t\\u1ec7p n\\u00e0y th\\u01b0\\u1eddng xuy\\u00ean."}, {"index": 109, "start": 298.0, "end": 299.0, "text": "H\\u00e3y gi\\u1eef n\\u00f3 \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00f3."}, {"index": 110, "start": 299.0, "end": 301.0, "text": "Nh\\u01b0ng \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t t\\u1ec7p r\\u1ea5t quan tr\\u1ecdng."}, {"index": 111, "start": 301.0, "end": 303.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u01b0\\u1ee3c r\\u1ed3i, v\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 c\\u00e1c URL."}, {"index": 112, "start": 303.0, "end": 306.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 th\\u1ea5y ch\\u00fang ta ch\\u1ec9 c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t URL \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y,"}, {"index": 113, "start": 306.0, "end": 308.0, "text": "\\u0111\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 cho c\\u00e1c t\\u00e1c v\\u1ee5 qu\\u1ea3n tr\\u1ecb."}, {"index": 114, "start": 308.0, "end": 310.0, "text": "V\\u1eady l\\u00e0 t\\u1ea1m th\\u1eddi nh\\u01b0 v\\u1eady."}, {"index": 115, "start": 310.0, "end": 312.0, "text": "H\\u00e3y t\\u1ea1o \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng \\u0111\\u1ea7u ti\\u00ean c\\u1ee7a ch\\u00fang ta, nh\\u01b0ng khoan \\u0111\\u00e3."}, {"index": 116, "start": 312.0, "end": 314.0, "text": "C\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 b\\u1ea1n \\u0111ang ngh\\u0129 ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n, \\u0111\\u00fang kh\\u00f4ng?"}, {"index": 117, "start": 314.0, "end": 316.0, "text": "T\\u1ea1i sao ch\\u00fang ta ph\\u1ea3i t\\u1ea1o m\\u1ed9t \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng ri\\u00eang?"}, {"index": 118, "start": 316.0, "end": 319.0, "text": "\\u0110i\\u1ec1u quan tr\\u1ecdng l\\u00e0, trong Django, nh\\u1eefng g\\u00ec ch\\u00fang ta l\\u00e0m l\\u00e0 c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n."}, {"index": 119, "start": 319.0, "end": 322.0, "text": "Gi\\u1ea3 s\\u1eed n\\u1ebfu t\\u00f4i mu\\u1ed1n t\\u1ea1o m\\u1ed9t \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng web l\\u1edbn,"}, {"index": 120, "start": 322.0, "end": 324.0, "text": "s\\u1ebd c\\u00f3 r\\u1ea5t nhi\\u1ec1u t\\u00ednh n\\u0103ng, b\\u1ea1n bi\\u1ebft \\u0111\\u1ea5y,"}, {"index": 121, "start": 324.0, "end": 326.0, "text": "c\\u00e1c c\\u00f4ng vi\\u1ec7c qu\\u1ea3n tr\\u1ecb, ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1,"}, {"index": 122, "start": 326.0, "end": 327.0, "text": "gi\\u1ea3 s\\u1eed l\\u00e0 trang web th\\u01b0\\u01a1ng m\\u1ea1i \\u0111i\\u1ec7n t\\u1eed."}, {"index": 123, "start": 327.0, "end": 329.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 c\\u00f3 s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m nh\\u01b0 m\\u1ed9t m\\u00f4-\\u0111un."}, {"index": 124, "start": 329.0, "end": 331.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 c\\u00f3 v\\u1eadn chuy\\u1ec3n nh\\u01b0 m\\u1ed9t m\\u00f4-\\u0111un."}, {"index": 125, "start": 331.0, "end": 332.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t t\\u1eadp h\\u1ee3p kh\\u00e1c."}, {"index": 126, "start": 332.0, "end": 333.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 nh\\u1eefng \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng kh\\u00e1c nhau."}, {"index": 127, "start": 333.0, "end": 336.0, "text": "V\\u00e0 t\\u1ea5t c\\u1ea3 c\\u00e1c \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng n\\u00e0y tr\\u00ean trang web s\\u1ebd \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c cung c\\u1ea5p"}, {"index": 128, "start": 336.0, "end": 338.0, "text": "trong m\\u1ed9t d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n c\\u1ee5 th\\u1ec3, \\u0111\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 trang web c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n n\\u00f3i chung."}, {"index": 129, "start": 338.0, "end": 340.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, vi\\u1ec7c \\u0111\\u0103ng nh\\u1eadp s\\u1ebd l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng."}, {"index": 130, "start": 340.0, "end": 342.0, "text": "Sau \\u0111\\u00f3, hi\\u1ec3n th\\u1ecb c\\u00e1c s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m s\\u1ebd l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng."}, {"index": 131, "start": 342.0, "end": 343.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 c\\u00e1ch m\\u00e0."}, {"index": 132, "start": 343.0, "end": 345.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, h\\u00e3y t\\u1ea1o m\\u1ed9t d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n \\u0111\\u01a1n gi\\u1ea3n \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y."}, {"index": 133, "start": 345.0, "end": 348.0, "text": "C\\u00e1ch \\u0111\\u1ec3 l\\u00e0m \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 b\\u1eb1ng c\\u00e1ch truy c\\u1eadp v\\u00e0o m\\u1ed9t terminal."}, {"index": 134, "start": 348.0, "end": 349.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 th\\u1ea5y \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 terminal."}, {"index": 135, "start": 349.0, "end": 351.0, "text": "V\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 n\\u01a1i b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 nh\\u1eadp."}, {"index": 136, "start": 351.0, "end": 354.0, "text": "V\\u1eady l\\u00e0m th\\u1ebf n\\u00e0o ch\\u00fang ta t\\u1ea1o ra m\\u1ed9t \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng v\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd \\u0111\\u1eb7t t\\u00ean n\\u00f3 nh\\u01b0 th\\u1ebf n\\u00e0o?"}, {"index": 137, "start": 354.0, "end": 357.0, "text": "Hi\\u1ec7n t\\u1ea1i, t\\u00f4i ch\\u1ec9 mu\\u1ed1n \\u0111\\u1eb7t t\\u00ean n\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 Calc"}, {"index": 138, "start": 357.0, "end": 360.0, "text": "b\\u1edfi v\\u00ec t\\u00f4i y\\u00eau Hello World v\\u00e0 v\\u00ed d\\u1ee5 ti\\u1ebfp theo s\\u1ebd l\\u00e0 Calc."}, {"index": 139, "start": 360.0, "end": 362.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, h\\u00e3y t\\u1ea1o m\\u1ed9t \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng Calc."}, {"index": 140, "start": 362.0, "end": 364.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u1ec3 l\\u00e0m \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3, ch\\u00fang ta ph\\u1ea3i g\\u00f5 m\\u1ed9t l\\u1ec7nh."}, {"index": 141, "start": 364.0, "end": 366.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, b\\u1ea1n ph\\u1ea3i n\\u00f3i python manage.py."}, {"index": 142, "start": 366.0, "end": 367.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 file m\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111ang s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng."}, {"index": 143, "start": 367.0, "end": 369.0, "text": "V\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3, b\\u1ea1n ph\\u1ea3i \\u0111\\u1ec1 c\\u1eadp \\u0111\\u1ebfn t\\u00ean c\\u1ee7a \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n."}, {"index": 144, "start": 369.0, "end": 371.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, cho \\u0111\\u1ebfn gi\\u1edd, ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng Calc."}, {"index": 145, "start": 371.0, "end": 374.0, "text": "Ngay khi b\\u1ea1n nh\\u1ea5n enter, ch\\u00fang ta g\\u1eb7p ph\\u1ea3i m\\u1ed9t l\\u1ed7i."}, {"index": 146, "start": 374.0, "end": 377.0, "text": "V\\u1ea5n \\u0111\\u1ec1 l\\u00e0 b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111ang s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng m\\u1ed9t command prompt kh\\u00e1c."}, {"index": 147, "start": 377.0, "end": 380.0, "text": "T\\u00f4i kh\\u00f4ng mong \\u0111\\u1ee3i \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y, nh\\u01b0ng sau \\u0111\\u00f3 ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111ang s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng m\\u1ed9t command prompt kh\\u00e1c."}, {"index": 148, "start": 380.0, "end": 382.0, "text": "Ban \\u0111\\u1ea7u, ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng command prompt c\\u1ee7a Windows."}, {"index": 149, "start": 382.0, "end": 384.0, "text": "B\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111ang s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng n\\u00f3 th\\u00f4ng qua Visual Studio."}, {"index": 150, "start": 384.0, "end": 388.0, "text": "V\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3, n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f2n nh\\u1edb, ch\\u00fang ta c\\u0169ng ph\\u1ea3i thi\\u1ebft l\\u1eadp m\\u00f4i tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng \\u1ea3o."}, {"index": 151, "start": 388.0, "end": 391.0, "text": "V\\u1eady m\\u00f4i tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng \\u1ea3o m\\u00e0 ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111ang s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 test."}, {"index": 152, "start": 391.0, "end": 392.0, "text": "V\\u1eady ch\\u00fang ta ph\\u1ea3i s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng c\\u00e1i \\u0111\\u00f3."}, {"index": 153, "start": 392.0, "end": 394.0, "text": "V\\u1eady ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd \\u0111\\u00f3ng c\\u00e1i n\\u00e0y l\\u1ea1i v\\u00e0 s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng test."}, {"index": 154, "start": 394.0, "end": 396.0, "text": "V\\u1eady, l\\u00e0m th\\u1ebf n\\u00e0o \\u0111\\u1ec3 b\\u1ea1n s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng c\\u00e1c m\\u00f4i tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng c\\u1ee7a ch\\u00fang ta?"}, {"index": 155, "start": 396.0, "end": 398.0, "text": "B\\u1ea1n ph\\u1ea3i n\\u00f3i work on test."}, {"index": 156, "start": 398.0, "end": 399.0, "text": "V\\u1eady b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111ang \\u1edf trong test."}, {"index": 157, "start": 399.0, "end": 401.0, "text": "B\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd ch\\u00fang ta ph\\u1ea3i g\\u00f5 m\\u1ed9t l\\u1ec7nh."}, {"index": 158, "start": 401.0, "end": 404.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, ch\\u00fang ta ph\\u1ea3i n\\u00f3i python manage.py."}, {"index": 159, "start": 404.0, "end": 406.0, "text": "\\u00d4i, \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 qu\\u00ean m\\u1ed9t \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u1eefa."}, {"index": 160, "start": 406.0, "end": 407.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, b\\u1ea1n ph\\u1ea3i n\\u00f3i b\\u1eaft \\u0111\\u1ea7u \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng."}, {"index": 161, "start": 407.0, "end": 408.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 nh\\u1eefng g\\u00ec t\\u00f4i l\\u00e0m."}, {"index": 162, "start": 408.0, "end": 410.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, b\\u1ea1n ph\\u1ea3i n\\u00f3i b\\u1eaft \\u0111\\u1ea7u \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng v\\u00e0 b\\u1ea1n ph\\u1ea3i \\u0111\\u1ec1 c\\u1eadp \\u0111\\u1ebfn Calc."}, {"index": 163, "start": 410.0, "end": 412.0, "text": "Ngay khi b\\u1ea1n n\\u00f3i nh\\u1eadp ngay, b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 th\\u1ea5y \\u1edf b\\u00ean tr\\u00e1i,"}, {"index": 164, "start": 412.0, "end": 414.0, "text": "ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t Calc."}, {"index": 165, "start": 414.0, "end": 415.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u00e2y c\\u01a1 b\\u1ea3n l\\u00e0 \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n."}, {"index": 166, "start": 415.0, "end": 417.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n \\u0111ang di\\u1ec5n ra."}, {"index": 167, "start": 417.0, "end": 418.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n."}, {"index": 168, "start": 418.0, "end": 420.0, "text": "B\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd, n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 th\\u1ea5y, ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 t\\u1ec7p kh\\u00e1c nhau \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00f3."}, {"index": 169, "start": 420.0, "end": 422.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta kh\\u00f4ng c\\u00f3 c\\u00e0i \\u0111\\u1eb7t \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y, nh\\u01b0ng ch\\u00fang ta kh\\u00f4ng c\\u00f3 c\\u00e0i \\u0111\\u1eb7t \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y."}, {"index": 170, "start": 422.0, "end": 426.0, "text": "B\\u1edfi v\\u00ec c\\u00e0i \\u0111\\u1eb7t n\\u00e0y l\\u00e0 cho d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n v\\u00e0 m\\u1ed7i \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng s\\u1ebd c\\u00f3 c\\u00e1c th\\u1ee9 ri\\u00eang."}, {"index": 171, "start": 426.0, "end": 430.0, "text": "V\\u00ed d\\u1ee5, gi\\u1ea3 s\\u1eed n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n n\\u00f3i v\\u1ec1 \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng, ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 th\\u1ee9 qu\\u1ea3n tr\\u1ecb \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y."}, {"index": 172, "start": 430.0, "end": 432.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd kh\\u00f4ng l\\u00e0m \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3 ngay b\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd, nh\\u01b0ng ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 c\\u00e1c th\\u1ee9 qu\\u1ea3n tr\\u1ecb."}, {"index": 173, "start": 432.0, "end": 434.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 c\\u00e1c \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng."}, {"index": 174, "start": 434.0, "end": 435.0, "text": "T\\u00ean n\\u00e0y l\\u00e0 quan tr\\u1ecdng."}, {"index": 175, "start": 435.0, "end": 436.0, "text": "Ch\\u1ec9 c\\u1ea7n nh\\u00ecn v\\u00e0o t\\u00ean n\\u00e0y."}, {"index": 176, "start": 436.0, "end": 438.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111ang c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t l\\u1edbp v\\u1edbi t\\u00ean l\\u00e0 Calconfig."}, {"index": 177, "start": 438.0, "end": 440.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng n\\u00f3."}, {"index": 178, "start": 440.0, "end": 441.0, "text": "Sau \\u0111\\u00f3, ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 c\\u00e1c m\\u00f4 h\\u00ecnh."}, {"index": 179, "start": 441.0, "end": 445.0, "text": "B\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd, n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n n\\u00f3i v\\u1ec1 Django, n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n x\\u00e2y d\\u1ef1ng m\\u1ed9t \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng web,"}, {"index": 180, "start": 445.0, "end": 447.0, "text": "T\\u1ea5t nhi\\u00ean, b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n l\\u00e0m vi\\u1ec7c v\\u1edbi c\\u01a1 s\\u1edf d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u, \\u0111\\u00fang kh\\u00f4ng?"}, {"index": 181, "start": 447.0, "end": 451.0, "text": "V\\u00e0 trong Django, ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t kh\\u00e1i ni\\u1ec7m tuy\\u1ec7t v\\u1eddi g\\u1ecdi l\\u00e0 ORM."}, {"index": 182, "start": 451.0, "end": 455.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd n\\u00f3i v\\u1ec1 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3 sau, nh\\u01b0ng m\\u00f4 h\\u00ecnh n\\u00e0y s\\u1ebd \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng cho vi\\u1ec7c \\u0111\\u00f3."}, {"index": 183, "start": 455.0, "end": 457.0, "text": "N\\u00f3i chung, n\\u00f3 \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng \\u0111\\u1ec3 l\\u01b0u tr\\u1eef d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u."}, {"index": 184, "start": 457.0, "end": 458.0, "text": "V\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 c\\u00e1c b\\u00e0i ki\\u1ec3m tra."}, {"index": 185, "start": 458.0, "end": 462.0, "text": "N\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 t\\u00ecnh hu\\u1ed1ng ki\\u1ec3m tra, n\\u1ebfu b\\u1ea1n mu\\u1ed1n ki\\u1ec3m tra \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng c\\u1ee7a m\\u00ecnh,"}, {"index": 186, "start": 462.0, "end": 464.0, "text": "th\\u00ec \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 c\\u00e1ch ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 l\\u00e0m \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3."}, {"index": 187, "start": 464.0, "end": 465.0, "text": "V\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 ch\\u00fang ta c\\u00f3 c\\u00e1c views."}, {"index": 188, "start": 465.0, "end": 468.0, "text": "Nh\\u1edb khi ch\\u00fang ta g\\u1eedi m\\u1ed9t y\\u00eau c\\u1ea7u, ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 n\\u00f3i v\\u1ec1 MVT,"}, {"index": 189, "start": 468.0, "end": 470.0, "text": "n\\u01a1i m\\u00e0 c\\u00e1c view s\\u1ebd x\\u1eed l\\u00fd y\\u00eau c\\u1ea7u c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n."}, {"index": 190, "start": 470.0, "end": 472.0, "text": "B\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 l\\u00e0m \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3 \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y."}, {"index": 191, "start": 472.0, "end": 474.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u01b0\\u1ee3c r\\u1ed3i, nh\\u01b0ng ch\\u00fang ta mu\\u1ed1n x\\u00e2y d\\u1ef1ng Hello World, \\u0111\\u00fang kh\\u00f4ng?"}, {"index": 192, "start": 474.0, "end": 475.0, "text": "V\\u1eady b\\u1ea1n s\\u1ebd l\\u00e0m \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3 nh\\u01b0 th\\u1ebf n\\u00e0o?"}, {"index": 193, "start": 475.0, "end": 477.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd th\\u1ea5y \\u0111i\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u00f3 trong video ti\\u1ebfp theo."}, {"index": 194, "start": 477.0, "end": 480.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, trong video n\\u00e0y, ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 n\\u00f3i v\\u1ec1 c\\u00e1ch t\\u1ea1o m\\u1ed9t \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng trong d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n"}, {"index": 195, "start": 480.0, "end": 481.0, "text": "trong Visual Studio, t\\u1ea5t nhi\\u00ean."}, {"index": 196, "start": 481.0, "end": 482.0, "text": "\\u0110\\u00f3 l\\u00e0 nh\\u1eefng g\\u00ec ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111ang s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y."}, {"index": 197, "start": 482.0, "end": 484.0, "text": "V\\u00e0 sau \\u0111\\u00f3 ch\\u00fang ta \\u0111\\u00e3 xem c\\u00e1c t\\u1ec7p."}, {"index": 198, "start": 484.0, "end": 486.0, "text": "Trong video ti\\u1ebfp theo, ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd ch\\u1ea1y m\\u00e3 n\\u00e0y."}, {"index": 199, "start": 486.0, "end": 490.0, "text": "V\\u00ec v\\u1eady, tr\\u00ean trang ch\\u1ee7, ch\\u1eb3ng h\\u1ea1n, n\\u1ebfu t\\u00f4i v\\u00e0o trang ch\\u1ee7 v\\u00e0 l\\u00e0m m\\u1edbi,"}, {"index": 200, "start": 490.0, "end": 493.0, "text": "T\\u00f4i n\\u00ean nh\\u1eadn \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c m\\u1ed9t c\\u00e1i g\\u00ec \\u0111\\u00f3 gi\\u1ed1ng nh\\u01b0 Hello World, m\\u1ed9t c\\u00e1i g\\u00ec \\u0111\\u00f3 nh\\u01b0 v\\u1eady."}, {"index": 201, "start": 493.0, "end": 495.0, "text": "B\\u00e2y gi\\u1edd \\u0111i\\u1ec1u n\\u00e0y kh\\u00f4ng ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng, nh\\u01b0ng ch\\u00fang ta s\\u1ebd l\\u00e0m cho n\\u00f3 ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng."}, {"index": 202, "start": 495.0, "end": 498.0, "text": "Ch\\u00fang ta mu\\u1ed1n Hello World \\u1edf \\u0111\\u00e2y, t\\u1ea1i trang ch\\u00ednh."}, {"index": 203, "start": 498.0, "end": 499.0, "text": "V\\u1eady l\\u00e0 h\\u1ebft n\\u1ed9i dung c\\u1ee7a video n\\u00e0y."}, {"index": 204, "start": 499.0, "end": 500.0, "text": "Hy v\\u1ecdng b\\u1ea1n th\\u00edch n\\u00f3."}, {"index": 205, "start": 500.0, "end": 503.0, "text": "H\\u00e3y cho t\\u00f4i bi\\u1ebft trong ph\\u1ea7n b\\u00ecnh lu\\u1eadn v\\u00e0 h\\u00e3y \\u0111\\u0103ng k\\u00fd \\u0111\\u1ec3 xem c\\u00e1c video kh\\u00e1c."}, {"index": 206, "start": 503.0, "end": 504.0, "text": "T\\u1ea1m bi\\u1ec7t."}]}}, "summary": ["- Gi\\u1edbi thi\\u1ec7u v\\u1ec1 series h\\u1ecdc Django c\\u1ee7a Dhavin Reddy.", "- Trong video tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc \\u0111\\u00e3 thi\\u1ebft l\\u1eadp Django tr\\u00ean Windows v\\u00e0 t\\u1ea1o d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n.", "- Ch\\u1ea1y m\\u00e1y ch\\u1ee7 nh\\u1eb9 c\\u1ee7a Django qua l\\u1ec7nh `python manage.py runserver`.", "- S\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng tr\\u00ecnh duy\\u1ec7t \\u0111\\u1ec3 truy c\\u1eadp \\u0111\\u1ecba ch\\u1ec9 IP localhost:8000.", "- Ph\\u00e2n bi\\u1ec7t gi\\u1eefa trang t\\u0129nh v\\u00e0 trang \\u0111\\u1ed9ng trong \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng web.", "- Trang t\\u0129nh hi\\u1ec3n th\\u1ecb c\\u00f9ng m\\u1ed9t n\\u1ed9i dung cho t\\u1ea5t c\\u1ea3 ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi d\\u00f9ng.", "- Trang \\u0111\\u1ed9ng hi\\u1ec3n th\\u1ecb n\\u1ed9i dung kh\\u00e1c nhau cho t\\u1eebng ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi d\\u00f9ng (v\\u00ed d\\u1ee5: Facebook, t\\u00e0i kho\\u1ea3n ng\\u00e2n h\\u00e0ng).", "- \\u0110\\u1ec3 x\\u00e2y d\\u1ef1ng n\\u1ed9i dung t\\u0129nh: s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng HTML, CSS, JavaScript.", "- \\u0110\\u1ec3 x\\u00e2y d\\u1ef1ng n\\u1ed9i dung \\u0111\\u1ed9ng: c\\u1ea7n th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n x\\u1eed l\\u00fd v\\u1edbi Django.", "- B\\u1eaft \\u0111\\u1ea7u vi\\u1ebft \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng web \\u0111\\u01a1n gi\\u1ea3n v\\u1edbi \\"hello world\\".", "- H\\u1ecdc Django m\\u00e0 kh\\u00f4ng \\u0111i s\\u00e2u v\\u00e0o l\\u1eadp tr\\u00ecnh ph\\u1ee9c t\\u1ea1p.", "- N\\u00eau c\\u00e1c l\\u1ef1a ch\\u1ecdn IDE \\u0111\\u1ec3 vi\\u1ebft m\\u00e3: Notepad, Sublime, Visual Studio.", "- H\\u01b0\\u1edbng d\\u1eabn t\\u1ea3i v\\u00e0 c\\u00e0i \\u0111\\u