verything in this URL because we can have"}, {"index": 12, "start": 59.8, "end": 63.8, "text": "multiple apps right and every app will have its own URL and it makes sense to do"}, {"index": 13, "start": 63.8, "end": 68.24, "text": "that because it will be isolated so if you touch one thing it will not affect"}, {"index": 14, "start": 68.24, "end": 72.28, "text": "the other one it will be easier to manage so in the urls.py you can see we"}, {"index": 15, "start": 72.28, "end": 75.64, "text": "are saying again path and then we are saying for the home page we have a"}, {"index": 16, "start": 75.64, "end": 80.12, "text": "function named as home so if you go to views.py which is your Python"}, {"index": 17, "start": 80.12, "end": 84.4, "text": "file for views here we are saying this is a function home the moment it"}, {"index": 18, "start": 84.52, "end": 89.44, "text": "gets called you just have to send a response which is a HTTP response and"}, {"index": 19, "start": 89.44, "end": 92.96, "text": "you have to send hello world and that's why we are able to see that hello world"}, {"index": 20, "start": 92.96, "end": 96.36, "text": "but hold on if you talk about the real projects if you talk about the actual"}, {"index": 21, "start": 96.36, "end": 101.16, "text": "websites you don't actually print only one text right you might want to print"}, {"index": 22, "start": 101.16, "end": 105.48, "text": "multiple text you want to print an image or you want to do some amazing UI style"}, {"index": 23, "start": 105.48, "end": 108.92, "text": "there don't worry I'm not going to do that here we are not going to create"}, {"index": 24, "start": 108.92, "end": 112.92, "text": "a good-looking website which we just want to get a simple web page even"}, {"index": 25, "start": 112.96, "end": 116.6, "text": "when you say web page it will have certain HTML tags right for the title"}, {"index": 26, "start": 116.6, "end": 120.44, "text": "for the bg color I mean if you want to change the background color I know how"}, {"index": 27, "start": 120.44, "end": 123.76, "text": "to do that but okay so you can change the background color and then you can"}, {"index": 28, "start": 123.76, "end": 127.56, "text": "also have some amazing font right if you want to use a big heading small"}, {"index": 29, "start": 127.56, "end": 131.68, "text": "heading so of course that should be done in HTML now how will you use HTML"}, {"index": 30, "start": 131.68, "end": 134.92, "text": "here so let's say I want to increase the font size of it or maybe I want to"}, {"index": 31, "start": 134.92, "end": 139.48, "text": "set it h1 so yes you can do that you can actually type h1 here so before"}, {"index": 32, "start": 139.52, "end": 143.48, "text": "hello world you can say h1 and after hello world you can say h1 close this is"}, {"index": 33, "start": 143.48, "end": 147.44, "text": "perfectly possible but is it logical because if you go to browser it will"}, {"index": 34, "start": 147.44, "end": 151.28, "text": "surely work you can see refresh you got hello world in a big font but what if you"}, {"index": 35, "start": 151.28, "end": 155.64, "text": "want to create a big page I mean multiple tags so it doesn't make sense to type"}, {"index": 36, "start": 155.64, "end": 160.2, "text": "all the tags here so what we should do we should be creating a separate page"}, {"index": 37, "start": 160.2, "end": 166.04, "text": "okay a home page which will have a lot of HTML tags but don't you think the"}, {"index": 38, "start": 166.04, "end": 171.4, "text": "moment you create a new HTML page it will be a static page once you specify the"}, {"index": 39, "start": 171.4, "end": 175.4, "text": "content we cannot change it it will static right we want to make it dynamic and"}, {"index": 40, "start": 175.4, "end": 179.64, "text": "that's where in Django we have this amazing concept called templates so you"}, {"index": 41, "start": 179.64, "end": 183.8, "text": "can imagine in template what we can do